_:a6668abc8fb228df11980525e2ef83b6 <http://schema.org/value> "Azores-Gibraltar Ridge" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ffd898ec92408f452379ab540d34bf1e9ac32259> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during July - August 1982. It incorporates a series of profiles around a mooring on the Azores-Gibraltar Ridge and a survey of the 'Discovery Gap' between the Azores and Madeira basins, including yo-yo time series on six stations. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
_:a6668abc8fb228df11980525e2ef83b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
