_:d61dd25dace2cdcceeb3fa874d689c73 <http://schema.org/value> "North Channel" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ffd2d0daf25bde1282131758441291f667eb3073> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d61dd25dace2cdcceeb3fa874d689c73 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ffd2d0daf25bde1282131758441291f667eb3073> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June 1987. It incorporates CTD sections in the northern Irish Sea, specifically sections S, N and NE from the Isle of Man, across the southern end of the North Channel (Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory section Z Copeland-Portpatrick) and two 12-hour time series. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
_:d61dd25dace2cdcceeb3fa874d689c73 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
