<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ffceb91f6ac8c3937701e6fa9cc15d40cdab12b3> <http://schema.org/description> "15 locations from Salcombe to Prawle Point. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes 1991 Devon Wildlife Trust Seasearch Salcombe Harbour survey, 1991-93 Devon Wildlife Trust Salcombe Estuary littoral survey, and 1992 Devon Wildlife Trust Seasearch Salcombe to Prawle Point survey." .
_:def17c20460c9bde72c009247872e799 <http://schema.org/value> "1991 Devon Wildlife Trust Seasearch Salcombe Harbour survey" .
