_:a0249484ad1a0bec46ed7534f99657f5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:b69ac74995a2c83a46d0f35a02e696f5 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
