<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ff0ad075357023f0cbf6b233debb80cc579d9e2d> <http://schema.org/description> "AWAC wave buoy devices were deployed at both Docking Shoal and Race Bank Offshore Wind Farms (both Centrica Energy at the time of deployment). This Package contains the data collected from the Docking Shoal buoy. All associated reports can be found in the series reports." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ff0ad075357023f0cbf6b233debb80cc579d9e2d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a2e9bbfeffbb271a4d613bf5d6ecbc65 .
