<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:feab838e2d9e4f94d785089478454538a09dcf9a> <http://schema.org/description> "This sampling survey trial took place in August 1997 in the Southern North Sea on board the RRS James Clark Ross a pre-requisite for survey work in the Antarctic. Seabed samples and cores were collected using the BGS rockdrill. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Internal Report WB/97/25C." .
_:f894e9dc14bdfe5337e66b91f9fa8f75 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:dc69d448df101e057b670aed32676e5f <http://schema.org/value> "Thames SEA" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fea8ad133be17a9d9f7902cb32ddc6e4d470d568> <http://schema.org/description> "ABP Marine Environmental Research Ltd (ABPmer) has been commissioned by Greater Gabbard Offshore Winds Ltd (GGOWL) to undertake a coastal process study for the proposed Greater Gabbard Offshore Wind Farm (OWF) development. This report focuses on providing a baseline understanding of the coastal process regime in the Thames SEA with particular emphasis on the proposed area of development." .
