_:dbfc687e30859f30919b8db4f7054ccf <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fdf94bc786fa0731957c4a260999822b0474ccae> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during January - February 1983. It incorporates a section along 19-20W from 47N down to 40.5N, a section along 41-42N from 19W to 12W and spot calibration casts associated with SeaSoar tows. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
