<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fdc933b1943b24d124f1ea852175e416ff6ade23> <http://schema.org/description> "Both manual and automated traffic counts were undertaken in the surrounding of the proposed location of the London Array offshore wind farm. The manual counts were undertaken by the Baptie Group at the intersections of Head Hill Road/Whitstable Road, and Monkshill Road/Seasalter Road. The automatic traffic surveys were carried out by Kent Highways Unit in Graveney and Goodstone during May 2004." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fdc933b1943b24d124f1ea852175e416ff6ade23> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fdbe2ceaa66d2f9b1197b50829774f9f4382b114> <http://schema.org/description> "This processed bathymetric data set has been derived from a Lidar - bathymetric survey. The source data was collected, validated and processed for the purpose of Safety Of Life At Sea (SOLAS). The data set must not be used for navigation or to create products that could be used for navigation." .
