<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd83eb54e78bbd03e0a91aab1585df0a44307ac4> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d1e3ac54c6cea7b6f3875f18befb51a8 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd83eb54e78bbd03e0a91aab1585df0a44307ac4> <http://schema.org/description> "Hosted by Historic Environment Scotland, Canmore provides an online searchable database and web GIS for Scotland's archaeological, built and maritime heritage. Within the national inventory there are over 30,000 records relating to known wreck sites as well as documented losses as well as numerous records for the archaeological and built heritage on land that are either directly associated with the exploitation of the sea or are situated close to the Scotland's shores.\r\n Recording of information for reported losses is derived from a range of published and unpublished sources (notably from Whittaker, IG 1998, Off Scotland: a comprehensive record of maritime and aviation losses in Scottish waters).\r\n The Datum has not been reported systematically." .
_:d1e3ac54c6cea7b6f3875f18befb51a8 <http://schema.org/value> "Historic Environment Scotland" .
