<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd6337bf74de2c2796c963d90743ac925a179209> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e6e08d94a0f41d9bccd49a53dbe9563 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd6337bf74de2c2796c963d90743ac925a179209> <http://schema.org/description> "The Port of London Authority (PLA) Hydrographic Service was commissioned by DONG Energy to undertake repeat Multibeam Echosounder (MBES) surveys at the Gunfleet Sands Offshore Windfarm in the Thames Estuary. Previous surveys have been conducted at 6 monthly intervals from September 2010.\r\n\r\nThe surveys are required for the FEPA Licence Numbers: Gunfleet Sands I &amp; II (GF1L/2011/0064/9 &amp; GF2 L/2011/00065/3) Offshore Windfarm.\r\n\r\nThis series covers survey elements which were undertaken on the 1st September 2012.\r\n\r\nThe survey work was carried out using the PLA survey vessel ‘Yantlet’, with bathymetric data being collected using a hull-mounted Reson SeaBat 8125h MBES." .
