<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd58e89a196820ed89328ea6b7b0f8f29be13a68> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd58e89a196820ed89328ea6b7b0f8f29be13a68> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f82e67f06e38600eff3b78e4738a2a5d .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd58e89a196820ed89328ea6b7b0f8f29be13a68> <http://schema.org/description> "This project relates to the ornithological monitoring that took place at the offshore wind farms of Lynn and Inner Dowsing in the pre-construction phase. The purpose of the monitoring work at Lynn and Inner Dowsing is to fulfil the objectives provided in Annex 2 of the Schedule to FEPA Licence Nos.31792/03/1. Boat based and aerial surveys were conducted between November 2002 and April 2004. The goal of the project is threefold:\r\n1. Assess changes in usage of area by feeding birds and birds on passage\r\n2. Assess collision risk prior to construction of the wind farm and investigate techniques/methodologies for collecting data on actual collisions during and post construction. \r\n3. Survey benthos to inform reasons for possible changes in bird distribution and density on site.\r\nThe outcomes of the survey show that it is predicted that the disturbance of feeding divers will not be significantly greater than the level described in the Environmental Statements and Addendum Reports for Inner Dowsing and Lynn wind farms. It was concluded that there are currently no December of February data on which to make an assessment, only a further boat survey in December 2004 and two boat surveys in February 2004 are recommended." .
_:f82e67f06e38600eff3b78e4738a2a5d <http://schema.org/value> "Inner Dowsing" .
_:f82e67f06e38600eff3b78e4738a2a5d <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:f82e67f06e38600eff3b78e4738a2a5d <http://schema.org/value> "Lynn" .
_:f82e67f06e38600eff3b78e4738a2a5d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:ad80660abb254c064e11fde32083b598 <http://schema.org/name> "policies" .
_:bb17ed99bff86c309ee9893a416d0d23 <http://schema.org/value> "fish" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd534f41e12d86a84f0258924b0934175eb96d54> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd534f41e12d86a84f0258924b0934175eb96d54> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ad80660abb254c064e11fde32083b598 .
_:ad80660abb254c064e11fde32083b598 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd534f41e12d86a84f0258924b0934175eb96d54> <http://schema.org/description> "Benthic monitoring of the sea bed adjacent to the fish farm as a requirement of the CAR licence for the site. Grab samples collected in proximity to the farm and at two reference locations. Samples analysed for: benthos, redox, psa, carbon and sea louse medicine residues." .
_:bb17ed99bff86c309ee9893a416d0d23 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd534f41e12d86a84f0258924b0934175eb96d54> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bb17ed99bff86c309ee9893a416d0d23 .
_:bb17ed99bff86c309ee9893a416d0d23 <http://schema.org/name> "migratory marine species" .
_:ad80660abb254c064e11fde32083b598 <http://schema.org/value> "CAR licence" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd40d7a956c8b7ff662a3c932d5224c328275d66> <http://schema.org/description> "This project has been undertaken by Subacoustech Environmental Ltd for DONG Energy to meet the requirements set out in FEPA consent 33723/08/0, specifically clause 9.35. It describes a series of underwater noise measurements undertaken at the Gunfleet Sands Offshore Wind Farm site during installation of the first four monopile foundations. The results have been interpreted in terms of the potential impact this noise may have on marine species based on linear unweighted metrics and also on the level of noise above hearing threshold (dBht) for the species considered. Measurements were undertaken along four transects extending approximately to the North, South, East and West of the wind farm site. These transects covered different areas and varying bathymetry of the surrounding region in order to best characterise the likely impact of the noise in the region. Measurements were carried out between the 10th October 2008 and 27th October 2008." .
_:a4f6b3222fea821ac3ae4af71db882f3 <http://schema.org/value> "linear unweighted metrics" .
_:b57048681f3396fb11ac4955713d1dc3 <http://schema.org/value> "Gunfleet Sands" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fd40d7a956c8b7ff662a3c932d5224c328275d66> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cf55a3072fa4015013b06b27fcbbac84 .
