<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fcf925b7857017d73bcba6052310f898eb95be44> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 93 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in December 1995 from stations along the Hebridean slope, centred around 56.5 N, 9.0 W in the North East Atlantic. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory as part of the Land Ocean Interaction Study (LOIS) Shelf Edge Study (SES)." .
_:ac373578d65ee2da99334265afb0d09d <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
