<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fcaff8bbb59b29a790aa5ba0d89368f07e6fffa4> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral monitoring of four sites in the Plymouth area. Drakes Island, Queener Point, Renney Rocks and Holme Mewstone. Survey carried out for Norman Holme. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes 1972 Holme Drakes Island Plymouth littoral monitoring, 1972 Holme Queener Point Rame Head, Plymouth littoral monitoring, 1972 Holme Renney Rocks Heybrook Bay, Plymouth littoral monitoring and 1973 Holme Mewstone Wembury Bay littoral monitoring." .
