<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fc5ef03d66406b09482174100c6eddb701950c7a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fc5ef03d66406b09482174100c6eddb701950c7a> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1420; Off Skerries TSS, Area in SqKm: 917, (24/08/2013 to 01/12/2013), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Medium. FY 2013/14. Contractor: MMT UK." .
