_:e0f66bd5b36d378b7c95a67365315fe4 <http://schema.org/value> "no cable\r\nzone" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fc1235dcbd03b409582d2a5d343b92e682320e70> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS International Ltd (EGSi), were contracted by Centrica Renewable Energy Limited (CREL) to\r\nundertake a side scan sonar (SSS) and multibeam (MBES) clearance survey centred on the no cable\r\nzone (400m x 400m) adjacent to WTGs LS23 &amp; LS65 at the Lincs Offshore Wind Farm. The surveys were\r\nrequired to support the safe emplacement of a jack-up vessel adjacent to the WTG for maintenance\r\npurposes.\r\nThis series details the operations and results of the survey around all turbines." .
_:b2d6a8267fba7ad7d1499ab22b344387 <http://schema.org/value> "multibeam" .
