<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fc048b0b9d6b6bc86b26a4490832ae868415dee2> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the series of bird surveys that took place at the site of the Barrow offshore wind farm. Survey began on the 17th September 2003 and finished on 6th June 2004." .
