<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fb4df746c16c7c6d67b6eee388aa638955a5d49c> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosurvey undertook surveys of the Dudgeon Offshore Wind Farm area and export cable route using single and multi-beam echo sounder, sidescan sonar, surface-tow boomer and magnetometer equipment to investigate the physical characterics of the site." .
