_:b9531fad8019cd9dc55397ec1988444 <http://schema.org/value> "southern North Sea" .
_:f8288ccdc0fedc4db8056ce96bd89a0d <http://schema.org/value> "EGS International Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:faa152b556c2d10d9c3db85d16c60e402e97f7a8> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS International Ltd (EGSi) were contracted by Centrica Renewable Energy Limited (CREL) to\r\nundertake the 2016 post-construction (year 4) hydrographic and geophysical survey of the\r\nL&amp;ID (Lynn and Inner Dowsing) windfarms. These works were conducted as part of a wider\r\npost-construction monitoring operation which included survey works on the adjacent Lincs\r\nwindfarm.\r\nThe L&amp;ID windfarms are located in the southern North Sea, approximately 5km off the coast\r\nof Lincolnshire, near Skegness. \r\nThis series contains the operations, mobilisation and results reports for the L&amp;ID array cables survey carried out on the EGS Pioneer and the bathymetry and side-scan sonar datasets." .
_:b9531fad8019cd9dc55397ec1988444 <http://schema.org/value> "Lincolnshire" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:fa8fe494282479986242520dc13d1be5a7825403> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
