<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f8c6ef0accbf2cd388f6d043c9b6e0a3f5bea4fe> <http://schema.org/description> "A collation of marine data from various dates for Lundy Island. Photographs and MapInfo Layers demonstrating habitats and focusing on sponges. Includes 2007/07/11 Lundy ASM MapInfo data files, and Lundy Sponges." .
_:b8a3358eedfc878fe1c5355ff18a7e32 <http://schema.org/value> "Sponges" .
