<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f8709c1881507bd44ec2eea58ca8c4feed89a54e> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b2d80f82fb5962212812c10bfcd5b3ea .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f8709c1881507bd44ec2eea58ca8c4feed89a54e> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset consists of estimations of wave parameters, near surface currents and the underlying bathymetry based on X band radar data. These data were used to explore the use of radar to derive nearshore bathymetry at a complex site, at Thorpeness in Suffolk, UK. A Kelvin Hughes 10kW, 9.41 GHz marine X-band radar system was utilised at the field site between August 2015 and April 2017. These data were collected for the UK Natural Environment Research Council (NERC) grant NE/M021564/1- X-band radar applications for coastal monitoring to support improved management of coastal erosion, led by scientists at Bournemouth University, Faculty of Science and Technology." .
_:b7a9f017646d24b8aec721a3899e1aee <http://schema.org/value> "UK" .
