<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f7b7693b8b5b2e4bf3679ad3ee2615dee28375e0> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c78f580330706a7feabc7c601d27bfd3 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f7b7693b8b5b2e4bf3679ad3ee2615dee28375e0> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a2265bb12cbf4afee31d707f15593cf .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f7b7693b8b5b2e4bf3679ad3ee2615dee28375e0> <http://schema.org/description> "RPS Energy (RPSE) have been contracted by Centrica Renewable Energy Limited (CREL) to\r\ndetermine the depth to which shallow soils (less than approximately 5m) with specific shear\r\nstrengths are found throughout the Lincs Wind Farm Site. This information will help CREL in\r\ndetermining the most efficient method for trenching given the soil conditions. This technical note\r\nhas been carried out based on boreholes and CPT’s from the main Lincs Site investigation. It\r\nshould be noted that if analysis of turbine locations LS70 – LS75 is required then this can be\r\ncarried out, assuming that RPSE is provided with the appropriate borehole / CPT data." .
_:a45d79666dd0cbca867e9438c1430379 <http://schema.org/value> "Scottish Marine Biological Association" .
_:a79523ba9db7ac5cd233196245b98116 <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
_:a45d79666dd0cbca867e9438c1430379 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
