_:a79523ba9db7ac5cd233196245b98116 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:a79523ba9db7ac5cd233196245b98116 <http://schema.org/value> "Ellett Line section" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f7b114d4da98fd418b407ff6ff0c467ea2def750> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a79523ba9db7ac5cd233196245b98116 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f7b114d4da98fd418b407ff6ff0c467ea2def750> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 18 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, along the Ellett Line section (eastwards of the Anton Dohrn Seamount) in the North East Atlantic Ocean. The data were collected during September 1979. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
_:a79523ba9db7ac5cd233196245b98116 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
