_:a0595a4fecc70a56f29043dfb26fc25d <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f7758a41a5fa21beac8bf88ceae62198c735e923> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 89 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in September 1988 from stations covering the Flamborough Head frontal system. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences as part of the North Sea Project Frontal Process Study." .
