<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f748c0f13493c79f793cfbedc8c275f88b4b0f66> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1436; Dover Strait TSS Bassurelle and Bullock Banks, Area in SqKm: 573, (07/10/2013 to 31/03/2014), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Shallow. FY 2013/14. Contractor: Gardline." .
_:f15ba07f6071c0b60cff9e5cecb028e4 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f738eadd6f3ed983b4c2c771bbd42751174133e9> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a7ac4714ccab07e9f157e96b2fe9cf91 .
