_:dce1e708451fff180abe02e18803ccd9 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
_:dce1e708451fff180abe02e18803ccd9 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f72a39db90b4c67acbdf828d5bc4b5c6b61921d4> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 140 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April - June 1998. The cruise occupied the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE) Atlantic section A16N with stations in the North Atlantic between 20 - 64 N and mainly following 20 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Southampton Oceanography Centre as part of the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f72a39db90b4c67acbdf828d5bc4b5c6b61921d4> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a442ce2a45d3bb32ec431aa184200b07 .
