<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f6e08744317d442993f857c9f0d62e83e1ddb72d> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 22 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Inner Seas off the west coast of Scotland area specifically from Loch Fyne, during February of 1995. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture Environment and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:b1c4bb72907a0f40cf73c56d370843ea <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
