_:edcf5b674634108330e355eda2328070 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f6d746b53374516d5776048ad79a94adf36c4681> <http://schema.org/description> "Runswick Bay recommended Marine Conservation Zone 2013/14 habitat verification survey. Drop Camera survey collecting video and still images of the seabed habitats within the Runswick Bay rMCZ. Hamon Grab survey within the Runswick Bay rMCZ. Sampling equipment: Drop camera and 0.1 m2 Mini-Hamon grab. http://jncc.defra.gov.uk/page-6230. Net Gain, 2011. The North Sea Marine Conservation Zones Project Final Recommendations submission to Natural England and JNCC. Version 1.1. 880 pp. These data are archived with the Marine Environmental Data and Information Network (MEDIN) Data Archive Centres (DACs) including the British Geological Survey (BGS) DAC for geology and geophysics, The Archive for Marine Species and Habitats Data (DASSH) and the United Kingdom Hydrographic Office (UKHO) bathymetry DAC. The full site data package including raw is also available on request from BGS." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f6d746b53374516d5776048ad79a94adf36c4681> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ca08120267edd9b360f7316e99bc5288 .
