_:e459528d7ac722fd82be0e25acbaa831 <http://schema.org/value> "Humber estuary" .
_:e459528d7ac722fd82be0e25acbaa831 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:dca5aca03e055e70ca3d737ba5e2eda0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f5cb4d8fc4db91afa1a00ba80f60e46743dc0a3b> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 76 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in December 1988 from stations covering the southern North Sea specifically the Humber estuary and adjacent coast. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the North Sea Project Plumes Process Study." .
_:dca5aca03e055e70ca3d737ba5e2eda0 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
