<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f589b6d7847d3030f180869532f6f933b5860ac7> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 53 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in May 1999 from the region of 52.3 N, 4.3 E in the southern North Sea. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Management Unit of the North Sea Mathematical Models as part of the PROcesses of Vertical Exchange in Shelf Seas (PROVESS) project." .
