<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f586d0ad139bd162d2549df6cf82a8d98262dffe> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 52 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Inner Seas off the west coast of Scotland and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area including specifically the Anton Dohrn to Rockall sea-mount (Ellett line) and along the SES lines N and S. The data were collected during July and August of 1995. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
