<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f5089a0721e7bf2380221561c04e6e3fcd828c1a> <http://schema.org/description> "This is the data from two surveys, the UK distribution records of Clymenella torquata and a survey of intertidal sites in Southampton water." .
