<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f4bca93630d0ca646f571a90452322c0f131e2d2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:d985112fa928db775ac69b3e1fbc8e67 <http://schema.org/value> "Plymouth Sound" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f4bca93630d0ca646f571a90452322c0f131e2d2> <http://schema.org/description> "Author: English Nature. Report number: R344. English Nature Research Reports: 411. This report details the results of a study aimed at trialling three acoustic seabed mapping systems in Plymouth Sound, to determine their effectiveness in identifying and spatially discriminating marine benthic biotopes. A sidescan sonar, a swath-sounding interferometer and a normal beam acoustic ground discrimination system were compared over an established calibration area. The area was surveyed by each system on more than one occasion." .
_:c2b17bcfd0563931332b6bd88bd6d7a1 <http://schema.org/value> "marine benthic biotopes" .
_:c2b17bcfd0563931332b6bd88bd6d7a1 <http://schema.org/name> "ecosystems" .
