<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f4a34a9aca43752e2ca2120a9f6cac4254030b1d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ff161edffdb4d8ff672737edf8ebfd2e .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f4a34a9aca43752e2ca2120a9f6cac4254030b1d> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 60 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section and two shorter parallel sections to the north, west of the Outer Hebrides. The data were collected during May and June of 1983. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
_:f0517cfbdacd4214aef2a70e455b05c4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
