<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f43ea6650f0cec86061a7bd5c188a0c11de24890> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the monitoring programme stipulated within the FEPA Licence for the construction of a 129MW offshore wind farm on the Kentish Flats, Thames Estuary, fish monitoring surveys are required as little is known about the potential effects of wind farms in terms of enhancing or aggregating fish populations. Advice detailed in Annex I of the FEPA Licence (Licence 31780/03/0) for the Kentish Flats Wind Farm states that ‘adequate pre-construction baseline and post-construction surveys of fish populations in the area of the wind farm’ need be undertaken.\r\nThree surveys were programmed to be undertaken pre-construction with seasonal fish monitoring surveys\r\nundertaken following commissioning of the wind farm over a period of approximately 12 months\r\nencompassing the projected first operational year of the wind farm.\r\nThe following presents the survey details for the third survey conducted on the 10th August 2004." .
_:c63df22733ba4ae8be1d3329eb080f10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
