<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f3d6850e78312f51192e4d036b28e0906448b8de> <http://schema.org/description> "Survey of the inter-tidal areas between Burnham Overy and Cley West Bank specifically mapping the distribution of Eelgrass, Zostera, species. Survey was conducted to locate the eelgrass for future monitoring. Maps are hand drawn with OS grid references included." .
