<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f3b9afee5eb3e6db40f12a1cec310072ba3eedbc> <http://schema.org/description> "A collection of Non-Native Species sightings from Sussex Biodiversity Record Centre (SBRC). The species listed are Spartina anglica, Sargassum muticum, Undaria pinnatifida, Styela clava, Didemnum vexillum, Eriocheir sinensis, Crepidula fornicata, Ficopomatus enigmaticus and Crassostrea gigas." .
