<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f30f636f0696a0075e5d7c85041fea46a0839e60> <http://schema.org/description> "Fugro EMU Limited (Fugro EMU) was commissioned by Dong Energy (the Client) to undertake an asset\r\ninspection survey of Barrow Offshore Windfarm (BOW01) array and inter-array cables. The survey area was\r\nsituated in Morecambe Bay, approximately 25 km west of Heysham.\r\nThe survey utilised two Fugro owned vessels, Fugro Seeker and Valkyrie and was undertaken between 31\r\nAugust 2015 and 27 October 2015." .
