_:b655197c5c552f66e3fcdb2799d823d8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f3088879390c78da3053d4b02fef1493f3fe4155> <http://schema.org/description> "A survey of the pools at South Walney. The objectives were to determine to what extent the pools offer a saline lagoonal habitat, whether they support any specialist lagoonal species and to suggest future management which may enhance them. The survey was conducted by the Natural History Museum (NHM) on behalf of English Nature (EN)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f306957485085c8d7fb056a27870941df70dee7f> <http://schema.org/description> "Monitoring of this designated wreck site was undertaken by the Archaeological Diving Unit (ADU) between 1987 - 2002. Results of individual monitoring dives are described in associated project bibliography items listed below. The coordinates given for the site are derived from the RCAHMW record for the site, and while the size of the survey area is not specified in the associated ADU reports, the max and min depth range for the size is derived from them. No finds were recovered during ADU operations. The protected area around the wreck is a radius of 100m from the co-ordinate 53 25.16N 04 36.40W." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f306957485085c8d7fb056a27870941df70dee7f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b1c295938b3b62923b277ce6b44019e9 .
