<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f2d9b1d691704c9379b471e20647de5c8b72978a> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 77 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in May 1990 from stations covering the southern North Sea (Humber Estuary and The Wash). A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the North Sea Project Plumes Process Study." .
