<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f28c55c25883f81db7dde2cea9c18090a42557f7> <http://schema.org/description> "Terri Tarpey AIEEM have been commissioned by Hydrosearch Associates Ltd to conduct a botanical survey of three proposed cable routes associated with the Gunfleet Sands Offshore Windfarm project.\r\nThe project proposes that the cable will come ashore at the south end of Holland Haven (approximately TM 215168) and make its way to the electricity sub-station at Cook’s Green (TM 192189). Due to the presence of a Site of Special Scientific Interest (SSSI) along Holland Brook and part of Picker’s Ditch, three alternative routes were surveyed." .
