<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f2748a546ac3bce823e453628cb589e426305142> <http://schema.org/description> "Geomarine Ltd have been commissioned by Brough Head Wave Farm Ltd (BHWFL) to undertake a geotechnical desk study for phase 1 of the Brough Head Wave Farm which is to be located at Outshore Point on the west coast of Mainland, Orkney (Figure 1.1)." .
