_:f060da016e636edbf65f9936ec5ab0c7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f23c8f6397e3e0f763ccec1dce45feb4ac6b3f64> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS International Ltd (EGSi), were contracted by Centrica Renewable Energy Limited (CREL) to\r\nundertake a side scan sonar (SSS) and multibeam (MBES) clearance survey centred on the no cable\r\nzone (400m x 400m) adjacent to LS68 WTG at the Lincs Offshore Wind Farm. The surveys were\r\nrequired to support the safe emplacement of a jack-up vessel adjacent to the WTG for maintenance\r\npurposes.\r\nThis series details the operations and results of the survey around the LS68 turbine." .
_:e35dc9ba50ae317973bfe0c16848e3ba <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:f060da016e636edbf65f9936ec5ab0c7 <http://schema.org/value> "EGS International Ltd" .
