<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f217cee74699a0265994bdb9bad5bd1489538ecc> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 17 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during December 1993 - January 1994 from stations in the North East Atlantic between 45 - 50 N, 5 - 15 E. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Bremen, Center for Marine Environmental Sciences as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
