<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f1b186593afaff6a8633ca5e4a3da6c47761a8d7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ea21abe41ebebc7e9969dab15d0e5850 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f1b186593afaff6a8633ca5e4a3da6c47761a8d7> <http://schema.org/description> "The report presents the findings of a series of sublittoral surveys carried out within the Berwickshire and North Northumberland Coast cSAC during the summers of 2002 and 2003. The objectives of the surveys were to utilise repeatable standard methods to obtain data that could be used to assess the conservation status of the site. The methods used broadly followed those outlined in the Procedural Guidelines in the Marine Monitoring Handbook. Six drop down video transects were undertaken across the cSAC to record biotope distribution and diversity." .
