<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f12951179df3e934df742a30d8bcda547fe4d09d> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 11 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from the North Sea area including specifically Wee Bankie, Marr Bank and the Firth of Forth during March 2004. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
