_:f1afe1bb894bf4b9325d59a68da347f3 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:f1afe1bb894bf4b9325d59a68da347f3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f1afe1bb894bf4b9325d59a68da347f3 <http://schema.org/value> "Barrow Offshore Wind Ltd" .
_:f1afe1bb894bf4b9325d59a68da347f3 <http://schema.org/value> "Subacoustech Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f0f34a3d5903951b8767060323481afccdabb3db> <http://schema.org/description> "This report has been prepared by Subacoustech Ltd for Barrow Offshore Wind Ltd. It describes a series of underwater acoustic measurements undertaken in and around the Barrow Offshore Wind Farm site, on the 30th January and 1st February 2007. The purpose of the measurement programme was to characterise any increase in the ambient subsea noise due to the presence of the operational wind farm, and to assess the range over which any increase in noise occurred." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f0f34a3d5903951b8767060323481afccdabb3db> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f1afe1bb894bf4b9325d59a68da347f3 .
