_:d9c949a19a1c91fb7f5b34521a74799a <http://schema.org/value> "Loch Moidart" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f0de95e01c96ccc222cc4fd388260609b8860fc5> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d8214849704f18cd0b9abe7dd1c5aa23 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f0de95e01c96ccc222cc4fd388260609b8860fc5> <http://schema.org/description> "The principle purpose of this project is to carry out site condition monitoring (SCM) of the intertidal sediment flats of Loch Moidart and Shiel Woods SAC site. SCM was inaugurated at this SSSI site in 2003, providing a baseline for future SCM surveys. The study approach taken aims to enable re-surveying of 16 relocatable stations along 5 transects that are representative of the biological and environmental diversity of the sediment flats in the SAC in order to 1) establish a baseline biological dataset to facilitate future assessment; 2) identify any deterioration in the condition of the mudflat feature; and 3) to form a judgement on its current condition." .
_:f567f07c3ae67e3aaf0358623597b91d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
