<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f0416c9b5529cc451467b655dddb1cd102d97a79> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:d62b18b8b16840d0b79e1228aed21ebd <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f0416c9b5529cc451467b655dddb1cd102d97a79> <http://schema.org/description> "Detailed survey of the Eddystone grounds with the aim of gaining knowledge on the distribution of seabed fauna in order to explain whether differences in community composition were a response to the nature of the bottom deposit." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f0416c9b5529cc451467b655dddb1cd102d97a79> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d62b18b8b16840d0b79e1228aed21ebd .
