<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef9597fb97417cd87cc6c5e9ba7089ac4ba63958> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a8a576d948ef170602549c7b9b471aa0 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef9597fb97417cd87cc6c5e9ba7089ac4ba63958> <http://schema.org/description> "Data contains effort sightings of sea birds recorded during survey work conducted by Marinelife. Sightings are plotted using latitude and longitude recorded from a GPS." .
