_:c30502a4bc8232af52a2ccaf080bb254 <http://schema.org/value> "English Channel" .
_:deab49193f7923a998ecdf1121bf6d1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:deab49193f7923a998ecdf1121bf6d1 <http://schema.org/name> "policies" .
_:deab49193f7923a998ecdf1121bf6d1 <http://schema.org/value> "FEPA Act" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef9112f9ea6a8cddbb3f137d6bf7e1e046c70e8a> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the onshore and offshore elements of the environmental pre-construction monitoring undertaken at the site of the Barrow offshore wind farm to comply with the conditions of the FEPA Act. In some cases repeat surveys will take place to determine the changes following construction or once the wind farm installation is completed. Subsequent annual reports will present results from monitoring surveys during construction and operation, and seek to assess whether any changes seen are a result of wind farm construction or operation." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef9112f9ea6a8cddbb3f137d6bf7e1e046c70e8a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:deab49193f7923a998ecdf1121bf6d1 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef9112f9ea6a8cddbb3f137d6bf7e1e046c70e8a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f7b302198549f04e8eb43b7b208f799c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef8c3751220ec2c50f1b2cb788afb5c45049316c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef8c3751220ec2c50f1b2cb788afb5c45049316c> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 52 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically all across the northern North Sea and around the Orkney and Shetland Islands. The data were collected during January and February of 2007. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef8c3751220ec2c50f1b2cb788afb5c45049316c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c12fff09f9f8ec55a44312e5cea309be .
