_:bd0cc2942f1cf16dc1575be2a35ef1af <http://schema.org/value> "Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA)" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef5a323b13eb2f46728523ab49c1d3d71dd7af72> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1546; Thames Routine Resurvey 2017, TE19 Fishermans Gat, Area in SqKm: 15; TE5a Trinity DW Long Sand Focused, Area in SqKm: 11; TE5a Sunk DW Focused, Area in SqKm: 4; TE3a Sunk, Area in SqKm: 9, (16/05/2017 to 06/11/2017), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: RRS. FY 2017/18. Contractor: EGS." .
_:dc407511f24e57bfa37d219e32928bce <http://schema.org/value> "Echinodermata" .
