_:dc7290bd387e0a8378c2a3373dff162c <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
_:b443d7335703bc63fa3e8c61ef8a49c8 <http://schema.org/value> "Department of Geology and Oceanography" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef4e7e47ed3215b232f6b66932b69e26aa4f22ee> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 33 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in September 1993 from stations in La Chapelle Bank and Biscay between 47 - 48 N, 5 - 10 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Bordeaux 1, Department of Geology and Oceanography as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
_:d1ee7e380f1400fe1a7fff5660386ce4 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef2ceb77a7f2a994b9809bf92c7d92ac5ac7b15a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ec1f7ea528db3d3e9060ed74655a8d1e .
_:af663e61c428e055d4e332eeefe7c060 <http://schema.org/value> "fish" .
_:ec1f7ea528db3d3e9060ed74655a8d1e <http://schema.org/value> "CAR licence" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef2ceb77a7f2a994b9809bf92c7d92ac5ac7b15a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:af663e61c428e055d4e332eeefe7c060 .
_:ec1f7ea528db3d3e9060ed74655a8d1e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:ec1f7ea528db3d3e9060ed74655a8d1e <http://schema.org/name> "policies" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef2ceb77a7f2a994b9809bf92c7d92ac5ac7b15a> <http://schema.org/description> "Benthic monitoring of the sea bed adjacent to the fish farm as a requirement of the CAR licence for the site. Grab samples collected in proximity to the farm and at two reference locations. Samples analysed for: benthos, redox, psa, carbon and sea-louse medicine residues." .
_:af663e61c428e055d4e332eeefe7c060 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:af663e61c428e055d4e332eeefe7c060 <http://schema.org/name> "migratory marine species" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef2ceb77a7f2a994b9809bf92c7d92ac5ac7b15a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:dec6494204058bbf410606b075c89d5d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:dec6494204058bbf410606b075c89d5d <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:af69e84b1cbcc43e9d54c92480171eca <http://schema.org/value> "EMU Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef2c7c7f29364bfe30f087e1747c03917c32de85> <http://schema.org/description> "Preliminary engineering design work and discussions with stakeholders highlighted a number of issues relating to the cable corridor and the indicative cable routes submitted in the original consent applications for both the proposed Docking Shoal and Race Bank Offshore Wind Farms. Three additional seabed areas were surveyed to allow minor alterations to the original cable routes. EMU Ltd undertake a full acoustic survey with ground-truthing, to determine benthic habitats, bathymetry, topography, subsurface geology and the locations of any magnetic anomalies within these areas." .
_:dec6494204058bbf410606b075c89d5d <http://schema.org/value> "ground-truthing" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef2c7c7f29364bfe30f087e1747c03917c32de85> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:dec6494204058bbf410606b075c89d5d <http://schema.org/value> "acoustic survey" .
