_:af69e84b1cbcc43e9d54c92480171eca <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:bba80bdfa436ed379cfec568c240ace4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:bba80bdfa436ed379cfec568c240ace4 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
_:b1693e65c066969646e316340a5780c7 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef20c7e3c651ebbf7f68db276ecf94db140954ac> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 166 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in September 1998 from sites centred at 59 20 N, 1 E covering the northern North Sea. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Alfred Wegener Institute for Polar and Marine Research as part of the PROcesses of Vertical Exchange in Shelf Seas (PROVESS) project." .
_:c573afcba9acf9b9f52154b7819f642e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
