_:eb013759925e35901d3f5f88e6c82c40 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ef007791f605ef254c4f252d274fe8ba73581661> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 73 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, incorporating the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section and a CTD survey of the Clyde Sea. The data were collected during May of 1993. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
_:eb013759925e35901d3f5f88e6c82c40 <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
_:b833786f5252ecf52041e1fe3d4b1f98 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
