_:c2f26b657c6e4155f3c10e34e8c32ad8 <http://schema.org/value> "Harbour porpoise" .
_:c2f26b657c6e4155f3c10e34e8c32ad8 <http://schema.org/name> "marine species" .
_:ac9469dcf1873809119eafbd221468cd <http://schema.org/value> "DMP Statistical Solutions UK Limited" .
_:c4872cb7088bd977f38cbb160b457ed4 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
