<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eeee6a0fa3f9e2b094670feb6d49aa32ad60dc68> <http://schema.org/description> "Phase 1 of the construction of an offshore wind farm situated midway between the Kent and Essex coastlines and more than 20km from each shore. Phase 1 comprises 175 turbines, 2 offshore substations, and 4 export cables to the shore. This particular part of the project is the archaeological assessment of 2012/ 2013 marine geophysical survey data for the turbine and inter-array cables as part of the post-installation archaeological monitoring of the wind farm." .
_:d33c20146261570f0548a1aa988d51a4 <http://schema.org/value> "Kent" .
_:d33c20146261570f0548a1aa988d51a4 <http://schema.org/value> "Essex" .
