<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eea99d255c79f4e383cc44695f94b5e34977d1ce> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f1ccf97dfd8686667ef1950d0de28833 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eea99d255c79f4e383cc44695f94b5e34977d1ce> <http://schema.org/description> "Dogger Bank Teesside A &amp; B, the subject of this ES, are the first and second\r\nprojects of the second stage of the Dogger Bank development. Forewind’s\r\ndevelopment of the Dogger Bank Zone began with Dogger Bank Creyke Beck\r\nfor which planning application was lodged during 2013. Dogger Bank Teesside\r\nA &amp; B will comprise two wind farms, each generating up to 1.2GW, and will\r\nconnect to the existing National Grid substation at Lackenby, in Teesside.\r\nDogger Bank Teesside A &amp; B projects will have a total combined generating\r\ncapacity of up to 2.4GW." .
_:d20674863cc1987d4fdb5fe7530f42b1 <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eea99d255c79f4e383cc44695f94b5e34977d1ce> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f1ccf97dfd8686667ef1950d0de28833 .
