_:a6d8e9c1abd5a8b7189ab56c19d75f8c <http://schema.org/value> "Islay" .
_:a6d8e9c1abd5a8b7189ab56c19d75f8c <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ee343b1963c3a222f6c2f5a11108cfeb2a213a87> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 54 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates the Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section, a section from west of Rockall to the shelf break due west of Islay then on to Islay and a section across the North Channel from Islay to Lough Foyle. The data were collected during February and March of 1991. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
_:e482f67a51bb597f168a3aa479068169 <http://schema.org/value> "Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory" .
_:a6d8e9c1abd5a8b7189ab56c19d75f8c <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
