<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:edcd43260bf5452a10c71086aadeab90dd96b111> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 122 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically along the JONSIS standard section in the northern North Sea, along the standard Faroe Shetland Channel sections. The data were collected during April and May of 1999. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
