_:fa66e80e4e0a56329a76a434025d758 <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed7e21b6583708276462a44ff6284df84eb0567a> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1426; DWR via DR1 -Southern Part, Area in SqKm: 659, (03/05/2014 to 12/12/2014), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Medium. FY 2014/15. Contractor: MMT UK." .
_:fa66e80e4e0a56329a76a434025d758 <http://schema.org/value> "Civil Hydrography Programme" .
_:fa66e80e4e0a56329a76a434025d758 <http://schema.org/value> "Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA)" .
