_:ed7fc12df17c93f98732ab640db156a1 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed4e36997b7f1c40913105a3eae1d813e890e877> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ef6761b8fba031bfd89224893d507801 <http://schema.org/value> "Greater Gabbard\r\n Offshore Wind Farm" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed4e36997b7f1c40913105a3eae1d813e890e877> <http://schema.org/description> "As the final report for the ornithological monitoring programme at Greater Gabbard\r\n Offshore Wind Farm (GGOWF), this report provides the collation, analysis and\r\n presentation of the full survey data from the monitoring programme. The monitoring\r\n programme covers the period from April 2004 to August 2015 and encompasses preconstruction,\r\n construction and post-construction periods of the wind farm development\r\n (with a break in survey coverage from May 2006 to May 2008). The findings reported\r\n here are intended to meet the ornithological monitoring objectives of the Marine Licence.\r\n These findings supersede those presented in previous annual reports for the GGOWF\r\n monitoring programme." .
_:c5d6c479efbcbc2c51bb4ab5795a93e8 <http://schema.org/name> "policies" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed4e36997b7f1c40913105a3eae1d813e890e877> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c5d6c479efbcbc2c51bb4ab5795a93e8 .
