<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed466929c24c8ce49e1ebdceaa5a22f4346cb6b9> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a15d939a0e6bc65a151127f74a93106f .
_:a15d939a0e6bc65a151127f74a93106f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed466929c24c8ce49e1ebdceaa5a22f4346cb6b9> <http://schema.org/description> "The environmental baseline survey was required to provide baseline data relating to the physico-chemical and macrofaunal benthic environment. The environmental survey comprised grab sampling for physicochemical and biological analysis. Geophysical data were used to assist with the environmental survey strategy and subsequent environmental data interpretation." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed466929c24c8ce49e1ebdceaa5a22f4346cb6b9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
