<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed3e3ae6b85912f052f76e2b1a0f4a35fdb4b50d> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June - July 1989. It incorporates CTD profiles at intervals along a track from North of Iceland to St. John's, Newfoundland. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
_:ed6c3daf29122a76be2db980623cd320 <http://schema.org/value> "Newfoundland" .
_:df7930f6a7bc3f7835696046a6c3efec <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
