<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ed3a4e727fc5e2855a988f2977aa70027d119812> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 17 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April - May 1991 from stations in the North East Atlantic, in an area approximately bounded by the coordinates 38 - 51 N, 2 - 30 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the James Rennell Centre for Ocean Circulation as part of the UK's contribution to the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE)." .
