_:bfd40d2803ca5ead43e8eda1bd29859b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ecab07b912c8eeec9dba72a73a577951b64fdc5f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bfd40d2803ca5ead43e8eda1bd29859b .
_:d0939acd94413795e74d527a25b20881 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
