_:d0939acd94413795e74d527a25b20881 <http://schema.org/value> "Bristol Channel" .
_:bfd40d2803ca5ead43e8eda1bd29859b <http://schema.org/value> "RPS Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ecab07b912c8eeec9dba72a73a577951b64fdc5f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ecab07b912c8eeec9dba72a73a577951b64fdc5f> <http://schema.org/description> "A visual assessment of the proposed Atlantic Array offshore wind farm and proposed onshore substation at Alverdiscott was conducted by RPS Ltd. This series contains maps associated with this assessment, which show the visual impact of the proposed wind farm on the Bristol Channel coastline (turbine heights of both 165m and 220m were considered), and Zones of Theoretical Visibility (ZTV) for the proposed substation. The visual impact on surrounding designated areas was also mapped." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ecab07b912c8eeec9dba72a73a577951b64fdc5f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d0939acd94413795e74d527a25b20881 .
