_:c6b36b68c4bf97026e7ee74e99008950 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ec7f5f6c5c7c72fad986d3e972bd902b69599b61> <http://schema.org/description> "In May 2012 EGS (International) Ltd was contracted to undertake a pre-construction\r\n geophysical and bathymetric survey of the export cable route of the future Walney Extension\r\n (WOW03) windfarm site. The surveyed areas were located 22-30 km north-northwest of\r\n Walney Island, UK. Survey operations were carried out in three distinct locations; Block 1\r\n and two separate cable routes String 2 and String 3. The survey was a Part 1 Consent and\r\n Environmental survey, data gathered for which is anticipated to lead to consent for grab\r\n sampling at the proposed sites.\r\n EGS conducted a high-frequency Multibeam Echo Sounder (MBES) bathymetric survey,\r\n combined with side-scan sonar (SSS), magnetometer and seismic sub-bottom systems. A\r\n pole-mounted Kongsberg HiPAP 351P/5 USBL was used for accurate sub-surface positioning\r\n of the towed instruments." .
_:d60e115ec773a07156532a3212d74f8a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c6b36b68c4bf97026e7ee74e99008950 <http://schema.org/value> "Walney Island" .
_:f9c8e8e4763c7b6886a1130ccf731bef <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
