<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ec796a491b891feb65e820e02f8ae518b57df7d5> <http://schema.org/description> "Two sites at Mothecombe were surveyed using two different methods. Push netting and seine netting were carried out at Coastguard Beach and Meadowsfoot Beach respectively. The species caught, by both methods, were recorded as both the frequency (count data) and the lengths of each individual." .
