<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ec512b8c6f6983259847a1307a8f05a76ed41ca0> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June 1982. It incorporates a section across the continental slope west of Porcupine Bank. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
_:eeaea0f58242b230dff021151cb9d99a <http://schema.org/value> "Porcupine Bank" .
