_:c5391b82288fb725628982a38b654958 <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica" .
_:c3e5ff2512e0900e852dce461e3c82ef <http://schema.org/value> "Wells-next-the-sea" .
_:c3e5ff2512e0900e852dce461e3c82ef <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ec437f671e9ed4379c5df1000cf94cd1fde5b1e4> <http://schema.org/description> "This project describes the Environmental Statement for Docking Shoal offshore wind farm. It aims to provide an overview of the key findings of the Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) undertaken by Centrica as part of the consent application. The proposed Docking Shoal offshore wind farm is 14 kilometres (9 miles) off of the coast of Wells-next-the-sea on the North Norfolk coast and approximately 19.5 kilometres (12 miles) from Skegness on the Lincolnshire coast. The Environmental Impact Assessment covers various themes that may be impacted from the construction of an offshore wind farm. These include surveys to observe Archaeology, Ornithology, Shipping and Navigation, Marine Ecology and Noise." .
_:c3e5ff2512e0900e852dce461e3c82ef <http://schema.org/value> "Skegness" .
