<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eb4fe3ee39d8160f54972fa56d7e1bc1e6ee8881> <http://schema.org/description> "Between 30/04/2010 and 21/07/2010, the jack-up rig Buzzard carried out pile-driving at 30\r\ngenerator sites and at one substation for the Ormonde Offshore Wind Farm in UKCS block\r\n113/28 in the Irish Sea. The document in this series reports on the implementation of a plan to mitigate\r\npotential impacts of pile-driving noise on marine mammals arising from these operations." .
