<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eb16e55f9ac1a1ca07cfe7570d268ec6b17ea976> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1159; Dover Strait TSS (A &amp; B), Area in SqKm: 1644; Dover Strait TSS (C), Area in SqKm: 889, (28/06/2006 to 25/09/2006), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1). Contract: Shallow (LT). FY 2006/07. Contractor: Fugro OSAE." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eb09e76f0bcf8502c7d489813a14635ae2ed6d9f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d7403ce4e78d31d046fc940663b3c1f8 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eb09e76f0bcf8502c7d489813a14635ae2ed6d9f> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 157 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically West of Scotland during February of 1985. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
