<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:eaf372361112efba5cb2504e3d15369303bd59ed> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during May - June 1979. It incorporates CTD sections off the Somalian and Kenyan coasts. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory to look at the structure of the Somalian Current." .
