<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ea7e124a1fd1d62a350ac1f9bebb9a3ce9b431e6> <http://schema.org/description> "Environmental baseline survey centred on the proposed S2 well location. Objective to acquire sufficient seabed information with which to establish the sediment physico-chemical characteristics and benthic community composition in the vicinity of the proposed well location." .
