_:c51f05a8985ad29a2102aee707a320fd <http://schema.org/value> "Firth of Clyde" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ea650b68a408c2dd08caf877a06f71016c38c5fc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c51f05a8985ad29a2102aee707a320fd .
