<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ea650b68a408c2dd08caf877a06f71016c38c5fc> <http://schema.org/description> "This marine multibeam survey took place in March 2007 in the Firth of Clyde on board the vessel Remote Sensor. The survey was carried out by Aspect Land &amp; Hydrographic Surveys on behalf of the British Geological Survey (BGS). Multibeam bathymetry data was collected using a Simrad EM3002D. These data are archived by BGS." .
_:e4e31985db380c2b703ab2b4537795cf <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ea63aedf506d8cb14656dd63cc2a4eaddbd0d396> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e4e31985db380c2b703ab2b4537795cf .
_:e4e31985db380c2b703ab2b4537795cf <http://schema.org/value> "Humber Plume" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ea63aedf506d8cb14656dd63cc2a4eaddbd0d396> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:e4e31985db380c2b703ab2b4537795cf <http://schema.org/value> "Humber Estuary" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ea63aedf506d8cb14656dd63cc2a4eaddbd0d396> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August 1993. It incorporates a CTD survey of the Humber Estuary, Humber Plume, the Wash and Norfolk coastal waters and CTD sections E-W across the North Sea along 53N and 53.5N. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory as part of the Joint Nutrient Study I (JoNuS)." .
_:e4e31985db380c2b703ab2b4537795cf <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e4e31985db380c2b703ab2b4537795cf <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea" .
_:b72ee998dc4ced50bd7f351427766598 <http://schema.org/value> "Race Bank" .
_:b1cb0006d86ed1cc5500496367d51006 <http://schema.org/value> "AMEC Power and Process Europe" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ea362e5aee4878ca5f918c25ada403d5b3846c25> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b1cb0006d86ed1cc5500496367d51006 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ea362e5aee4878ca5f918c25ada403d5b3846c25> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
