<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ea18e9c9d627a7c366128c2bf3b9c375a9dfcd5c> <http://schema.org/description> "An oil and gas industry site survey acquired in August 2009. The block number traversed was 48/30. The 2D HR seismic survey covered an area for the site of a proposed development drilling location and two new proposed platforms in the Deborah Field." .
