_:a6dea4009d3fb56d95595f347ffa459a <http://schema.org/value> "South West Black Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ea0a72ba705da10e9968e696082090586b298ff0> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset consists of measurements of horizontal and vertical current velocity and of vertical profiles of temperature and salinity collected during cruise PE372 in the Bosphorus Strait and South West Black Sea, June and July 2013 . Pelagia cruise PE372 formed part of the field collection of project \"Flow dynamics and sedimentation in an active submarine channel: a process-product approach\" which was composed of NERC Discovery Science lead grant NE/F020511/1 and 2 child grants: NE/F020120/1 and NE/F020279/1" .
