_:e861e0fef4344b7dbc0131f06e7d507e <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea" .
_:e861e0fef4344b7dbc0131f06e7d507e <http://schema.org/value> "Greenland" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e9f2853da92bb35a715f896c01e48573e9b4a637> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 72 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June - July 1988. The dataset includes two totally separate components with work in the North Sea (associated with the NERC North Sea Project) en route to and from the working area off Greenland. First, a set of sections off East Greenland at the southern end of the Denmark Strait. Secondly, a set of three sections perpendicular to the Yorkshire coast between Whitby and the Tees. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
_:d014c85bb5a824ac758915791dd18a93 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
