<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e8d8822411ce4b7a7d519f40f4faa2ecc6bee8a2> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1223; Long Sand Head (A), Area in SqKm: 8; Long Sand Head (B), Area in SqKm: 7; Long Sand Head (C), Area in SqKm: 2, (04/05/2007 to 16/05/2007), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2006/07. Contractor: MMT." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e8d8822411ce4b7a7d519f40f4faa2ecc6bee8a2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
