<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e8d3cf77ced3d8d77ca4f4c4a2440f377c30ecdb> <http://schema.org/description> "ECON Ecological Consultancy Limited were commissioned to undertake boat based ornithological surveys of the Dudgeon Offshore Wind Farm site for two years to provide an estimate of numbers of birds using or flying over the site to assist with the Environmental Statement submission. The two years will run from December 2007 to December 2009 and the first year of monitoring data is provided here." .
