<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e808e912ee7b6d173f579d08f4997b5ad9894a06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e808e912ee7b6d173f579d08f4997b5ad9894a06> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during March 1987. It incorporates CTD sections across the shelf west of Jura and Islay, between Islay and Mull, Islay and Northern Ireland and at two points across the North Channel plus a full CTD survey of the Clyde Sea. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
_:a407c61e2df6df85c5a5a0e3504d3ae8 <http://schema.org/value> "Tyne" .
_:a407c61e2df6df85c5a5a0e3504d3ae8 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e8056b1bec894779fb0be988a760b8b4bb590ac8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a407c61e2df6df85c5a5a0e3504d3ae8 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e8056b1bec894779fb0be988a760b8b4bb590ac8> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during October - November 1989. It incorporates anchor stations and a CTD section in the Marsden Bay area off the Tyne. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e8056b1bec894779fb0be988a760b8b4bb590ac8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
