_:b7160d573191d89e3eb8622e673afcd0 <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e73fd1373c212168d2b707a9aa5c4e67c1e3a782> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) regional marine sampling survey (comprised of two legs) took place in June/July 1977 in waters to the north and west of Scotland on board the MV Ferder. Seabed cores were collected using a wireline drilling system along with push and hammer sampling . These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Internal Report 77/8 &amp; 9." .
