_:dec11fbb22f7e305fe077560527375aa <http://schema.org/value> "DONG\r\nEnergy" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e7001e867e7c5f00cd0aeb6ebe65985de3ecfcf7> <http://schema.org/description> "The Port of London Authority (PLA) Hydrographic Service was commissioned by DONG\r\nEnergy to undertake a survey of scour protection and the surrounding bed at the WTG\r\nlocations at Gunfleet Sands in the Thames Estuary.\r\n\r\nThe scope of work, for the April 2013 survey was for a MBES survey of an area the\r\nseabed, a minimum of 100m from the outer extent of the rock protection around the\r\nlocations of installed bases of WTG F00 and G00.\r\n\r\nThis series covers survey elements which were undertaken on the 25th &amp; 26th April 2013." .
_:dec11fbb22f7e305fe077560527375aa <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
