_:d6cf023e01a78ca5af692924082cd9b1 <http://schema.org/value> "depth" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e6738a095728299c875145b4e6aa26cec2c11e4c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e665f399e90368321b31f23247a4fff5e7c9930a> <http://schema.org/description> "Fugro Alluvial Offshore Limited (FAOL) was requested by Dong Energy Power (UK) Limited to perform a\r\ngeotechnical investigation at the site to provide soils information to assist in the design and installation of a\r\ncable route.\r\n\r\nThe work was performed from the Fugro Commander from 25 October to 16 November 2012 in accordance with\r\ninstructions received from Dong Energy Power (UK) Limited." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e665f399e90368321b31f23247a4fff5e7c9930a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
