<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e60b8133be9e149ae2663ab722b617f0767885c4> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the results of the multibeam echosounder bathymetric survey of the cable export route from the Gunfleet Sands offshore wind farm site. The survey was carried out by DEEP BV on behalf of V+S Marine Contracting. The surveys were conducted between the dates of April 23rd 2008 and May 2nd 2008." .
_:a9f7f24dd8fcef31fcf2056e82c0a39b <http://schema.org/value> "multibeam echosounder bathymetric survey" .
_:d2bbfebb2e18a87025ee81a4e3e184c7 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
