_:dcc2140e4a2d4d1becd77fdd6fdab043 <http://schema.org/value> "MMT" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e5d21e5a3caf41d892b6141783dda13ff2a7201c> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1202; Westray &amp; Stronsay Firth, Area in SqKm: 221, (09/11/2006 to 28/12/2006), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2006/07. Contractor: MMT." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e5d21e5a3caf41d892b6141783dda13ff2a7201c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:dcc2140e4a2d4d1becd77fdd6fdab043 .
