<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e5aa242fc83fd200352bb7281b476310be704d76> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e7a7e6ed18237fbd94a39358312f4dcd .
_:d37ac267e7f9bb2987a0f41e7e3436f0 <http://schema.org/value> "Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e5aa242fc83fd200352bb7281b476310be704d76> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 30 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in March 2008 throughout Liverpool Bay and the Dee Estuary. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the National Oceanography Centre (formerly the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory), Liverpool Bay/Irish Sea Coastal Observatory initiative." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e5aa242fc83fd200352bb7281b476310be704d76> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
