<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e56de07da9ed3b7798b0f502e4e0ec1abfc16d2f> <http://schema.org/description> "This series contains a dataset which displays vessel tracks observed during two week Maritime Traffic Survey for Atlantic Array OWF project. The data was collected by AIS, Radar and visual observation by two survey vessels deployed within Bristol Channel Zone between the 14th and 23rd April, 2010. There are also numerous reports within this series." .
