_:a81d53a6689fb911fe51c21af440b14 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e5480390a29b9ccd17f1fb7fa0c6e9f02aa060f4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e5480390a29b9ccd17f1fb7fa0c6e9f02aa060f4> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of this benthic survey in the southern region of Kyle Rhea was to improve knowledge of the occurrence and distribution of species and habitats of recognised conservation importance, particularly priority marine features (PMFs), and to ground-truth multibeam data. An underwater video and still photograph survey was conducted by MSS for MSS on the 13th of May 2010 to collect detailed biological information on the seabed species and habitat features present. Drop-down video drift tows were undertaken at 4 sites in the area. The images, analysed under SNH contract by Dr Colin Moore, were used to describe the nature of the seabed in terms of the physical structure and the species assemblages." .
_:a81d53a6689fb911fe51c21af440b14 <http://schema.org/value> "SNH" .
