<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e50dd8b180921b8127147b45bf470a4296d77db6> <http://schema.org/description> "Dataset Description: QC and re-interpretion of 2D seismic data;\r\n Centrica Project: Round 3 Irish Sea - Zone 9 Offshore Wind Farm Development;\r\n Project Phase: Consenting;\r\n\r\n Work Carried Out By: Eurotech;\r\n \r\n Corresponding Centrica Document Title: QC and Interpretation of Irish Sea Zone 2D Seismic Dataset.\r\n Corresponding Centrica Document No: R3-D-EN-078-0000-000000-019.\r\n Available Datasets and supporting documentation:\r\n 1.\tKingdom Project files" .
