<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e50bf2c672c036c3c5582ac1b53fb52cd797e010> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e50bf2c672c036c3c5582ac1b53fb52cd797e010> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:acf96aceda48a3b2593362e91d0ed3e5 .
_:acf96aceda48a3b2593362e91d0ed3e5 <http://schema.org/value> "Stakmap/Fishermap" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e50bf2c672c036c3c5582ac1b53fb52cd797e010> <http://schema.org/description> "This geodatabase contains manually digitised GI created during the Stakmap/Fishermap participatory mapping research project. The geometries have been cleansed and non polygonal features have been converted into polygons using a 300m buffer. \r\n One condition of the research was that only those interviewees who explicitly gave permission for their data to be shared would have their own mapping represented in the final product shared with third parties. All other individuals have had their data removed from this feature class. \r\n Where interviewees gave permission to share there data it has been presented in a suite of three feature classes '_activity_individual', '_additional_individual', '_club_individual'.\r\n \r\n This feature class gives details on the accuracy of the data offered, records the nature of the interview and describes how many people were represented by this interviewee. The number of individuals represented in this feature class will be lower than that described in the [sector]_activity_individual feature class. Only individuals who submitted information on representivity are included." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e50246956a70a673582dd655a44d718a814e633f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:df8fc5b9cccbb18fdb109622a7bd8d83 .
