<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e4fbbf51cb5523d6bfda27348b5055fae6e54902> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 341 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in June 1990 from stations covering the southern North Sea and English Channel. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the North Sea Project Blooms/Chemistry Process Study." .
_:c40d4cc565d4bc48ff5e2e486172b689 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
