<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e47885de5c3a8c58c0d131e5adab877dbbbf6e37> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral surveys of North Devon including Beckland, Ilframcobe, Morte Bay, Clovelly, Appledore and Westward Ho!. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes 1992-93 Beckland littoral survey, 1992-94 Devon Wildlife Trust Ilfracombe littoral survey, 1992-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Morte Bay littoral survey, 1993 Devon Wildlife Trust Clovelly littoral survey, 1993-94 Devon Wildlife Trust Appledore and Westward Ho! littoral survey." .
