<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e44d24fea9a5a793c9ca5d6587b515ba6b6d315a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f2d479998c3d1f6af11c1bd570076b88 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e44d24fea9a5a793c9ca5d6587b515ba6b6d315a> <http://schema.org/description> "This Environmental Statement has been\r\nprepared for Westermost Rough Ltd. to\r\nsupport its application for consent, licenses,\r\npermissions etc. for the construction\r\nof an offshore windfarm in the North Sea\r\noff the Yorkshire coast at Tunstall, with associated\r\nonshore works in East Riding of\r\nYorkshire County.\r\nThe aspiration has been to prepare a clear\r\nand concise Environmental Statement,\r\nwhich nevertheless provides a sufficiently\r\ndetailed description of the construction\r\nand impacts. Consequently, large amounts\r\nof background information, survey results\r\nand data have been structured as annexes\r\nto the report. They are all provided in this series, along with a revised addendum to the Environmental Statement published in 2012." .
_:f2d479998c3d1f6af11c1bd570076b88 <http://schema.org/value> "Tunstall" .
_:f2d479998c3d1f6af11c1bd570076b88 <http://schema.org/value> "Yorkshire coast" .
