_:a8b51355bbbb0dece93fe7c3fbe5bc7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a8b51355bbbb0dece93fe7c3fbe5bc7 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e42d21e76551ac5c3803531e786b5b68efb45c42> <http://schema.org/description> "Series Description: Race Bank and Docking Shoal Geotechnical Investigations Reports; Centrica Project: Docking Shoal Offshore Wind Farm Development; Project Phase: Consenting; Survey Title : Race Bank and Docking Shoal Geotechnical Investigations – Report on Ground Investigations; Date Range: 2004-2005; Surveyor: Fugro Engineering Services Limited (FES); Vessel/Platform: Voe Venture /Jack Up Platform FES1; Available reports and supporting documentation: Report, Drawings and Photos (.pdf)\r\n\r\nFugro Engineering Services Limited(FES) carried out this geotechnical investigation under the supervision of BOMEL Ltd, in order to determine the ground conditions at the site- proposed Docking Shoal Wind farm area- and provide information that would assist in the geotechnical aspects of the design of the proposed works" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e42d21e76551ac5c3803531e786b5b68efb45c42> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
