_:d923fa02204ed66672751e19d0b3685 <http://schema.org/name> "marine biodiversity" .
_:d923fa02204ed66672751e19d0b3685 <http://schema.org/value> "cetaceans" .
_:d923fa02204ed66672751e19d0b3685 <http://schema.org/value> "seabirds" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e411c2adc9b29a66d1063c3d811b2431e13932a2> <http://schema.org/description> "Shore based monitoring at the Brough Head Wave Farm Limited Agreement for Lease (AfL) area. The data collected will allow the numbers and distribution of seabirds and cetaceans using the waters surrounding the proposed deployment site to be characterised, along with their behaviour. This information will be used to inform an Environment Impact Assessment" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e411c2adc9b29a66d1063c3d811b2431e13932a2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:c77bf4dac9578513c5efedeaa77ccb9b <http://schema.org/value> "Archive for Marine Species and Habitats Data" .
_:c77bf4dac9578513c5efedeaa77ccb9b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e401a4853e6de4018f7ee92866146c7fac79779d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c77bf4dac9578513c5efedeaa77ccb9b .
_:c77bf4dac9578513c5efedeaa77ccb9b <http://schema.org/value> "Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e401a4853e6de4018f7ee92866146c7fac79779d> <http://schema.org/description> "Full coverage multibeam survey collecting bathymetry and backscatter to client specifications, namely International Hydrographic Organization (IHO) Order 1a standard, WGS84 latitude and longitude co-ordinates collected by Differential Global Positioning System (D-GPS), depths corrected to Chart Datum (CD), crosslines run at 20 times spacing of main lines. Raw and processed data delivered to Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science, UK (Cefas) complete with georeferenced mosaics and GeoTiffs images. These data are archived with the Marine Environmental Data and Information Network (MEDIN) Data Archive Centres (DACs) including the British Geological Survey (BGS) DAC for geology and geophysics, The Archive for Marine Species and Habitats Data (DASSH) and the United Kingdom Hydrographic Office (UKHO) bathymetry DAC. The full site data package including raw is also available on request from BGS." .
_:c77bf4dac9578513c5efedeaa77ccb9b <http://schema.org/value> "Marine Environmental Data and Information Network" .
_:c77bf4dac9578513c5efedeaa77ccb9b <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
