_:e4ec2edff4722f9a24ea5b48ac7fbfb0 <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e35bcf21308cc8bb3ce2b3cb2602e78f09bb8cc0> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1119; Fisherman's Gat &amp; Foulger's Gat, Area in SqKm: 46, (14/06/2005 to 23/06/2005), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2005/06). FY 2005/06. Contractor: RN (NP1016)." .
