<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e349c5e630384f41a6c7a4aa85d049dfe31a2632> <http://schema.org/description> "This project uses high definition video surveys to monitor sea bird and mammal populations. The trial and feasibility study was undertaken in March and April 2009 to study different species in large far offshore areas and to provide further confidence in the technique developed by HiDef Aerial Surveying Ltd in the Norfolk area." .
