<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e323eede699b0e54e09c49c3d196780b6a086c8a> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) regional marine sampling survey (comprised of fourteen legs) took place from April to october 1981 in North Sea and west of Scotlandl on board the MV Whitethorn. Seabed samples and cores were collected using Shipek grab, Gravity corer, Vibrocorer and Midi drill. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Marine Geology Internal Report 81/4 to 8, 13, 14, 16, 20, 22, 25, 27, 28." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e323eede699b0e54e09c49c3d196780b6a086c8a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
