<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e2b518d6cdfe032b474840739d643436bd6fb6e4> <http://schema.org/description> "This study was carried out by Centrica’s fisheries consultants, Brown and May Marine Ltd as part of the Environmental Statement of the Race Bank Offshore Wind Farm. GIS datasets shown in figures within Section 7.4 (Commercial Fisheries) of the Environmental Statement are provided within this series. Please refer to the Environmental Statement series for the Commerical Fisheries chapter and associated documents." .
