<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e1d8b5e8a7ccf028b7c4c2c10fbafbd0661b40cb> <http://schema.org/description> "Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward from the 1956 RV Sarsia Cruise surveying the seabed at the European continental slope, west of Brittany. All survey events used a 4ft rectangular dredge and species collected were identified and recorded by surveyors from the Marine Biological Association of the UK." .
