_:b821a9fe18c16007c1dcd6292cb18c23 <http://schema.org/value> "Magnus platform" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e1b5e0022c2c3275d8be4d8e0d3310e1d15aaab2> <http://schema.org/description> "34 Grab samples were collected for macrofaunal analysis, to determine the benthic community composition within the vicinity of the Magnus platform. Samples were also taken for physico-chemical analysis." .
