<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e09bf342aafe1d5c990c75d15cb61acf694a723f> <http://schema.org/description> "Records of pelagic and shore fauna from a study to increase the knowledge on marine fauna in the Isles of Scilly. The first study was conducted by the author from 21-26th July 1899 with the second being from 27th April-15th May 1903. This survey was collated as part of the Scillies ATBI project." .
