<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e06f6c4850d22d1da5788ee91768af3492fc37be> <http://schema.org/description> "Geotechnical surveys supervided by BOMEL Ltd for Offshore Wind Power Ltd conducted by Fugro Engineering Services Ltd (FES) at Lynn and Inner Dowsing and cable routes. Objectives were to determine the ground conditions to assist with the engineering design. The surveys required geology and hydrogeology and included field and laboratory testing and photographs and .AGS data files." .
