<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:e017a55838970ee9a747ac48da8fe9f798ff419d> <http://schema.org/description> "This document reports benthic environmental survey work carried out in relation to the proposed Galloper Offshore Wind Farm development. The surveys were undertaken to support an environmental impact assessment to be undertaken by others.\r\n\r\nA combination of benthic grab sampling, camera survey and beam trawling was undertaken by CMACS Ltd, supported by Aquatech Ltd and Osiris Projects Ltd survey vessels. This survey supplements the 2009-2010 Osiris Projects, Galloper Offshore Wind Farm, Geophysical and Benthic Ecology Survey." .
