<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:df48956a313415df094723ce280009a95b4edbdb> <http://schema.org/description> "Operations and maintenance geophysical survey for Teesside Offshore Wind Farm between 19 August and 3 September 2014.\r\nThe aims of the survey were to; To identify debris within the construction area; To identify changes to seabed morphology; To enable the evaluation of the effectiveness of installed scour protection and ratify the predictions for scour development; To Inform the foundation and cable maintenance schedule; To satisfy the requirements of the Marine License, specifically the monitoring of Archaeological Exclusion Zones." .
