<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dea6910e4cedd9d83e222b64d38f175554db2429> <http://schema.org/description> "Ostrea edulis records from 1973 survey of oyster grounds in the Solent. This report deals with examinations made on the Calshot Fishery and some others parts of the Solent in the Southern Sea Fisheries Committee area. This survey was collated by MarLIN as part of a data collation contract for species on the provisional list of nationally important marine features (Lieberknecht et al. 2004)." .
