<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dded01d19d75b7c56df39dae6f35f3abce866251> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a114a50cbee48788db9f31f7a0f8e66f .
_:a114a50cbee48788db9f31f7a0f8e66f <http://schema.org/value> "Emu Limited" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dded01d19d75b7c56df39dae6f35f3abce866251> <http://schema.org/description> "In accordance with the FEPA licence, there is a requirement to undertake pre-construction and post-construction bathymetric surveys of a selection of turbine locations and the associated cable corridor\r\nto determine rates of scour around the turbines after construction. Emu Limited was commissioned by\r\nNEG Micon UK Ltd. to perform a series of hydrographic surveys of these areas in order to determine\r\nwhether any scouring occurs around the turbines or significant changes to the seabed profile have been\r\nmade during construction of the wind farm. This project relates to the first post-construction swath survey which was carried out on 16th January 2005 from the vessel Avante." .
_:a114a50cbee48788db9f31f7a0f8e66f <http://schema.org/value> "NEG Micon UK Ltd." .
_:f3f4f23c9a2718606325f7d894d49b94 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
