_:c12f435077f9269c0878bf669974b81a <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dce216d5166b3f42fe62d21a20d4ccc1e5281898> <http://schema.org/description> "SeaGeneration Wales (SGW) a wholly owned subsidiary of Marine Current Turbines is required to\r\nundertake pre-installation monitoring of seabirds in the vicinity of the Skerries Tidal Stream Array\r\n(the Project) off Anglesey. This 10MW tidal stream project received consent in 2012 but installation\r\nwork has not yet commenced.\r\nA requirement of the Marine Licence is that undertake appropriate pre-installation monitoring. The\r\nwider programme of monitoring work is considered in detail in the project’s environmental\r\nmonitoring and adaptive management plan (EMAMP) (MCT, 2014). The ornithological aspects of the\r\nEMAMP are set out in detail in the Seabird Monitoring Plan (SBMP) contained therein and this\r\ndescribes the seabird monitoring required to meet the Marine Licence consent conditions, this\r\nincludes the undertaking of pre-installation seabird monitoring. It was agreed by the Skerries Science\r\nGroup in February 2014 that the initial phase of the pre-installation monitoring would be to\r\nundertake a 4-month vantage point pilot survey to trial survey methods for pre-installation bird\r\nsurveys to understand if the VP methodology can acquire appropriate data." .
_:f000bb9c0167d5418268305e778b56d0 <http://schema.org/value> "Anglesey" .
