<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dbb4cacdb6fe4ac9046709b0f40fa3538a4d6931> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 119 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during May - June 1989 from a pre-determined 123-station survey grid covering the southern North Sea (south of 56N). A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the North Sea Project water column survey." .
_:c34592353fde13d51ebb542c7f23916f <http://schema.org/value> "Loch Etive" .
