<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:dba1e79048be65ef132bd7cbb3515279d225b82f> <http://schema.org/description> "On-going monitoring dives and survey, under the Nautical Archaeology Society (NAS) Adopty-a-Wreck Scheme, of the steam collier VERA, which was beached in 1914 following a collision and could not be re-floated." .
_:b351a3f5bb7933ac24b75908e31860a2 <http://schema.org/value> "Nautical Archaeology Society" .
