<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:da75736f4facc5327902d26e75dbbc7839ab5362> <http://schema.org/description> "A study developing and improving on already existing data for the presences of Sabellaria alveolata in the Teignbridge area. The current 2006 report is an addendum on the 2003 findings, which used data from 1992-1994. The data is available in PDF, Word, GIS, video, and photographic format. These include reports, surveys, and mapping of the biotopes and locations of the surveys. Photographs available from DBRC." .
