<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:da1d8d7cf630f2e9059b6ddc40a010982e8bbdf8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:da1d8d7cf630f2e9059b6ddc40a010982e8bbdf8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d875be20806c8e6002085b56b5021a24 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:da1d8d7cf630f2e9059b6ddc40a010982e8bbdf8> <http://schema.org/description> "Norfolk Offshore Wind Ltd (NOW) is a consortium of two companies, London Power Company and Enertrag UK, each with expertise in the energy sector. NOW is proposing to construct and operate a wind farm approximately 7km off the seaside town of Cromer on the North Norfolk coast. Posford Haskoning has been commissioned by NOW to carry out an Environmental Impact Assessment of the proposed Cromer Offshore Wind Farm development including both the offshore and onshore elements. This Environmental Statement presents the findings of the EIA. Scoping reports were produced for both the offshore development and landside infrastructure and provided an initial overview of the environmental issues associated with the proposed wind farm." .
_:dd48e4eb027e2cd0946027fa2454111d <http://schema.org/value> "Posford Haskoning" .
