<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d95ccaaa10aea8cb279452549d6e31569695b97a> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 24 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) \r\nsensor package, during September - October 1995 along the Atlantic Meridional Transect (AMT) from the UK \r\nto the Falkland Islands. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter \r\nDiscovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the \r\nPlymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the Atlantic Meridional Transect (Phase 1) programme." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d95ccaaa10aea8cb279452549d6e31569695b97a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b08658d3949a0b48fcbc0c51ba4bd05e .
