<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d902754535ea34279154cf5159d26cd34c4221dc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c09d0724052aba23e22fac8b6f2b10b5 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d902754535ea34279154cf5159d26cd34c4221dc> <http://schema.org/description> "The report following a study commissioned by English Nature (EN) to survey the littoral sediments at Lindisfarne NNR. The survey was to obtain information about the infauna, to produce baseline maps of the sediments and their associated communities (biotopes) to act as a baseline for future management and monitoring of the cSAC." .
_:f4e62e6b8380d70beaca695ef0c78a4e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
