<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d8feb60cd4fdb349b01d28c0180751f23a92b2cd> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1328; Approaches to Milford haven, Area in SqKm: 1101, (11/04/2010 to 15/03/2011), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Shallow (LT). FY 2010/11. Contractor: Fugro OSAE." .
