_:e0dfdaf87dbf1554164ec2e8912047d3 <http://schema.org/value> "fish" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d8943086a27c8743b851570ac7904d1e2e6da601> <http://schema.org/description> "The Teesside A and B Fish and Shellfish Technical Report provides a description of the existing environment in the area of the proposed Dogger Bank Teesside A &amp; B offshore wind farms and the Dogger Bank Teesside A &amp; B Export Cable Corridor in relation to fish and shellfish resources and ecology. It provides supporting information to the Fish and Shellfish Environmental Statement (Chapter 13) and has been undertaken by Brown and May Marine Ltd.\r\n\r\nESRI ArcGIS software has been used to present the data within the report." .
_:cbcde897050867543a465357db6da273 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:d724b7eb4a7d948cbc9173e387c3eb8c <http://schema.org/value> "West of Scotland" .
