_:d724b7eb4a7d948cbc9173e387c3eb8c <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
_:d724b7eb4a7d948cbc9173e387c3eb8c <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:cfdb66bebc684476943c5c71098b9c42 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d88fafc8ad44514cc34513911020e3497acd30ae> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 60 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically from all across the Inner Seas off the West of Scotland, during April and May of 1984. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
_:e1e3a61044a77219152253617fa6895c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d88b5be1c41361954185f257d8c8950783000187> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e4dd926b230032ec937cb3db971c8e7b .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d88b5be1c41361954185f257d8c8950783000187> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 3 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in the North East Atlantic Ocean. Two of these were on the Ellett Line between the Anton Dohrn Seamount and Rockall. The third cast was performed in the Little Minch. The data were collected during October of 1982. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
_:e4dd926b230032ec937cb3db971c8e7b <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
