<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d882e78551142301b1adcab27898a2fd880f74b0> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 90 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically along the Fair Isle-Munken, Nolso-Flugga, JONSIS, East Shetland (ES) and northern North Sea (EC) standard sections, during September of 1993. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d882e78551142301b1adcab27898a2fd880f74b0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
