_:c15a3a0880d45cc9ff1d545abe038e6 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d8781edbb981063491ba75aa7cb53503432c92f1> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d014e3341e69ead5113082315bd1e2d8 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d8781edbb981063491ba75aa7cb53503432c92f1> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September 1980. It incorporates a section across the shelf west of South Uist plus two profiles on radiocaesium stations between Mull and the shelf edge. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
_:c15a3a0880d45cc9ff1d545abe038e6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:d014e3341e69ead5113082315bd1e2d8 <http://schema.org/value> "Mull" .
