<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d7142c72ecfc8400c85b95ae46eb5632ef53317d> <http://schema.org/description> "This marine sampling survey carried out for British Geological Survey (BGS) took place in February 1982 in the North Sea on board the MV Volans. The purpose was to collect data as part of the UK continental shelf survey programme. Seabed sample were collected using Geodoff vibrocorer. These data are archived by BGS. No survey report currently available." .
