_:b46c46b3f09a9fcf394318b12ce4180 <http://schema.org/value> "Whitehaven" .
_:b46c46b3f09a9fcf394318b12ce4180 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
