<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d6e7b710a56f7a923d204dbf0df8ce1d56c49e42> <http://schema.org/description> "Four sites at Bigbury Bay were covered a total of 11 Seasearch forms completed. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d6e7b710a56f7a923d204dbf0df8ce1d56c49e42> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b182865569887caca44f17b53da10769 .
