<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d6db333be82dee59bc8dfc723e7872dab472d6d4> <http://schema.org/description> "An assessment of the impacts of the WoDS and Walney projects both individually and cumulatively on marine mammals as well as suggestions for mitigation measures and assessments regarding the residual impacts." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d6cf9c959e8740bbbb4949d0eccd373e3ae8a2f0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b1d01cd3d83da1905a45e8d0cb277087 <http://schema.org/value> "HOL Coccolithus braarudii" .
