<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d5fc2c6e321fba7b0d60b54df61e4169320ce900> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the further work on the effect of large gravity base structures on tidal currents, waves and sediment transport within the site of the Sheringham Shoal Offshore Wind Farm." .
