<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d5d97d9be35ca6c4f44167707dc217e4bfe4ef44> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 59 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically the northeast coast, during October of 1993. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
