<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d5a2226db90477c40eac17b0995ae693e4ae94c4> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 40 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically the north and west of Orkney, and east of Shetland, during April of 1991. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
