<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d505172cd94b2e7079f7b9257cb4fff807cf03b9> <http://schema.org/description> "The environmental survey programme included a habitat investigation and environmental baseline sampling to determine presence of potential SAC features and baseline physico-chemical and biological conditions within the survey area." .
