<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d503550af5fbf04b0d2f9745688a4ab6cba52bd2> <http://schema.org/description> "The report uses previous measurements and some scaling of data to predict the underwater noise levels during operations to construct the offshore wind farm. The study then uses this data to determine impact zones for marine species in the Barrow coastal region." .
