_:ce045f64b6a9f49a482cec1decd30624 <http://schema.org/value> "Westermost Rough Offshore Wind Farm project" .
_:f3ffeb1958e1013999de762dfb0cf205 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d3ca068db68ad5d39e2969df0677b9204dd4d109> <http://schema.org/description> "This report presents the results of the desk-based assessment required by the Marine Licence. The aim of the desk study is to summarise the existing knowledge on the potential effects on electrosensitive species from electromagnetic fields originating from the submarine power cables and to assess whether further biological monitoring and mitigation will be required to investigate the effect from the Westermost Rough Offshore Wind Farm project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d3ca068db68ad5d39e2969df0677b9204dd4d109> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ce045f64b6a9f49a482cec1decd30624 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
