_:d1a744f429a4ebc8b80701413176d81d <http://schema.org/value> "Barrow Offshore Wind Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d25765a5fe7ded83934a2077acee8990749aeb5f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d1a744f429a4ebc8b80701413176d81d .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d25765a5fe7ded83934a2077acee8990749aeb5f> <http://schema.org/description> "On the instructions of Barrow Offshore Wind Ltd, Osiris Projects were\r\ncommissioned to carry out a Scour Monitoring Survey covering a series of\r\nselected turbines within the existing Barrow Offshore Wind Farm development.\r\nThis was done in conjunction with the completion of an earlier hydrographic and\r\ngeophysical survey across the whole of the development area, which had to be\r\npostponed due to severe weather during the original survey period (September\r\nto November 2006). High-resolution side scan sonar, swath multi-beam and single beam bathymetry data\r\nwere acquired along all survey lines, which were run at 100m centres, in order to\r\naccurately map the entire seabed within the wind farm development area. Additional\r\nlines were run at 25m offsets from the turbine positions, in order to provide detailed\r\ninformation around the turbine/seabed interface.\r\nData acquisition took place during the period 4th April to 13th April 2007, with\r\nsurvey works undertaken using the survey vessel MV ‘Freja’." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d25765a5fe7ded83934a2077acee8990749aeb5f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
