_:e152df6848b936929844edc05a961352 <http://schema.org/value> "England's inshore and offshore region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d237273fb6b99ccbd56edc71c8f4b5877c5d18ad> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b6b1460178f2138da068b77b2c974956 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d237273fb6b99ccbd56edc71c8f4b5877c5d18ad> <http://schema.org/description> "This project provides an audit of the current state of knowledge of submerged palaeolandscapes and sites within the confines of England's inshore and offshore region, as defined in the Marine and Coastal Access Act 2010. Intertidal sites are not specifically included in the audit unless directly part of an offshore project (e.g. cable routes, pipelines). The aim of this project is to raise awareness and widen understanding of the results of offshore projects and surveys which have been undertaken for academic or commercial purposes through appropriate dissemination aimed at a professional, but not necessarily specialist, audience." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d237273fb6b99ccbd56edc71c8f4b5877c5d18ad> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
