_:e88a996b987b1953fce21c03e41e910a <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica Renewable Energy Limited" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d230b051e40ea17833b9f916a52eadd6e28951c2> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e88a996b987b1953fce21c03e41e910a .
