<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d229645605da389529713d3737f13566cd632aba> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a00fe1a47415e2bdb63fa260601ac93 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d220807b1679bcf9ec5307cd7e0d5ec838197669> <http://schema.org/description> "Geophysical and environmental survey. The environmental survey programme included a habitat investigation and environmental baseline sampling." .
_:bf6bf5a51be1754cc016e06efd5dc938 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
