<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d1ba93c60415713fab906bb067009e493b38d4a8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e844eeefa336028096c1f69a1ef23277 .
_:e844eeefa336028096c1f69a1ef23277 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d1ba93c60415713fab906bb067009e493b38d4a8> <http://schema.org/description> "Fugro Emu Ltd. deployed met buoys in the north and south of the proposed First Flight Wind offshore wind farm site to measure current and wave parameters. Data from these buoys and any processed data that was carried out has been provided as packages within this series. The project was cancelled and the survey campaign incomplete, which is why full reports of the survey are not available." .
_:e844eeefa336028096c1f69a1ef23277 <http://schema.org/value> "current and wave parameters" .
