<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d0ffd9ce41838ec9b6387b994d3c8031050461e8> <http://schema.org/description> "Vattenfall commissioned Partrac Ltd. to undertake oceanographic measurements to collect wave, current, water and sediment data to support the development, consenting and design of a potential extension to the operational Thanet offshore wind farm. The series presents the consolidated data recorded at sites A2b and A3b for the duration of the survey campaign between 16 December 2016 and 16 February 2018" .
