_:bb160b8e907d3c22b6c73750ca944e36 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d032bf7ad79a5350b541fc08a39596fab514046a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c8a0c3e15437112421cd989f1212a046 .
