_:f54b8dd331d6bf43123d1329313c3a5b <http://schema.org/value> "fraction of fly ash" .
_:f54b8dd331d6bf43123d1329313c3a5b <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d00003012122b9eec8275e3c40d3d8993c0ee9d1> <http://schema.org/description> "A comparison of sites on a gradient from natural to centre of fly ash tipping. With focus on the sediment composition, fraction of fly ash, and the meiofauna and macrofauna associated" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d00003012122b9eec8275e3c40d3d8993c0ee9d1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:d00003012122b9eec8275e3c40d3d8993c0ee9d1> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f54b8dd331d6bf43123d1329313c3a5b .
