<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cfe9983fcd1ba9a557cad140dec8f236f3aefe7e> <http://schema.org/description> "On the instructions of RPS Environmental Consultancy acting under the instructions of\r\nDONG Energy, Osiris Projects were commissioned to carry out a hydrographic and\r\ngeophysical survey covering the proposed Walney offshore wind farm site, 9 miles\r\nwest of Walney Island, Cumbria. The aims of the survey were to provide a\r\ncomprehensive overview of seabed levels and sub bottom sediments throughout the\r\nsite." .
