<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cf9ce8db448845959fddf2f993b7b8ebe11f32c5> <http://schema.org/description> "Polychaete records for the Plymouth Sound area collected by P.E. Gibbs from 1967 onwards. The majority of the sightings are within the late 1960's and 1970's but records continue until the early 1990's. The data has been transcribed from record cards into a spreadsheet format. Information includes detailed observations, dates and location names." .
_:d32d987fe11c7d40105ebf46f53130c0 <http://schema.org/value> "Polychaete records" .
