_:b20676dd8a3e921c3156ab73ee34187d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cf666ed6093fac96a25a41a58b5c1c2c05d328eb> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b20676dd8a3e921c3156ab73ee34187d .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cf666ed6093fac96a25a41a58b5c1c2c05d328eb> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 147 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates a section of the Ellett Line between the Anton Dohrn Seamount (Ellett Line) and Mull;\r\r\nCTD sections in the North Channel (Copeland-Portpatrick, Corsewall-Sanda and Kintyre-Antrim); CTD sections across the Scottish Shelf west of Islay and between the mainland and the Outer Hebrides; a section running north west from Lewis and a CTD survey of the Wyville Thomson Ridge. The data were collected during June 1988. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association as part of the North Atlantic Norwegian Sea Exchange (NANSEN) project." .
_:baef7c3f57c6f826c746ef68494323c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
