<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cf3dd53662119b659a14e9cbc1a0b28c999ce7d2> <http://schema.org/description> "A large number of datasets provided by Eve Sotuhward and Jason Hall-Spencer for the DASSH Dredging the Depths project for MEDIN. Data has been compiled between 1869 to 1988.\r\n Datasets included in this series are listed in lineage." .
