<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cf185eb7c40d9f20181883cf1c06aae7ca41834e> <http://schema.org/description> "White-beaked dolphin critical habitat and areas of interest around the UK. \r\n \r\n See Clark, Dolman and Hoyt (2010) Towards Marine Protected Areas for Cetaceans in Scotland, England and Wales: A scientific review identifying critical habitat with key recommendations. WDCS Report - for detailed methodology and criteria." .
