<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cf04d4eb77f6351d2525835bda10bb69ec5fac66> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of the PEMP is to ensure that the construction of the offshore elements of the Rhyl Flats\r\nOffshore Wind Farm meets the requirements established by legislation, legal consents and\r\nenvironmental commitments, and that it follows environmental best practice. It contains nine parts: \r\n1. RFOWFL Project Environmental Management Plan\r\n2. RFOWFL Marine Pollution Contingency Plan\r\n3. RFOWFL Archaeological Written Scheme of Investigation\r\n4. MT HØjgaard A/S Environmental Management Plan\r\n5. MT HØjgaard A/S Marine Pollution Contingency Plan\r\n6. MT HØjgaard A/S Dropped Object Plan\r\n7. Oceanteam Power and Umbilical Environmental Management Plan\r\n8. Oceanteam Power and Umbilical Marine Pollution Contingency Plan\r\n9. Oceanteam Power and Umbilical Dropped Object Plan" .
_:a88189f6ce4c5116c972bfe5405ce890 <http://schema.org/value> "PEMP" .
_:a88189f6ce4c5116c972bfe5405ce890 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
