_:b6ae5736977660791cbe02b2fe0ef29d <http://schema.org/value> "Civil Hydrography Programme" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ce84712eaa2a0ccd6feecb61522ae67130815a89> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1274; Papa Stour to Point of Fethaland Blocks 1 to 6, Area in SqKm: 607, (14/05/2008 to 16/07/2008), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: ETV. FY 2008/09. Contractor: NetSurvey." .
