<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ce71f3eff437f4675a72562ba13a1eb3ac84e256> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during November 1985 in the region 30 - 45 N, 13 - 26 W. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory during a physical oceanography cruise which also included the deployment of moored current meters and acoustic listening stations." .
