<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ce07c531a1798c6763bbfce9ce93ce52c16222b4> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 11 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August - September 1995 from stations in the north east Atlantic Ocean between 45 - 50 N, 5 - 15 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Marine Research, Norway as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
