_:c9862bdc72fbde1c0592e074b31159de <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cdd08d2435ce2344137a393ee1ded483eedc220e> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1227; Morcambe Bay (A), Area in SqKm: 195; Morcambe Bay (B), Area in SqKm: 2, (11/06/2007 to 15/03/2008), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2006/07. Contractor: MMT." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cdc705e6724e1964ca97ea1108c09e56227547d3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
