_:e3f552486adec7f335413572a5cb5c2c <http://schema.org/value> "Wembury" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cdb78889d2eb7cad6b6e11485e40126f03adf30a> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral surveys of various locations in and around Exe, Wembury and Yealm. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes 1992-93 Devon Wildlife Trust Exe Littoral Survey and 1992-93 Devon Wildlife Trust Wembury and Yealm Estuary littoral survey." .
