<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cc60a8ddfbec2bf93f6351f7f8bac18df035bf9e> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during January - February 1981. It incorporates a section from 30N, 25W to 38N, 17W with a closely spaced array of profiles at mooring locations within 50km of 33N, 22W. This included yo-yo casts covering the bottom 500m of the water column.. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cc60a8ddfbec2bf93f6351f7f8bac18df035bf9e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
