<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cc5ce1a1ca856b2279f58a09e9bef49eb69ef6e7> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 38 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the Celtic Sea areas including specifically the north east coast of England, between the Firth of Forth and Flamborough Head, and in vicinity of the Dogger Bank. The data were collected during July of 1998. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science Lowestoft Laboratory." .
_:b48e3a2a21b150efb7a95f29c1bca8b1 <http://schema.org/value> "north east coast of England" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cc5396283ba7f63af56058b88af03f7eef957f89> <http://schema.org/description> "An oil and gas industry site survey acquired between September and November 2011. The block number traversed was 15/18d." .
