<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cc4f77d1b20cfea9125fc6970ed7cd2649bc0146> <http://schema.org/description> "Consent for a Marine Licence has been awarded (MMO reference: L/2013/00303) with pre-construction conditions requiring the Licensee (currently Narec) to provide a Written Scheme of Investigation as necessary to inform the detailed delivery of the project as stated in condition 5.2.25. This document was commissioned by NaREC, through their agents, Natural Power. Data sets were provided by the National Monuments Record, Sea Zone Ltd, and the Northumberland County Council Archaeology Section. Geophysical data was reviewed from survey undertaken by EGS (International) Ltd. This Written Scheme of Investigation (WSI) has been prepared by Wessex Archaeology on behalf of the Licensee in support of its objective to prevent significant impacts to archaeological receptors." .
_:f671c415edabe7d9db613a9e1852d239 <http://schema.org/value> "NaREC" .
