<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cbd4539a9fe2d499737d246f186e82044fc7da88> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 91 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Atlantic Ocean, North Sea and the Inner Seas off the West Coast of Scotland area including specifically the area of the Fair Isle and Dooley currents, during June of 1988. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
