<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cb623c620f3d0f23c47f4de6eca169722ad30aec> <http://schema.org/description> "Tenellia adspersa records from the firth of Forth from JNCC. Information on candidate rare/scarce species. The Joint Nature Conservation Committee (JNCC) has seven lever arch files containing information on candidate rare/scarce species compiled by Dr Bill Sanderson. This data set lists observations of Tenellia adspersa." .
