<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:cb2405a3893d09e21cf37c8371a5cc62be7ac71a> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 34 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during July - August 1989 from transects in the North East Atlantic Ocean, around the Rockall Plateau, Maury Channel and East Thulean Rise. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Cambridge Department of Earth Sciences as part of the Biogeochemical Ocean Flux Study (BOFS)." .
