<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:caf53e0131a35c77ee18b76926abfc3087a6e94f> <http://schema.org/description> "Zostera plant density data plus blades per plant, % of decayed blades and number of blades per plant recorded within 1m sq quadrats on the shallow middle and deepest parts of the bed. The survey work was carried out for the Helford Voluntary Marine Conservation Area Group, with funding from World Wildlife Fund for Nature UK and English Nature." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:caf53e0131a35c77ee18b76926abfc3087a6e94f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cb8f04912a5e9e339f8df6a77b30d689 .
