_:e0b3c70ae925fb72ec24e1d0fdb7c1c7 <http://schema.org/value> "west European Basin" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ca871546098d77812b733b725988988e4e944eaa> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ae6176550df0b85ca9b2c2bb467ab5cf .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ca871546098d77812b733b725988988e4e944eaa> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 30 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically from south of the west European Basin to just south of the Pedro Nunes Seamounts, during March and April of 1984. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
_:ae6176550df0b85ca9b2c2bb467ab5cf <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ca871546098d77812b733b725988988e4e944eaa> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f03602b96445458cfe5e7f3921de8919 .
_:e0b3c70ae925fb72ec24e1d0fdb7c1c7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:ae6176550df0b85ca9b2c2bb467ab5cf <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ca7822961cdb4b00a62afb9bc3aa8ab38ec21903> <http://schema.org/description> "Data collected from stakeholders within the Southeast of England region (Balanced Seas region), by Balanced Seas project team between January 2010 and October 2010. Interview data was processed to create a gridded 1km x 1km layer of relative effort for the specific recreational activity (according to the number of interviews undertaken across the Balanced Seas region). First output was published July 2010, although updates were made after this date due to more interview data." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ca7822961cdb4b00a62afb9bc3aa8ab38ec21903> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e11fb925c2487ece90e8e9cc95b4f193 .
