<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c9f5da315dc2d9712ef48b3b1e4a4c29e54bfafa> <http://schema.org/description> "These data Multibeam (bathymetry and backscatter), grab sampling (PSA), are archived with the Marine Environmental Data and Information Network (MEDIN) Data Archive Centres (DACs) including the British Geological Survey (BGS) DAC for geology and geophysics, The Archive for Marine Species and Habitats Data (DASSH) and the United Kingdom Hydrographic Office (UKHO) bathymetry DAC. The full site data package including raw is also available on request from BGS." .
