<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c9f41c3f6038e1edbe90dcbbb0b0dafe8c70e772> <http://schema.org/description> "Sublittoral surveys for Lundy Island at various locations. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes 1977 SWBSS Lundy sublittoral survey and 1978-79 SWBSS Lundy sublittoral survey." .
