_:f506220fd632bbc8c8c886f01a0236 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:f506220fd632bbc8c8c886f01a0236 <http://schema.org/value> "Civil Hydrography Programme" .
_:f506220fd632bbc8c8c886f01a0236 <http://schema.org/value> "MMT UK" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c9a547bcad943c36308315667c100850533785f7> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1443; Dover Strait TSS Separation (West), Area in SqKm: 283, (06/03/2013 to 17/03/2013), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Medium. FY 2013/14. Contractor: MMT UK." .
