<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c9a0010c78904a46f024e41306eebd919df96f3e> <http://schema.org/description> "RPS Explosives Engineering Services (RPS), part of RPS Energy Ltd, has been\r\ncommissioned by Centrica to conduct a UXO Anomaly Assessment with\r\nRecommendations for the Lincs Wind Farm project, off the coast of Lincolnshire in the\r\nNorth Sea.\r\n\r\nThe purpose of this study is to review the data collected during the Debris/Unexploded\r\nOrdnance (UXO) survey conducted by Emu Limited, with a view to assessing the\r\npotential of identified anomalies to be UXO." .
