<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c94baf9bb48fb8e42e1ebad1cc2c162d203bb81e> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e674683a698e3c18232e05a3dbb08f2f .
_:e674683a698e3c18232e05a3dbb08f2f <http://schema.org/value> "survey methodology" .
_:e674683a698e3c18232e05a3dbb08f2f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c94baf9bb48fb8e42e1ebad1cc2c162d203bb81e> <http://schema.org/description> "This report details the findings of the 13th to 18th potting survey undertaken in the area relevant to the operational Lynn &amp; Inner Dowsing offshore wind farms. The survey is the Year 2 post construction survey which span across 2010 and 2011.\r\n\r\nThe survey methodology used replicated that of the previous surveys. This is detailed in the “LID Offshore Wind Farm Post-construction Potting Survey, August 2009, Interim Report (Ref: LIDPPS01)”." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c94baf9bb48fb8e42e1ebad1cc2c162d203bb81e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:e674683a698e3c18232e05a3dbb08f2f <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
