_:f5f6e7723a00a621e98b61c4c98319f9 <http://schema.org/value> "MCT" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c949d60bf4262818af61cf223ecee3a19af8c064> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f5f6e7723a00a621e98b61c4c98319f9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f5f6e7723a00a621e98b61c4c98319f9 <http://schema.org/value> "Metoc" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c949d60bf4262818af61cf223ecee3a19af8c064> <http://schema.org/description> "This document provides meteorological and oceanographic (metocean) criteria for use in designing the devices for extreme loading and fatigue and planning their installation. It provides information on wind, waves and water levels. In accordance with the specification, it does not include information on currents, as MCT already has sufficient information on that subject\r\nData for this study have been procured from public domain sources and selected from surrounding measurement sites. Best estimate metocean criteria have been derived using these data in combination with Metoc’s in-house expertise and tools, plus regional project experience." .
_:f5f6e7723a00a621e98b61c4c98319f9 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:a0e3e2b4361cd615cd97f81735dd2712 <http://schema.org/value> "Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA)" .
_:a0e3e2b4361cd615cd97f81735dd2712 <http://schema.org/value> "Civil Hydrography Programme" .
_:a0e3e2b4361cd615cd97f81735dd2712 <http://schema.org/value> "MMT UK" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c923afba1de720fc10c548c64d05cf2154e95158> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1508; Beauforts Dyke North, Area in SqKm: 580, (05/01/2017 to 18/02/2017), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Medium. FY 2016/17. Contractor: MMT UK." .
_:a0e3e2b4361cd615cd97f81735dd2712 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
