<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c893f502a75252cebec983c6ec6666e14ba306c1> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 29 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, along the Ellett Line section (between the Anton Dohrn Seamount and Mull) in the North East Atlantic Ocean. The data were collected during April and May of 1982. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
_:add7f0f591faeaa8da689031c39e8c0f <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
