<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c7b5611ed229bf7d39435c7b2e3ee3a3c11c9993> <http://schema.org/description> "Marine benthic species abundance data from an environmental survey at Coombe Creek, Devon. This was a baseline survey prior to the construction of a temporary causeway across Coombe Creek to allow the transfer of spoil. The survey included multiple quadrant samples from 27 stations taken at low water springs on 26 and 27th of September 1992." .
