<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c6bdbb6ed34ca89c32190a014460fe8cac83551d> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in September 2016 by EDF Energy Renewables to carry out\r\ngeophysical and high resolution surveys of Teesside Offshore Wind Farm (OWF) as part of ongoing\r\nmonitoring of the site.\r\nThe survey was completed under Bibby HydroMap’s Terms and Conditions. The survey was carried\r\nout between 07/09/2016 and 12/09/2016." .
