<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c5d61c1abc1a0f07b55127587f3cd4ebce8a7516> <http://schema.org/description> "A GIS dataset consisting of polygons representing sea features around the UK from the United Kingdom Hydrographic Office (UKHO). There are 3071 features in total, for example, \"Rockall Bank\", \"Laggan Bay\", \"Jane Macrae Rocks\" and \"Sound of Harris\". These data are included in the merged dataset 'MEDIN Gazetteer of Marine Points of Interest'." .
