<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c5d09f23ebd59f508f7b136936e53deb9c26b5e2> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS (International) Ltd was contracted to undertake a marine geophysical survey of\r\nsix cables within the Lynn Offshore Wind Farm (OWF) which had not been buried to\r\ntarget depth during the original installation phase. The cables to be surveyed were\r\nbetween the following wind turbines; LN01 to LN06, LN06 to LN11, LN11 to LN16,\r\nLN16 to LN21, LN08 to LN09 and LN18 to LN23." .
