<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c59976a5aab546bef32acd5775715cae3072f7c0> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sir Frederick Russell Cruise in November 1984 around Shamrock Canyon on the European continental slope. Samples collected using a number of methods including anchor dredge, general purpose corer, Reineck box corer and 4ft rectangular dredge. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
