<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c54e9dceddc615255348335c9e45616e3dd4e399> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1279; Eastern Approaches to the Nab Channel, Area in SqKm: -101, (29/09/2008 to 19/10/2008), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Shallow (LT). FY 2008/09. Contractor: Fugro OSAE." .
