_:fde061f4c6c7d567e68f396ad3159422 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:da4991ddd4a2c7d3e01d2c3b584cb3cc <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f8dedaa7d083c1f73f6cce024610cae3 <http://schema.org/value> "MT Højgaard" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c528b67f93747b2f85e615232829909791ed4e95> <http://schema.org/description> "Osiris Projects were commissioned by MT Højgaard in January 2011, to carry out a\r\npre-construction geophysical survey at the proposed Lincs offshore wind farm site,\r\nwhich lies approximately 8 - 12km off the Lincolnshire coast, between the River\r\nHumber and The Wash. The site is situated to the east of the existing Lynn and Inner\r\nDowsing wind farms. The survey was completed under Osiris Projects Terms and\r\nConditions and was carried out between 25th January 2011 and 12th February 2011.\r\nThe main objective was to undertake a complete sonar seabed survey (multibeam\r\necho sounder &amp; high frequency side scan sonar) of the entire wind farm site, which\r\nincluded a 250m ‘buffer’ around the designated boundary of the wind farm." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c528b67f93747b2f85e615232829909791ed4e95> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f8dedaa7d083c1f73f6cce024610cae3 .
_:fde061f4c6c7d567e68f396ad3159422 <http://schema.org/value> "River\r\nHumber" .
_:da4991ddd4a2c7d3e01d2c3b584cb3cc <http://schema.org/value> "Osiris Projects" .
