<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c4f96e6ca7673d063c513ad59b149d3dc60cce6c> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of the document is to draw together and summarise the key parameters from existing site surveys and studies to facilitate their inclusion in design basis specifications and other documents.\r\n\r\nAssessment of Location, Water Level, Currents, Waves, Wind, Atmosphere, Marine life, Geophysical conditions, Navigation hazards." .
