<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c4c42d4cd3068d5f60a3a799c7fe097a1a0562b1> <http://schema.org/description> "The aim of this archaeological protocol for the construction of Walney Offshore Windfarm is to reduce any adverse effects of the development upon the historic environment. This project also sets out the procedures for reporting discoveries of archaeological interest during construction and operation of WOW. This project was undertaken by DONG Energy and approved on June 27th 2008." .
