_:dec67a92cec62b133bc071575c6252ba <http://schema.org/value> "East Irish Sea" .
_:b03423f04d90c2d565c5d36723130808 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:dec67a92cec62b133bc071575c6252ba <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
