<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c48c0ed63fc06292091997e4a89c27affec2ffb2> <http://schema.org/description> "Timed interval scan sampling for marine mammals 2007-2008" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c48c0ed63fc06292091997e4a89c27affec2ffb2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ee5fce459fb538938514595a32b754d6 <http://schema.org/value> "Timed interval scan sampling" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c47bc04e44d6486dd1a0c19de4e135af22249810> <http://schema.org/description> "Celtic Array Limited (Celtic Array) is proposing to develop an offshore wind farm, called Rhiannon Wind Farm (RWF) in the Irish Sea which is anticipated to have a generating capacity of up to 2.2GW and this comprise both Offshore and Onshore Developments. This is the resulting data from Tidal Survey Works - Consent Applications in 2012 Associated Data : Drawings in pdf format and GIS data in shp format" .
_:f6cd0bdb1334350208f951e53a6f5a3a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f6cd0bdb1334350208f951e53a6f5a3a <http://schema.org/value> "Irish Sea" .
