<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c4675e8a9ca58b6564c17bb5d032a785efcd56f9> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ee77709ed2bda9f645ff992872df0d1 .
_:ee77709ed2bda9f645ff992872df0d1 <http://schema.org/value> "Wessex Archaeology" .
_:ee77709ed2bda9f645ff992872df0d1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c4675e8a9ca58b6564c17bb5d032a785efcd56f9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c4675e8a9ca58b6564c17bb5d032a785efcd56f9> <http://schema.org/description> "Work carried out on the Diamond by the Malvern Archaeological Diving Unit (MADU) between 2002 and 2009 (there may be future work by this licensee team). The work comprised a large amount of documentary research, and limited survey and recovery of samples with the aim of establishing the identity of this vessel, which, following comparison of vessel remains on the site and documented vessel specification, appeared not to be The Diamond. The team's work coincided with Wessex Archaeology's survey of the site." .
_:ee77709ed2bda9f645ff992872df0d1 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:ee77709ed2bda9f645ff992872df0d1 <http://schema.org/value> "Malvern Archaeological Diving Unit" .
_:a357058a91d0b6bc1dbb8075f7842430 <http://schema.org/value> "Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Bidston Laboratory" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c45eedd7f5f779a1f3b0f0be06ab87b50aaccd5c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d6e3a1aba65984afafdd3eeb45eacff9 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c45eedd7f5f779a1f3b0f0be06ab87b50aaccd5c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:a357058a91d0b6bc1dbb8075f7842430 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a0c374311bc552133d4bb2b469ebe263 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c45eedd7f5f779a1f3b0f0be06ab87b50aaccd5c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a0c374311bc552133d4bb2b469ebe263 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c45eedd7f5f779a1f3b0f0be06ab87b50aaccd5c> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during May 1978. It incorporates a CTD survey on the stations of a mooring array distributed along three sections from Baginbun to St. Marys, Ilfracombe to Castletownshend and NE to SW from 51.5N, 6.5W to 47.75N, 10.5 W. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Bidston Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c45eedd7f5f779a1f3b0f0be06ab87b50aaccd5c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a357058a91d0b6bc1dbb8075f7842430 .
