_:ad10f19e16268cc82870951fc9ca2047 <http://schema.org/value> "Cumbria" .
_:b7d0ccef7a23c2e7ba04ce164afc9983 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c3d649fb08476dd50d63e11fe2be7c70b29549af> <http://schema.org/description> "Titan Environmental Surveys Limited was commissioned by Warwick Energy Ltd to undertake a geophysical survey for the purpose of assessing the seabed and the shallow sub-seabed conditions prior to the installation of an offshore wind farm approximately 10km South of Barrow-In-Furness in Cumbria. The principal aims of the surveys was to provide comprehensive information over a proposed wind farm area and consequent cable route corridor to the shore for use in the design, installation and sunsequent maintenance of the wind farm. The detailed objectives were to investigate aspects of the bathymetry, geomorphology, lithology, seabed features and the general environment within the survey areas." .
_:ad10f19e16268cc82870951fc9ca2047 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:b7d0ccef7a23c2e7ba04ce164afc9983 <http://schema.org/value> "Warwick Energy Ltd" .
