<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c384d2c2c676cac595886a5868ed7f9a9746633a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:bab6fea46fb0e70cf3a7994366f38545 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c384d2c2c676cac595886a5868ed7f9a9746633a> <http://schema.org/description> "This project relates to survey work undertaken by RPS Hydrosearch and Osiris on behalf of DONG Energy at their Gunfleet Sands offshore wind farm. The report and data contained within this project consider the ROV targets that have been identified at the site of the wind farm. Surveys were undertaken between April and May 2007. For more information about the Magnetic and Side Scan data September - December 2006 by Osiris Projects Ltd, please see the \"Magnetic and Side Scan data from the site of Gunfleet Sands Offshore Wind Farm\" project." .
_:d9a692f5ab156cb2b8e5716ab96671f2 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:fe2972b6a5cf5b655dff2d804e4a5ec8 <http://schema.org/value> "Sheringham Shoal" .
_:d9a692f5ab156cb2b8e5716ab96671f2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
