<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c34ace3a66bb683fb495f9515053f34670b60784> <http://schema.org/description> "In June 2011 Gardline conducted a preliminary geophysical\r\n investigation for the Gunfleet Demonstration Offshore Windfarm Cable Route." .
