<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c33b87f9a255e495f6abc77a326a3e5027cc6f44> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b5548285a5d1b42a522d432c237e42d2 .
_:b5548285a5d1b42a522d432c237e42d2 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c33b87f9a255e495f6abc77a326a3e5027cc6f44> <http://schema.org/description> "This survey forms part of the preliminary survey work for the Shrimp trial project. Ground truthing was conducted using a video camera sled and day grab to assess and identify areas of subtidal mixed sediment within boxes A and G, identified as potentially suitable for the trial. The survey work was conducted North and West of Sunk Sand." .
_:be9e07d7c923b63f1f756e95b863101a <http://schema.org/value> "Shrimp trial project" .
