_:c50221c4d09dd067f23f24c633c24298 <http://schema.org/value> "composition" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c2ec153162a328c883cb614ba0d55df42f1f1075> <http://schema.org/description> "In order to monitor the abundance and composition of fish and epi-benthic species within the area, otter and beam trawl surveys were undertaken during Autumn 2014 in and adjacent to the Ormonde offshore wind farm. The results of the second year of post-construction surveys have been compared with those obtained in 2009, 2012 and 2013." .
