<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c2bdd05ad30c01152b4485df24b891642ff6d3f6> <http://schema.org/description> "The marine aggregates licensing round plan-level HRA was undertaken by The Crown Estate to assess the potential implications on European sites, as required under the Habitats Regulations. The following reports have been produced by MarineSpace Ltd and ABPmer Ltd and are provided within this series: Screening Report, General Principles Document and a Report to Inform Appropriate Assessment (RIAA)." .
