_:f41b989f2be3cad7bad8fb8cec405555 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:dda8d3f103aafa1b36190ca368326e3 <http://schema.org/value> "Norway" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c2a2752101fe44f5186a8c58fec957e081e87603> <http://schema.org/description> "The report in this series presents the factual results from laboratory tests on soil samples from\r\nthe Burbo Bank Extension Project, performed at NGI’s laboratory in Oslo, Norway.\r\nIt also includes some interpretation of the laboratory tests with respect to diagrams\r\nwith cyclic and average shear strains as function of cyclic and average cyclic shear\r\nstresses for N=1, 10, 100 and 1000.\r\nThe main objective of the laboratory programme was to establish design soil\r\nparameters with respect to cyclic characteristics for foundation analyses of\r\nmonopiles for offshore windmill foundations. The laboratory testing program\r\ncontained static and cyclic DSS tests together with x-ray pictures used for the\r\nselection of suitable samples for testing." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c2976b11fe067e83c9ee9953f0081f622b42801c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c2b93574c0da67c94d6327b21d187c15 .
