<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c2976b11fe067e83c9ee9953f0081f622b42801c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c2976b11fe067e83c9ee9953f0081f622b42801c> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) marine sampling survey took place in July 2004 in the area of Fladen, North Sea on board Vidar Viking. The objective was to drill a trial borehole (04/1, +58+00/535) in the North Sea to allow testing of the drilling rig and coring tools, particularly the piston corer. The site chosen met the specified requirements of test, i.e. a soft to firm downhole transition. The site is located in the Witch Ground Basin close to previously drilled BGS boreholes (75/33 and 77/2)." .
_:c2b93574c0da67c94d6327b21d187c15 <http://schema.org/value> "Witch Ground Basin" .
