<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c2396f17c3d9089013e7f87871fdcdb36c4521e5> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) regional marine sampling survey (comprised of three legs) took place from May to August 1983 in Northern North Sea and the Minch, west of Scotland on board the MV Whitethorn. Seabed samples and cores were collected using Shipek grab, Gravity corer, Vibrocorer and cone dredge. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Reports WB/MI/79/6, 8 and 14." .
_:a42027b44d682ebd7801797189f880fa <http://schema.org/value> "Vibrocorer" .
_:a42027b44d682ebd7801797189f880fa <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
