<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c21ee3075231d8916123ec8e80f37d7fcb536a94> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d1e33922c3791b21c0d3531424787dc9 .
_:b56e429ea1bd8fcaf63165d80ce94252 <http://schema.org/value> "Great Yarmouth" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c21ee3075231d8916123ec8e80f37d7fcb536a94> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c21ee3075231d8916123ec8e80f37d7fcb536a94> <http://schema.org/description> "This series examines the swath bathymetry survey that took place across the site of the Scoby Sands offshore wind farm. Lankelma Andrews carried out a swath batheymtrey survey at the site of the Scroby Sands wind farm off Great Yarmouth. The survey took place between 6th and 22nd November 2006. The scope of the survey was to undertake a hydrographic survey and obtain maximum coverage of the Scroby Sands Wind Farm site and export cable routes. Virtually complete swath coverage was obtained over the whole survey area, where depths allowed. The survey results for the area are presented in both a drawing and digital format." .
