<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c1e14538a14e4e1a832c43b244327e22b98bdffd> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b9cb013bcbd63e3b20060ba7e1a5a9de .
_:b9cb013bcbd63e3b20060ba7e1a5a9de <http://schema.org/name> "marine biodiversity" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c1e14538a14e4e1a832c43b244327e22b98bdffd> <http://schema.org/description> "A Natural England commissioned survey conducted by the Institute of Estuarine and Coastal Studies (IECS). The survey aimed to standardise fauna, and the information for mud/sand habitats and communities of the Dee Esturay SAC, in order to act as a baseline for future management and condition monitoring. Phase I survey of the intertidal zone, mud/sand and rock habitats resulting in the production of detailed biotope maps." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c1e14538a14e4e1a832c43b244327e22b98bdffd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b9cb013bcbd63e3b20060ba7e1a5a9de <http://schema.org/value> "fauna" .
