<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c0d1fbfb8a32743347973cb16273356ec78e8ebe> <http://schema.org/description> "Surveys in and around Plymouth Estuary focusing on the reasons for poor bird populations. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes 1992 Devon Wildlife Trust Plym Estuary Littoral survey and 1993-96 Devon Wildlife Trust Seasearch Plymouth Sublittoral survey." .
