<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c0c1fbac7863d72c4063f6823d7a061d4b3ac176> <http://schema.org/description> "School students performed a transect survey of the crabs at Wembury Point on 21/02/2015. They started the transects at 3 different points on the beach and searched 1m either side of the transects recording species, carapace width and length, gender, habitat and other interesting observations." .
