<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c030ec6f32c77eb8d3525188356d4d1a970c325f> <http://schema.org/description> "Spectrum Geosurvey Limited was contracted to perform multibeam bathymetry surveys of\r\nselected assets on the Westermost Rough Offshore Wind Farm (WMR01). The purpose of the\r\nsurvey programme was to provide bathymetric data meeting the requirements of the wind\r\nfarm’s Marine Licence L/2011/00305/10.\r\nThe survey scope consisted of surveys along the export cable, around the offshore substation,\r\naround six turbines and along the array cables bounding the south, west and north sides of the\r\nmain site.\r\nMultibeam bathymetry was acquired on board the Foryd Bay between the 20th April and 14th\r\nMay 2017." .
