<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c0285dbff280368e8e3051aef09185b58dac71e7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:da0d89f3f39d7198ffbd4ffe14b693c1 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:c0285dbff280368e8e3051aef09185b58dac71e7> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) regional marine sampling survey (comprised of five legs) took place from April to June 1978 in Northern North Sea, Malin Sea and Tay-Forth region on board the MV Cape Shore. Seabed samples and cores were collected using Shipek grab, Gravity corer, Vibrocorer and Rockdrill. Geochemical analysis was undertaken. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Internal Report 78/5, 9 to 11, 13 &amp; 15." .
