<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bfd3f187dd10b4d03ae856a1b7d4dd84bbb85821> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during July 1983. It incorporates full-depth casts on two east Atlantic stations (51.6N, 18.2W, 47.8N, 16.8W). The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
