_:bbdac4039bab1c49d557d85b823d2812 <http://schema.org/value> "Gardline Geosurvey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bfd3e6ce2e907f25aebe6b3661ef29ca81568fa3> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosurvey carried out a debris survey for Thanet Offshore Wind Limited (TOW)\r\noff the coast of Kent. The object was to investigate the proposed Thanet Offshore Wind\r\nFarm (Thanet) site using echo sounder, swathe bathymetry, sidescan sonar, and\r\nmagnetometer. Positioning control for the survey was the Fugro Starfix DGPS service." .
_:eb6f44cbd4123c6c0310b042eb62f475 <http://schema.org/value> "sidescan sonar" .
_:bbdac4039bab1c49d557d85b823d2812 <http://schema.org/value> "Thanet Offshore Wind Limited" .
