<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bf5b2571d31c51ed8bf96f034bb90a84f9212e40> <http://schema.org/description> "This report presents the results of a shallow geological survey carried out in Ramsgate\r\nHarbour. The work was undertaken by UTEC Survey Limited, using the M.V. Excel II, on 19th\r\nand 20th February 2009. The object of the survey was to determine the thickness of the clays\r\noverlying chalk in the area of a proposed jack-up rig and to determine the existence or\r\notherwise of a buried, infilled excavation." .
_:c1c4fc6dd8f7d8b66aabf7327178419 <http://schema.org/value> "Ramsgate\r\nHarbour" .
