_:ecb1fd45336d0b2f316c4bfcb0c9d9e5 <http://schema.org/name> "marine biodiversity" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bf002f1065837377730e779cb9fbbaf9b6ea91c5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:befde99c2863638e4e40cc6a9593358641c3675f> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 25 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, along the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory Rockall via Anton Dohrn Seamount (Ellett Line) section in the North East Atlantic Ocean. The data were collected during November of 1994. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
