<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:beae87211f3a7dfc031c31c8eae9ef5711f0955d> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 11 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in June 1994 from stations in the North East Atlantic Ocean. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Bordeaux 1, Department of Geology and Oceanography as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:beae87211f3a7dfc031c31c8eae9ef5711f0955d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:abde431d09b1b7374f652de68bb0a648 .
