_:de4b8507e6c188dee4f34d8ea07dc475 <http://schema.org/value> "Scottish legislation" .
_:de4b8507e6c188dee4f34d8ea07dc475 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:de4b8507e6c188dee4f34d8ea07dc475 <http://schema.org/name> "policies" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bdee1686f3e6aeeba5cfd00342b1559a83eda394> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f5f5414c8bb4c11579745977dbc4382b .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bdee1686f3e6aeeba5cfd00342b1559a83eda394> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bdee1686f3e6aeeba5cfd00342b1559a83eda394> <http://schema.org/description> "This layer shows the distribution of polygon records of Sabellaria alveolata reefs, a Biodiversity Action Plan Habitat.\r\n This layer forms one of a set of data layers created for the Defra MB0102 contract. This work will support the delivery of a network of Marine Protected Areas as required to meet existing international and national obligations and commitments, including Marine Conservation Zones (MCZs), a new measure to be delivered as part of the Marine and Coastal Access Bill, and equivalent measures under Scottish legislation. The availability of these data layers will also be of importance in underpinning Marine Planning (e.g. licensing) in our marine area." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bdee1686f3e6aeeba5cfd00342b1559a83eda394> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:de4b8507e6c188dee4f34d8ea07dc475 .
_:f5f5414c8bb4c11579745977dbc4382b <http://schema.org/name> "occurrence records" .
_:f5f5414c8bb4c11579745977dbc4382b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:de4b8507e6c188dee4f34d8ea07dc475 <http://schema.org/value> "Marine and Coastal Access Bill" .
_:e852038158fc2f90a5a6e17945baccb7 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bde021be096ec98787c62b9e1292a339c33f6051> <http://schema.org/description> "Kent and Essex patrol vessels log sightings of commercial fishing vessels at sea along with the activity of the vessel when it is sighted. Data is collected for the purposes of fishery management and risk based enforcement of the fleet. Time, date, position, vessel PLN, vessel name, gear type and activity are recorded. Data is then inputted into GIS so that the results can be spatially analysed." .
_:e852038158fc2f90a5a6e17945baccb7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bde021be096ec98787c62b9e1292a339c33f6051> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e852038158fc2f90a5a6e17945baccb7 .
