<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bd9776b5ffd94544b6b6a5238b0cf50dd497c09e> <http://schema.org/description> "Marine benthic species presence/absence data from a macrobenthic ecology survey of Culver Sands, located off Bridgewater Bay, Devon. The survey took place between Sept. 5th and Sept. 8th 2000 and was undertaken to support the Environmental Impact Assessment process required as part of the Government review procedure. Further information on sediment composition is available in the report but has not been digitised." .
