<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bd5cb892fa2fb831ca7479d0729f9c8c87740d9d> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August 1987. It incorporates a CTD section across the shelf break SW of Ireland from 50 35N 14 22N to 50 9N,15W plus some isolated profiles on mooring sites in the vicinity of the section. The data were collected by the University of Southampton Department of Oceanography." .
