_:f14a78b1401943c9e04ba0b6b5e2b83a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bcbc6d1990ffe3b01c773e655c5c06f3ed6d2ef7> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1398; TE 2A, Area in SqKm: 14; TE3A, Area in SqKm: 20; TE7, Area in SqKm: 151; TE5A, Area in SqKm: 50, (06/10/2012 to 05/12/2012), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: RRS. FY 2012/13. Contractor: MMT/NetSurvey." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bcbc6d1990ffe3b01c773e655c5c06f3ed6d2ef7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f14a78b1401943c9e04ba0b6b5e2b83a .
