<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bcb979fbeaa95b81ee0fb3f421e39081639fde66> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ecc7653af69dc5bf1b0b364869a32cea .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bcb979fbeaa95b81ee0fb3f421e39081639fde66> <http://schema.org/description> "An Environmental Statement (ES) has been prepared by Natural Power Consultants in support of an application\r\n submitted on behalf of The National Renewable Energy Centre (the applicant) to the Marine Management \r\n Organisation (MMO). This ES accompanies an application for marine licence consent (the 'application') to \r\n develop infrastructure for an up to 99.9 MW grid-connected offshore wind demonstration project with the \r\n capability to accommodate up to 15 turbines." .
_:ecc7653af69dc5bf1b0b364869a32cea <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
