<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bc4b3e8c36ab73a2ad131aa3791e930d884befba> <http://schema.org/description> "Dog whelk, Nucella lapillus, abundance data from around pembrokeshire. In addition an estimation of the exposure of the sample site is given. Easter Rock was sampled in April 1967 no grid reference is included in the paper and 'Easter Rock' could not be found on a chart or map and has not been included in the dataset." .
