_:f777b91b4a53f69df0f3376e632bd2c4 <http://schema.org/value> "Forewind Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bc3fff50c493eaf13babbfd1dca90ef41886ab13> <http://schema.org/description> "The object of this survey was to investigate the seabed around the proposed UKCS Block 30/14 Flyndre Jack-up rig location in order to establish baseline figures for the current macrofaunal community, sediment chemistry and granulometry. Any potentially sensitive habitats, protected under Annex I of the EU Habitats Directive were also to be identified." .
