<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bc11055a57fcd34f024b404e5a040564220fae09> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the development of Gunfleet Sand Offshore Windfarm by GE Gunfleet Limited (GE), an integration of the geophysical and geotechnical data has been undertaken by RPS Hydrosearch (Hydrosearch) in order to aid geotechnical aspects of the foundation design." .
