<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bbc5fba8eddf4c384e6597cfee6ec38d7434e60c> <http://schema.org/description> "This Institute of Geological Sciences now British Geological Survey (BGS) marine geochemical and sampling survey took place in July 1980 in the Solway Firth aboard a hovercraft AV Tiger. Sea-bed samples and cores were collected using Beach sample hand corer and photography. The sample data are archived by BGS. No BGS survey report currently available." .
