<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bb37cf1997f4867bc530b622a3eeec24528a2c98> <http://schema.org/description> "Dataset Description: Glacial land systems in the Irish Sea Basin: approaching a sediment-landform predictive model for the sea floor - Geological appraisal of swath bathymetry and seismo-stratigraphic data in the SE region of the R3 zone - Liverpool Bay; \r\nCentrica Project: Round 3 Irish Sea - Zone 9 Offshore Wind Farm Development; \r\nProject Phase: Consenting; \r\nDataset produced Out By: Liverpool/Bangor University ; \r\nCorresponding Centrica Document Title: Land system model SE Lease Zone\r\nAvailable Datasets and supporting documentation: 1.\tGIS data (.shp, mxd, Raster) \t \t2.Drawings (.pdf, .tif)\t3. Documents (.pdf)" .
