_:bcd291228762244361f350baee33c365 <http://schema.org/value> "Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Deacon Laboratory" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bb3778fdf31f94f2d54b8494315876d1b99d12f6> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 95 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August - September 1991. The cruise occupied the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE) Atlantic Area 12 (AR12) with stations in the North East Atlantic between the southern tip of Greenland and the western Irish coast. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Deacon Laboratory as part of the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE)." .
_:eab93d0c277cbc2e0ece89fcb955510f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a6fca0cdebce0e455cc5f82f47e84ff5 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
