<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bb26ca16b564d10d1c941f9666b57504ad625486> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c0956ae224d93506f6ea26aa6fc8c078 .
_:c0956ae224d93506f6ea26aa6fc8c078 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c0956ae224d93506f6ea26aa6fc8c078 <http://schema.org/value> "North Northumberland" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bb26ca16b564d10d1c941f9666b57504ad625486> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bb26ca16b564d10d1c941f9666b57504ad625486> <http://schema.org/description> "The main aim of this study was to produce a map of biotopes (or catergories of biotopes) for the area of North Northumberland. Information from previous surveys has been incorporated into the mapping process. A conservations assessment has been made of marine biotopes within the survey area. The study ends with options for appropriate management techniques discussed in the accompanying Coastal Zone Management (CZM) study and an evaluation of the usefulness of biotope mapping to the preparation of CZM plans." .
_:c0956ae224d93506f6ea26aa6fc8c078 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:ced01407c52ef283279bde6a3d935507 <http://schema.org/value> "Rampion Windfarm Limited" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bb25fa7db758bff04b28291b08e007d88cbde74a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ced01407c52ef283279bde6a3d935507 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bb25fa7db758bff04b28291b08e007d88cbde74a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f50605363479eb698a354dc21dcc54e .
_:f50605363479eb698a354dc21dcc54e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f50605363479eb698a354dc21dcc54e <http://schema.org/name> "policies" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bb25fa7db758bff04b28291b08e007d88cbde74a> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in December 2015 by Rampion Windfarm Limited to carry out a geophysical survey at Rampion Offshore Windfarm. The survey was completed under E. ON Terms and Conditions and was undertaken between 9th December 2015 and 1st March 2016.\r\n Bibby HydroMap were then commissioned again in April 2016 by Rampion Windfarm Limited to carry out a UXO infill survey of the K03 turbine in the Rampion Offshore Windfarm. The survey was completed under E. ON Terms and Conditions and the survey was undertaken between 8th April 2016 and 9th April 2016.\r\n The windfarm has been previously surveyed by another contractor, however, changes to design layout have generated the need for additional survey work for small areas of infill. Bibby HydroMap have been commissioned to undertake this additional work, providing additional UXO mitigation around various portions of the site. Data acquisition was undertaken on two vessels: MV Bibby Tethra and MV Lia - each vessel undertook small areas of data acquisition on various part of the windfarm. \r\n This data includes Side Scan Sonar images and also a dataset containing the targets and debris identified on the seabed using this imagery." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bb25fa7db758bff04b28291b08e007d88cbde74a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
