_:a4fd8a17a80021dd6b8696c4a6fdffd4 <http://schema.org/value> "Loch Bracadale" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bac2bd5d1fb18c97245e32a753c0e9dbecfa6e89> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 29 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates the Ellett Line stations east of the Anton Dohrn Seamount, plus further shelf sections from Loch Moidart past Oigh Sgeir and at right angles into Loch Bracadale, Skye. The data were collected during April of 1981. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:bac2bd5d1fb18c97245e32a753c0e9dbecfa6e89> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
