_:b5543231d431a2848274e650cb5f30 <http://schema.org/value> "Isles of Scilly" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ba993007d36086bcf6fd5a9ca6780081eca619df> <http://schema.org/description> "Report following an investigation into grey seals, during the breeding season, on the Isles of Scilly. The survey and report looks at sites used for pup production, timing and the number of pups born and the identity of adults present and observations of disturbance.\r\n The report looks at the results gained from the survey work and discusses it along with recommendations made to the Isles of Scilly Wildlife Trust and Natural England to reduce disturbance." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ba993007d36086bcf6fd5a9ca6780081eca619df> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e97a15a06b31742674058f0f24861329 .
