<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b9f95d959e2cc283b1ef6eed87efb0945ec6083f> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 27 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates the Ellett Line section between the Anton Dohrn Seamount and Mull and sections across the Hebridean Shelf. The data were collected during March of 1993. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
_:c18fc3870d9cc7779b434688591c5a1 <http://schema.org/value> "Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory" .
