<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b89b1a2bc3195c9bf7d357562340f2a91d54b02b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b0db801bae2a0e9f0d7c17b4f87868a8 <http://schema.org/value> "CAR licence" .
