<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b85e51383feeaaa26bba39e7770003d6c2e2c00f> <http://schema.org/description> "Ostrea edulis presence records from experimental study investigating the energy budget of European flat oysters. This survey was collated by MarLIN as part of a data collation contract for species on the provisional list of nationally important marine features (Lieberknecht et al. 2004)." .
