_:c84d1de5f5cdd1ff621292b7701723e0 <http://schema.org/value> "Kent" .
_:a6b471b5f39fb37369fb5629d238d5a <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:c84d1de5f5cdd1ff621292b7701723e0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b7b550ddd157f29c584cda03d04e5527e946edac> <http://schema.org/description> "Colin Plant Associates (UK) were commissioned by RPS to undertake a preliminary examination of\r\ninvertebrate habitats at a site on Cleve Marshes, Kent on the proposed cable route from the offshore\r\nwind farm to a proposed sub-station at Cleve Hill farm.\r\n\r\nExamination of the water beetle fauna was also requested as well as a scoping exercise for further beetle surveys in particular and wider invertebrate surveys in general.\r\n\r\nThe site was visited on 28th September 2004. Aquatic beetles were sampled using a pond net of mesh diameter 0.5 millimetres, taking care to sample all available micro-habitat feature that were evident in the ditches.\r\n\r\nTerrestrial invertebrate sampling was not undertaken; because of the late date in the year, there were almost no terrestrial invertebrates in evidence." .
