<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b79c179c065dfcc095aaf65bda6cc13853de2a92> <http://schema.org/description> "Marine and Coastal Access Act 2009 Construction Compliance Report. This report summarises the requirements of the Marine Licences and confirms the relevant licence conditions have been discharged.\r\nThis metadata file has been created by SeaRoc Group Ltd for the purpose of publishing the dataset onto the Marine Data Exchange." .
