<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b7969fa8084e5b9aa954e9f75284dd38f1e4eadc> <http://schema.org/description> "This map shows areas where historic and proposed dredging and disposal of dredged material have occurred. The SSMEI pilot digitally reproduced historical dredge and dredge disposal grounds from UKHO Charts. Recent dredging and disposal of this material have occurred and this locational information was obtained from Lerwick Port Authority (Lerwick) and Natural Capital (Scalloway) and mapped by SSMEI." .
