_:f0c30eb3e3412749042c7b0ea0dfb325 <http://schema.org/value> "BGS" .
_:afb068834f63f921e6c930d6e5e2ed91 <http://schema.org/value> "5611km" .
_:bf7f6cd4f4a371406a1f11ea24e934fa <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b794873f21e267df1c1fd32d3307cbcad774ca5a> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) marine geophysical survey took place in May to July 2000 in the Hatton and Rockall Banks aboard the RV Colonel Templer. This was a regional geophysical survey to gather high resolution seismic, gravity and magnetic data of the area. A total of 5611km of data were collected in a grid of 58 survey tracks using a suite of seismic instruments (airgun, sparker and echo sounder) and also gravity meter and magnetometer. The data was recorded digitally and is archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Internal Reports CR/00/42 (https://nora.nerc.ac.uk/id/eprint/529920/) &amp; CR/01/07. GeoIndex Offshore - https://mapapps2.bgs.ac.uk/geoindex_offshore/home.html?cruise=2000/1_RCK&amp;." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b794873f21e267df1c1fd32d3307cbcad774ca5a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
