<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b76aa6cd0200d90095d92cacce925150e62061cd> <http://schema.org/description> "Eleven boat based bird surveys have been carried out by Ecological Consultancy LTD (ECON) from April 2009 to July 2010. Both summary reports and raw bird and boat track data are present, including any ad-hoc cetacean records." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b76aa6cd0200d90095d92cacce925150e62061cd> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e9695f2071e5c9c1f3e361e9e931ba77 .
