<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b769813e73c05fff8ccf90aa68309ad47fd6d962> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during October 1989. It incorporates a CTD survey of an area off the Northumberland coast extending eastwards to just beyond the Greenwich meridian. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
