<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b71db4adf5089c7ba28c9422a68e2943cae0780a> <http://schema.org/description> "2014 geophysical survey of Kentish Flats Extension wind farm and associated cable corridor. Survey carried out by EGS (International) Ltd. from March to June 2014. Survey includes the following elements: - Magnetometer - SSS - Sub-bottom profiler - MBES.\r\nThe survey report in this series summarises the mobilisation and operation of the vessel during\r\nsurvey works on the Kentish Flats Extension site and to present the interpretation of the\r\nbathymetric, sonar, magnetometer and seismic datasets collected during these operations." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b71db4adf5089c7ba28c9422a68e2943cae0780a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e0d69582ebe0388639c0fd56a388d0c9 .
