<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b707988ec25717c2b47d58d4980c3dbf9a37d65c> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral surveys of South Devon including Axmouth, Dawlish, Sidmouth, Teign Estuary and Torbay. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes 1992-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Axmouth littoral survey, 1992-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Dawlish littoral survey, 1992-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Sidmouth littoral survey, 1992-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Teign Estuary littoral survey and 1992-95 Devon Wildlife Trust Torbay littoral survey." .
