<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b6d6ca3a95f742d52495ed6f719e68c02a642e1b> <http://schema.org/description> "This series contains a report which details the results of seabird surveys conducted by the Institute of Estuarine &amp; Coastal Studies (IECS) on behalf of TOTAL in the vicinity of a proposed offshore windfarm site off the Yorkshire coast. There is also a dataset that shows all the sightings of birds, their location, species and other attributes throughout the boat based surveys carried out between August 2004 and July 2006" .
