_:a3eb49fe17ced1249c4b5952262493a6 <http://schema.org/value> "Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA)" .
_:d94b77ed992b3793ad852d6ccd7644cb <http://schema.org/value> "Flamborough Head" .
_:a3eb49fe17ced1249c4b5952262493a6 <http://schema.org/value> "MMT UK" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b6c6dedaccf1b4f9973b55f077cfbd8c2dc8b003> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1473; Flamborough Head to Humber Approach, Area in SqKm: 1148, (15/01/2016 to 12/04/2016), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Medium. FY 2015/16. Contractor: MMT UK." .
