_:e54f465ae64bde272eafd1539a5965cc <http://schema.org/value> "Deep BV" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b69d439ff978f0cf6a6614d95e71f38b98caa1ce> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of a transfer of assets between Dong Energy Power UK Ltd (DONG) and TC Barrow OFTO Ltd, a detailed\r\nsurvey of the Barrow wind farm export cable is required. DONG awarded Deep BV, the Netherlands the\r\ncontract to undertake the marine cable inspection survey for three export cables (Barrow, Walney I and\r\nWalney II offshore wind farm export cables). The export cable routes are located in the East Irish Sea with\r\nlandfalls on the west coast of England. This report describes the geophysical and depth of burial survey\r\nconducted along the export cable trajectory of the Barrow Offshore Wind farm export cable. This series contains reports and data for the Barrow export cable only." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b69d439ff978f0cf6a6614d95e71f38b98caa1ce> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a70bcbaaaf106ade570c2ac7e3b3bb0 .
_:a70bcbaaaf106ade570c2ac7e3b3bb0 <http://schema.org/value> "west coast of England" .
