<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b675ff8f20b38f2d1172b2e891b19c9c4d98fd25> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during July 1987. It incorporates sections in the Irish Sea between the Isle of Man and the Scottish, English and Welsh coasts plus four anchor stations between Sellafield and the Burbo Bank. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
_:cd03863ee7dad8e520cbcbd7216e982d <http://schema.org/value> "Welsh" .
