<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b670a40749cec503dea1b771c7b74a71e72f4d12> <http://schema.org/description> "A seabird and cetacean survey was conducted onboard RV Kommandor Jack in July 2002 as part of the Department of Trade and Industry's (now Department of Energy and Climate Change) Strategic Environmental Assessment (SEA4) of the Faroe Shetland Channel." .
