<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b52c9301d8cccc2b53f992f5b46c21eac6ee4aa9> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 65 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically along a transect offshore of Stonehaven and across the Wee Bankie/Marr Bank study area. The data were collected during March of 2001. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:a27cb66c61bbd8f2ba760184efaf5ca3 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
