<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b449595d336ae6c0ed5d4253539cb75b3026f994> <http://schema.org/description> "This report provides advice on the likely environmental effects in the marine environment of electric and magnetic fields resulting from the transmission of power to shore from the Teesside Offshore Wind Farm. \r\nThis metadata file has been created by The Crown Estate for the purpose of publishing the dataset onto the Marine Data Exchange." .
_:fb7e37c2eca07c76609d7f8eed5f1540 <http://schema.org/value> "Shetland Islands" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b44880644129523f0074493c78deebcdfc5e66f9> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) sampling survey took place during October &amp; November 1986 to the North and West of the Shetland Islands on board the MV Kommandor Subsea. To the East of the Shetland Islands a geochemical sampling programme was carried out. Seabed samples and cores were collected using Shipek grab, Vibrocorer and Gravity corer. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Internal Report WB/87/7." .
