<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b43958ceabf2fd52990bbebe0dcebb6a5df093aa> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS International Ltd (EGSi) were contracted by Centrica Renewable Energy Limited (CREL) to undertake the 2014 post construction hydrographic and geophysical surveys of the Lincs windfarm and export cable routes. And 2014 post construction environmental benthic survey of the Lincs offshore windfarm (OWF). EGSi sub-contracted Benthic Solutions Limited (BSL) to undertake the benthic element of the survey" .
