_:d87caea7a49111033ea86de19c3315d5 <http://schema.org/value> "EDF Energy Renewables" .
_:d87caea7a49111033ea86de19c3315d5 <http://schema.org/value> "Ultrabeam Hydrographic" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b4127133953ef3ae1d40241ada6d2951ef0d33b8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b4127133953ef3ae1d40241ada6d2951ef0d33b8> <http://schema.org/description> "Ultrabeam Hydrographic were asked by EDF Energy Renewables to undertake a subsea monitoring survey of the Blyth Offshore Demonstrator - Array 2.\r\nThe main objectives of the survey were to:\r\n- Identify seabed debris within the construction area;\r\n- Identify changes to seabed morphology to enable the evaluation of the effectiveness of installed scour protection and ratify the predictions for the scour development;\r\n- Inform the foundation and cable maintenance schedule;\r\n- Satisfy the requirements of the Marine Licence.\r\nThe operations were undertaken between 24th June 2020 and 4th July 2020." .
