_:b4b2ba27098522f005be9bbbe836d85f <http://schema.org/value> "Morecambe Bay" .
_:b4b2ba27098522f005be9bbbe836d85f <http://schema.org/value> "Heysham" .
_:e8c1a576d2fdb80bb474942999006b72 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b3bfa241f00b60089764a97e367c066c63428b7c> <http://schema.org/description> "Walney Offshore Windfarm (WOW) is located in the East Irish Sea and has been con-structed in two stages, Walney 1 and Walney 2. Export cable 1 runs into Morecambe Bay and connects to a transformer station at Heysham. Export cable 2 comes ashore at Cleveleys and connects to a transformer station at Hillhouse, Stanah. The construction of Walney Offshore Windfarms will commence in February 2010. Pre-construction surveys were conducted from 2008 and ongoing into 2010.\r\nThe document within this series describes the environmental monitoring undertaken pre construction of Walney 1 and 2 and export cable routes 1 and 2. The environmental monitoring reported in this document should be seen as an ongoing process of monitoring pre-, during and post construction monitoring. Monitoring activities will be reported annually to the licensing authority, as described in the Marine Licence, for a period up to three years post-construction. The technical reports from the monitoring surveys are also provided within this series." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b3bfa241f00b60089764a97e367c066c63428b7c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b5b08623153e66a4d725ba5d7c38c59f .
