<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b38f29fab5e0516dfc9a1dbff8885aea9199171f> <http://schema.org/description> "This project surveyed four of the Crown Estates Round 3 wind farm sites including Moray Firth, Hastings, West Isle of Wight and Bristol Channel. The objective of these surveys was to gather suitable data sets on the number and distribution of seabirds at and around the surveyed wind farm sites during 2009" .
