_:d0404dd3004db74bf8b3c2424d61d796 <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b240b6e1c3eb1a941fef523dcad9a1eed931735c> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 3 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically west of Portugal and south of Palmer Ridge, from September to November of 1970. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the National Institute of Oceanography." .
_:d0404dd3004db74bf8b3c2424d61d796 <http://schema.org/value> "Palmer Ridge" .
_:f2ff76648cd6a1000a0ff8d4124e60e6 <http://schema.org/name> "occurrence records" .
_:f2ff76648cd6a1000a0ff8d4124e60e6 <http://schema.org/value> "Acartia tonsa records" .
_:f2ff76648cd6a1000a0ff8d4124e60e6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:debe0a33d485a30c29706a0db4eb5f03 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b23d469b38021151261b580498dba2b57e7c9ffc> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of the survey in this report was to study larval Herring (Clupea harengus). However, this dataset only reports the Acartia tonsa records as part of MSFD NNS baseline data collation project Jan 2016." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b23d469b38021151261b580498dba2b57e7c9ffc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
