_:fcb798348172d93647a07834c1491ecb <http://schema.org/value> "French Continental Shelf" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b231c833e494d09005bb984aa2200ab0544c28dd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b231c833e494d09005bb984aa2200ab0544c28dd> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d4b6519c31a7e4022bf051f93270399c .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b231c833e494d09005bb984aa2200ab0544c28dd> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 17 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April - May 1994 from stations along the French Continental Shelf, La Chapelle Bank, Meridzek Terrace, Holeopen Bay East and the Celtic Sea. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Université Libre de Bruxelles, Laboratory of Chemical Oceanography and Water Geochemistry as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
_:fcb798348172d93647a07834c1491ecb <http://schema.org/value> "La Chapelle Bank" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b231c833e494d09005bb984aa2200ab0544c28dd> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fcb798348172d93647a07834c1491ecb .
