<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b20a52e201d1a5846e08cb85572eac44b4a2f4ee> <http://schema.org/description> "This map shows the locations of piers, slipways, jettys and ferry terminals in Shetland. The map was created by the Scottish Sustainable Marine Environment Initiative (SSMEI) Shetland Pilot. It was created using the OS MasterMap as a tool and local knowledge to create point data (the OS MasterMap is region data)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b20a52e201d1a5846e08cb85572eac44b4a2f4ee> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e70f43c122d84fcc7398e2108651f1b7 .
