<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b2046c429fd3ea3e10aa5e6bf184f992a43dc363> <http://schema.org/description> "Various data for the Plymouth area of marine species, habitats and biotopes from 2004-2006. Includes 2004/02/24 Devon Biodiversity Records Centre (DBRC) GIS Data Processing Plymouth STE. ROC. Stage 3, 2004/04/02 Plymouth SAC Psfrods GIS Data, 2006 Asia Knoll Photos, and 2006 Kristina Downey, University of Plymouth. 2006 Bsc Envi. Sci. Dissertation Zostera Marina Survey - Drakes Island data." .
