<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:afbd24a361705eaebee4a930625795776d889338> <http://schema.org/description> "English Nature littoral biotope and habitat survey of Plymouth Sound and River Yealm. To establish the presence and absence of certain key biotopes which fall within the area of a proposed Site of Special Scientific Interest (pSSSI). Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:afbd24a361705eaebee4a930625795776d889338> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f27cf41b8e36d51290604306d0df6c50 .
