_:ec8aebb404090d88c7658f37a8abd173 <http://schema.org/value> "north of Scotland" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:afb0cbd20e5c8f414aeff31e35c98bcc7ab18702> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ec8aebb404090d88c7658f37a8abd173 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:afb0cbd20e5c8f414aeff31e35c98bcc7ab18702> <http://schema.org/description> "This BGS regional marine sampling survey took place from July to August 1982 in northern &amp; southern North Sea and north of Scotland on board the MV Ferder. Seabed borehole cores were collected using a modified Christensen marine wireline drilling system. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Marine Geology Internal Reports 82/15 and 83/24." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:afb0cbd20e5c8f414aeff31e35c98bcc7ab18702> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c09dcc815195852496319f51e823fd5a .
