_:c561b503c26deb6851899e5ab7907185 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:af6c0982d05d85fabe224470a60dae49132d4083> <http://schema.org/description> "The report in this series presents results of a walkover biotope survey and sediment core sampling undertaken in August 2007. This survey follows baseline sampling at the same time of year in 2006. The survey consisted of a walk over biotope survey of the cable route corridor supported by sediment core samples from selected positions." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:af6c0982d05d85fabe224470a60dae49132d4083> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
