<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:af5c65509b754c86d6052c89420cc4366e7cf832> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:af5c65509b754c86d6052c89420cc4366e7cf832> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c441f0eda2c5c9ecfef72417ab08e298 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:af5c65509b754c86d6052c89420cc4366e7cf832> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during April 1977. It incorporates STD casts performed along the Rockall via Anton Dohrn Seamount (Ellett Line) section in the North East Atlantic Ocean. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
