<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:af5c48b1eb8d19164f693e747859afd3d861dc6a> <http://schema.org/description> "Scleractinian and gorgonian records from the RV Prince De Monaco cruise around the Azores and Madeira. Records supplied by Jason Hall-Spencer and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
_:b2958f2c73c8ca4bd845fb2eb9452548 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
