_:c98cfa1a31537d42157964a26657e609 <http://schema.org/value> "plan-level Habitats Regulations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:aeab89dc4fa7bbc662f4dc7d6b0442d10631e71b> <http://schema.org/description> "The Crown Estate commissioned a series of research projects aimed at decreasing uncertainties and thereby building the evidence base to support the delivery of the plan-level Habitats Regulations Assessment that will be required for Round 4 of Offshore Wind Leasing." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:aeab89dc4fa7bbc662f4dc7d6b0442d10631e71b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c98cfa1a31537d42157964a26657e609 .
