<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ae8b505a40510cae05b72ddac9a9fe133b5084e7> <http://schema.org/description> "Scleractinian and gorgonian records from the RV Prince de Monaco cruise around the Azores. Records supplied by Jason Hall-Spencer and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
