<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:acd05cad26285ac4f5a507d1b88dcd26cd6f69e3> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 157 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel area specifically the Western Irish Sea, the North Channel and the Malin Shelf, during October and November of 1994. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
