<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:acc240faa368128613bc5635c11eb9906182c0e2> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f6d95fddc70e5f53807313eb98db5bd1 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:acc240faa368128613bc5635c11eb9906182c0e2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
