<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:acb2cf3a3d18df5eb2c52d75d21d2156dba7a043> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during July 1977. It incorporates casts performed within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, including the Rockall via Anton Dohrn Seamount section (Ellett Line) and at three locations close to the Joint Air Sea Interaction Experiment (JASIN) moorings site. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
