<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ac72063419f846158efa63e5c665d460b2660796> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 35 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the South Atlantic Ocean area specifically just off the north west coast of South Georgia and the South Sandwich Islands, during December of 1985 and January of 1986. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the British Antarctic Survey." .
_:dd911b8d0320b552f29c5f48e0316d19 <http://schema.org/value> "South Sandwich Islands" .
