<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ac58eb3c0874b3ad5bd60dd3823175abc0e69593> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Report Ref: 10045 (Final_Rev2). Gardline Geosurvey Limited was contracted by DONG Energy Walney Extension (UK) Ltd to\r\nintegrate all survey data acquired over the Walney Extension Offshore Wind Farm Cable Route\r\ncorridor. The surveys were undertaken between 2011 and 2014. The report within this series details the results of\r\nthe surveys, and illustrates all the data in a set of alignment charts. GIS data has also been provided.&lt;/abstract&gt;" .
