<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:abdec114ae84e705d9a34ecbc5b467ee261c7c68> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June 1997. It incorporates two CTD sections across the western edge of the Norwegian Trench between the Shetlands and Norway. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
