<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:abbbf41feda4b56d2436d36c5f013b2809e114ec> <http://schema.org/description> "Report: Day, GA, and Sunderland, J. 1970. Cruise Report for MV Surveyor, North Channel Survey. MGU Project 70/04. (IGS Report No 13) Positioning: No information provided in the cruise report. Main Chain Decca presumed with coastal coorrections as necessary Echo Sounding: Presumed to be Kelvin Hughes MS 32 Sonar Systems: EG&amp;G side-scan sonar. Transit sonar (Kelvin Hughes?). Seismic Systems: Sparker System: EG&amp;G sparker system with 263b hydrophone streamer and 254 recorder. Most lines run at 1kJ Gravitymeter: Presumed to be LaCoste and Romberg Air Sea gravity meter. Magnetometer: Presumed to be RVU Barringer magnetometer" .
_:a729d646e37def8d5d7b450f0cca3200 <http://schema.org/value> "Sunderland" .
