_:a1527fb2655bb0fd4175edf6ae904538 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:a1527fb2655bb0fd4175edf6ae904538 <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea area" .
_:a1527fb2655bb0fd4175edf6ae904538 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ab9bb7842895dfd3ed90b77e50724d82b06f0798> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 18 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically the north-western North Sea, north of Scotland Orkney Shetland area. The data were collected during June and July of 2002. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ab9bb7842895dfd3ed90b77e50724d82b06f0798> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a9ea1027b767d0bba49399880aa471f1 .
