<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:ab0d969ddf30e125b4406a8af5863dc55074c837> <http://schema.org/description> "Wessex Archaeology was commissioned to undertake an archaeological assessment of geophysical survey data as part of the heritage annual monitoring process for aggregate extraction Area 478. A total of six anomalies have been identified across Area 478, one of which (7004) has been classified as A1 - Anthropogenic origin of archaeological interest." .
