<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:aaa1650f773ec3be6b1346aee647ce23db0baf19> <http://schema.org/description> "This sampling and geophysical survey has been carried out by British Geological Survey (BGS) (formerly Institute of Geological Sciences (IGS), the survey took place in November 1973 in the Irish Sea, St. George's Channel and Bristol Channel on board the RRS John Murray. Sample data were collected using Cone Dredge and Shipek Grab. These data are archived by BGS. BODC inventory RRS John Murray JM11/73, Cone Dredge, Shipek Grab, Echo sounder, sparker, MS47 sonar" .
