<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:aa8854cb73d5de98e81430ccef77f11db70b3858> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:a146f12a77005d4e8a8b2d5c46f8e380 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
