<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:aa335017dd2f1ba3c192ecc4dcde4b39521f3cfd> <http://schema.org/description> "Selected records (Palinurus and Achaeus cranchi records) from Fauna of the Clyde Sea area. Includes a map showing most of the localities mentioned in the text, this indicates that some locations are not shown. Grid references have been estimated for those sites in bold, all others have not been included as it was not clear whereabouts the sites were. Original reference contains a large number of other records not yet held in the DASSH data catalog." .
