<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a95ccfba1aff388aedf13fc991a995919eb8fe89> <http://schema.org/description> "Sabellaria spinulosa and Caryophyllia smithii abundance data from a site near Skomer Island. Subset of of a more extensive faunal survey of the site, where baseline studies of seasonal changes in animal communities were carried out over a one year period at a location near Skomer Island, south Wales. A basic map of the sampling location is included in the report, but no grid references or latitude/longitude are included. The location has therefore been estimated from a map." .
