_:a62e43a33dfc58f8451bb00d380e3ceb <http://schema.org/value> "Engineering Technology Applications (ETA)" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a8d3a5b07f21ff7e4024d67993a4d71250b74789> <http://schema.org/description> "XE has been contracted as the electrical consultant to assist the process in determining the optimal electrical transmission solution and cable route for the grid connection of AAOWF. This work has been done in coordination with Royal Haskoning (RH) as the environmental consultant assessing the environmental constraints, and with Engineering Technology Applications (ETA) providing input on offshore seabed conditions, landfall conditions and subsea cable installation." .
_:a62e43a33dfc58f8451bb00d380e3ceb <http://schema.org/value> "XE" .
_:a62e43a33dfc58f8451bb00d380e3ceb <http://schema.org/value> "Royal Haskoning (RH)" .
