<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a896d78f0db158e1de8bdfc8d5585ebc3e05cdea> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a896d78f0db158e1de8bdfc8d5585ebc3e05cdea> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 87 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in July 1996 from stations along the Hebridean Shelf and shelf edge west of Scotland, centred around 56 30 N, 9W in the North East Atlantic. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences as part of the Land Ocean Interaction Study (LOIS) Shelf Edge Study (SES)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a896d78f0db158e1de8bdfc8d5585ebc3e05cdea> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ce37fb3791f030f353708dd21be73553 .
_:f7b24431cbbf741cbedd4c1896be29d9 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:f7b24431cbbf741cbedd4c1896be29d9 <http://schema.org/value> "Hebridean Shelf" .
_:f484e2d3aa0140fbe425de03d5a6ce7f <http://schema.org/value> "UK coastline" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a89402543536fa96b483913a43d934e1b29a0f7d> <http://schema.org/description> "Author: British Marine Aggregate Producers Association. Report number: R394.This report gives an account of key events of the year 2001 for BMAPA and aggregate dredging. The main note was the issues facing the marine aggregate industry the most crucial is the need for new aggregate reserves. BMAPA advanced a number of fronts to ensure that dredging around the UK coastline takes place in partnership with other stakeholders. New research was commissioned to better understand the impacts of dredging on marine life." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a89402543536fa96b483913a43d934e1b29a0f7d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
