<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a861c5e60e91a34d647550441dc4e3835df2641b> <http://schema.org/description> "This Decommissioning Programme has been prepared by DONG Energy in August 2009 to comply with the license conditions for Walney Offshore Windfarm. The proposed decommissioning measures set out in this project aims to adhere to the existing UK and International legislation and guidance notes. In addition, decommissioning industry best practice will be applied, taking into account the legislation applying at the time of decommissioning Walney Offshore Windfarm." .
_:f4aa7a8aab80e1069715a6fca43fac48 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
