<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a84abc376f2b0ebb4227bdebbad3d8cc8cc983ad> <http://schema.org/description> "Journal paper detailing an investigation into the spatial variability of algal assemblages associated with Zostera marine beds. Three seagrass beds within Plymouth Sound were studied. The purpose was to determine if distance from the edge of the seagrass bed affected the assemblage composition." .
