_:dba75848a91858d9577f6a1e272162b <http://schema.org/value> "backscatter data" .
_:f3cc6d30e3fc65155997fe2f4832ba9c <http://schema.org/value> "Spectrum Geosurvey Limited" .
_:dba75848a91858d9577f6a1e272162b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a83082ac3b8f6e77eee93241f2d08edd67c9382b> <http://schema.org/description> "Spectrum Geosurvey Limited was contracted by London Array Limited (hereinafter ‘the Client’)\r\nto survey four export cables (HV1-HV4) during summer 2016.\r\nThe surveys were performed on board the survey / crew transfer vessel Spectrum 1. The primary\r\nobjective was to collect high resolution multibeam bathymetry and backscatter data over the\r\ndefined survey areas. This data was required to provide a comparison with previous datasets and\r\nto assess any changes in seabed level and morphology." .
_:f3cc6d30e3fc65155997fe2f4832ba9c <http://schema.org/value> "London Array Limited" .
_:ff5da2c0b219a548b9ae77371909397b <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
_:ed536504091f13a53d02ee4d8e191172 <http://schema.org/value> "Ireland" .
