_:ed536504091f13a53d02ee4d8e191172 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a472e36edf1b6c7ed7a9c22b88cd59ce <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a828fb7c3ca2b077e66a3645460ee4e0038a4ef2> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 46 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, incorporating the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory Rockall to Anton Dohrn Seamount (Ellett Line) section and from the south west tip of Ireland over the southern end of Porcupine Bank to 52N, 17W. The data were collected during January and February of 1989. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
_:ed536504091f13a53d02ee4d8e191172 <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
