_:ecdb9e90a46948a72701f716df90009d <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a7a84a77a8bb521491e80c8ef9077354bafadb1b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ecdb9e90a46948a72701f716df90009d .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a7a84a77a8bb521491e80c8ef9077354bafadb1b> <http://schema.org/description> "The Benthic Monitoring Programme (BMP) was produced to fulfill Marine Licence pre-construction requirements. The BMP sets out the scope, methodology and programme for the pre-construction bathymetric, Annex I and Benthic surveys that were to be undertaken before the commencement of construction. The BMP was submitted to the Licencing Authority in March 2012 for agreement." .
_:ecdb9e90a46948a72701f716df90009d <http://schema.org/value> "Benthic surveys" .
_:ecdb9e90a46948a72701f716df90009d <http://schema.org/value> "bathymetric" .
_:fb1fd0951197ebbec53644b554954419 <http://schema.org/value> "Marine Licence" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a7a0a5695805dbe2767f0ec7c16696c43ab6226a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d4204b80192ef79423bd24203acfc847 .
