<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a78bebeb04a4b3dabd927bc26098883a65bf98b3> <http://schema.org/description> "A survey of biological resources in the vicinity of the Thanet Offshore Wind Farm was carried out by Marine Ecological Surveys Ltd. (MES) from May - August 2005. The survey comprised the following elements:\r\n\r\n• A quantitative survey of the benthic infauna inhabiting the sediments within and surrounding the proposed turbine array and along the path of the proposed cable routes ashore in Pegwell Bay;\r\n• A survey of the intertidal communities and habitats within Pegwell Bay; and\r\n• A survey of the nature and distribution of Ross worm (Sabellaria spinulosa) communities in the survey area using a combination of high-resolution side scan sonar and seabed camera imagery." .
_:da98b9680d78531f8b37a8d2af00a89c <http://schema.org/value> "seabed camera imagery" .
