<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a73fb06f78b8ddfe5996d69ec22d8596dbae5d1f> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 25 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically in the Scottish coastal zone between Arbroath and Fife Ness, during March and April of 1994. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture Environment and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
