<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a6e1e661bbb7046a87197ec2224c0c8866f8deac> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:feda6697370731fb62c87b43aaaa8a6c .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a6e1e661bbb7046a87197ec2224c0c8866f8deac> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS (International) Ltd, on behalf of Centrica undertook this survey\r\n\r\nThe LINCS Offshore Wind Farm is located 8km off the Lincolnshire coast at Skegness, just north of the\r\nNorth Sea area known as “The Wash”. The total route length of the array cables is 69.68km with the\r\ntwo export cables measuring approximately 47km each. Water depths across the site vary between\r\n8m – 16m Chart Datum (CD). The wind farm consists of 75 3.6MW turbines with monopile foundations\r\nand a substation. An overview of the survey area is provided in Figure 1 &amp; 2.\r\nThe primary objectives of the survey were to:\r\n- Determine the Depth of Burial (DoB) of the array and collector cables until a point where the cable\r\nis in at least 0.5m of reliable burial\r\n- Determine the DOB of selected infield shallow burial areas at LS 30-31, 29-30, 36-37, 38- 37 (3\r\nsections), 52-53, 38-56, 61-42, 62-63, 45-46, 44-45, 43-44 and 67-68" .
_:feda6697370731fb62c87b43aaaa8a6c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
