<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a5fd486d52da5a7d1a4f39ed708427fe3352dd9b> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sir Frederick Russell Cruise along the European continental slope in November 1981. Samples collected using a number of methods including 4ft rectangular dredge, phleger corer, anchor dredge and 8ft Agassiz. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
