_:a655eb02a9e00f8d80286a2c83567614 <http://schema.org/value> "Orkneys" .
_:a655eb02a9e00f8d80286a2c83567614 <http://schema.org/value> "Faroe Shetland Channel" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a4afcae3bbc1838dab2547eb3cfe8c548c96df3d> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during October 1996. It incorporates three CTD sections (the JONSIS line due east from the Orkneys and two in the Faroe Shetland Channel (Nolso-Flugga and Fair Isle-Munken)) plus a CTD survey of the Moray Firth The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture Environment and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
