_:fb99d181960f7916f2bb4aa489bdd7f1 <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a48e4f1130b05a9795f51e6c3b6bae026860bbb6> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during May - June 1976. It incorporates casts performed within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, including the Rockall via Anton Dohrn Seamount (Ellett Line) section, together with a survey grid in the Sea of the Hebrides. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
