<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a42c1cafbfbc2a9bba20445c99c0e0c6fc27132d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:eb9dab4997cc9d944f962ca7e346b398 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a42c1cafbfbc2a9bba20445c99c0e0c6fc27132d> <http://schema.org/description> "This report presents the basis for assigning soil strength profiles for the 30 wind turbines of the North Hoyle Wind Farm. The analysis comprises determination of seabed level, soil strata (in particular the bed rock surface), soil strength profiles, scour depth and seabed features." .
