<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a32773b9ad0a3106c2e6c3c176e369d03882b004> <http://schema.org/description> "Palinurus elephas records off the Scottish coast from fishermen. Occurrence of the spiny lobster Palinurus vulgaris in Scottish waters including Orkney and Shetland Islands covering the period between 1939 and 1954. The report provides additional records of sightings/capture of Palinurus elephas by fishermen to the records of the occurrence of the spiny lobster Palinurus vulgaris in Scottish waters including Orkney and Shetland Islands reported by fishermen between 1924 and 1951." .
