<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a27ac6f6475ba11d3be3b9ae6e0509c49f9741a4> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 56 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from the English Channel, North Sea, Irish Sea and St. George's Channel, Bristol Channel, Thames region, English Channel, and the SW Approaches during the month of January 2004. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science Lowestoft Laboratory." .
