<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a25f92154e6169b36f6defb304b8a0a8a26f8af7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a948fd4347be35353e539cc79a9451f2 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a25f92154e6169b36f6defb304b8a0a8a26f8af7> <http://schema.org/description> "Survey and excavation of the wreck of a slate-cargo ship found in the Pwll Fanog area of the Menai Strait in July 1976. This record incorporates the September 1977 pre-disturbance survey which revealed a cargo of slates with a date range of some 800 years, the 1978 survey and excavation which revealed the well preserved timbers of the wreck beneath the slate cargo, and the 1979 lifting of a small part of the keel which had broken away from a larger section exposed in 1978. The keel type was attributed to the 1100s. Radiocarbon dating of one of the ship's timbers suggested a date of loss some time in the second half of the 16th century. The site is designated as a Historic Wreck under the Protection of Wrecks Act (1973). As such, diving on, or any other interferance with the wreck including filming, survey and excavation is a criminal offense unless a license has first been obtained." .
_:a948fd4347be35353e539cc79a9451f2 <http://schema.org/value> "Protection of Wrecks Act" .
