<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a194af40ab2aea99e34705e3a9119313d3a5d8ef> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1365; St Brides Bay, Area in SqKm: 519, (01/12/2011 to 01/09/2012), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Shallow. FY 2011/12. Contractor: EMU." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a194af40ab2aea99e34705e3a9119313d3a5d8ef> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ab8025d9ae649a00b7d23f336d1db366 .
