_:f8fe602472cd4205472f92771c26a44d <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a19491c365298bf58dff4ce44fb4d2f4845ceaec> <http://schema.org/description> "The surveys were carried out as part of the environmental monitoring programme outlined within FEPA licences 31792/10/1 and 31814/10/2 for the Lynn and Inner Dowsing (LID) wind farms respectively. This series details the findings of the first and second year of post-construction surveys, and makes comparisons with the data collected during pre-construction surveys. The second year post-construction surveys (potting, shrimp trawl, otter and beam trawl and longlining) generally replicated that of the first year post-construction and pre-construction surveys (August 2004 to July 2005) and utilised local fishermen and fishing vessels." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a19491c365298bf58dff4ce44fb4d2f4845ceaec> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d0490df6eb4ec9ff47a112997d23c5b4 .
