_:c544ec86cc90aa5cc1378d2579856d3 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
_:feb5d47fc8b334da6913fa9a5669db66 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a1294a000ea0764946735f4ae9b663d2af623173> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 44 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically in the southern North Sea, during March of 2000. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science Lowestoft Laboratory." .
