<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a0ed696aaf160404576db4a5df9ad5bbbf50289b> <http://schema.org/description> "A collection of Non-Native Species sightings from Dumfries and Galloway Environmental Record Centre (DGERC). The species listed are Bonnemaisonia hamifera, Spartina anglica, Sargassum muticum, Caprella mutica, Crassostrea, Styela clava and Ensis directus." .
