<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a0ca05009b61a9768b6134c353069cf855d6d9b8> <http://schema.org/description> "Geophysical and geotechnical survey which comprised bathymetric, sidescan sonar, and shallow seismic survey, vibrocore survey and environmental sampling of seabed sediments off Happisburg and Pakefiled respectively. The aim of the survey, which was commissionned by English Heritage (EH), and part of the wider Aggregate Levy Sustainability Fund 'Seabed Prehistory' project, was to" .
