<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a082f5131ca62c3da8332ae4b1c04917823c4e77> <http://schema.org/description> "A PhD was conducted at the University marine Biological Station Millport (UMBSM) and presented tot the University of London.\r\n The study investigated the native European flat oyster, Ostrea edulis, which was identified under UK government initiatives to conserve biodiversity as a \"priority species\". Research aimed to determine the conservation status of O. edulis in Scottish waters. A review management measures was undertaken and the development of guidelines for the conservation of O. edulis in Scotland were established." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a082f5131ca62c3da8332ae4b1c04917823c4e77> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f6f16930a90effcd57a1368e89b7da94 .
