<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a0782c34cfa9568cfbb71e1515735f52f532866b> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 68 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically the Faroe-Shetland Channel/Viking Bank, during November and December of 1995. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture Environment and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a0782c34cfa9568cfbb71e1515735f52f532866b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
