<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a04b277f7cbc8e6dd066512bb29eeb78905fc5e1> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sarsia Cruise in July 1970 along the European continental slope west of France. Samples were collected using a number of methods including a 4ft rectangular dredge, anchor dredge and Agassiz trawl. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
