<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a0372654618875f9f4b5aab292ba7cf00d71ffcf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:daa46edfed6c45c49640ad9543f857c8 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a0372654618875f9f4b5aab292ba7cf00d71ffcf> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 80 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section, from Rockall to Porcupine Bank and from Islay due west to the shelf break. The data were collected during November and December of 1989. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
_:b2f36e9ceb982b97e012a8751d1dbe0d <http://schema.org/value> "Porcupine Bank" .
