<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:a0092fbd8d1dde9d12a830bcce8402ad6f293c7e> <http://schema.org/description> "Depth of burial (DoB) survey in 2015 of the approximately 8.5 km long Gunfleet Sands 1 and 2 Export Cable." .
_:e6a3b70380d8e504604fe1613e76d2b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e6a3b70380d8e504604fe1613e76d2b5 <http://schema.org/value> "Depth" .
