<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9f72fdfcf4e81c738e706fa71e6f1995786d4e71> <http://schema.org/description> "Groundtruth survey collecting sediment samples (using Day grab) for infaunal anaysis and PSA and video and still image samples (using drop camera). These data are archived with the Marine Environmental Data and Information Network (MEDIN) Data Archive Centres (DACs) including the British Geological Survey (BGS) DAC for geology and geophysics, The Archive for Marine Species and Habitats Data (DASSH) and the United Kingdom Hydrographic Office (UKHO) bathymetry DAC. The full site data package including raw is also available on request from BGS." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9f72fdfcf4e81c738e706fa71e6f1995786d4e71> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
