<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9f72d50b0c82e169da70689fa10feeff804e17ae> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of the CMACS study is to undertake an environmental impact assessment (EIA) to determine the likely impacts of the proposed development on subtidal benthic ecology, fish and marine reptiles.\r\n\r\nThe report details the results of desk and field studies (offshore survey) undertaken to characterise the Proposal Area. The primary objectives of the report are to describe the marine biological characteristics of the site and identify potential ecological sensitivities. This information will support the subsequent EIA" .
_:dd3006a8a466b682dc4c1b5ca8351e39 <http://schema.org/value> "CMACS" .
