<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9f6350f4119782f06287e046c24a04e30fec5119> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) marine sampling survey took place in September 1977 off the North and West coast of the Outer Hebrides aboard the FRV Scotia. The purpose was to obtain data for regional geology mapping. Sea-bed samples were collected using a shipek grab. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in report ?????." .
