<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9f4d90b1a08a30f059fd6d1ad9864f04d21776ef> <http://schema.org/description> "Marine benthic species abundance data from 1989 impact assessment of Irvine Valley Sewage discharge and SmithKline Beecham Pharmaceutical discharge sites." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9f34304870dbf574533f0ca88ade38d8d9c47953> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 47 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during January-February 1996 from stations along the Hebridean slope, centred around 56 30 N, 9 W in the North East Atlantic. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the Land Ocean Interaction Study (LOIS) Shelf Edge Study (SES)." .
_:ff864fee76adc474cb90ab2c0febd0c8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
