<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9e861d0562afca94a23bc2db486c6f5360d06fd7> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June 1986. It incorporates CTD sections in the Irish Sea (Scotland to Isle of Man), North Channel and across the Hebridean Shelf. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
