<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9e502bee83731ffee0f0c6a3aa7750b71d721f91> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1355; Kintyre Renewables v2, Area in SqKm: 108; Kintyre Renewables Extension, Area in SqKm: 9, (11/10/2012 to 07/11/2012), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: INIS Hydro. FY 2012/13. Contractor: NLB." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9e440c349e12143ff335f140d66ab94c085f6027> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ef8ead01aa240c439a1121b8168ed3b5 .
