<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9e3ebbd1ff08ab4068224d2bf414d6296f46b2f8> <http://schema.org/description> "Desk-based study, geophysical, Remotely Operated Vehicle (ROV) and diver survey of the seven remaining wrecks of the scuttled German High Seas Fleet. A collaborative project between several organisations, with multibeam survey being carried out by the Archaeological Diving Unit (ADU). The products of the study include a range of images and datasets pertaining to the wrecks; and recommendations on their future management, and potential for educational and research initiatives. Work followed earlier side-scan sonar survey of the Markgraf, Dresden, Karlsruhe, Coln, Kronprinz Wilhelm, Brummer and Konig undertaken by the ADU in 2000." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9e3ebbd1ff08ab4068224d2bf414d6296f46b2f8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ac38edeeb6b7eea7463e8935e9cd48ec .
