<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9dcaa5f58cc023e7f3f766cb2c3eec6c961150cd> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during January - February 1977. It incorporates CTD casts from the N Atlantic comprising a section from Vigo, Spain out to 30W along 42N and a section from 49N, 28W to 45N, 16W. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory as part of a physical oceanography study in eastern North Atlantic." .
