_:f0428712527f450161f5b5774d714c9a <http://schema.org/name> "marine species" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9da2b147ed0ca48a74a630e003e9c1dd38bbdeb1> <http://schema.org/description> "The following reports details the findings of the herring spawning surveys undertaken\r\nbetween 2007 and 2009 to assist in the determining of the spawning areas and spawning periods of the Thames\r\nherring stoc." .
_:b570911436c57a8f470b13747ec22f0d <http://schema.org/value> "Channel Coastal Observatory" .
