<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9d81bea548e2fd9ec4fd74713a2d914de7ddcecd> <http://schema.org/description> "Environmental Statement for the Gunfleet Sands Offshore Wind Farm project, which is located approximately 7km south-east of Clacton-on- Sea, Essex. The project consists of the already consented Gunfleet Sands 1 project (GS1), which has consent to construct up to 30 turbines and a proposed extension, Gunfleet Sands 2 (GS2)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9d81bea548e2fd9ec4fd74713a2d914de7ddcecd> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:dc2d3e2aa168e4fc230f7375be817869 .
