_:c64f027898388c3b2c76187e3687d3a7 <http://schema.org/value> "Shetland" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9d49762aea532eae93b66f94abde4058d45e8078> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 37 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically the Fair Isle-Munken, Nolso-Flugga, along the shelf edge to the north and west of Shetland, the standard JONSIS, East Shetland (ES), and northern North Sea (EC) sections. The data were collected during November of 1994. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9d49762aea532eae93b66f94abde4058d45e8078> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ec6d72d1efffdf1ba2929e89e972c6a2 .
