_:f7491bbe95c33a8d30ef576f84226f53 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9ce1c5561d6b7b8830800a46342376eba1718274> <http://schema.org/description> "This series presents the results of the benthic surveys undertaken in relation to the Docking Shoal and Race Bank Offshore Wind Farms, and includes details on the sedimentary characteristics and the species found within the survey area. Surveys included the collection of benthic grab samples, epifaunal beam trawling and drop-down video sampling to avoid the use of invasive sampling in areas of significant biogenic reef. The surveys were undertaken in 2006. Please note the original benthic survey reports are provided within the appendices of the individual Docking Shoal and Race Bank Environmental Statements." .
_:cd2a9929f081bb1ab34a9acf117c46a9 <http://schema.org/value> "Race Bank" .
_:b03fcc0f330eb255c198e8543cc34fe6 <http://schema.org/value> "species" .
_:f7491bbe95c33a8d30ef576f84226f53 <http://schema.org/value> "drop-down video sampling" .
