<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9c8411c1e32dfba0f3606bb410af538cbdc3bc4c> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 242 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically the Iberian shelf and shelf edge during August 1994. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
_:cea01475ee8595a2d00dfc760b0bb5b0 <http://schema.org/value> "shelf edge" .
