_:ba8a7a565ffaf53374dbf726a97f8f3e <http://schema.org/value> "Flamborough Head" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9c7a6700d71cb4a5fbb8d5336658cf0f693d6017> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ba8a7a565ffaf53374dbf726a97f8f3e .
_:a67b5701f00429997f6b39d162bc60e8 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:ba8a7a565ffaf53374dbf726a97f8f3e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9c7a6700d71cb4a5fbb8d5336658cf0f693d6017> <http://schema.org/description> "Report following a sublittoral monitoring survey of Flamborough Head. The purpose of the survey was to enable the assessment of the Flamborough cSAC's condition compared with the targets for the features present. The project also aimed to establish a methodology that was both repeatable and able to produce a robust data set that would enable comparions with other data sets to be made. The data gathered was to act as a baseline for future comparisons." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9c7a6700d71cb4a5fbb8d5336658cf0f693d6017> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a67b5701f00429997f6b39d162bc60e8 .
