<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9c6f43fa18b08f4fe05f4311438a48bfd7731903> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b65d3ac5653792f2cc6bb36d2fa2f619 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9c6f43fa18b08f4fe05f4311438a48bfd7731903> <http://schema.org/description> "This report is a contribution to the Strategic Environmental Assessment (SEA5) conducted by the Department of Trade and Industry (now Department of Energy and Climate Change). Macrofuanal analysis was undertaken on 61 seabed samples from 13 locations to the southwest of Shetland that were contaminated by oil from the Braer tanker spill. The data report presents the resulting species list and abundance data, together with biomass data and the size measurements of selected taxa." .
