_:b7c8256e1c489b1827a3c178f76469b0 <http://schema.org/value> "Outer Hebrides" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9c200f306e2da87d614b6e0034cdc29b2246aa01> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d180e58f8288d35542d9d46e45c8763f .
_:d180e58f8288d35542d9d46e45c8763f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c4e49e28e51ddec558673ccf46cee183 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
_:d180e58f8288d35542d9d46e45c8763f <http://schema.org/value> "southern North Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9c200f306e2da87d614b6e0034cdc29b2246aa01> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 258 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August - September 1988 from stations covering the southern North Sea (south of 56N). A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences as part of the North Sea Project Frontal Process Study." .
