_:f72913991e56ed15fd8314373e5dc1f3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9bc924764aae9f2536f00a385074f35f4bc59251> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f72913991e56ed15fd8314373e5dc1f3 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9bc924764aae9f2536f00a385074f35f4bc59251> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosciences was contracted by Hydro Soil Services to perform a geotechnical survey along the proposed cable route from landing point 1 to the proposed substation at the wind farm site. The results of the surveys are presented in a series of reports. As part of the survey, SEtech have undertaken a cable trenching assessment for the proposed cable route." .
_:f72913991e56ed15fd8314373e5dc1f3 <http://schema.org/value> "SEtech" .
_:f72913991e56ed15fd8314373e5dc1f3 <http://schema.org/value> "Hydro Soil Services" .
