<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9bb33b9095aa013d3960ab8a625a1f2817d06dde> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) regional marine sampling survey took place in May/June 1984, North of Scotland on board the drillship Ferder. Seabed borehole cores were collected using wireline coring system. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Marine Geology Report 84/9." .
