<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9ab8e9ff4e62c7b6fdc74ae9b1b6e5d95ba2a951> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 60 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel area specifically covering the area to the north west of Ireland and between the Isle of Man and Northern Ireland, during August of 1995. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
