_:da9a87da4b9f308ffdc87309e5042324 <http://schema.org/value> "Thanet Offshore Wind Farm" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:988c0269feace3a7d96eaad284f494c9ac596dde> <http://schema.org/description> "Records of radar tracks and seabird observations and video recordings were collected at Thanet Offshore Wind Farm as part of the Offshore Renewables Joint Industry Programme (ORJIP) Bird Collision Avoidance Study. The purpose of this study was to improve the evidence base for bird avoidance behaviour and collisions around offshore wind farms through the monitoring of seabird behaviour, focusing on five target species\r\nThis series contains screen dumps, videos and geodatabases for the bird collision avoidance studies." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:988c0269feace3a7d96eaad284f494c9ac596dde> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
