<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:986577bc099034ec92a589c13946c1453db1c3d2> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bf569c5336ff90ca3f1388168d0c7e66 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:986577bc099034ec92a589c13946c1453db1c3d2> <http://schema.org/description> "The Offshore Wind Extensions Plan-level HRA was undertaken by The Crown Estate to assess the potential implications of the 2017 Offshore Wind Extensions Plan on European sites, as required under the Habitats Regulations. \r\n\r\nThe following documents have been produced by NIRAS Consulting Ltd and are provided within this Series: Principles, Screening, Report to Inform Appropriate Assessment, Record of Appropriate Assessment and Cable Route Protocol" .
_:bf569c5336ff90ca3f1388168d0c7e66 <http://schema.org/value> "Crown Estate" .
