<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:984855caffbecefe4a87168cc45cc65ca47ceccc> <http://schema.org/description> "Following 12 months of bird observations for the whole of Ramsey Sound, CCW requested that further survey should concentrate on the Deltastream deployment site." .
