<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:982d55b6fe1affde8e14fa14f1288ebe5629b038> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b785cab7ca784ad090f90ebe298beef7 .
_:b785cab7ca784ad090f90ebe298beef7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
