_:bb723aa8a04ed7bd08e0c9ff7f6dcd46 <http://schema.org/value> "Bibby HydroMap" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:98167215d813db0ce7bc5e6d13a5bdb1197c2910> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bb723aa8a04ed7bd08e0c9ff7f6dcd46 .
_:ee6d94a9d557df428a36958870349535 <http://schema.org/value> "Horsea 03 Lots 5" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:98167215d813db0ce7bc5e6d13a5bdb1197c2910> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in May 2018 by Orsted to carry out Geophysical and Benthic surveys at Horsea 03 Lots 5 and 8. \r\n The survey across the Lot 8 export route was completed under Bibby HydroMap's terms and conditions using MV Bibby Tethra, between 16th August and 3rd September 2018 with a 40m line spacing. \r\n The main objectives of the surveys were as follows: \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Cable route engineering \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Geo-hazard assessment\r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Consenting requirements \r\n o Identifying archaeological restrictions \r\n o Identifying protected ecological habitats \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Planning of Geotechnical investigations \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ UXO clearance for Geotechnical investigations \r\n This dataset comprises of the magnetometer data across the survey area." .
_:bb723aa8a04ed7bd08e0c9ff7f6dcd46 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:bb7f33ad4d669370bce21bd5d199b02e <http://schema.org/value> "Hatton-Rockall area" .
