_:f8e7a81128497bbb4ef94f67991b92b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:97e13161a8bff12f5d42a7a821bbe5d7deff362d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f8e7a81128497bbb4ef94f67991b92b5 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:d6de859503dab8751ab19a618489d0ef <http://schema.org/value> "magnetometer" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:97e13161a8bff12f5d42a7a821bbe5d7deff362d> <http://schema.org/description> "Archaeological review of additional side scan and magnetometer data collected post consent for the Westermost Rough Offshore Wind Farm (WMR01) developed by DONG Energy. Impact assessment, mitigation and recommedations provided." .
