_:a06932f7b6402020b36bb99a942a198c <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:97c386fbb2fe08f8256987da535c94fe2e9ce1ce> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during December 1993. It incorporates a CTD survey of the Humber Estuary, Humber Plume, the Wash and the Southern Bight of the North Sea. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory as part of the Joint Nutrient Study I (JoNuS)." .
