<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:96ce7fdc8f3fd66b5229f0829f697ef2a836f1bb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:96ce7fdc8f3fd66b5229f0829f697ef2a836f1bb> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the navigational risk assessment undertaken at the site of the Sheringham Shoal offshore wind farm. The scope of work for the study was to make a fit-for-purpose navigational risk assessment for the project, recommend minimum hub clearance, recommend a safe and cost effective arrangement of navigational aids and risk reducing measures, to recommend the definition of appropriate safety and exclusion zones and to outline SAR(Search and Rescue)plans." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:96ce7fdc8f3fd66b5229f0829f697ef2a836f1bb> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b4ad82ea9b55a8e158a931212adf629d .
