<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:9658c1bd5c50776415c23cb862a7b477d58a683c> <http://schema.org/description> "Scottish Power REnewables held a workshop to discuss the presence of basking sharks at Argyll Array Offshore windfarm, and requirements to progress. Attendees included APEM, Marine Scotlands and Scotish Natural Heritage." .
