<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:95c93fc83de5df3cdac3524ccecb9e6382caab62> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during March 1998. It incorporates three CTD sections. The Joint North Sea Information System (JONSIS) line due east from the Orkneys and two in the Faroe Shetland Channel (Nolso-Flugga and Fair Isle-Munken). The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:95b6134bd191802c19f95d252fc70a7d4070c228> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
