_:baa5a24998024e8a660de2f882311cbe <http://schema.org/value> "geotechnical investigation" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:958f1b29bc67e5b9335489d8ba6688ecadd887bc> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosurvey Limited carried out a geophysical survey for Triton Knoll Offshore Wind Farm Limited (TKOWFL) situated 33km off the coast of Grimsby covering an area of 143km². The proposed survey consisted of an Unexploded Ordnance (UXO) survey over 18 proposed borehole locations, an Ultra-High Resolution Seismic (UHRS) survey and a sand wave migration study over two areas within the Triton Knoll Offshore Wind Farm (TKOWF) site.\r\nThe data acquisition programme commenced on the 12-Jul-2015 and was carried out by two vessels; the M.V. Confidante and the M.V. Ivero. The M.V. Confidante undertook a UXO investigation survey covering 18 proposed borehole locations in preparation for a geotechnical investigation. The M.V. Ivero undertook a UHRS survey covering the main Triton Knoll Offshore Wind Farm area as well as the sand wave mapping investigation.\r\n\r\nReporting for the project has been sub-divided into four volumes." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:958f1b29bc67e5b9335489d8ba6688ecadd887bc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:baa5a24998024e8a660de2f882311cbe .
