_:f96145f9565c19a2f23db3126e70907d <http://schema.org/value> "southern North Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:958bcb153e962403d103e6cbe49809d853bbc140> <http://schema.org/description> "Vattenfall Wind Power Limited (Vattenfall) is developing the Thanet Offshore Windfarm off the coast of Kent in\r\nthe southern North Sea.\r\nVattenfall Wind Power Limited (Vattenfall) is developing the Thanet Offshore Windfarm off the coast of Kent in\r\nthe southern North Sea.\r\nVattenfall requested Fugro EMU Limited (FEMU) to perform geophysical, benthic and geotechnical\r\nsite investigations to provide soils information to assist in expansion of the Thanet Windfarm site.\r\nFugro EMU Limited subcontracted Fugro Engineers B.V to perform the geotechnical site investigation\r\nand Fugro Engineers B.V (FEBV) subcontracted Fugro GeoConsulting Limited (FGCLTD) to provide\r\nonshore laboratory and reporting services. The fieldwork was performed from the geotechnical drilling\r\nvessel MV Bucentaur. Seabed cone penetration test (CPT) and vibrocore sampling (VC) operations\r\nwere performed from the MV Bucentaur from 12 September to 16 September 2016.\r\nPlate 1.1 presents a vicinity map showing the general location of the investigated site and Plate 1.2\r\npresents a detailed location plan showing the positions of the boreholes and in situ tests." .
_:c3e71bb00dae5dbfdc4c9b4f1f25bf37 <http://schema.org/value> "Fugro GeoConsulting Limited" .
