<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:94fdb5e53f48f59225fd74108dba874fa15efb55> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 145 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the South Atlantic Ocean area specifically the Southern Ocean, from December of 1987 to March of 1988. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the British Antarctic Survey." .
