<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:94d7e3ab43abd676f6538c3d2d0f7be6c9dbbe8a> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 104 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April - May 1990 from the North East Atlantic Ocean. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Queen's University Belfast School of Biological Sciences as part of the Biogeochemical Ocean Flux Study (BOFS)." .
_:b63c67102d4c396a46bc0551f6216e27 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
