_:a50e7ffa5e0a8b80eb243c84f2806009 <http://schema.org/value> "Irish Sea Pilot Project" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:94be8c076d06169dd5fdc9bc184ce2109a0e240d> <http://schema.org/description> "A marine benthic species survey undertaken as part of the Irish Sea Pilot Project during June 2003. All surveys were undertaken aboard the RV Lough Foyle (DARD) during June 2003. Also includes sediment information." .
