<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:94b75d47f64c71fcf6049111fa7664b413b6fb75> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a3c3786a117d9b22b03a0c168009e408 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:94b75d47f64c71fcf6049111fa7664b413b6fb75> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
