<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:93fb97e7d38c3dc16e35a22deedc24006c1ef4f2> <http://schema.org/description> "2008 Anglia topographic dataset from the Channel Coastal Observatory Catalogue (number of records: 118" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:93f3ac19ccb265036e8db12e46916ddae39b0f7b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:93f3ac19ccb265036e8db12e46916ddae39b0f7b> <http://schema.org/description> "Sound recordings in the vicinity of the unit were made over a period of 2 days, at various states of tide, with the unit running and idle. The sound recordings were made using a high fidelity digital system, and all data stored for post processing. The recorded data includes time and position stamping. The sound data has been post processed to provide intensity vs range plots, with Power Spectral Densities and weighted measurements by M, and dBht factors appropriate to the local mammalian fauna.\r\n\r\nThe report describes field measurement methods, data processing and presentation, of underwater sound attributed to the operation of the SeaGen electrical power generator." .
_:fda52098b68cdb0017e2b6d84bdbc758 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:93f3ac19ccb265036e8db12e46916ddae39b0f7b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fda52098b68cdb0017e2b6d84bdbc758 .
_:fda52098b68cdb0017e2b6d84bdbc758 <http://schema.org/value> "Power Spectral Densities" .
_:fda52098b68cdb0017e2b6d84bdbc758 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:93f0ad634a2c342afb261c8fab3bf0d9ed8e174c> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 25 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September - October 1993 from stations in the north east Atlantic 45 - 50 N, 5 - 15 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Université Libre de Bruxelles, Laboratory of Chemical Oceanography and Water Geochemistry as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
_:a57f1e1f21a74bb5087f803d0fa82a50 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
