_:bfb9fb22dcb40411057ee1ebb429b13c <http://schema.org/value> "Brims Tide Array Project" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:93e4628f3ae7c917d0b7c349ffcd5bdf017c908e> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bfb9fb22dcb40411057ee1ebb429b13c .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:93e4628f3ae7c917d0b7c349ffcd5bdf017c908e> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the Navigation Risk Assessment of the proposed Brims Tide Array Project, 28 days of shipping data surrounding the Agreement for Lease (AfL) area is being gathered.\r\nThe data are being gathered over 2 x 14 day periods to give account to seasonal and tidal variations." .
_:bfb9fb22dcb40411057ee1ebb429b13c <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:93e4628f3ae7c917d0b7c349ffcd5bdf017c908e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
