<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:931930f09deed80790d6e35724c43c2aec140d3b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ea13947f26d9a6570f56167ded207026 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:931930f09deed80790d6e35724c43c2aec140d3b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
