<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:92d857c5eaf00de57df6dfa5b46e9d30cc297711> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e26f069b91d3681fd5de8b1d0fdeaa9c .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:92d857c5eaf00de57df6dfa5b46e9d30cc297711> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 70 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the English Channel area specifically the western English Channel just off Plymouth, during August of 2003. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science Lowestoft Laboratory." .
