<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:928ee9da01028318806766ca01663ec391067308> <http://schema.org/description> "An oil and gas industry umbilical route survey acquired under licences P2596, P2411, P1453 West of Shetland between April and May 2023. The block numbers traversed were 207/1, 206/5, 206/4." .
