<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:92112b7243cb4d0d03d37076e1336e5ebae79e99> <http://schema.org/description> "The Floating Offshore Wind Round 5 Plan-level HRA was undertaken by The Crown Estate to assess the potential implications of the 2024 Floating Offshore Wind Round 5 Plan on European sites, as required under the Habitats Regulations. \r\n \r\n The following documents have been produced by NIRAS Group (UK) Ltd and are provided within this Series: Principles, Screening, Report to Inform Appropriate Assessment (RIAA), and the following undertaken by The Crown Estate: Record of the Habitats Regulations Assessment. The RIAA was produced in digital format and for best readability it is recommended that interested parties access it at the following link https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/c94ca80f13204b92959f999d1d440a9c/." .
_:ec53d1f84c6a7d3cbf1e6b74ecb39fe4 <http://schema.org/value> "NIRAS Group (UK) Ltd" .
