<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:920d522fd01929e51a2ad880fe116fd6120bfa25> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 26 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the Celtic Sea areas including specifically the North East coast, during August and September of 1998. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science Lowestoft Laboratory." .
