<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:91d06eb285e6b851164d36d5cb375fe6ed1aa64f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a2d6c636934b0a6a6a51e2f1761e0c3d .
_:a2d6c636934b0a6a6a51e2f1761e0c3d <http://schema.org/value> "Stakmap/Fishermap" .
