_:d8f05aa22008fa209f1c718b2e8fb116 <http://schema.org/value> "Humber Estuary" .
_:d8f05aa22008fa209f1c718b2e8fb116 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:91940f882fb074857309406ff2a1478577a81f25> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d8f05aa22008fa209f1c718b2e8fb116 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:91940f882fb074857309406ff2a1478577a81f25> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in February 1993. It incorporates a CTD survey of the Humber Estuary, Humber Plume and the Wash. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory as part of the Joint Nutrient Study I (JoNuS)." .
_:d8f05aa22008fa209f1c718b2e8fb116 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
