<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:916116197ac1a714ce2b3b67db0771ce8c0f3605> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:916116197ac1a714ce2b3b67db0771ce8c0f3605> <http://schema.org/description> "NOAH (Narec Offshore Anemometry Hub) is a meteorological mast based in approximately 38m of water. It has a a lattice meteorological mast with 7 instruments mounted on it. Data is recorded as a 10 minute numerical average of wind speeds recorded on a 1 second basis. This series contains all of the reports, instrumentation details, mast set up, maintenance details as well as the actual data recovered by the instruments." .
