<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:915b85d4709778a526e6facd2d4c2b89a2fbb6e5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:e5b7f5c013c29f2b4562e7ff18546db2 <http://schema.org/value> "James Rennell Centre for Ocean Circulation" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:915b85d4709778a526e6facd2d4c2b89a2fbb6e5> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 96 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during March - May 1993. The cruise, part of the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE) Indian Special Survey (ISS01), worked stations around the Crozet Plateau region in the South West Indian Ocean. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the James Rennell Centre for Ocean Circulation as part of the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE)." .
_:f140c45b9ca9e9e6006f39c33dc51426 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
