<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:91501919cd04980262b00af822fde1e202d37d06> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 44 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during May - June 1992 from stations in the North East Atlantic, west of the Canary Islands, in the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE) area AR10 which is centred approximately on 27 N, 32.5 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE)." .
