<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:90f361e74efa2912e995607e9bb9eec32ac870e8> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 131 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during November - December 1990. It incorporates CTD surveys of the Clyde Sea, North Channel (Portpatrick-Copeland and Islay-Lough Foyle sections) and Liverpool Bay. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
