<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:902ba91e375b96fa2c2f18eedacb1074b15b8d34> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September 1984. It incorporates CTD moorings on the Porcupine Bank (50.55 N, 14.66 W). The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
_:c79013476172de03609f2a782ea072b7 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
_:aa3d4b3ac730b7b88ca8df942f918315 <http://schema.org/value> "RRS" .
