<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:90191913fd279dfb0d96b870d8444a142b251449> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosurvey Ltd carried out an HR seismic hazard survey for RWE Npower Renewables at\r\nthe Triton Knoll Offshore Wind farm to investigate the shallow soils conditions using single beam\r\nand multi-beam echo sounders, sub-bottom profiler, sparker as a source for Ultra High Resolution\r\ndigital seismic (UHR 2D), 3m vibrocores, 5m miniature cone penetration tests (MCPT) and drop\r\ncamera visualization." .
