_:a83b0bc6c17f02aa6d81e266af5fa09f <http://schema.org/value> "Amathia pruvoti" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8ff9796bbd35521b92332cbf17384482a41ed687> <http://schema.org/description> "The objective of this study was to determine whether the presence of a gizzard in a bryozoan increases its ability to crush or open diatom frustles. Amathia pruvoti, used in this study came from Swanage, Dorset. No other relevant distributional data was given." .
