_:ca5aa99521c43521983615579561d81 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:b4e9b345bf8b048650f044c6bcff5cfe <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8fb8dd0a8b4deb78c4eb021a85684f9514902a3e> <http://schema.org/description> "On behalf of GE Gunfleet Limited, Seacore Limited were contracted to undertake a geotechnical investigation at the site of the proposed windfarm at Gunfleet Sand, approximately 7km off the Essex coast. The geotechnical investigation comprised two phases. One to provide data on the ground conditions that would assist in the design and construction of wind turbine foundations and the other to assess the suitability of the seabed for installation of the associated cable route to shore. This project relates to the first." .
