<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8fa1e1c9e721fb9f958bae2fff4bc3f4446a5270> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 189 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Indian Ocean area specifically the Aldabra Islands/ W. Indian Ocean, during June and July of 1987. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
