<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8f5ef6a9ba1bdcf8531f32b21140e721a6c0b5f1> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September 1987. It incorporates a CTD survey of the Faroes Shetland Channel and surrounding areas of the NE Atlantic and Northern North Sea. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
