<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8ec031e9f4eda9a9538943f60fc8e11664977770> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosurvey carried out a cable route survey for Eclipse Energy Company Limited\r\non behalf of Ormonde Energy Limited in Morecambe Bay. The object was to investigate\r\nthe location of the proposed offshore wind farm development, which was to be integrated\r\nwith ‘fallow’ gas reserves (via pipeline) and cable route for export of power generated." .
