<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8e9d8f73f4e224e468c8698360f0a0c775ac9ec5> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 48 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically the standard JONSIS, Fair Isle-Munken and Nolso-Flugga survey lines, the Faeroe Shetland Channel, and on the Fladen ground. The data was collected during December of 2005. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
