<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8e7bf49adc2536259bbd7f6d324c3e8ba1b594d0> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 28 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during October 1996 - November 1996. Leg B of the cruise occupied the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE) Atlantic Area 12 (AR12) with stations in the North East Atlantic. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Southampton Oceanography Centre as part of the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE)." .
_:c69ee6f659d9e72097f0b28d84b1de52 <http://schema.org/value> "Ostrea edulis" .
