<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8e64e94ea6bc5523d9d64eef6bf68a2f931bbd8f> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 13 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during October - November 1989 from stations covering the southern North Sea (south of 56N). A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the North Sea Project Blooms/Chemistry Process Study." .
