_:fd8d32b111ab0170ee872cc914eb6b18 <http://schema.org/value> "Derek the Dredger" .
_:ab49847e78e81c0c31411c11e48f4fa9 <http://schema.org/name> "marine biodiversity" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8d90c7c940178885299610446c10b7190469ac95> <http://schema.org/description> "This report describes the development of a second children\\'s book (for children between the ages of 5 and 7) about Derek the Dredger to highlight the relationship between marine aggregates dredging and marine wildlife. Funds raised from the sale of the book will be used to pay for re-prints making the book sustainable in the future." .
