<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8d77cafb96225e63891217d6405fdb228ffbed55> <http://schema.org/description> "Keith Hiscock, Sarah Fowler, Greg Lingard, and Esther Hughes surveyed the granite boulder intertidal community at Gannet's Rock, Lundy. The aim of the survey was to re-survey the place where L.A.Harvey had surveyed in 1949; noting the presence and SACFOR of fauna and flora found from the highest part of the shore to the lowest at low tide." .
