<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8d478cf6e889792dbc2d2cc6055f46564288cb72> <http://schema.org/description> "Each week during the surveillance period, morning counts of Pink-footed Geese and Whooper Swans roosting on the WWT Martin Mere reserve were made from hides. Counts were conducted around first light, before the birds left the reserve to feed. A summary of weather conditions during the week and any notes regarding count data were also made." .
