<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8cf9b24f1cd2693e012ed2ee05a75deb602aa774> <http://schema.org/description> "This study provides an environmental reference statement defining marine and seabed conditions within the study area. It as funded by the Marine Aggregate Levy Sustainability Fund and was acquired along geophysical survey transects spaces 10-20km apart and grab samples were recovered at the intersection of survey lines." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8cf9b24f1cd2693e012ed2ee05a75deb602aa774> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c824ab571efd4f9f56ede5d5ecbfee61 .
