<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8c864d3e98be0a3199ca7e62f55599712bf539c7> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 153 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Inner Seas off the west coast of Scotland and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically the Scottish Shelf, during September and October of 1987. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
