<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8c65d2d35f39e0bf22baa2c4cde34f64ae73ade6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ad8676c033306218350ad731117d724e <http://schema.org/value> "scour protection" .
_:c00c8432fac26477f3c68456893fd427 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:ad8676c033306218350ad731117d724e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8c65d2d35f39e0bf22baa2c4cde34f64ae73ade6> <http://schema.org/description> "This project concerns the scour protection for the monopiles foundations of the wind turbines to be installed at Gunfleet Sands. The foundations for the Gunfleet Sands project consist of 30 monopiles foundations for the wind turbines and one monopile foundation for the transformer station. The scour protection for the monopiles will be installed 6 to 9 months after the installation of the monopiles. The type of scour protection and the installation methodology are outlined." .
