<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8c4b4f53e1845917268f4350958f42166866ab23> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August - September 1979. It incorporates three surveys during a 10-day period of a grid off the Danish coast occupying 53.5-55.5N, 6-9E. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Bidston Laboratory." .
