<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8c2fae6a195c1ab8cc0fff2aebc0613336c54c3a> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 29 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package,in August 1995 from stations off the coast of North West Scotland at the Malin shelf break, approximately 56.5 N, 9 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences as part of the Land Ocean Interaction Study (LOIS) Shelf Edge Study (SES)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8c2fae6a195c1ab8cc0fff2aebc0613336c54c3a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ec6ebbacded7a08a62c6e5699b52edf5 .
