<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8bea2b6a3003ff0869181218d5b7fc0ee4e117d7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fd415248021fb659313d6a8cc1b44868 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8bea2b6a3003ff0869181218d5b7fc0ee4e117d7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8bea2b6a3003ff0869181218d5b7fc0ee4e117d7> <http://schema.org/description> "Ordtek Limited (Ordtek) has been appointed as the unexploded ordnance (UXO) risk management consultant \r\nto DONG Energy DE) for the Walney Extension Offshore Wind Farm project. This package contains a range of UXO risk management documents inclduing technical notes and reports." .
_:fd415248021fb659313d6a8cc1b44868 <http://schema.org/value> "DONG Energy DE" .
