<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8ba8820794e187cca531dd17abd0250452e07c95> <http://schema.org/description> "This report presents a brief initial assessment of the airborne noise levels as a function of\r\nrange that may occur during offshore impact piling at Greater Gabbard. This will involve\r\ndriving a 6.5 m diameter pile using an IHC-S-600 hammer. The IHC Hydrohammer is a\r\nhydraulic pile driver that uses an enclosed system encasing the top of the pile." .
_:b015d668d5f950be8625ee1abfb72b19 <http://schema.org/value> "Greater Gabbard" .
_:b015d668d5f950be8625ee1abfb72b19 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
