_:e6a2687652a2914589fdad1b1c083c40 <http://schema.org/value> "Inner Owers" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8a879dcc32d5de08c848eafe7f9958e9c0e3431c> <http://schema.org/description> "Benthic survey of Inner Owers, south coast. 17 sites were surveyed using a Forster's Box Dredge (0.15m2), with full particle analysis and species identification at each site. Four habitats were identified, three of which were sandy gravel, dominated by the slipper limpet, Crepidula fornicata." .
_:cbcc1cf8513ca34678938bf5bb9841e5 <http://schema.org/name> "taxon" .
