_:da5f59bff5de2072e001fc0a91d2a3e <http://schema.org/value> "density survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8a81b07e30f30918498031e5e95b866ac229d2c3> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August - September 1980. It incorporates profiles around moored instrument arrays in the Celtic Sea. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Bidston Laboratory as part of a density survey." .
