_:f020c6b5e152dad4fea8624a39e6034d <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8a2dfa6f64ffb3358c0ada4faa6c216eae082387> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 53 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during May - June 1989 from two sites in the North East Atlantic Ocean, centred on 47 N, 20 W and 59 N, 22 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Deacon Laboratory as part of the Biogeochemical Ocean Flux Study (BOFS)." .
_:f020c6b5e152dad4fea8624a39e6034d <http://schema.org/value> "Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Deacon Laboratory" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8a2dfa6f64ffb3358c0ada4faa6c216eae082387> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
