<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8a067675da8eef4170c05a7f82ad4f4dc4457cb6> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1117; Long Sand Head, Area in SqKm: 4, (28/07/2005 to 28/07/2005), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2005/06). FY 2005/06. Contractor: RN (NP1016)." .
_:d6776b96e37ff1d139fb69a5329e55c6 <http://schema.org/value> "Civil Hydrography Programme" .
