_:d74e90ba1d244704b5e7752fcab13f71 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:ca6af902393b660f53ffcfdea5734a78 <http://schema.org/value> "Sterna spp." .
_:f3696ce8f0c8b04260b2bc8979952aac <http://schema.org/value> "OWF projects" .
_:ca6af902393b660f53ffcfdea5734a78 <http://schema.org/value> "Sternula albifrons" .
_:f3696ce8f0c8b04260b2bc8979952aac <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
_:b98b5460f2a9ef346d2ce1f33b799e84 <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica/AMEC" .
