_:ef28b59b4a50afaa37a1571fa9b6aa58 <http://schema.org/value> "Scottish east coast" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:89ada7dda8c607bc9d0bcf827275d82bcaec40f2> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during January 1998. It incorporates a CTD grid survey of the Moray Firth between 57.5N to 58.5N and the Scottish east coast and 2.5W plus two CTD sections from the coast due north along 3.2W and 2.85W. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
