<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:893738714240ba7e6a04404fe3db56db71144858> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c297e20f271d5027b74da04ab9881885 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:893738714240ba7e6a04404fe3db56db71144858> <http://schema.org/description> "Centrica Renewable Energy Ltd (CREL) commenced construction in 2007 of the Lynn and Inner\r\nDowsing (LID) offshore wind farms located 5 km to 8.5 km off the Lincolnshire coast. The project\r\nconsists of 27 turbines at Lynn and 27 turbines at Inner Dowsing\r\n\r\nThis document provides a summary of the post-construction monitoring undertaken at LID during\r\n2009, as required by the latest versions of the LID FEPA Consents 31792/09/0 and 31814/10/0.\r\nThe FEPA licences are provided in Appendix 1." .
