<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:88fb5c4bf5406d2f1fde883609f437753e029d68> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d74e71d0f2caf424c2ea38056e5b64d5 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:88fb5c4bf5406d2f1fde883609f437753e029d68> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:d74e71d0f2caf424c2ea38056e5b64d5 <http://schema.org/value> "otter and beam trawl surveys" .
_:bc28ef3b9a3677dc0e554b845cfdf631 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:88fb5c4bf5406d2f1fde883609f437753e029d68> <http://schema.org/description> "A series of pre-construction and post-construction surveys have been undertaken within and adjacent to the Lincs Offshore Wind Farm (OWF) in order to meet the requirements outlined within the Lincs Marine Licence L/2011/00111/9 and LID6 FEPA consent 34852/11/0.\r\nThe first year post-construction (January to December 2014) otter and beam trawl surveys as far as practicably possible, replicated the pre-construction surveys (September and October 2010). In addition, potting surveys were also undertaken as part of the post-construction surveys (pre-construction potting surveys were not undertaken).\r\nDuring the first year (2014) of post-construction surveys, a total of six surveys were undertaken in the area related to the Lincs OWF, these comprised of;\r\n? two otter and beam trawl surveys; and\r\n? four potting surveys.\r\nA series of analyses have been carried out on the fish (and to a lesser extent invertebrate) survey data in order to detect any changes in the recorded fish communities in the vicinity of the wind farm over the first year post-construction period when compared with the pre-construction baseline. This series contains the summary report and associated datasets." .
_:d74e71d0f2caf424c2ea38056e5b64d5 <http://schema.org/value> "potting surveys" .
_:d74e71d0f2caf424c2ea38056e5b64d5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
