_:a16cdd8ae34a03f22f54bba60d5ba017 <http://schema.org/value> "Noordhoek Offshore B.V." .
_:a16cdd8ae34a03f22f54bba60d5ba017 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:b3df99176d31fdaad591d4d33a90c68a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:88e4700e197b013eb2814a786fb758d6f4037a68> <http://schema.org/description> "Greater Gabbard Offshore Winds Ltd. (GGOWL) has contracted Noordhoek Offshore B.V. with\r\nGEO (Danish Geotechnical Institute) as sub-contractor to conduct geotechnical work in terms\r\nof seabed CPT’s (Cone Penetration Test) for The Greater Gabbard Offshore Wind Farm Project.\r\nTest site is located approximately 26 km (14 nautical miles) off the Sufford Coast at Felixstowe/\r\nHollesley Bay.\r\nThe geotechnical work has including seabed CPTs at the planned wind park turbine locations\r\nand at a part of the Cable Route Corridors. Totally 138 CPTs have been carried out for the\r\nwind turbines and 9 CPTs for the cable routes.\r\nThis report presents the results from these investigations. The report includes factual data\r\nincluding both measured cone resistance and sleeve friction and values corrected for pore\r\npressure effects. No interpretations of the measured data are included in this report." .
_:ec7efa57c8950d3c6ce50727bc9e088c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
