_:ed24863d61d4e79ae45780bd3b221ade <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8858a22b799d51ecabc068f42d92a5ba3608687e> <http://schema.org/description> "Report following an offshore survey of the Isles of Scilly conducted by the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science (CEFAS) on behalf of Natural England (NE). The survey aimed to conduct the survey work according to the chosen sampling design and equipment and to map the extent of reef, identifying the varying reef types and to provide data to advise the likely geographic limits of reef features. In addition the survey aimed to identify and record the nature and location of any obvious human impacts identified within or near the sites." .
