_:ee378db01fcb30decfe5ba420e8c11cd <http://schema.org/value> "North Norfolk" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:88025c89c1a85fcc83a9029d92043655c676ae65> <http://schema.org/description> "Geotechnical Engineering and Marine Surveys Limited (GEMS) have been contracted by Dudgeon\r\nOffshore Wind Limited (COMPANY) to perform a preliminary geotechnical investigation at the proposed\r\nDudgeon Offshore Wind Farm site in the southern North Sea. The site is approximately 65km east of\r\nSkegness (East Lincolnshire) and 32km North of Cromer (North Norfolk), covering an area of\r\napproximately 35km². The investigation consisted of geotechnical borings at 4 locations.\r\nFieldwork operations were conducted from the vessel MV Investigator which is owned by GEMS\r\nInternational NV and managed by Chapman International Services Ltd. The vessel is provided to GEMS\r\nunder exclusive long term charter.\r\nFieldwork operations were carried out from the 1st June to the 9th June 2009 and a Field Report has been\r\nsubmitted ref.GUK09034-FLD-01-02." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8801600b988eb770e2249860e35985be451278ab> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cb36937563f68b45cad69d3c2bcc6816 .
