<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:86b33a99f81029074002b8aaf13b9010b4dffa53> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during November 1975. It incorporates casts performed within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, including the Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section, together with the St Kilda shelf edge section. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
