_:cd126c235a11ace0aab7828ac0713792 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:ea67000d5283c28949189fcdcb2a5d38 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:868c8774f0fabff1c1631a4cdac90ab8e54a6c49> <http://schema.org/description> "Phase 1 of the construction of an offshore wind farm situated midway between the Kent and Essex coastlines and more than 20km from each shore. Phase 1 comprises 175 turbines, 2 offshore substations, and 4 export cables to the shore. This particular part of the project is the second year of archaeological assessment of marine geophysical survey data acquired during autumn 2014 and undertaken by the London Array Retained Archaeologist's as part of the three year programme of post-installation archaeological monitoring between 2013-2015." .
