<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:86868faebb5bddbf2a3edc1ac6d04388bc168a0f> <http://schema.org/description> "The Coastal Surveillance Unit (CSU) monitoring programme was carried out for 10 years from 1973 - 1983, mainly around Anglesey using 10 transects and looking at 10 species including Fucus serratus, F. vesiculosis, F. spiralis and Patella spp. It was resurveyed in 1993." .
