<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:868616818d52eb161ae3c74d921076f52e635f22> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 32 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in June 2010 from stations throughout Liverpool Bay. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the National Oceanography Centre, Liverpool as part of the National Oceanography Centre (formerly the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory), Liverpool Bay/Irish Sea Coastal Observatory initiative." .
