_:b7cfce8deb319e79229f7698dbc2dd3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e39d70e57e5ebd800c5cf9593df5d1e7 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
