<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:85b1fd3622ae906ef4bc1071476a86495bb19f1f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:aa19d826c6baf7dd74891e5d6d358f6f .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:85b1fd3622ae906ef4bc1071476a86495bb19f1f> <http://schema.org/description> "Pectenogammarus planicrurus presence record from a survey of amphipoda in southern end of the Isle of Man, within a 10 mile radius of Port Erin. The object of the survey was to revise records of the area and to obtain additional information about the habitats of the species found. This survey was collated by MarLIN as part of a contract to find information on the distribution of species and habitats in the Irish Sea as part of the Irish Sea Pilot project. Only selected data was entered from the survey." .
