_:d7afcf6b80ac7345f799c892050b0ced <http://schema.org/value> "Marine and Fisheries Agency" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:856a68d9109126c3cf720e19a235055385920ebb> <http://schema.org/description> "This additional Information is in response to the initial application to the Marine and Fisheries Agency (MFA), seeking consent under the Food and Environment Protection Act (FEPA) 1985 Part II, to dispose of materials within the boundaries of the proposed Lincs offshore wind farm project. This application was submitted to MFA on the 8th May 2008. The initial response was submitted and entitled LN 2007 RPS Drill Disposal Monitoring Report\r\nThe additional information requested were\r\no\tA quantification of the area of habitat loss associated with each individual foundation (mapped for each pile based on the size of deposited particles); \r\no\tA cumulative impact assessment for all 17 piles proposed for the Lincs project; and a cumulative impact assessment with the habitat loss associated with the Lynn &amp; Inner Dowsing project. \r\nThis report provides response to the above request." .
_:d7afcf6b80ac7345f799c892050b0ced <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:baf34ca5fef9c0c44f182c20d7d1bb71 <http://schema.org/value> "Lynn &amp; Inner Dowsing project" .
