_:c82797da970f27f48b4e6ebfe5383fa0 <http://schema.org/value> "onboard observer surveys" .
_:e90df206e23a91c515a5fba19efe1eec <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
