<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:840505d5da353192e84427d921b4515ed3d2a346> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 68 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically the Fair Isle - Munken, Faroe and the Nolso, Faroe - Flugga, areas west of the Hebrides, west of Orkney and Shetland, during September and October of 1989. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
