<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:83f1fff138ed14cda22537d71da381c55800e5a4> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 16 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel area specifically around the Liverpool Bay Front area, during January of 1979. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
