<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:83acafb5fe570f62f2364b0c67243199db92cd69> <http://schema.org/description> "Oyster flesh analysis results from Cefas The results of the oyster sample contaminants testing for Escherichia coli and heavy metals at Vattenfall’s Kentish Flats Offshore Wind Farm Extension Project have now been received from Cefas Technology Ltd. This series contains a Confirmation Letter on the oyster flesh analysis results, chemical analysis letter and the pre-jetting and during-jetting E.coli results." .
_:bcdc37f27b9b67efb36089b1fd935565 <http://schema.org/value> "heavy metals" .
