<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:834cda719ea13af0a9cde277a58a9499f941a19c> <http://schema.org/description> "This study investigates the population density of meiofauna on the intertidal mudflats of the Tamar estuary in Cornwall. Monthly core samples were collected and analysed for meiofaunal specimens. The dataset contains a species list of the organisms found and comparisons in the size of the organisms and the density they were found at the various sample sites along the estuary." .
