_:dd6126be1ec2bd4d25b8f6047c40ff99 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c9e05f1ab8be5f7802f1122d0bbef85a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82d54af1db558276a4e6ce1a4906fa13ee2d514c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c9e05f1ab8be5f7802f1122d0bbef85a .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82d54af1db558276a4e6ce1a4906fa13ee2d514c> <http://schema.org/description> "HR Wallingford has undertaken a brief study for Sea Generation (Wales) to:\r\n1. review the potential locations for five tidal current turbines at the Skerries site, off\r\nnorthwest Anglesey, North Wales \r\n2. derive full year time series of depth-averaged tidal current speeds at each location\r\nbased on the year 2008\r\n3. derive a full year time series of depth-averaged tidal current speeds at the site of an\r\nearlier ADCP deployment.\r\n\r\nThis work extends an earlier flow modelling study for the same site (HR Wallingford,\r\n2009)." .
_:dd6126be1ec2bd4d25b8f6047c40ff99 <http://schema.org/value> "Sea Generation" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82d54af1db558276a4e6ce1a4906fa13ee2d514c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fecf2361f4f438a87456a3b73ebd07b4 .
