_:a39a98d7b2dc68ad06896216d96e7f37 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a39a98d7b2dc68ad06896216d96e7f37 <http://schema.org/value> "Fenham Flats" .
_:a39a98d7b2dc68ad06896216d96e7f37 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82c81d87b8259750cbfa174f6d2e66498884a331> <http://schema.org/description> "Four sites on the Berwickshire and North Northumberland European Marine Site were surveyed in order to assess the condition of intertidal sand and mud flats and establish a baseline for characterisation and future monitoring of the large shallow inlets and bays feature of the site. These sites are: Fenham Flats; Budle Bay; Beadnell Bay; and Embleton Bay." .
_:a39a98d7b2dc68ad06896216d96e7f37 <http://schema.org/value> "Embleton Bay" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82c81d87b8259750cbfa174f6d2e66498884a331> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a39a98d7b2dc68ad06896216d96e7f37 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82c81d87b8259750cbfa174f6d2e66498884a331> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:a39a98d7b2dc68ad06896216d96e7f37 <http://schema.org/value> "Beadnell Bay" .
_:a39a98d7b2dc68ad06896216d96e7f37 <http://schema.org/value> "Budle Bay" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82b03370140e5cc129ffead393174568eddea551> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b1ff4605d98f43d60c8cb39425443f67 .
_:d6836716c3e56fa847cbc6f057414165 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82b03370140e5cc129ffead393174568eddea551> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82b03370140e5cc129ffead393174568eddea551> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 32 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically along the Fair Isle - Munken, Faroe and the Nolso, Faroe - Flugga, Shetland, JONSIS line, and along the EC lines. The data were collected during September and October of 1991. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82b03370140e5cc129ffead393174568eddea551> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d6836716c3e56fa847cbc6f057414165 .
