<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:82a1a5b653470b5631d10506056c5e8e3d93597d> <http://schema.org/description> "An intertidal monitoring programme was carried out at six sites covering the north and south banks of the Helford River, (both sides of the Gillan inlet and an exposed headland)." .
_:df2ccf3ee061c70b966fdfdc75d06adc <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
