<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:81da73b9c2e6f09e1df7899547dd67eba5560632> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b0bad689acf61269e45d57824b8b8dc3 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:81da73b9c2e6f09e1df7899547dd67eba5560632> <http://schema.org/description> "An oil and gas industry swathe bathymetric site survey for seabed infrastructure (Britannia Platform) acquired in April 2003. The block number traversed was 16/26." .
