<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:816deb9910506f5f9b69417b6d5044c524853047> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosurvey Limited carried out an export cable route survey for DONG Energy Wind\r\nPower AS extending from the Hornsea Project One Wind Turbine Area to landfall at the\r\nLincolnshire coast. The object was to gather information strictly along newly designed export cable\r\nroutes where the existing data is considered insufficient, using single beam and multi-beam echo\r\nsounders, pinger and sparker." .
