<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:80eef759238cef4afcb45e3543a9aa8304f7439c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d4db5a78178b9566e5bbde59d87a9ff3 .
_:d4db5a78178b9566e5bbde59d87a9ff3 <http://schema.org/value> "Princes Channel" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:80eef759238cef4afcb45e3543a9aa8304f7439c> <http://schema.org/description> "The Port of London Authority (PLA) Hydrographic Service was commissioned by DONG Energy to undertake a seabed monitoring survey of a designated section of the four export cable routes from the LAWF that cross the Princes Channel.\r\n\r\nThis series covers survey elements which were undertaken on the 30th April 2013.\r\n\r\nThe survey work was carried out using the PLA survey vessel ‘Yantlet’, with bathymetric data being collected using a hull-mounted Reson SeaBat 8125H MBES." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:80eef759238cef4afcb45e3543a9aa8304f7439c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:c21b9a885feb0b2828365b95ccc25a44 <http://schema.org/value> "MMT" .
_:c21b9a885feb0b2828365b95ccc25a44 <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:80ecb4ade23120dbfd80c7d297ec01b2e948aa9e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:c21b9a885feb0b2828365b95ccc25a44 <http://schema.org/value> "Civil Hydrography Programme" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:80ecb4ade23120dbfd80c7d297ec01b2e948aa9e> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1162; Cross Sands, Area in SqKm: 85, (24/05/2006 to 21/06/2006), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2006/07. Contractor: MMT." .
_:c21b9a885feb0b2828365b95ccc25a44 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:c21b9a885feb0b2828365b95ccc25a44 <http://schema.org/value> "Maritime Coastguard Agency" .
