_:c8bfaeebfc78c58aaad6096ea5d350c1 <http://schema.org/value> "Black Sea" .
_:ec4b33fb5099e04eabc8ae182a8d6807 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:8006d87c77341359a1e2f359a83c9377fac2bafc> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during November 1986. It incorporates CTD sections from St. Bees Head to the Isle of Man and the Isle of Man to Burrow Head. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
