<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7fcbc22107fdea981ccdb2e7cc595c5b30ce0f6a> <http://schema.org/description> "An oil and gas industry site survey for a pipeline/cable route (Harding to East Brae) acquired between May and September 2006. The block numbers traversed were 16/3, 9/23 and 9/28." .
