<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7fa778fa763896fcafa7f5785564abdf876190c4> <http://schema.org/description> "Data contains the merged mean foraging ranges for the following species; common guillemot, razorbill, black legged kittiwake, nothern gannet, arctic tern, european shag, northern fulmar, atlantic puffin, little tern, roseate tern, common tern, sandwich tern and great cormorant. Foraging ranges for individual species were clipped according to foraging depths and habitats as provided by Martin Kerby (RSPB).\r\n \r\n The data layer shows foraging intensity at the 1kmÂ² scale." .
