_:f58e34aca3e0672332329ed9e3e8f8b9 <http://schema.org/value> "North of Scotland" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7fa7017a6dd3075b3ffec6c6c82e16b053657aa5> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) regional sampling survey took place from August to November 1984 around North of Scotland, the Minches, Central and Southern North Sea on board the British Enterprise Four. Seabed samples and cores were collected using Shipek grab, Gravity corer, Vibrocorer and rockdrill. Geochemical subsamples were obtained at selected sites. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Marine Geology Internal reports 84/11, 13, 16, 19, 20,22, 23." .
