_:d1a342efc4d5819613344c622bd53d42 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f8bc1c0c61dc937c22a0f6b881b2b5c0c60ef9d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ad9cb41e40cecfe54101071cbfd7a1ed .
_:ad9cb41e40cecfe54101071cbfd7a1ed <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f8bc1c0c61dc937c22a0f6b881b2b5c0c60ef9d> <http://schema.org/description> "Centre for Marine and Coastal Studies Ltd (CMACS) was appointed by SeaScape Energy Ltd in April 2005 to develop and undertake pre and during construction environmental monitoring to meet the requirements of the Food and Environment Protection Act (FEPA) licence issued to the wind farm developer.The Environmental Monitoring Methods have been developed in consultation with statutory and non-statutory consultees. Monitoring is being undertaken through a series of discrete surveys covering various environmental and ecological components. The purpose of the report in this series is to bring together the various technical reports\r\nwhich present results of the different strands of the environmental monitoring.\r\nAn overview of the results is provided in an Executive Summary (Section 3)\r\nand inter-related elements of the monitoring are considered in Section 4.\r\nDetailed information is provided in the technical reports within Appendix 3." .
_:ad9cb41e40cecfe54101071cbfd7a1ed <http://schema.org/value> "Centre for Marine and Coastal Studies Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f8bc1c0c61dc937c22a0f6b881b2b5c0c60ef9d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
