<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f5e095c19beefefcef6c26a6622de56f398c84a> <http://schema.org/description> "This sampling survey has been carried out by British Geological Survey (BGS) for BGS, the survey took place in August to October 1975 in the North Sea and Forth Approaches on board the MV Whitethorn. The purpose was to collect data as part of UK continental shelf survey programme. Sample data were collected using gravity corer; Vibrocorer; Dredge: Sediment or Shell; Shipek Grab. These data are archived by BGS. No BGS survey report currently available." .
