_:c26e11d4fb34d69905fb85873a8218a8 <http://schema.org/value> "Humber Plume" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f5a5e1271f35569201b1e00da2e0c3ab36e74ed> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 143 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September - October 1991. It includes CTD anchor stations and grid surveys in the Humber Estuary, Humber Plume and the Wash. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory as part of the Joint Nutrient Study I (JoNuS)." .
_:c26e11d4fb34d69905fb85873a8218a8 <http://schema.org/value> "Humber Estuary" .
_:c26e11d4fb34d69905fb85873a8218a8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
