_:dca8eeddd53495cebaa3742bd984ba30 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f33bb7c57ac26d132acb08f15bedddfcf071cbb> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 20 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during January - February 1994 from stations in the Celtic Sea, Goban Spur and the shelf break between Goban Spur and La Chappelle Bank. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Southampton Department of Oceanography as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
