<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f0e11f190187a6774a37a635715eb1cd96bd74f> <http://schema.org/description> "This investigation is a series of reports from 2002 to 2011 on the characteristics and habitat extent of seagrass Zostera marina in the Isles of Scilly. This investigation was contracted by Natural England. The data was gathered by volunteer divers carrying out full monitoring of Zostera marina beds using quadrats and underwater photographs. The dataset includes detailed GIS habitat polygons of seagrass beds and biotope abundance data of other species present within the survey sites." .
_:f1b342eb78a3f2576dd89b1c6628e2ab <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
_:e0ce5d69d73c9193c382e3c5bff1ebff <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:f1b342eb78a3f2576dd89b1c6628e2ab <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f0c15c478e9e379c3c9dcb5dd00999290faa382> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7f0c15c478e9e379c3c9dcb5dd00999290faa382> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 23 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the South East and West Atlantic Ocean (limit 20W) area specifically the Fimbul Ice Shelf and the Weddell Sea around Filchner Depression during February and March 2005. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the British Antarctic Survey as part of the Autosub Under Ice (AUI) project." .
_:e0ce5d69d73c9193c382e3c5bff1ebff <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
