_:ce9662fc76d559a524f663123ae29ef5 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7ef633ee4a7ba1c72a539fb055bb1acb5239e316> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e82392d83fa6eddf7352bfcebba5cf0 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7ef633ee4a7ba1c72a539fb055bb1acb5239e316> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ce9662fc76d559a524f663123ae29ef5 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7ef633ee4a7ba1c72a539fb055bb1acb5239e316> <http://schema.org/description> "This project outlines the work undertaken for the first year of post-construction monitoring of birds at Gunfleet Sands and Gunfleet Sands 2 offshore wind farms. Ten boat-based surveys were undertaken within the area occupied by these wind farms and adjacent areas between Oc-tober 2010 and March 2011. The survey methods employed are consistent with those un-dertaken during previous monitoring periods." .
_:e82392d83fa6eddf7352bfcebba5cf0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e82392d83fa6eddf7352bfcebba5cf0 <http://schema.org/value> "survey methods" .
_:ce9662fc76d559a524f663123ae29ef5 <http://schema.org/value> "Gunfleet Sands" .
_:f7024ca637dd4c5b3ed0cd61e6e4ec01 <http://schema.org/value> "fish" .
