<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7ea4b2ab0f3962fb348952e9166a885e540000ea> <http://schema.org/description> "A series of marine wildife surveys conducted by Natural Research Projects Ltd on behalf of OpenHydro for the area in which the Brims Ness AfL resides." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7ea4b2ab0f3962fb348952e9166a885e540000ea> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:aff8de6c4f3d3b19a0d21284a4ba4ab0 .
