_:c10e7a88ba89f6e67effa40e5b25c586 <http://schema.org/value> "Irish Sea" .
_:c10e7a88ba89f6e67effa40e5b25c586 <http://schema.org/value> "St. George's Channel" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7ea0e7c13bf6e65e2b59bbf66adbfa3da8be08f8> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 73 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel area specifically a number of lateral transects between Liverpool and the Isle of Man, during July and August 1978. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
_:f0d7d247331422089595863b7ce85e85 <http://schema.org/value> "University of Wales" .
