_:ee63c347701aaaf32035254e40c8a397 <http://schema.org/value> "avian taxa" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7e0e3d1615068ae3f681c77609bdbcd7477a1728> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7e0e3d1615068ae3f681c77609bdbcd7477a1728> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b160843e37dfca1d5397dea3bbec4141 .
_:b160843e37dfca1d5397dea3bbec4141 <http://schema.org/value> "great-circle distances" .
_:ee63c347701aaaf32035254e40c8a397 <http://schema.org/name> "taxon" .
_:ee63c347701aaaf32035254e40c8a397 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7e0e3d1615068ae3f681c77609bdbcd7477a1728> <http://schema.org/description> "Data was collected during May 2005 and September 2009, although 2005 \r\ndata was omitted from the analysis as methodologies were still being refined. All statistical \r\nanalyses and data manipulations were carried out in the R statistical and computing \r\nenvironment. The data were constrained to include only avian taxa, leaving 101014 \r\nobservations. Previous work into the effects of wind farms had identified ‘avoidance \r\ndistance’ as the best metric to determine the impacts of such structures (Devereux et al. \r\n2008, Madsen &amp; Boertmann 2008). Therefore the distance of each \r\nobservation to the position of the SeaGen tidal turbine was calculated. Distances were calculated using \r\nthe Haversine formula to calculate great-circle distances \r\nbetween the observation and SeaGen. This series contains the statistical report." .
_:b160843e37dfca1d5397dea3bbec4141 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7e0e3d1615068ae3f681c77609bdbcd7477a1728> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ee63c347701aaaf32035254e40c8a397 .
_:a80b3bfc4933e2b9495b433d65c1ad89 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
