<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7ded077be609dbcb14ab72ccab09fcfe04c94e0e> <http://schema.org/description> "An oil and gas industry site survey for seabed infrastructure (anchoring conditions) acquired in October 2005. The block number traversed was 21/25." .
