<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7dc3d4968be30c73aaef0dc0bc001feb4f4ffde7> <http://schema.org/description> "Targeted search for the Orange-Tipped Sea Squirt Corella eumyota at Batten Bay. Targeted search for the Orange-Tipped Sea Squirt Corella eumyota at Batten Bay. For each Corella eumyota found, the following observations were recorded: Length (mm), width (mm), aggregation size (number of individuals in aggregation). Photographs of some specimens were taken." .
