_:c2ef3a69c17b174bf85efa4dbdb8065b <http://schema.org/value> "Clyde estuary" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7d07ec459ca362e884481649c5a5151e92483cf4> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f57e52d14a3e4fbd775e654587cc7aa9 .
_:c2ef3a69c17b174bf85efa4dbdb8065b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
