_:bd11fbc64ed8e3d69807abe6919c27f <http://schema.org/value> "transit sonar" .
_:d708f3d68c47f9cca593e36ea54f5668 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:a02b0c0a1a422a3cdbc64a482c9d9bd1 <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
_:bd11fbc64ed8e3d69807abe6919c27f <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7c3fe61c08c69225c8c690ad30996939fa9c4f55> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) marine geophysical survey took place from the May to June in the SW Approaches on board the TSS profiler. The purpose was to collect data for regional survey of the UK continental Shelf. See Survey 1973/7 for the second phase of the project. A total of 6395km over 91 survey lines were collected during 1973/6 (Lines 1-49) and 1973/7 (Lines 50-91) surveys. Sea floor data were collected using echo sounder and transit sonar. Sub-bottom profiling data were collected using gravity meter; magnetometer; pinger and sparker. The data were recorded as paper records. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS report WB/MG/74/48." .
_:e021298eaa419cc861d744ebe3185734 <http://schema.org/value> "EGS International Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7c3224ffcc6370ba31f5afc592001a21a658214b> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS International Ltd (EGSi) were contracted by Centrica Renewable Energy Limited (CREL) to\r\nundertake the 2015 post construction (Year 3) hydrographic and geophysical surveys of the\r\nLincs and L and ID (Lynn and Inner Dowsing) windfarm array cable routes. Additionally, a benthic\r\nsurvey was required for the Lincs OWF post construction survey.\r\nThis series details the operations and results of the surveys." .
_:e021298eaa419cc861d744ebe3185734 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7c3224ffcc6370ba31f5afc592001a21a658214b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e021298eaa419cc861d744ebe3185734 .
