<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7bf392d201ccb1042241d10735df4639154ffd10> <http://schema.org/description> "This report provides a summary of the monitoring completed at WDS during the construction period, with such monitoring undertaken during the period April 2013 to September 2014. Accordingly the report is termed the Construction Monitoring Report. Those parameters that required construction monitoring (under the Marine Licence) included marine mammals, archaeology and ornithology." .
