<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7bf1e035809d2bceb9c067816d7453251c5390d5> <http://schema.org/description> "Report of the observed number and distribution of harbour seals (Phoca vitulina) within the Wash during June and August 2001. This study by the Sea Mammal research Unit (SMRU) acted as a baseline survey to identify the distribution of breeding harbour seals." .
