<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7babcef5da4fc91c57d02a26af9562141157b05b> <http://schema.org/description> "This monitoring summary report has been prepared by Vattenfall A/S as part of the\r\nFEPA monitoring program for the Kentish Flats Offshore Wind Farm. This report\r\ndescribes the environmental monitoring completed over the period 2004 to 2008 and\r\ncovering the pre, during and post-construction periods and in line with the\r\nrequirements of the Kentish Flats FEPA licence." .
