<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7b9a24a0fc84831d685692614ebad36e966352ec> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 40 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically the upwelling area off NW Africa, during April and May of 1969. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Liverpool Department of Oceanography." .
_:b8b3bd41a2f3c789ffa4efad35917c55 <http://schema.org/value> "NW Africa" .
