<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7b82198a3cdce4efcb9efe57a02af621da343179> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during July 1975. It incorporates casts performed within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, specifically at the Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) and Rockall-Malin Head sections. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
