_:f23eff8abb213f6d6830e52df93639f9 <http://schema.org/value> "Sheringham Shoal" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7b2cdffbccaa7550eadac7059c2f93ada51a8791> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the sediment dispersion modelling surveys undertaken at Sheringham Shoal Offshore Wind Farm. The definition of sediment dispersion due to seabed construction activities requires:\r\n1) Tidal Flow velocities over a number of tide cycles\r\n2) Description of the characteristics and volume of disturbed sediment\r\n3) Understanding of the dynamics of sediment suspension, dispersion and settling" .
