<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7b2a6c5f6f4ae785f99fa2502283cf12c8d69fbc> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 153 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the Inner Seas off the west coast of Scotland areas specifically sea lochs bordering the Minch and Shetland Voes including Loch Torridon. The data were collected during August and September of 2007. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:ef425b3507e0662c88939d367e7b755f <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea" .
