<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7b1b7c7a4dc1ba530a61db5de087c05305db7a6b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a5bae644cf2bc16dd597584f7396ec5 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7b1b7c7a4dc1ba530a61db5de087c05305db7a6b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
