<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7a4e0bb7d26a5faaee6ed89fb8b58bd9217fe9e5> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 34 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in August 1998 from stations off the coast of the Iberian Peninsula. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
