<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:79d29719765e2b6763d87eeeedcf35cf0bbc0851> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 30 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in August 1989 from stations covering the southern North Sea in a area off Flamborough Head. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences as part of the North Sea Project Frontal Process Study" .
