<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7952779d38ec436a1ba8308a781398b815403487> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e4d7f23cc53b9d697b45e94036bfe4e1 .
_:e4d7f23cc53b9d697b45e94036bfe4e1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7952779d38ec436a1ba8308a781398b815403487> <http://schema.org/description> "The Port of London Authority (PLA) Hydrographic Service was commissioned by DONG Energy to undertake a Multibeam Echosounder (MBES) survey at the Gunfleet Sands 1 &amp; 2 Offshore Windfarm in the Thames Estuary.\r\n\r\nThe scope of work, for the November 2014 survey included:\r\n1. MBES survey of 300m x 300m box around 5 sites including high resolution\r\nsurvey of the J-tubes/ rock protected areas.\r\n\r\nThis series covers survey elements which were undertaken on the 26th &amp; 27th November 2014, around the Substation and WTG locations E04, F05, F08 and G06. The survey work was carried out using the PLA survey vessel ‘Yantlet’, with bathymetric data being collected using a hull-mounted Reson SeaBat 8125h MBES." .
_:ae35a43758ae5f724d14b08c65ac16a9 <http://schema.org/value> "Thames Estuary" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7952779d38ec436a1ba8308a781398b815403487> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ae35a43758ae5f724d14b08c65ac16a9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
