<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7946deb841ce6fbcd39026caca4e1fc76832cc17> <http://schema.org/description> "A collection of Non-Native Species sightings from Natural Resource Wales (NRW). The species listed are Crassosstrea gigas, Crepidula fornicata, Ficopomatus enigmatus, Sargassum muticum and Styela clava." .
