<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:780db42f44fa6028f6ffc936c2aea0f3bea1bd53> <http://schema.org/description> "Spectrum Geosurvey Limited was contracted to perform multibeam bathymetry surveys of selected assets on the Westermost Rough Offshore Wind Farm (WMR01). The purpose of the survey programme was to provide bathymetric data meeting the requirements of the wind farm’s FEPA licence agreement.\r\nThe survey scope consisted of surveys around six turbine foundations and along the sixteen array cable routes bounding the south, west and north sides of the main site. Multibeam bathymetry was acquired on board the Foryd Bay between 6th April and 12th April 2016." .
_:f883c39b05d99ab858c4b8249ed304a6 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
