<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:780db42f44fa6028f6ffc936c2aea0f3bea1bd53> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a7485a0a49abde1b35b4cdfeeba827c7 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:77f4e322d536de46ddb0ae7b1260a5754904bbbc> <http://schema.org/description> "Spectrum Geosurvey Limited was contracted by London Array Limited (hereinafter ‘the Client’)\r\nto survey six pre-defined corridors across the London Array Offshore Windfarm site including\r\nsubstations 1 and 2.\r\nThe surveys were performed on board the survey / crew transfer vessel Spectrum 1. The primary\r\nobjective was to collect high resolution multibeam bathymetry and backscatter data over the\r\ndefined survey areas. This data was required to provide a comparison with previous datasets and\r\nto assess any changes in seabed level and morphology." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:77f4e322d536de46ddb0ae7b1260a5754904bbbc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d9708511811eb9f730319a52b2cab2ac .
