<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:779a4195b87d75fcf3cbf38f7f530016547b0b11> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1152; Wee Bankie to Gourdon (A + B), Area in SqKm: 4291, (17/07/2006 to 05/09/2006), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: Medium (LT). FY 2006/07. Contractor: Gardline." .
