<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7775c8a6a8c239f4833130faf1cae4644a9776c8> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 124 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from the North Sea and Inner Seas off the west coast of Scotland area specifically the Western Isles, Skye, Edrachillis Bay and Shetland. Undertaken by measuring multiple stations in each loch. CTD casts made during April 2004. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
