<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:76e6f02f4224ee9cc4823fd5726490d7223d085e> <http://schema.org/description> "To help target marine nature conservation in Scotland, SNH and JNCC have generated a focused list of habitats and species of importance in Scottish waters - the Priority Marine Features (PMFs). A subset of these features (termed MPA search features) will drive the identification of Nature Conservation MPAs. The principal aim of the present investigation was to improve knowledge of the occurrence and distribution of species and habitats of recognised conservation importance in Scottish waters, especially PMFs, but also taking into consideration other importance measures. This was to be achieved through the analysis of seabed video and still photographic imagery collected during research cruises around Scotland carried out by various organisations between 2000 and 2012. This Marine Recorder record contains an ROV survey of habitats in Loch Torridon and the adjacent region of the Inner Sound in 2005." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:76e6f02f4224ee9cc4823fd5726490d7223d085e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
