_:b0ae7263e3fb7de48856a1967e1062b6 <http://schema.org/value> "Fal" .
_:a0fc5151aac8668405b8e4f36403a698 <http://schema.org/value> "Biosonics MX Scientific Echosounder" .
_:a0fc5151aac8668405b8e4f36403a698 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
