<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:75e78663ae46dfd701059df676783287ca547a1a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:e21ef371a2a07ea44b87a6884858078 <http://schema.org/value> "30km radius study area" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:75e78663ae46dfd701059df676783287ca547a1a> <http://schema.org/description> "This project details the assessment which will define the existing landscape/seascape and visual baseline\r\nenvironment, within the 30km radius study area, and assess its quality and sensitivity\r\nto change. It will describe the nature of the anticipated change and\r\nassess the magnitude and significance of the changes during the construction,\r\noperational and decommissioning stages. The assessment will also identify any\r\nintegral mitigation measures to assist with reducing effects upon particularly sensitive\r\nreceptor groups and landscape environments." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:75e78663ae46dfd701059df676783287ca547a1a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e21ef371a2a07ea44b87a6884858078 .
