<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:75d1bd3035cda0ff066048e4dd0ce9eb1b931aaa> <http://schema.org/description> "This data has been collected as part of the North West Coast Connections project (NWCC), Morecambe Bay. A geotechnical survey was undertaken which acquired three boreholes around the target Islet location. The purpose of this survey was to evaluate natural and mechanical properties of seabed and intertidal sediments." .
