_:b0b5e84a773f2e6fc1e60f0e39d4dab <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:75b20c3fb0baf393ee8ae204065f212c1d286f85> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sarsia Cruise in July 1974 to the European continental slope. Samples were collected using a number of techniques, including a 4ft rectangular dredge, anchor dredge and Norway Agassiz trawl. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
