<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7548da74271af6da86b73bb29eb9ec3b0816f974> <http://schema.org/description> "Forewind has installed 2 meteorological masts within the Dogger Bank Offshore Wind Farm Round 3 Development Zone. Dogger Bank East (DBE) was installed during March 2013 and Dogger Bank West (DBW) was installed during September 2013. \r\n\r\nBoth met masts were deployed by Fred Olsen United. The suction bucket foundation and lattice towers were put in place by the jack-up vessel Brave Tern. \r\n\r\nThis series contains the following datasets for Dogger Bank East (DBE) met mast:\r\n\r\nRaw 10 minute data from 15 December 2013 to 9 September 2014\r\n\r\nCleaned 10 minute data from 26 March 2013 to 11 August 2014\r\n\r\nBoth raw and cleaned data from installation to 15th December 2013 has previously been submitted.\r\n\r\nFor each Dogger Bank met mast the following reports are included:\r\n\r\nCalibration certificates\r\nLogger codes\r\nOperations and Maintenance reports\r\nGeneral Dogger Bank met mast information\r\n\r\nThe raw data was cleaned and supplied to Forewind by the SSE wind assessment team." .
_:fd53411138d5223f3f1c7b71168aefe9 <http://schema.org/value> "Fred Olsen United" .
