_:dac8e668b76133675d966a50935033b <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:e5c71031e9e797ef4d41cf8ff9085c6 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
_:e5c71031e9e797ef4d41cf8ff9085c6 <http://schema.org/value> "abundance of infauna" .
