_:c35bccd9a8946b5f5bb7d36776a78344 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7469a1f599bdce4ac469dea5426bbb46da9d8dbc> <http://schema.org/description> "Wildfowl and Wetlands Trust (Consulting) Ltd, known as WWT Consulting was commissioned by Centrica Renewable Energy Limitedto undertake two aerial surveys of waterbirds and seabirds in inshore waters in an area of the Outer Wash approximately bounded to the west by Skegness, to the north by Mablethorpe, to the east by Wells-Next-the-Sea and to the south by the Norfolk coastline. This area was included in an aerial survey flying block identified as ‘GW4’. Both surveys were undertaken in late winter. The first one was to take place in February 2010 and the second one in March 2010." .
_:c74c5d7d7831a88c63f94be1dc88c548 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:746210ef2b45bd721f5af7d3f530ab2702720fe9> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ebb3f4c71a521a8be3c6697196b8feec .
_:ebb3f4c71a521a8be3c6697196b8feec <http://schema.org/value> "Osiris Projects" .
_:ebf2833ffa6a4bae2dd0611c77b0bbd0 <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica Renewable Energy\r\nLtd." .
_:ebf2833ffa6a4bae2dd0611c77b0bbd0 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:746210ef2b45bd721f5af7d3f530ab2702720fe9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
