<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:73e669e8c8e06b485c4a3fc96da551966608d0d4> <http://schema.org/description> "Bioblitz event at Brownsea Island, Hampshire over the 12th and 13th June 2015. The event mostly concentrated on outreach, with a dedicated strand and shoreline walks for school groups. Staff and volunteers carried out Seine netting, shoreline walks, push netting and were on hand to identify species found by participants, including members of the public." .
