<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:73ddde96aee609b2016dab6d1fe45fd0b59762c7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a59bc00adcd91dcf4d1e2c022fbee514 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:73ddde96aee609b2016dab6d1fe45fd0b59762c7> <http://schema.org/description> "Report: Tully, MC. 1971. Bristol Channel Cruise Report for MV Researcher. MGU Project 71/03. (IGS Report No 20) Positioning: Decca Mk12 receiver Echo sounding: ORE sub-bottom profiler was used as an echo sounder Sonar systems: Transit sonar (Kelvin Hughes?). Seismic systems: Sparker system: EG&amp;G sparker system with 263b hydrophone streamer and 254 recorder. Most lines run at 1kJ. Also various multi-electrode sparker units were tested Gravity meter: LaCoste and Romberg gravity meter. Magnetometer: Barringer magnetometer" .
