<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:73caf12da4d567b46ba1b42cf7f5a40e3f69b9c5> <http://schema.org/description> "Geo conducted a geotechnical investigation of the proposed wind farm areas at Dogger Bank, A B C. The predomination part of the investigation was performed in the Dogger Bank B area where tests have been performed for the planned WTG and OSP locations. At the Dogger Bank A and C areas the investigations have been performed at positions where more detailed information was required to supplement previous geotechnical and geophysical investigations.\r\n The investigation for Dogger Bank A and B areas include the following work components;\r\n - CPTUs (enhanced CPTUs with target depth of 45 m)\r\n - CPTUs (CPTUs with target depth of 15 m)\r\n - CPTUs (CPTUs with target depth of 6 m at positions selected for archaeological sampling)\r\n - SPTUs (seismic CPTUs with target depth of 25 m)\r\n - DCPTs (direct CPTs with target depth of 45 m)\r\n The investigation for Dogger Bank C area include the following work components;\r\n - CPTUs (enhanced CPTUs with target depth of 45m)\r\n - CPTUs (CPTUs with target depth of 15m)\r\n - SPTUs (seismic CPTUs with target depth of 25m)" .
_:cff933befd0631de93220224682cbf51 <http://schema.org/value> "SPTUs" .
