<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7397e9fe77f3dea42a35575ec858632135f1995f> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Shackleton Cruise No. 5 along the European continental slope. Data and samples collected using a number of methods including 8 ft Agassiz, 3 ft Agassiz, Scottish Marine Biological Association (SMBA) sledge, anchor dredge, Norway Agassiz, SMBA box dredge, lightweight Agassiz and drop video camera. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
