<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:735d6dd9bc5e0cb757a8cf89a01d120ce6419d9d> <http://schema.org/description> "Since January 2011, Eastern IFCA have carrried out foot surveys at Horseshoe Point, Lincolnshire for the purpose of a cockle (Cerastoderma edule) stock assessment and monitoring, and to assess the possibility of opening the fishery if deemed viable. The surveys have been carried out bi-annually where possible, otherwise surveys have been conducted annually." .
_:d2ccf2d47fdfdef6643b1c24fc92246 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:73520fdaeea7fbcf8d4781a039b7d7f88f44fb8b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c1d28eb1f8d0efa99b823bc5cfa562d9 .
