<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:73520fdaeea7fbcf8d4781a039b7d7f88f44fb8b> <http://schema.org/description> "As a part of the Food and Environmental Act monitoring requirements, a benthic monitoring survey has been carried out. The purpose of the surveys was to provide information against which future monitoring of the wind farm development can be compared, specifically regarding any changes in the benthic communities and sedimentary composition." .
