<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7297f5377dc1fa4539b5910cbfe25811f886a5a6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:e8a281e47967cf641023037f2d64307b <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:d20139677fe6561a822a4b41ed1a4328 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:e8a281e47967cf641023037f2d64307b <http://schema.org/value> "cluster analyses" .
_:e8a281e47967cf641023037f2d64307b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7297f5377dc1fa4539b5910cbfe25811f886a5a6> <http://schema.org/description> "RPS was commissioned by Gunfleet Sands Ltd to undertake a preconstruction benthic\r\necological study for their consented Round 1 Offshore Wind Farm at Gunfleet Sands\r\n(GS1). Data from 2002 and 2007 surveys of the whole study area, including the cable route\r\nand the GS2 proposed offshore wind farm (just to the south of GS1) were analysed for\r\nthis study. PSA, multivariate and cluster analyses were carried out on the sediment samples." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:728e85f54ef8ead85a25cee33afda3aa229b8f15> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a195a083f9aef058bd29561c59d3152d .
