<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:7251c9a5e406fc29211624f49aa3b05eeb833747> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sir Frederick Russell Cruise in April 1982 to the underwater canyons off the north coast of Spain in the Bay of Biscay. Samples collected using a number of methods including anchor dredge, small anchor dredge, pipe corer, phleger corer and Agassiz trawl. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
