<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:71b5960b93702f7444d19b3bb740044ec01338c7> <http://schema.org/description> "Records for the RV Sarsia Cruise in June 1964 along the European continental slope west of Brittany in the Western Approaches. Samples were collected using a number of methods including a 4ft rectangular dredge, 1-sided anchor dredge and 4.5ft scallop dredge. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
