<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:716f34b8bb5d9d2967302e777d1c3299cde31b92> <http://schema.org/description> "This survey forms part of the preliminary survey work for the Shrimp trial project. Ground truthing was conducted using a video camera sled and day grab to assess and identify areas of subtidal mixed sediment within boxes identified as potentially suitable for the trial. The survey work was conducted to the East of Roger Sand within waters of up to 20m deep." .
