_:b639d126fd59a7e16131b524b3310faf <http://schema.org/value> "BGS" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:71184b81e09600387679af67cde23858e639b5fb> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) marine sampling and geophysical survey took place from the May to June 1975 in the North Sea on board the RRS John Murray. Sub-bottom seismic profiling data were collected using Pinger and Sparker. Sample data were collected using dredge, gravity corer and shipek grab. These records are archived by BGS. No cruise report available." .
