<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:704c03172010894a12962d82eb4f64de6d9c9dc2> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) regional marine sampling survey took place in September 1975 in the Bristol Channle on board the RRS John Murray. Seabed samples and cores were collected using Shipek grab, Gravity corer and sediment dredge. These data are archived by BGS." .
