_:a0ffd66d6215f0ce8915b7e18c75df98 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:d4b002f64f607f1b5379577402c2b2ee <http://schema.org/name> "marine species" .
