<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6fd689be23a608a55a335444b2ccc89729fe4dee> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 19 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Barents Sea, Norwegian Sea area specifically Grimsoy NW standard sections, during May of 2001. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Marine Research, Norway as part of the Monitoring the Atlantic Inflow toward the Arctic (MAIA) project." .
