_:be1a05a49fe4785f3472d5abc0329286 <http://schema.org/value> "Channel Coastal Observatory" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ee6497c52d40227b0297bfc54f2eb30d23b84cd> <http://schema.org/description> "2022 South West document dataset from the Channel Coastal Observatory Catalogue (number of records: 1" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ecfa92bae8fe010a82c7c915dbcc0a59e03713c> <http://schema.org/description> "The scope of work carried out by CT Offshore was to perform a data analysis based on existing data from\r\nprevious survey operations, leading to a series of profile charts. These profile charts are to describe the status of\r\nthe J-Tube extensions and cables for the foundations where data is available." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ecfa92bae8fe010a82c7c915dbcc0a59e03713c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
