<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ec716c5cf59dfb8a2d090befecfa4ac84de9e66> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1437; Selsey Bill to Lee-on-Solent, Area in SqKm: 192, (15/05/2013 to 10/07/2013), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: SE Coastal Monitoring Programme. FY 2013/14. Contractor: MMT UK." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ec716c5cf59dfb8a2d090befecfa4ac84de9e66> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cdce25fc8f827b2401736850290f564d .
