_:efd2121292fe36dfe80a24dbfcb364a2 <http://schema.org/value> "Species" .
_:f3dcb049d39e514d74ac107201e73495 <http://schema.org/value> "Tees" .
_:f3dcb049d39e514d74ac107201e73495 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
