<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6eaf8e1795593238bc8902267ef96f451596528e> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1165; Sunk, Area in SqKm: 22, (22/06/2006 to 27/06/2006), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2006/07. Contractor: MMT." .
_:fb8670146a4d7f5450e02fb4c0f96136 <http://schema.org/value> "Civil Hydrography Programme" .
