_:f403745c4dbe696385ee65227eba49c8 <http://schema.org/value> "saltmarsh" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6ea48a84508c790fe93a4e1de5896262dac621e3> <http://schema.org/description> "The original data provided showed a map with the field that was flooded as part of the managed realignment for saltmarsh in the Aln Estuary. The map shows the extent of the new saltmarsh. The floodbank was taken down in September, 2006." .
_:f403745c4dbe696385ee65227eba49c8 <http://schema.org/name> "ecosystems" .
_:d4fea6db0a0791427b6b62bf758af0b0 <http://schema.org/value> "Aln Estuary" .
