<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6e999dc087b15bf92d23356079b52297de9403db> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 10 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Indian Ocean and the South East Atlantic Ocean (limit 20W) areas specifically the S.W. Indian Ocean, during January and February of 1987. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
