_:a03139033172c6f3841e6e998188eecc <http://schema.org/value> "Echinus esculentus" .
_:f328cb7f50832db1edca868882fce719 <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6e021bc1fac31073486eb482f6761c3ed1044814> <http://schema.org/description> "Echinus esculentus records from a more comprehensive comparative survey of fauna eaten by flatfish compared to actual benthic fauna. Bottom fauna, of a small area near the Cumbrian coast, were invesitgated using a grab and compared with the gut contents of flatfish. A map of locations is included in the paper, but no latitude/longitude given, therefore, an area incorporating all the survey stations has been estimated from a map. This survey was collated by MarLIN as part of a contract to find information on the distribution of species and habitats in the Irish Sea as part of the Irish Sea Pilot project." .
