<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6dd168a877255cd43348f011033ac71b9365ebc5> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 13 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during May - June 1994 from stations in the Nort East Atlantic between 45 - 50 N, 5 - 15 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Royal Netherlands Institute for Sea Research as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
_:a54b7efc5c062c04f4f42cb33ed3cf37 <http://schema.org/value> "Royal Netherlands Institute for Sea Research" .
