<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d99c2c59657fda5ebbab9f4762af45471bb9b98> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:e9c369d8e82b83a6d7fac7635c04cf46 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d99c2c59657fda5ebbab9f4762af45471bb9b98> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during March 1997. It incorporates three standard sections. The Joint North Sea Information System (JONSIS) section extending eastwards from the Orkneys and the Fair Isle-Munchen and Nolso Flugga sections across the Faroe-Shetland Channel. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture Environment and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:d653c9b645887bab355d7843f494e761 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:d653c9b645887bab355d7843f494e761 <http://schema.org/value> "Faroe-Shetland Channel" .
_:d653c9b645887bab355d7843f494e761 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d99c2c59657fda5ebbab9f4762af45471bb9b98> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e9c369d8e82b83a6d7fac7635c04cf46 .
