_:f1b43d06428f5910a642a399c2d65500 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d45a934f1ee66840d34b275bb0b21b341e3d95c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d45a934f1ee66840d34b275bb0b21b341e3d95c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:de7119fde3346b948d779e12a8b80539 .
_:f1b43d06428f5910a642a399c2d65500 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f1b43d06428f5910a642a399c2d65500 <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica Energy" .
_:de7119fde3346b948d779e12a8b80539 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d45a934f1ee66840d34b275bb0b21b341e3d95c> <http://schema.org/description> "RPS have been requested by Centrica Energy to give an Environmental Appraisal of the intertidal habitats along the proposed Lincs, Docking Shoal and Race Bank cable route, as part of an Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) for a Round 2 offshore wind farm development. This appraisal uses existing published data to evaluate the benthic communities within the vicinity of the proposed cable route corridor, to assess their importance relative to the wider Wash area, and in comparison to other similar habitats. Given that the previous datasets are somewhat dated, a survey of the biological resources along the route corridor was conducted and a temporal comparison of these resources was made." .
_:de7119fde3346b948d779e12a8b80539 <http://schema.org/value> "benthic communities" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d45a934f1ee66840d34b275bb0b21b341e3d95c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f1b43d06428f5910a642a399c2d65500 .
_:de7119fde3346b948d779e12a8b80539 <http://schema.org/name> "ecosystems" .
_:caabe4ce8ebed992b8d919dfeb9a79a8 <http://schema.org/value> "Emu Ltd" .
_:caabe4ce8ebed992b8d919dfeb9a79a8 <http://schema.org/value> "Dong Energy" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d3fc661fffad9275c7862b43882e73737a596c1> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the seafloor glacial features at the site of the Westermost Rough offshore wind farm. The project aimed to provide context and aid in the identification and interpretation of a complex of ridges bathymetrically-imaged across 6 km2 zone of sea-bed off Holderness. Aberystwyth University undertook desk based research using a digital surface model provided by Dong Energy from the Westermost Rough Wind Farm Hydrographic Survey conducted by Emu Ltd (2009). As well as this data including a 1:5000 bathymetric survey raster image, grab sample descriptions, photographs and locations also collected during the same survey were used. This was supplemented with data from the BRITICE GIS database, a compilation of terrestrial and marine glacigenic landforms from the last British Ice Sheet. Identification of landforms was assisted by manipulation of the DSM. The DSM allows the 3-dimensional structure of the seafloor landforms to be examined, for example, vertical profiles can be produced of horizontal transects. A hill-shade surface of the bathymetric survey illuminated from several directions image provides a detailed plan view of the study area. By overlaying the various datasets, relationships and assemblages can be identified from the old and new data. The report concludes further sedimentological data is required to more fully understand the off shore landforms identified here." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d3fc661fffad9275c7862b43882e73737a596c1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:caabe4ce8ebed992b8d919dfeb9a79a8 <http://schema.org/value> "Aberystwyth University" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d3fc661fffad9275c7862b43882e73737a596c1> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:caabe4ce8ebed992b8d919dfeb9a79a8 .
_:caabe4ce8ebed992b8d919dfeb9a79a8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:caabe4ce8ebed992b8d919dfeb9a79a8 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d373b96619754dfa80fa3916c9b8279ad09122e> <http://schema.org/description> "DONG Energy Power contracted EGSi to undertake a hydrographic and geophysical survey in\r\nthe post-construction (operational) phase of the project to determine, changes to seabed\r\nmorphology and classify targets on the seabed, including exposed cables and rock dumping\r\nareas, along the export cable route. he data acquisition took place between September-October 2014 on the \r\nresearch vessel, MV Xploer. To meet this objective EGS conducted a multibeam high frequency bathymetric survey combined with seabed mapping and sub-surface hazard\r\nidentification using side-scan sonar (SSS)." .
_:f2e6ca3df82d93911792f14803bd46d3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d373b96619754dfa80fa3916c9b8279ad09122e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f2e6ca3df82d93911792f14803bd46d3 <http://schema.org/value> "EGSi" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d373b96619754dfa80fa3916c9b8279ad09122e> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f2e6ca3df82d93911792f14803bd46d3 .
_:f2e6ca3df82d93911792f14803bd46d3 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:f2e6ca3df82d93911792f14803bd46d3 <http://schema.org/value> "EGS" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d354a66396fda5d0b48ecc1d0c544a7b93188fc> <http://schema.org/description> "Trial Intertidal seagrass survey at several sites in the Firth of Forth and Forth Estuary, Scotland for EU Water Framework Directive Monitoring using the WFD (Angiosperm) Intertidal Seagrass tool. The tool looks at the species composition of the seagrass bed, the density (as percent cover) and the extent of the seagrass bed." .
_:fdaa74a6038894ab7e179758459df0e7 <http://schema.org/value> "seagrass bed" .
