<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d0b23517be5ead358d4a0a8d93fcfebe2489057> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c060db2ec28462a90c8f583520034672 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d0b23517be5ead358d4a0a8d93fcfebe2489057> <http://schema.org/description> "Following the license conditions (Food and Environment Protection Act 1985 Licence 33369/10/3 updated by Marine Licence L/2011/00153/8) for the Sheringham Shoal Offshore Wind Farm (OWF), monitoring was conducted to determine any impact of the construction and operation of the Sheringham Shoal OWF on marine mammals. Monitoring comprised boat-based surveys of the wind farm site, 2 km and 4 km buffer zones and a control area. The principal aim of this report is to describe the results of the monitoring during baseline and construction phases, with the latter also including pre-construction and start of operation, over the period from March 2004 to January 2014 inclusive." .
_:e3351ea6c1669f4847bc1f15dd4817f4 <http://schema.org/value> "boat-based surveys" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6d0b23517be5ead358d4a0a8d93fcfebe2489057> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e3351ea6c1669f4847bc1f15dd4817f4 .
_:c060db2ec28462a90c8f583520034672 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
