<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6cd1c3984b89f2fbea413eea41b147c14de5b24a> <http://schema.org/description> "This document was prepared by Entec UK Limited. The report was submitted in support of the proposed Teesside Offshore Wind Farm development and provides an extensive assessment of the potential impacts of the proposed site on the surrounding area." .
