<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6c83a5b62791462c82f336e44cebee9fdd0ce55a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fbc217beffeda22096842f2907d64e1f .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6c83a5b62791462c82f336e44cebee9fdd0ce55a> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during February - March 1985. It incorporates a line of CTD across the east Azores Fracture Zone plus profiles in the Great Meteor East area and around the Madeira Abyssal Plain. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
