<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6c1f18b873dd6ee2554ecf3dfb72470ad251ac47> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b1647408c6aacc04ab356498e1b6183b .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6c1f18b873dd6ee2554ecf3dfb72470ad251ac47> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 58 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates the Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section and further sections northwards - culminating in a section from off of the Butt of Lewis to 60N, 10W. The data were collected during April of 1981. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
