<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6bba74203403bd0175d55740ccebbb88d189a423> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 96 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during February - March 1998 from stations on the Western Iberian Continental Margin. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute for Marine Science, Kiel as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
_:b060bb638788e5c6208028040766525f <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
_:b0a28aa81260255afa01e64d32890525 <http://schema.org/value> "Western Iberian Continental Margin" .
