_:b4419b200bb4940c48be9be6414ada4a <http://schema.org/value> "Faroe Shetland Channel" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b508f57f91199994964a553fab3fa42cb20bb11> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b4419b200bb4940c48be9be6414ada4a .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b508f57f91199994964a553fab3fa42cb20bb11> <http://schema.org/description> "Environmental survey for Chevron North Sea Ltd / Chevron Upstream Europe at the Aberlour prospect at UKCE block 213/28 in the Faroe Shetland Channel. The objective of the survey was to describe the physio-chemical and biological characteristics of the Aberlour propsect area." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b508f57f91199994964a553fab3fa42cb20bb11> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
