_:dacaf2c9b92894a63f29cda6489ef99b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a34cf2bb4cf2ae178b1a9c7bcb0937e4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a34cf2bb4cf2ae178b1a9c7bcb0937e4 <http://schema.org/value> "Bristol Channel Zone" .
_:a34cf2bb4cf2ae178b1a9c7bcb0937e4 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b4f3dfe3d0f31d6b279b46324a1067216d096ca> <http://schema.org/description> "RWE npower renewables Ltd (NRL) has gained exclusive rights to develop the Bristol Channel Zone (BCZ) as part of The Crown Estate Round 3 leasing programme. NRL have identified a potential development area for an Offshore Wind Farm (OWF) within the BCZ, known as Atlantic Array. As part of the initial assessment of the development area, it is proposed that a meteorological mast (met mast) will be constructed at the site. This series contains various reports associated with the proposed Met Mast, including the Food and Environment Protection Act (FEPA) licence." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6b4f3dfe3d0f31d6b279b46324a1067216d096ca> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:dacaf2c9b92894a63f29cda6489ef99b <http://schema.org/value> "Food and Environment Protection Act" .
