<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6a71b4522bd3f9dcf46c3e758460db1c609b5e1b> <http://schema.org/description> "A geophysical survey of the\r\nWest of Duddon Sands (WDS01) and Barrow Offshore (BOW01) windfarm arrays and export cables\r\nfor DONG Energy was carried out by Fugro.\r\nTwo Fugro vessels were utilised; Fugro Seeker and Valkyrie." .
