_:b465293c312a22358d856adb576b4db1 <http://schema.org/value> "Scotland" .
_:b465293c312a22358d856adb576b4db1 <http://schema.org/value> "Firth of Forth" .
_:bbb5e60de161b8d8d1d7704730dd7119 <http://schema.org/value> "Area 407" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6a5dc67046d9ce9c01de13692ed2bb7fb156ec82> <http://schema.org/description> "Marine benthic species presence/absence data from a benthic ecology survey of Area 407 (St. Catherines), south of the Isle of Wight was carried out between the 27th September and 5th of November 2004" .
_:bbb5e60de161b8d8d1d7704730dd7119 <http://schema.org/value> "Isle of Wight" .
_:bbb5e60de161b8d8d1d7704730dd7119 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
