<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:69e4d0ebcb07a2a9fdd4aac3eb5ee20c2bc9d71e> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c9545d6e2447c6d10ad5a1fc266959a2 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:69e4d0ebcb07a2a9fdd4aac3eb5ee20c2bc9d71e> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS (International) Ltd was contracted by Centrica in 2010 to undertake a geophysical survey of the Lynn and Inner Dowsing (L&amp;ID) offshore wind farms (OWF) and cable route corridors in order to help determine the nature and distribution of broad scale sediment types and identify seabed features. The results of the geophysical survey will be used to assess the environmental impact of the existing OWF with reference to the presence of Annex 1 habitats to meet regulatory requirements and to inform benthic habitat survey sampling locations. The Phase 2 which is the bilogical aspect was also carried out by EGSI and assisted by assisted by Benthic Solutions Limited,\r\n\r\nCorresponding Centrica Document Title: Lynn and Inner Dowsing Post Construction Monitoring Survey Works :\r\nFinal Report (Phase 1 - Geophysical Survey)\r\nPhase 2 – Benthic Ecology Survey and\r\nSummary Assessment of Annex 1 Habitats\r\n\r\nAvailable Datasets and supporting documentation: 1. DWG; 2.Images(.tif, jpg) ; 3.ESRI grids; 4. Spreadsheet (xls) 5. Documents and Charts (.pdf); 6. Raw data (.all, .xtf)" .
_:e60be8f43fa337d0b2a39462275f8af1 <http://schema.org/name> "policies" .
