_:e60be8f43fa337d0b2a39462275f8af1 <http://schema.org/value> "regulatory requirements" .
_:c9545d6e2447c6d10ad5a1fc266959a2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
