<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:69e38080f8083dd94d701d576075c3394b5f3c32> <http://schema.org/description> "This report is a contribution to the Strategic Environmental Assessment (SEA5) conducted by the Department of Trade and Industry (now Department of Energy and Climate Change). Macrofaunal analysis was carried out on sediment samples collected in the Moray Firth between September and October 2003." .
_:a1d700903b686473028cf531e280cc80 <http://schema.org/value> "Moray Firth" .
_:f8684a5eb83d7743b19d8a0264cdba2b <http://schema.org/value> "Department of Energy and Climate Change" .
