<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:69a5f0761e3286643d01863e26c25e5993a3e630> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during May - June 1985. It incorporates deep CTD profiles to near-bottom over the Iberia Abyssal Plain. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
