<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:69a25347de6b7b6cf1523bd0be88f7b8a272a6e3> <http://schema.org/description> "The cable route section of the Westray South site covers an area of approximately\r\n15.5km x 500m, split into a north-south running cable route, and an east-west leg to a\r\nlandfall area at Wass Wick. M/V Lia collected data from the landfall area, the inshore sections in the north of the\r\ncable route and the LOA, with S/V Chartwell collecting data from the main cable route\r\ncorridor and the LOA." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:69a25347de6b7b6cf1523bd0be88f7b8a272a6e3> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d0e43623db97f851b9364dbc526f3b8f .
