<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6936f9d32ff6bfcd1fd1817d1120047bfec24f66> <http://schema.org/description> "A quadrat survey of Crassostrea gigas in Scotland conducted by the Scottish Aquaculture Research Forum (SARF) for the Scottish Association for Marine Sciencew (SAMS). The purpose of this survey was to determine the extent of C. gigas in Scotland. Abundances and shell dimensions were measured, as well as habitat descriptions." .
