<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:682f2295fef3773ec0d0e43205a0dac61f99bc88> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cd947856ddbbb31490baa75e7832db60 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:682f2295fef3773ec0d0e43205a0dac61f99bc88> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 3 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel area specifically to the south west of the Isle of Man, during June of 1981. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
_:fedb58eb476ef41c59cb26fc6dc70977 <http://schema.org/value> "Isle of Man" .
