<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:682b0cafd121a3c6d350f5ddda2d80e1f1a4b4b8> <http://schema.org/description> "Canyon Offshore Limited (COL) conducted this Geotechnical Site Investigation utilising the ROVDrill\r\nMK2.1 system on behalf of Marine Current Turbines (MCT), with Gardline Geosciences providing\r\nGeotechnical services and reporting, including borehole management planning.\r\n\r\nThe site survey comprised seabed video and geotechnical rock coring boreholes utilising Canyon’s ROVDrill Mk2.1 Subsea drill unit with Gardline Geosciences providing Geotechnical services and reporting." .
_:ec84a77e6dc6c776cfbf657942417be7 <http://schema.org/value> "Marine Current Turbines" .
