_:d0491e2dcfe53175d0375f174092635c <http://schema.org/value> "Outer Thames Estuary" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:68223f6fa170ffedf4ee23271da89505bda3314c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e2d650060489715be626be9cf3b64722 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:68223f6fa170ffedf4ee23271da89505bda3314c> <http://schema.org/description> "Osiris Projects were commissioned in July 2009 by Airtricity Developments (UK) Ltd,\r\n(Airtricity), (since acquired by Scottish and Southern Energy Renewables - SSER) to\r\nundertake an extensive hydrographic, geophysical and benthic environmental survey in the\r\nOuter Thames Estuary, as part of the programme to extend the existing Greater Gabbard\r\nOffshore Wind Farm (GGOWF). This programme will be known as the Galloper Wind Farm\r\n(GWF). The survey was undertaken under Airtricity Contract Reference '09.0558.G' 'Benthic\r\n&amp; Geophysical Survey Services for the Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA)' and was\r\nsubstantially completed during the period 3r d August to 5t h December 2009, at which point\r\nthe GWF survey was postponed due to prolonged periods of severe weather. The surveys\r\nwere eventually completed during the period 16t h February to 14t h March 2010." .
_:b25e146b9ff0299c9398e47e7b5469ec <http://schema.org/value> "Galloper Wind Farm" .
