<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6789e63017611e50fd061d80360e75d6d3318054> <http://schema.org/description> "Environmental baseline and habitat survey at the proposed Sailor location in UKCS block 8/15. Provide baseline data relating to the physico-chemical and macrofaunal benthic environment." .
