_:a078f726b59050fa4d78487952cc08e7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:674460534c35c1adb991d6bda51398e078986f48> <http://schema.org/description> "Wessex Archaeology conducted a geophysical survey of the wreck of the vessel South Australian in July 2015. The survey was undertaken on behalf of the Ilfracombe and North Devon Sub-Aqua Club with the main objective of producing a site plan to inform further diving investigations at the site. The interpreted features consist of the rail stack, adjacent scour, debris field and 13 individual items of debris within the debris field. The identities of the majority of the features are not known to the divers and will provide targets for further diving investigations." .
_:d3ba8ead3616ff41a311fe3a724b02e5 <http://schema.org/value> "Ilfracombe and North Devon Sub-Aqua Club" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:674460534c35c1adb991d6bda51398e078986f48> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b86a8cb69b9a9e165bd2b9410b346c3d .
