_:c6b7cc9902f572d192d6df7a4fb4e737 <http://schema.org/value> "Irish Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:66ff3be9bc2a8b2723bc877e67bc2a756639c83e> <http://schema.org/description> "This sampling survey has been carried out by British Geological Survey (BGS) and George Wimpey and Co Ltd for BGS, the survey took place from August to December1970 in the Irish Sea and Firth of Clyde on board the MV Whitethorn. The purpose was to collect data as part of the UK regional mapping programme. Sample data were collected using dredge; borehole drill; gravity corer; vibrocorer and Shipek grab. These data are archived by BGS. Details of the survey are contained in Institute of Geological Sciences (IGS) report 72/10." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:66ff3be9bc2a8b2723bc877e67bc2a756639c83e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
