<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:66dc7adb419a61efa5f375b60780ef5ece0aca37> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e497e65ddb84b2569414d338fc23edf1 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:66dc7adb419a61efa5f375b60780ef5ece0aca37> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:e497e65ddb84b2569414d338fc23edf1 <http://schema.org/value> "Loch Begg" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:66dc7adb419a61efa5f375b60780ef5ece0aca37> <http://schema.org/description> "The Offshore Habitats Regulations Assessment- HRA - Screening Report is an iterative document and is based on the information and assessments available at the time. It is intended that the Offshore Habitats Regulations Assessment -HRA- Screening Report can be updated following further anlaysis which may indicate a likely significant effect or determine no likely significant effects on features from the Rhiannon Wind Farm. Further analysis will be undertaken in support of the Environmental Impact Assessment and the outputs will be considered to determine if the Offshore Habitats Regulations Assessment -HRA- Screening Report needs to be refined.\r\nThe scope of the screening assessment is based on the advice received during consultation on the Offshore Scoping Report. All coastal Special Protection Areas and Ramsar sites and all coastal and offshore Special Areas of Conservation with interest features that could be affected by the proposed Rhiannon Wind Farm development were included in the screening assessment. The geographical extent of the screening assessment extends from the Rum SPA to the north to Skokholm and Skomer SPA, 216km to the south. It also considers sites in Ireland, Lough Neag and Loch Begg, 149km to the west.\r\n\r\nCorresponding Centrica Document No: SE-D-EV-133-0117-000000-001\r\n\r\nAvailable Datasets : 1. ArcGIS files (mxd, . shapefiles), 2. Drawings (pdf, jpeg,), \t3. Reports (.doc, .xls, .txt, csv)," .
_:e497e65ddb84b2569414d338fc23edf1 <http://schema.org/value> "Skokholm" .
_:e497e65ddb84b2569414d338fc23edf1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
