<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6652ece55633236a518f9a2c6c9bbd3a1239a32b> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 46 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August - September 1995 from stations in the Celtic Sea and Goban Spur. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Southampton Department of Oceanography as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
