<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:65f30527ad23b1f124e200f89902852ba30d2eb3> <http://schema.org/description> "The consenting process which is required to allow the wind farm development to proceed is\r\ncurrently underway, led by Natural Power. As part of this consenting process the environmental\r\nimpacts of the potential foundation options at Narec require consideration as part of Rochdale\r\nEnvelope within the Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA).\r\nNarec have commissioned Cathie Associates (CA) to undertaken the “Concept Engineering”\r\nsection of the Rochdale Envelope. Cathie Associates have completed a high level assessment of\r\nthe potentially suitable foundation types." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:65e231bee979e7b8bc3d4bb637b430b0850e2465> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bb303041c76ef6507a6342ba948e5bdd .
