<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:65c6f8bb2c18532818ad1d4c0facda30ee8c3acf> <http://schema.org/description> "Survey conducted by the Underwater Conservation Society with assistance from the Nature Conservancy Council (NCC). The survey took place during July 1980 and involved numerous dives throughout the Scilly Isles and South Cornwall. Sites were described and the presence/absence of species recorded. The survey aimed to describe the range of sublittoral habitats and species present at the islands." .
_:d9d92e420d68e57998b752fc7850c1cd <http://schema.org/value> "South Cornwall" .
