<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:652311049986560276ecebcc746abcdb78b10918> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 164 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April - May 1988 from a pre-determined survey grid in the North Sea. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Bidston Laboratory as part of the North Sea Project." .
