<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:64ab2f8a5741719c3af6d7ae772fe06eac29e50c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b24dbcb897b4ea5e4906b0b0c7380552 <http://schema.org/value> "Helford River" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:64ab2f8a5741719c3af6d7ae772fe06eac29e50c> <http://schema.org/description> "During the 1986 to 1999 period, six intensive surveys were carried out at each of six sites covering the north and south banks of the Helford River, both sides of the Gillan inlet and an exposed headland. The results of all these studies and brief, more recent, notes, are drawn together here in this report to inform and assist in any future investigations." .
