_:f5171d828f7eef2be84b43f96be45931 <http://schema.org/value> "sand and gravel biotopes" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:64a28ce9f8a2b3587f382c55248402425d3a03d5> <http://schema.org/description> "This project, aimed to address the impacts of marine aggregate extraction on sand and gravel biotopes in South East England. It also provided a vehicle for the Wildlife Trusts to tackle issues such as marine biodiversity action planning and raising awareness of the marine environment and its conservation amongst government, industry, environmental organisations and the general public. " .
