_:d752783ce33292a782d539d9045220cb <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
_:c11471cf18dde9d6c2edee36a08a354b <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:63dd8f2eaf2fb3d28427c24ffd30784fda9b9a8d> <http://schema.org/description> "A ground investigation has been carried out by Fugro Seacore Limited (FSCL) on the\r\ninstructions of DONG Energy Burbo Bank Extension (UK) Limited (the Client) and under\r\nthe supervision of Cathie Associates (the Engineer), at Burbo Bank Extension Offshore\r\nWind Farm. The site is located west of the existing Burbo Bank Offshore Wind Farm." .
