_:e22ae676ccace57c7c2f56295f41310f <http://schema.org/value> "EGS (International) Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:63cf8a681846852db3e16e33e8b7692ab4365f94> <http://schema.org/description> "In September 2014 EGS (International) Ltd was contracted to undertake the post\r\nconstruction (6 month) survey of the Barrow and Walney OWFs and export cables." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:63cf8a681846852db3e16e33e8b7692ab4365f94> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
