<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:63babbec25a7a10b5952ace295fb6da9817fc520> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April - May 1985. It incorporates full-depth CTD profiles from 7 stations along a section in the Northeast Atlantic from 37N to 50N between 14W and 20W. The CTD package was also fitted with a transmissometer and an oxygen sensor, but the oxygen sensor only worked for the southernmost station.The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
_:afe44b77b62b307b4f899c085e2037c <http://schema.org/value> "Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:63ba3d04cedde3e14187fd224109eda29203de4d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fbbe09272f21bbb27172058660f8f8b4 .
_:fbbe09272f21bbb27172058660f8f8b4 <http://schema.org/value> "fauna" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:63ba3d04cedde3e14187fd224109eda29203de4d> <http://schema.org/description> "Benthic surveys undertaken at the site of the Sheringham Shoal Offshore Wind Farm. These surveys consist of both infauna and fauna data. The data analysis of faunal samples consists of both multivariate and univariate analysis methods." .
_:ba9083d2e907506dcb855ba7ad6440bd <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
