<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:62e676249f9b5be29e80b18b47c5b26f7ee298ee> <http://schema.org/description> "This report details the findings of the 7th to 12th potting survey undertaken in the area relevant to the operational Lynn &amp; Inner Dowsing offshore wind farms. The survey is the Year 1 post construction survey which span across 2009 and 2010\r\n\r\nThe survey methodology used replicated that of the previous surveys. This is detailed in the “LID Offshore Wind Farm Post-construction Potting Survey, August 2009, Interim Report" .
