<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:62d76feea200afcd5fc7266f961204de72a8311a> <http://schema.org/description> "This point data are locations of video sampling undertaken in:\r\n Hughes DJ and Atkinson RJS. 1997. A towed video survey of megafaunal bioturbation in the North Eastern Irish Sea. Journal of the Marine Biological Association, 77, 635-653.\r\n This data was digitised and compiled by Natural England (North West) in order to produce the paper \r\n LUMB, C. 2011. Evidence on the distribution and quality of mud-related features in the Eastern Irish Sea. A paper presented to the ISCZ Project Team and Regional Stakeholder Group." .
