<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6271f54f9e8926fb57f509e5d03060231c005f79> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 1 hydrographic data profile, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from the North/North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically west of Castro Terrace, during June of 1974. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
