<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:625c3faa74db44ba3ecd02c73632ec4535135dce> <http://schema.org/description> "Emu Ltd were commissioned by Scira Offshore Energy Ltd to undertake a benthic\r\nand Sabellaria spinulosa study in 2009 within the proposed Sheringham Shoal\r\nOffshore Windfarm site, off Sheringham, North Norfolk. These results are presented\r\nwithin a separate report (Emu Ltd., 2010a).\r\n\r\nAn additional survey was undertaken in 2010, with sites for investigation selected\r\nfrom the new sidescan sonar data acquired during the UXO survey performed in\r\n2009/2010 as specified in the survey specifications within Appendix VIII (Emu Ltd.,\r\n2010a)." .
