<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:621b6cce1eca0dd967a6ab8ad14d489d46c3fcf4> <http://schema.org/description> "Ad-hoc series of events carried out in the Gara point, Stoke point, Plymouth Sound and Plymouth Sound Approaches area in 2007 using SeaSearch methodology. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes the 2007 Seasearch survey of Gara point to Stoke point, 2007 Seasearch survey of Plymouth Sound, 2007 Seasearch survey of Plymouth Sound Approaches, and the 2007 Seasearch survey of The Eddystone Plymouth." .
