<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:61debd01662bc29aba433bf053f16b99773c91f9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:61debd01662bc29aba433bf053f16b99773c91f9> <http://schema.org/description> "Irish Sea Zone: Operational Impact Assessment. The work presented in this report is an aviation operational impact assessment for the Centrica round 3 Irish Sea - Zone 9 Offshore Wind Farm Development project focusing on operations at RAF Valley and Warton Aerodrome. This study was prodiced by Osprey Consulting Services Limited (Osprey) with the purpose of assessing the potential impact the Windfarm might have on Radar services. \r\nCorresponding Centrica Document No: R3-D-EV-130-0032-000000-008\r\nCorresponding Centrica Document Title: Irish Sea Zone: Operational Impact Assessment\r\nAvailable Datasets and supporting documentation: 1. Image ( .tif) \t2. Documents (.pdf)" .
_:c16d789524a7be0cddc5b01a1c9c9add <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
