<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:61d2b1ef4c75750862887d410364c111d67d3041> <http://schema.org/description> "Records taken from a 1985 paper summarising historic records of Atrina Pectinata (Pinna fragilis) in Scotland. All locations have been estimated from a map included in the paper. Various units of measurement were used in the past and the distinction was not always made between nautical and statute miles. Here all measurements have been converted to metric and miles have been assumed to be nautical." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:61d2b1ef4c75750862887d410364c111d67d3041> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b1ffd94551edf68b417cf60e664d15e2 .
