_:e27dba3e63b351a1181bc88b8f64a30d <http://schema.org/value> "Orkney and Shetland Islands" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:60359d20bbb389747ff97072d1a1ef9d80049aa1> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) marine sampling survey took place in 1974 along the coastline of the Orkney and Shetland Islands. The purpose was to collect beach samples as part of an offshore regional geological mapping programme. Beach samples were collected by hand. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Internal Report ?????." .
