<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:6007dda5d42d1a1d56ad4dffbe0c85f7763ee711> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 139 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates the Ellett Line stations to the east of the Anton Dohrn Seamount, plus a large number of sections across the shelf between the North Channel and Cape Wrath. The data were collected during July of 1981. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
