<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5fd372173696658e9ae7b909d5aad427be8d2694> <http://schema.org/description> "Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd. was commissioned by Scottish Power Generation Ltd. to conduct a combined baseline benthic survey for these two OWF projects (Walney and West Duddon). The Walney site is approximately 75km squared, which at the time of sampling had a proposed export cable route to Cleveleys, north of Blackpool. The West of Duddon Sands (WoDS) site is adjacent to, and immediately southeast, of the Walney site - with a proposed export cable route into Heysham.\r\n \r\n Survey operations were conducted in April/May 2005 and comprised of a programme of grab sampling and beam trawling to provide infaunal, epifaunal and associated sediment samples to characterise the benthos and sediment quality over the area of interest." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5fd372173696658e9ae7b909d5aad427be8d2694> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b8f6552a84439b046d33b2614c264071 .
