<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5f70fde6f17cc2daae1f104767e0f437a137799d> <http://schema.org/description> "A project funded by English Heritage to apply Historic Seascape Characterisation to the Bristol Channel and Severn Estuary. The dataset comprises the project report which is in three sections: Section 1 Implementing the Method; Section 2 Application Review and Case Studies; and Section 3 Character Type Texts." .
