_:ce7ebf23e843a3e39114e9deb7b317d0 <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
_:a468af3aa83bff2c3843522ebe82c7db <http://schema.org/value> "Plymouth Marine Laboratory" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5ec0c7cb9205f9930af8f967704d1340a399377a> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 68 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically the Gt.Meteor Table Mount,Moroccan,Portuguese,Spanish,Amorican shelf during March and April of 1992. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory." .
_:e647a469a6c7f6615a451b07d08659f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
