<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5e98028657122e6ac84c3c2be4849f0a0c56f643> <http://schema.org/description> "Cathie Associates were commissioned by NaREC to undertake the premliminary geotechnical report prior to construction.The objectives of the preliminary geotechnical investigation were to: investigate the distribution, thickness and geotechnical properties of the superficial Holocene and Quaternary deposits; investigate the distribution, thickness and geotechnical properties of the solid geology. The surveys took place in November 2010, and the laboratory analysis occured in December 2010 to January 2011." .
