<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5df5d3d17d6d2c6d618900e1f06dc97cf175541d> <http://schema.org/description> "Provides information on the baseline environment in the Enlli and Bardsey Sound area including available data and evidence on environmental, social and economic factors of relevance to the Enlli Tidal Project EIA. Considers the possible environmental and socio-economic effects of a tidal energy project at this location. See Annex I for list of PES chapters.\r\n Available for use in any future tidal energy projects in Bardsey Sound. Information is likely to be relevant to environmental assessments of any marine project in the area but would need updating and should not be considered a replacement for the need for a project-specific scoping report. Wider potential environmental interest and application for the area generally. The Enlli Tidal Project Summary Report is provided in both English and Welsh." .
_:ab07ccb3d18a2abf58e6f2d64ff81e3d <http://schema.org/value> "Enlli Tidal Project EIA" .
_:ab07ccb3d18a2abf58e6f2d64ff81e3d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
