_:ad15c87f810f00198c1288aabc9e12ed <http://schema.org/value> "Department of Trade and Industry" .
_:af4be5b492d705b2b72c95f5113da79f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
