<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5d514873d0df57385c3d13e38a3a462be82a6ffe> <http://schema.org/description> "Eastern IFCA (and its predeccesor, ESFJC) have conducted stock assessment surveys of cockle (Cerastoderma edule) every two years from 2001-2009 (excluding 2005), and then annually since 2009 along both the River Stour and River Orwell, Suffolk. The aim of the surveys has been to undertake a stock assessment of the cockles to identify any potential commerical stocks." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5d514873d0df57385c3d13e38a3a462be82a6ffe> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
