<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5d236b3270aec99cd8685051b4c3d81c0857bef6> <http://schema.org/description> "This report provides detailed information about the Lizard Point site and evaluates its interest features according to the Habitats Directive selection criteria and guiding principles. This assessment has been made following a thorough analysis of existing information combined with newly acquired field survey data. The dataset includes multiple forms of biotope analysis, species lists and abundance, digital stills of habitats, Multibeam bathymetry, GIS mapping showing biodiversity and abundance of various species and acoustic surveys." .
