<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5cffc8ae087c54114e70d9374dc9e12fa79e4e79> <http://schema.org/description> "The survey was carried out in an area approx. 15km to the east of Harwich. 72 Hammon grab (0.2m2) samples from 24 stations were collected in total - at 12 stations a single grab was taken and at the other 12 stations 5 grabs were taken. 200 taxa in 12 phyla were identified, (85% to species level). Survey was carried out by Unicomarine Ltd for Oakwood Environmental Consultants" .
_:f4a1d3196851f346543df4e1c58ba354 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
