_:bfa5920f7ceb250f92777ba4e2a4f0cc <http://schema.org/value> "acidity" .
_:bfa5920f7ceb250f92777ba4e2a4f0cc <http://schema.org/value> "temperature" .
_:bfa5920f7ceb250f92777ba4e2a4f0cc <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5ce429f54dd0fee035257233bf4772765ed05f86> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5cdd3417dbf83263c32262dc9a31ca95758238eb> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e291ea8b0a2a8adbf706f685169118db .
_:b0ec7e190ba18697ae50116f6953276d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e291ea8b0a2a8adbf706f685169118db <http://schema.org/value> "fish traps" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5cdd3417dbf83263c32262dc9a31ca95758238eb> <http://schema.org/description> "This feature class contains interview data that has been summarised onto a grid of 3/4 of a nautical mile longitude and 3/8 of a nautical mile latitude. \r\n One condition of the research was that only those interviewees who explicitly gave permission for their data to be shared would have their own mapping represented in the final product shared with third parties. All other individuals have had their data removed from this feature class. Of 984 interviews, 594 gave their permission for their data to be shared.\r\n This summary data set represents the activities of all interviewees, the summarisation process is considered to anonymised the data to a sufficient degree to protect the individual's privacy. As an added measure of protection, data from interviews has been included in this summary table only if the following conditions have been met. \r\n 1) Permission has been granted for the individual data to be used, or\r\n 2) Five or more separate interviews are represented within a single record.\r\n This data represents the activities of vessels under 15 metres in length using pots and traps. This includes: inkwell, parlour, whelk and unpsecified pots. it also includes cuttlefish and fish traps. This data is presented as a series of monthly totals of vessel numbers per grid cell." .
_:e291ea8b0a2a8adbf706f685169118db <http://schema.org/value> "cuttlefish" .
_:b0ec7e190ba18697ae50116f6953276d <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
