<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5bf663c017740f9be60b9a33c44ae9e8877ebeca> <http://schema.org/description> "RPS was commissioned by the Institute of Estuarine and Coastal Studies (IECS) to conduct a\r\nsurvey for marine mammals off the Holderness coast for the proposed Humber Gateway\r\noffshore wind farm and to report on the results. Data from aerial and vessel-based bird\r\nsurveys were also supplied, analysed and discussed." .
