<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5bdeb0278503f93ea05c30dd9917b9717393113a> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1405, St Catherine’s Deep. FY 2012/13. Area in SqKm: Unknown. Contractor: Netsurvey." .
