<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5bd8c9c962314fb01499b66713a0be1fb1f2209d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5bd8c9c962314fb01499b66713a0be1fb1f2209d> <http://schema.org/description> "An oil and gas industry site survey for a platform/pipeline route acquired under licence P335 between May and June 2011. The block number traversed was 9/11. This was a shallow drilling survey without any seismic sources. It drilled 8 shallow boreholes to maximum depth of 102m below the seafloor for a planned jacket location. All borings were within a 209m radius of the planned wellbay centre. No borings were drilled for anchor locations. 11 samples of the seabed surface were taken along a planned pipeline route." .
_:e85d35b8537ba75da6cd9901a1a41575 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e85d35b8537ba75da6cd9901a1a41575 <http://schema.org/value> "wellbay centre" .
