_:ef96e9df209f48d76571e8346887669 <http://schema.org/value> "Marine Environmental Data and Information Network" .
_:ef96e9df209f48d76571e8346887669 <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5b69c0adf0aaca969c3461235b121c4f7e5d4a74> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:a0f6a8c3d6708b3a4304492faccb8e4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
