_:ef68d09ba6b8e38283268f948d3c0c59 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:ef68d09ba6b8e38283268f948d3c0c59 <http://schema.org/value> "ABP Marine Environmental Research Ltd" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5b12b7fb192ac9b84fac1f5ccb0c5d35605a9290> <http://schema.org/description> "Monitoring the effects before and after scallop dredging in Lyme Bay. Conducted through dive and video surveys. Includes 2000/04/26 and 2000/04/27 Before Survey, 2000/04/28 Video 2, before and after survey Lyme Bay Reefs Project, 2000/04/28 WBRP Before and After; After Dredging, 2001/01/01 Free, 2001-2004 DWT LBR Monitoring Data, 2006/08/07 Lyme Bay Impacts of Scallop Dredging surveys. Also includes electronic data from Lyme bay survey in the format of PDF, Word, Excel, photographs and GIS containing before and after surveys, monitoring surveys and refuges." .
