<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5a9174950fbd97d3e286daeba4a44c5077d226cf> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sarsia Cruise in july 1967 along the north coast of Spain and west south west coast of France. Samples were collected using a number of methods including epibenthic sled, anchor dredge and 4ft rectangular dredge. Records supplied by Dr. Eve southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
