<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:596ed7323bc721ba8f12a196d1a05bdea3732188> <http://schema.org/description> "In February 2007, Ormonde Energy Limited (OEL), a wholly owned subsidiary of Vattenfall UK plc, was granted consent from the Secretary of State to develop the Ormonde offshore wind farm project (Ormonde OWF). The Ormonde OWF is located approximately 10 kilometres west of the nearest coastline at Walney Island, Barrow-in-Furness, Cumbria in approximately 20 metres of water.\r\nThis document represents the 2012 post-construction monitoring report for the Ormonde project (i.e. the first year of a 3 year post-construction monitoring programme)." .
