<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5899b4c2736465eeeb1fe5e9f62d404f3112234d> <http://schema.org/description> "This sampling survey has been carried out by British Geological Survey (BGS) for BGS, the survey took place in April to May1973 in the North Sea (Marr Bank and Tay-Forth map sheet areas on board the MV Whitethorn. The purpose was to collect data as part of UK continental shelf survey programme. Sample data were collected using gravity corer; borehole drilling; Vibrocorer; Dredge; Shipek Grab and photography. These data are archived by BGS. No BGS survey report currently available." .
_:ac451adde87401a3d14226dd203d241a <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
