<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:588e9ed0b543613de10fc025eb0c0a3de60989b6> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1325; Flat Holm to Middle Grounds, Area in SqKm: 82, (08/03/2011 to 08/04/2011), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2010/11. Contractor: MMT." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:588e9ed0b543613de10fc025eb0c0a3de60989b6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
