_:bbca7251631df522d6b4ab9de36310b5 <http://schema.org/value> "Centre for Marine and Coastal Studies" .
_:d3d1644af844b478d69b7b2c46851e71 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a5bb51f7312106f1b7e80d08ec3c2a5 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:57c13069d6522b6afb2c4ffdb5f0871038ae52db> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a5bb51f7312106f1b7e80d08ec3c2a5 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:57c13069d6522b6afb2c4ffdb5f0871038ae52db> <http://schema.org/description> "A Natural England commissioned intertidal survey conducted by the Centre for Marine and Coastal Studies (CMACS). The aim of the survey was to provide a baseline dataset for future management and condition monitoring of the intertidal interest features in the Dee Estuary. Phase I Biotope Mapping including sediment cores for fauna and Particle Size Analysis." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:57c13069d6522b6afb2c4ffdb5f0871038ae52db> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bbca7251631df522d6b4ab9de36310b5 .
