<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5768d666079d432ed5bb6e731087f01aff8b8b8e> <http://schema.org/description> "These reports concluded that the site was at risk from explosive ordnance, resulting from the proximity to sea mines and aerial bombing. Magnetometer and side scan sonar surveys were carried out as well as a desk based research study.\r\nThis metadata file has been created by The Crown Estate for the purpose of publishing the dataset onto the Marine Data Exchange." .
