<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5711f63a33171b58067a8d8ee8312a431bd1859e> <http://schema.org/description> "After completion of the depth of burial survey of the Lincs Array Cables project, and the Export Cable\r\nsurvey, EGS (International) Ltd, on behalf of Centrica, undertook a Side-Scan Sonar (SSS) and\r\nMultibeam (MBES) clearance survey of the no cable zones (500m by 500m) around WTGs LS28 (on the\r\nLincs site) and ID24 (on the Inner Dowsing Site). The areas surveyed were identified by Centrica for\r\nthe upcoming works on the aforementioned turbines and the need to get a jack up vessel in the locality\r\nto complete the works. This report details the operations and results of the survey around LS28." .
_:d0fc65c36a9c5055bbde90a9e4b80129 <http://schema.org/value> "Lincs Array Cables project" .
_:b79d4f24d678a9d53baf7ac478ea6d14 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
