<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:570835c246a223021ceeeae91b95f7ceb62c1d0d> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1161; Cockle Shoal, Area in SqKm: 4, (04/06/2006 to 21/06/2006), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2006/07. Contractor: MMT." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:570835c246a223021ceeeae91b95f7ceb62c1d0d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f1a3a5d2db117bd60e5268db3a3486dc .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:570835c246a223021ceeeae91b95f7ceb62c1d0d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c41e17c79e0412b5ec0895a2519ac6e .
