<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:56be1bd00414b7f4c4221139f1acd804a725d563> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1496; Folkestone to Goodwin Sands, Area in SqKm: 126, (30/07/2016 to 13/09/2016), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Shallow. FY 2016/17. Contractor: Gardline." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:56be1bd00414b7f4c4221139f1acd804a725d563> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
