_:c01f43db6abfc6e24c79dd0c1ec1aa34 <http://schema.org/value> "CPT" .
_:bee22ebfade77eb5faed4069e9c5eb80 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:56b324417b2e05a83109547301e87d60fd75fbfd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:bee22ebfade77eb5faed4069e9c5eb80 <http://schema.org/value> "GEO" .
_:c01f43db6abfc6e24c79dd0c1ec1aa34 <http://schema.org/value> "Vibrocore sampling" .
_:c01f43db6abfc6e24c79dd0c1ec1aa34 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:56b324417b2e05a83109547301e87d60fd75fbfd> <http://schema.org/description> "DONG Energy has contracted GEO (Danish Geotechnical Institute) to conduct a geotechnical\r\nsite investigation at the planned location for a substation, at the turbine area and at\r\nthe export cable route for the Burbo Bank OWF. The investigations included CPT and\r\nVibrocore sampling with GEO’s seabed rig GEOceptor.\r\nIn total 32 seabed CPTs and 29 Vibrocores to a maximum 8 m below seabed were carried\r\nout." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:56b324417b2e05a83109547301e87d60fd75fbfd> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:bee22ebfade77eb5faed4069e9c5eb80 .
