<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:568b6cc3c4b784c94f083ca5af33ca9bc8f92efc> <http://schema.org/description> "This NERC marine sampling survey took place in April 1995 in the North East Atlantic Ocean on board the RRS Charles Darwin. The purpose was to identify suitable sites on the LOIS northern mooring line for benthic process studies and carry out the first set of process measurements in the LOIS study at these sites. BGS collected three box core samples. Survey details contained in Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory Cruise report 92/95." .
_:d72f2018d78f57f93abf69fdf0c0c3b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:567f8a405aff9e25de3e51d2aca75579fe8c1b78> <http://schema.org/description> "AWAC wave buoy devices were deployed at both Docking Shoal and Race Bank Offshore Wind Farms (both Centrica Energy at the time of deployment). This Package contains the data collected from the Race Bank AWAC buoy. All associated reports can be found in the series reports." .
_:e271972e406088c66392b6340af2e3e3 <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica Energy" .
