<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:56657298565fbcd2e05ce46f9006f6d9111f058e> <http://schema.org/description> "An oil and gas industry site survey for a pipeline/cable route (Helvellyn to Rough, Helvellyn to A2D) acquired between November and December 2001. The block numbers traversed were 47/10, 47/13, 47/14, 47/15, 47/8 and 47/9." .
