<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:565e5f6a6fb3235e809d00b4f43ee3703e7a7ab7> <http://schema.org/description> "Four 0.01m2 cores were taken at each site. The survey was carried out in November 1991 by the NRA South West Region. Samples were also taken for particle size analysis and organic carbon/nitrogen analysis. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:565e5f6a6fb3235e809d00b4f43ee3703e7a7ab7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:dd24162c42918849726ca41c6ec0f9a2 .
