<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:559adb38fc7259d7cbce9103f82858a6ae3b9605> <http://schema.org/description> "Osiris Projects were commissioned in April 2012 by RWE npower renewables and\r\nSenergy Survey and GeoEngineering to carry out a geophysical and geotechnical\r\ncable route survey along the proposed Triton Knoll Export cable route. The proposed\r\nTriton Knoll Offshore Wind Farm is located in the Greater Wash Strategic\r\nEnvironmental Assessment (SEA) area, approximately 18nm from the Lincolnshire\r\ncoast and 25nm from the Norfolk coast." .
