<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:552ace9bdc33ee0b48152657b6c6a04497b7d23e> <http://schema.org/description> "RPS carried out a basking shark survey in 2012, collecting details of behaviour, size band, aggregation numbers, distance and heading. Details are also recorded for other species such as harbour porpoise and detailed weather logs are maintained. Although no report was completed for this study, this series contains .xls, JPEG, tect and GPX files." .
