<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:55140f5b19f5b86dac4052b0dcdedd302e463b5f> <http://schema.org/description> "Before and after dredging comparison surveys and drop video surveys of Lyme Bay. Includes Colin Munro dredged/undredged, 2002/01/01 Colin Munro dredged/undredged, 2004/01/01 Colin Munro En Drop Video, 2004/01/01 Lyme Bay Drop Video Survey Colin Munro, and 2006/06/16 Colin Munro dredged and undredged surveys. Only open larger, DVD Movie files to play video." .
