_:dabb6283a124c4643c006277ad1a9edc <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:aab0b8040609195a2e8278ae3a0162a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:54e455a2e82f9c2fc89582e19ecfa8e955a6690b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:aab0b8040609195a2e8278ae3a0162a .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:54d8e35c7dc56705bbd043e9ea02b352dab1bec9> <http://schema.org/description> "A 30 turbine windfarm is to be constructed on a marine site on the Kentish Flats near\r\nWhitstable. The construction will involve piling monopiles for the pylon bases and\r\nthe laying of interconnecting cables between the pylon bases using a plough.\r\nAdditionally the export cables will be emplaced from the windfarm to the foreshore\r\nusing a plough for a distance of some 7 km. \r\n\r\nThe site of the windfarm has a history of unexploded ordnance finds resulting from\r\nwartime activity in the area. The last significant incident, the discovery of a WWII\r\nGerman “G” mine occurred earlier this year. A threat assessment was carried out as\r\na result of which risk mitigation measures were identified as being necessary to\r\nreduce the risk posed by unexploded ordnance.\r\n\r\nInitial magnetometry and side scan sonar survey was conducted over the area but the\r\nquality and detail was not adequate to plan for and execute a risk mitigation\r\noperation to provide the required clearance certification." .
_:c108064ab174a55339a621fccd7016e0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a3aa5c4509cee6a3053fdbc5ab63d70f <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
