<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5395e34741d9e221d64d736bc1090ae00dae76ce> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 125 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September - October 1999 in the North East Atlantic Ocean between Iceland and Scotland A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Southampton Oceanography Centre." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5395e34741d9e221d64d736bc1090ae00dae76ce> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
