<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:52cf8ef04a3483297410ce1b4979c51a31155743> <http://schema.org/description> "Preliminary report detailing outline biotope and habitat mapping for the survey area, including a detailed benthic grab survey, a seabed photographic survey at selected sites in the windfarm area and an assessment of seabed resources along the two considered cable routes including intertidal sediments of Pegwell Bay." .
_:bffc0a102634c3d3f07504c2d2d36fe7 <http://schema.org/value> "Southampton Oceanography Centre" .
_:bffc0a102634c3d3f07504c2d2d36fe7 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:52c8def3c6f28a6965a2e93577517fb51ab3bd99> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 12 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during 26 February to 16 March 2004 from a few stations at approximately 24.5N, 55.93W to a transect across the Florida Strait. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Southampton Oceanography Centre as part of the Rapid Climate Change programme." .
