<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:5234b37327fdcbfb82fa85a3e0addd59d376c555> <http://schema.org/description> "In 2003 as part of the Joint Nature Conservation Committee (JNCC) Irish Sea Pilot (ISP) project areas of seabed were surveyed to fill gaps in ecological data that the ISP project had managed to gather from desk studies\r\n This dataset is of Marine benthic species abundance data from surveys conducted to the northwest and west of Anglesey" .
