<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:51b34eed85d2b2896a40a4816a5eafba8ff2bb1b> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during August - September 1975. It incorporates casts performed within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, inclunding three stations of the Ellett Line east of the Anton Dohrn Seamount, the Rockall-Malin Head and the Rosemary Bank-St Kilda sections. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
