<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:50c8335001d2e1e57c70b9dc06ffa57f9754d686> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:50c8335001d2e1e57c70b9dc06ffa57f9754d686> <http://schema.org/description> "SEtech Ltd have been appointed by MCT to undertake a geotechnical desk study principally to identify the likely geology within the proposed tidal array area and to identify any geological or geotechnical risks associated with the anticipated rocks and soils\r\n\r\nA geological and geotechnical assessment of the proposed site was undertaken using all available published data, websources and information from SEtech’s in-house database. The aim of the desk study is to assist in the selection of suitable turbine locations." .
