_:e30c2779816aa560a8e5ba669e8ffaaa <http://schema.org/value> "BGS" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:504d6cd5083610bee607af3c4e47968013035015> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) marine sampling survey took place in August 1972 in the Moray Firth on board a zodiac. The purpose was to obtain data for regional geology mapping. Sea-bed samples were collected by divers. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in report ?????." .
