<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:504a06ea93c2f5b9745187d03fccc1021133ae36> <http://schema.org/description> "Fugro Alluvial Offshore Limited has performed a geotechnical investigation for Ormonde Energy Limited, to assist in the design of the foundations for wind turbines and associated seabed structures." .
