<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:500bd5f8024b6ed996291bb7f1e03ce5afbaa92b> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during January 1982. It incorporates profiles on four of the ten radiocaesium sampling stations across the Scottish shelf to the Sound of Mull. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
