<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4fc816384083c2ca532157f1d645ec3a6f2e44a1> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1368; Wallet Spitway (Additional area), Area in SqKm: 6; TE6A Black Deep Focused Area 2, Area in SqKm: 3; Dover DWR C1, Area in SqKm: 6; TE3A Sunk Focused, Area in SqKm: 5; TE6A Black Deep Focused Area 1, Area in SqKm: 1; TEE5A Sunk DWR Focused Area, Area in SqKm: -4; TE5A Trinity and Long Sand Head, Area in SqKm: 6; TE3A Sunk Focused, Area in SqKm: 5, (01/07/2011 to 04/08/2011), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: RRS. FY 2011/12. Contractor: MMT/NetSurvey." .
_:c393e567274bff9799f70058cb076782 <http://schema.org/value> "otter and beam trawl surveys" .
_:c270e33e2a7068b30dae8ab0f63bc443 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4fbb7fc73486b83fd6181ce449b0b3a7058f8e90> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4fbb7fc73486b83fd6181ce449b0b3a7058f8e90> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c270e33e2a7068b30dae8ab0f63bc443 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4fbb7fc73486b83fd6181ce449b0b3a7058f8e90> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the environmental monitoring programme outlined within FEPA licences 31792/10/1 and 31814/10/2 for the Lynn and Inner Dowsing (LID) wind farms respectively, both valid from the 10th October 2010 until the 31st October 2013, Brown &amp; May Marine Ltd. was commissioned by Centrica Energy to undertake post-construction fisheries surveys within the LID wind farms.\r\n\r\nThis report details the findings of the 13th to 16th in a series of otter and beam trawl surveys to be undertaken in the area relevant to the operational LID wind farms. The survey is the Year 3 post construction survey which span across 2011 and 2012." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4fbb7fc73486b83fd6181ce449b0b3a7058f8e90> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c393e567274bff9799f70058cb076782 .
