<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4f3af71de4b58f56831f38bc0090e46580219760> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the foundation scour assessment surveys undertaken at the Sheringham Shoal Offshore Wind Farm. The assessment is based on two turbine foundation structures: 7.5m diameter monopiles and a gravity base foundation comprising a large diameter octagonal base supporting a 6m diameter central cylinder." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4f3af71de4b58f56831f38bc0090e46580219760> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
