<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4f2573394998fc90a9fb0b011d92d540fafc0285> <http://schema.org/description> "Blyth Offshore Demonstrator Ltd (BODL) has developed an offshore wind demonstration site off the Northumberland Coast close to the Port of Blyth. The Blyth Offshore Demonstration project (the “Project”) was subject to an Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) as reported in an Environmental Statement (ES) (NaREC, 2012).\r\nSubsequently the Project received a Marine Licence (L/2013/00303 as amended) from the Marine Management Organisation (MMO) to develop and operate the demonstration site subject to satisfying a number of conditions within the Licence.\r\nThe Project will be comprised of a maximum of 15 wind turbine generators, to be constructed across three arrays (Arrays 2, 3a and 4), on an array-by-array along with three associated export cables, resulting in a maximum of three construction phases. Array 1 was removed from the scheme ahead of consent application.\r\nBODL has currently progressed with Array 2, the closest inshore array.\r\nThe report in this series has been produced in order to provide BODL with a post-construction comparison to baseline (EIA) and pre-construction characterisation of the fish and shellfish populations present in and around the Project. This report presents the findings of the otter trawl, set nets and potting surveys, which were undertaken by Natural Power Consultants Ltd." .
_:abc16ba0dc4dd078e2db6c703d6b5f7b <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
_:abc16ba0dc4dd078e2db6c703d6b5f7b <http://schema.org/value> "Blyth Offshore Demonstration project" .
