<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4f047358d6fcbcff5c5d528cbf6c8e8af50557da> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 13 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in February 1989 from stations covering the southern North Sea (south of 56N). A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Plymouth Institute of Marine Studies as part of the North Sea Project Sandwaves/Sandbanks Process Study." .
_:a0374df49581f0041bce5de527a25521 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
