_:b6544ad0d8494cc5cbdccb596fe82627 <http://schema.org/value> "Bathymetric Survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4e32eac36ccb7bf71ecbea23bb69364b8e5b0e6c> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1174; Sledway to Blakeney Overfalls, Area in SqKm: 71, (22/07/2006 to 19/08/2006), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2006/07. Contractor: MMT." .
_:b67202f1350fdbee7d9170723edcd892 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
