<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4dc6536c730fb5a7e33a780b28ea848de7995595> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 16 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel area specifically the NW Irish Sea and Bristol Channel, during April of 1996. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
