<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4d8bf293b76fc99442eccf701f52ce2dd65ea3b6> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e25fbb0b47414b90f9b88f582d471234 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4d8bf293b76fc99442eccf701f52ce2dd65ea3b6> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ad68c94fd8359d33ad9d48ebf89ed2d9 .
