_:caa9af9863832175c1755fe85cf7fb5c <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:a619c73084392dd150336985c6ff80e7 <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4cdd2cda1b2cdca3d7f205cf9b4ef6ba184cdcd7> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 94 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in February 2009 from 2 sites over 25 hour tidal cycles, in Welsh and Hilbre Channels. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory Dee Experiment." .
