<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4be08cd98f5f96bc58feb2b7ff8f07bb9623753f> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS (International) Ltd (EGSi) carried out a survey for Blyth Offshore Demonstrator Ltd (BODL), offshore Blyth, northeast England. The objectives of the geophysical survey were to acquire bathymetry data over the Array 2 dredge dump area and bathymetry and side scan sonar within a 250m radius around the proposed WTG locations." .
