<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4ba12d4b3326425be2838a0600534622ae2e3c33> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c1d4386fb4e40078b22adb10dfbf34d7 .
_:c1d4386fb4e40078b22adb10dfbf34d7 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4ba12d4b3326425be2838a0600534622ae2e3c33> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) marine sampling survey took place in September/October 1989 on board the Whitethorn and Bucentaur drilling vessels. It was part of a joint project between various European Geological Surveys to study aspects of the Quaternary Strata of the Sourthern North Sea, funded by the EEC under their Stimulation Progreamme. Boreholes were drilled using a wireline coring system. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS internal report WB/89/40." .
_:f89da770cfa2a7f95b6bdc2d40c8e47 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c1d4386fb4e40078b22adb10dfbf34d7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4b9c697007177f26f2d2881fa021087afdf901fb> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d50f07eb7c014c9b8ea3fb0d7ccace9d .
_:d50f07eb7c014c9b8ea3fb0d7ccace9d <http://schema.org/value> "Greater Wash area" .
_:d50f07eb7c014c9b8ea3fb0d7ccace9d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:d50f07eb7c014c9b8ea3fb0d7ccace9d <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4b9c697007177f26f2d2881fa021087afdf901fb> <http://schema.org/description> "This study was commissioned to examine the feasibility of deploying a new radar in the Greater Wash area to provide extra observations around and above offshore windfarms. The new radar would \"in-fill\" regions of air space where surveillance coverage is predicted to be lost due to interference caused by offshore wind turbines. The proposed solutions differ in terms of technology employed, the level of detail provided, and product maturity; some companies also provided more than one possible solution. Where possible the results of radar trials involving real equipment observing real aircraft above windfarms were sought and factored into the report's conclusions and recommendations." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4b9c697007177f26f2d2881fa021087afdf901fb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4b94e76a548da3dfe7c6e67904afbb41ad1365cc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ef71e29fe076fd1347b50d32c37e7ef9 <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica Renewable Energy Limited" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4b94e76a548da3dfe7c6e67904afbb41ad1365cc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c89b3a74ae751feb988187edca13871f .
