<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4b7a6b95d815e9299cd7448f51b8ff3789f3f7b9> <http://schema.org/description> "A comprehensive record of recreational dives off Dorset since the mid 1970s. A paper log of each dive records the location; conditions; photos taken and sightings/items of interest. In addition, the paper records are supported by an extensive collection of slides which are labelled with species name, site and date all held by the recorder." .
