_:ad227f3000f6236c476f71912a3ad694 <http://schema.org/value> "DEFRA" .
_:ad227f3000f6236c476f71912a3ad694 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:ad227f3000f6236c476f71912a3ad694 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4b61c5c79aa20ed93acdbbdabec275653ef0ff7f> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the effectiveness of a jetting system on the burial and trenching of cable at the site of the Barrow Offshore wind Farm. The amount of sediment agitated into suspension by the jetting process, had to be monitored to provide DEFRA with information in order to assess the environmental impact of this method of trenching. \r\n\r\nThe results of the survey show that the increase in sediment loading is relatively localised and that any detectable levels remain within 1 to 2 metres of the seabed." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4b61c5c79aa20ed93acdbbdabec275653ef0ff7f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:a2e06d33fdab9c7c1599c3b1f42783ca <http://schema.org/name> "marine species" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4b598883a2cc8f7da4ee8ea2366b0e1fa2b4f1e6> <http://schema.org/description> "This layer shows the distribution of the Couch's Goby, Gobius couchi, a Wildlife and Countryside Act Species. \r\n This layer forms one of a set of data layers created for the Defra MB0102 contract. This work will support the delivery of a network of Marine Protected Areas as required to meet existing international and national obligations and commitments, including Marine Conservation Zones (MCZs), a new measure to be delivered as part of the Marine and Coastal Access Bill, and equivalent measures under Scottish legislation. The availability of these data layers will also be of importance in underpinning Marine Planning (e.g. licensing) in our marine area." .
_:d384770c8566333908379415896ede4d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
