<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4a9e63e84436a17ea3cb4fbdede3f7ab78271263> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 51 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June - July 1998 from stations at La Chapelle Bank in the Bay of Biscay and off the coast of Vigo, Spain. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Liège Department of Astrophysics Geophysics and Oceanography as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
