_:c56ee02ce3d155558ee98af7cf121ac7 <http://schema.org/value> "species abundances" .
_:f0db57e9dc6fa56b349ff497eb507bee <http://schema.org/value> "Aquatic Surveys and Monitoring Ltd." .
_:ed5b417ac407fdd629b15c61848485a3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:d07a2bc0efcccf9678c592c094a32df2 <http://schema.org/name> "marine biodiversity" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4a75f5cb875f2b814bd671f5134832b27e86eef2> <http://schema.org/description> "A report presenting the findings of a series of sublittoral surveys carried out within the Berwickshire and North Northumberland Coast cSAC. The surveys were conducted during the summers of 2002 and 2003 by Aquatic Surveys and Monitoring Ltd. on behalf of English Nature (EN).\r\nThe purpose of the surveys was to use a standard method (that was repeatable) to gather data to assess the conservation status of the site. By using repeatable methods it allowed for future sampling of the site and the possibilty of comparing the data with that gathered in the future.\r\nThe data includes biotope diversity and distribution along with characteristic species, comparison between transects and species abundances (gathered using quadrats)." .
_:c56ee02ce3d155558ee98af7cf121ac7 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
_:c56ee02ce3d155558ee98af7cf121ac7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:db8e43a63c90cb469e45a5bee927451c <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
