<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4a47f7d39ce275fd506ced1d670bff0b1255196f> <http://schema.org/description> "Consultancy report collating records of flora and fauna for the pool of Bryher, Isles of Scilly into a taxonomic list. Species presence data digitised as part of the Scillies ATBI project." .
