_:e4f37b879854aaaa1541d5d4ccfcc5ba <http://schema.org/value> "Eastern Engish Channel" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4a467c1df38a3218eadad41a9f753889e64f1ae4> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examined the historic impacts of dredging with specific study areas at the Eastern Engish Channel and the North Sea." .
