_:da1b2157ad3e7cc86b387f50581e198b <http://schema.org/value> "National Oceanography Centre" .
_:b5439703873c8b687bfce16b25f5c7e9 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4a30322cab391ef6a772198d248bae22778bb2f9> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b5439703873c8b687bfce16b25f5c7e9 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4a30322cab391ef6a772198d248bae22778bb2f9> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 37 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in June 2007 throughout Liverpool Bay. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the National Oceanography Centre (formerly the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory), Liverpool Bay/Irish Sea Coastal Observatory initiative." .
_:da1b2157ad3e7cc86b387f50581e198b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:cef85c671b8ae8254143e0e7ff645e1a <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
