<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4a0a4fecedc370d51cafc685ab2f4ead9d54a6b3> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 610 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlanic Ocean area specifically between Hatton Ridge and the Ymir Ridge, during August and September of 1978. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute for Marine Science, Kiel as part of the Joint Air-Sea Interaction (JASIN) project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4a0a4fecedc370d51cafc685ab2f4ead9d54a6b3> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cd0adf39bb1ffe570d044eb126e195a .
