<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:49cf77d3d34c4a381da3f4b945773ccfa188639b> <http://schema.org/description> "The shapefile contains polygons that indicate the location of crustaceans based on available data and from fishermen's knowledge. The attribute table contains infromation that indicates gear types, seasonality, months present, importance, spawning areas and other comments relating to the location." .
_:a63683b2e09874e493e8331c831fb695 <http://schema.org/name> "undescribed biodiversity" .
