<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:498014c53f2a5420fc7f1db9b21fa6ff675b371c> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June - July 1981. It incorporates a CTD survey in the Irish Sea and includes only temperature profiles due to a conductivity sensor malfunction. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Wales, Bangor School of Ocean Sciences." .
