<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:493f28a6068a7509392da0593eda2bbd33f094aa> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:493f28a6068a7509392da0593eda2bbd33f094aa> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ea6f8655f0c5ed247559e96c8ec713d2 .
