<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:490f9a6074a6a9747ff96e504335cf50c7fc2b56> <http://schema.org/description> "Echinus esculentus records from Isle of Man. This data is a subset of a more extensive survey of benthic fauna carried out in order to investigate the possibilities of comparing biomass of bottom fauna at different localities with the same grade of deposit. It was also carried out to provide basic data for investigation into bottom fauna biomass at a single locality over a period of years. This survey was collated by MarLIN as part of a contract to find information on the distribution of species and habitats in the Irish Sea as part of the Irish Sea Pilot project." .
