<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:48ce4b37e5a06afd8b7ea02068f9f6945b6ebcfe> <http://schema.org/description> "This report has been produced by Natural Resources Wales (NRW) marine ecosystems and physical processes specialists to help inform potential siting of cabling infrastructure associated with offshore wind farm developments in Wales within Offshore Wind Leasing Round 4. The document contains a high-level overview of some of the key considerations needed for marine ecosystem receptors in Wales. For any associated information and/or data please visit http://lle.gov.wales" .
