<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:489478b069fa8b652ce303a6d22d4dd56fc33420> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1109; Cockle Gateway &amp; Cockle Shoal, Area in SqKm: 44, (16/05/2005 to 21/05/2005), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2005/06). FY 2005/06. Contractor: RN (NP1016)." .
