<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:479c72b3c4ae4654f3e58504a6a1d7355c1c2010> <http://schema.org/description> "This Environmental Management Plan (EMP) is prepared to form part of the Project execution plan for the Barrow offshore wind farm project. The EMP covers different topics such as climate and air quality, archaeology, noise and vibration, traffic and shipping, ecological assessments, water quality and waste management." .
