<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:479a28bf7013d54c311dc8c141f72b0bf0f360b1> <http://schema.org/description> "HiDef Aerial Survey Ltd. was contracted by Celtic Array to carry out a series of digital video aerial surveys of marine mammals, sharks and birds in the Irish Sea Zone over the duration of April 2012 to March 2013 on a monthly basis. Special emphasis was placed on survey with the North East Potential Development Area and the Rhiannon Wind Farm. Information from this aerial survey will be used to inform the Rhiannon Wind Farm Environmental Statement and, if required for the other Potential Development Areas Environmental Statements.\r\n\r\nResults of the survey has been documented and written in the reports: \r\nIrish Sea Zone, Rhiannon Wind Farm and NE Potential Development Area : Interim report on aerial surveys for April to August 2012, Corresponding Centrica Document No : R3-D-EN-013-0006-501028-002 \r\n\r\nIrish Sea Zone, Rhiannon Wind Farm and NE Potential Development Area: Final report on aerial surveys from April 2012 to March 2013, Corresponding Centrica Document No: SE-D-EV-013-0008-000000-003 \r\n\r\nAnd \r\n\r\n Irish Sea Zone, Rhiannon Wind Farm and North East Potential Development Area: Final report on supplementary aerial surveys from June 2013 to July 2013 , Corresponding Centrica Document No: SE-D-EV-013-0008-000000-004 \r\n\r\nAvailable Datasets : 1. ArcGIS files (mpk, . shapefiles), 2. Drawings (pdf, jpeg), \t3. Reports (.doc, .xls, .txt, csv)," .
