<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:47674e0a1e23bc81c92e5c2b47daf50d329b3c86> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ec6b1d17dc0bf1ec02919c74cad1eaed .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:47674e0a1e23bc81c92e5c2b47daf50d329b3c86> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c8ea225395ae2828a4cc0d7f16d8471 .
