_:afa3e99028ac70fd1f2e3282f01199a <http://schema.org/value> "General Bathymetric Chart of the Oceans" .
_:afa3e99028ac70fd1f2e3282f01199a <http://schema.org/value> "US Geological Survey" .
_:afa3e99028ac70fd1f2e3282f01199a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:46f9f7fcd48fa546dd8b9b7b713bf6fe05eaccb0> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral and sublittoral monitoring surveys of Lundy. Looking at the changes in communities and habitat because of the protection of a voluntary marine reserve. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Includes 1980 OPRU Lundy littoral rock and caves survey, 1984 OPRU Lundy littoral survey and monitoring, 1984 OPRU Lundy sublittoral monitoring, 1985 OPRU Lundy monitoring, 1986 OPRU Lundy monitoring, 1987 OPRU Lundy monitoring." .
_:c5eebeab4ef14a91c4b616f552ef3001 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
