<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:46e08b1fe0b152ccfcf87567e9b55ed703e2585c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:46e08b1fe0b152ccfcf87567e9b55ed703e2585c> <http://schema.org/description> "DONG Energy contracted EGS (International) Ltd to undertake a bathymetric survey in the\r\npost-construction (operational) phase of the project using both Multibeam Echo Sounder\r\n(MBES) and Side Scan Sonar (SSS) survey techniques. The primary objective of the survey\r\nwas to assess the stability of the scour protection around the turbine foundations.\r\nTo meet the requirements of the survey, survey lines were run at a distance of 25 metres\r\neither side of a centreline which connected the turbine locations." .
_:adaeee0f0ae839a02dcffb36ce0b0a7b <http://schema.org/value> "EGS (International) Ltd" .
