<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:46945ff2371273ce63b13148e15a05c6538542a5> <http://schema.org/description> "This geophysical and sampling survey has been carried out by British Geological Survey (BGS) for BGS, the survey took place in June to August 1973 in the Lundy map sheet area on board the MV Steelfish. The purpose was to collect data as part of UK regional mapping programme. Sub-bottom profiling data were collected using pinger. Sample data were collected using gravity corer; Vibrocorer and Shipek Grab. These data are archived by BGS. No BGS survey report currently available." .
