<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:464579702863d3e54023d699f8f7653deeaf72f6> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1137; E Approaches to Sanday &amp; Stronsay (Blocks 2,3,5), Area in SqKm: 2693; E Approaches to Sanday &amp; Stronsay (Blocks 3,4,6,7), Area in SqKm: 1711, (29/05/2006 to 19/09/2006), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1). Contract: ETV. FY 2006/07. Contractor: NetSurvey." .
