<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:45fdbc4df52c8e3a6ebc26c9865decef866c4f97> <http://schema.org/description> "A GIS dataset consisting of a merged dataset consisting of points and centroids of line and polygon features for marine points of interest in the UK. There are 50,163 features in total, for example, \"Dogger Bank\", \"Wolf Rock\", \"Bude Bay\" and \"Anton Dohrn Seamount\". The constituent datasets are separately available as GIS layers; MEDIN Gazetteer of Named Marine Areas v2 (November 2013), MEDIN Gazetteer of Coastline Features and MEDIN Gazetteer of Sea Features." .
