<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:44ecc4c05c9897dd268504fd2b4480ffd1ecff32> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 49 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically the north western North Sea, north of Scotland, during July of 1999. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
