<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:44653cba10e40bf2688d421ac9fda24f8bc1df29> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:aa5f3399c083e4335c6351cbd1b060da .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:44653cba10e40bf2688d421ac9fda24f8bc1df29> <http://schema.org/description> "The report within this series contains the operation details and results of the Lynn and Inner Dowsing Windfarm Mono Pile\r\nFoundation Bathymetric Investigation carried out for MT Højgaard A/S. The fieldwork was undertaken between\r\nthe 8th and the 26th January 2007 by Fugro Survey Limited, using the M/V Genesis.\r\nThe objective of the survey was to acquire, process and document high quality acoustic data, using a multibeam\r\necho sounder, to ascertain the bathymetry information about the mono pile locations. The survey work was\r\nperformed for 30 mono pile locations on the Lynn Windfarm and 30 mono pile locations on the Inner Dowsing\r\nWindfarm. The survey vessel M/V Genesis was mobilised in Great Yarmouth with the necessary equipment\r\nand personnel to complete the project requirements and then operated out of Grimsby for the fieldwork.\r\nThe purpose of the survey is to collect information on the bathymetry conditions around each of the proposed\r\nmono piles. The information to be collected will include tidal levels and water depths" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:44653cba10e40bf2688d421ac9fda24f8bc1df29> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b9fe451feb4f841f33f4a9247cd0e769 .
