<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:445e22c8fc43a7bce6316bece9559b3816dc557d> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset is an amalgamation of ad-hoc sightings made by HA Cole from 1938 to 1941 of Urosalpinx cinerea in the oyster beds of the Essex estuaries." .
