_:b0cb28e9bc86b0bd3106ba732aed3f83 <http://schema.org/value> "Greenland Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:444acf1074c2ac8d87bc7363044b872dae8474a6> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b0cb28e9bc86b0bd3106ba732aed3f83 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:444acf1074c2ac8d87bc7363044b872dae8474a6> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 3 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Atlantic Ocean and the Greenland Sea areas specifically at stations south of, north of and within the Denmark Strait. The data was collected during July 1990. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
_:b0cb28e9bc86b0bd3106ba732aed3f83 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:b0cb28e9bc86b0bd3106ba732aed3f83 <http://schema.org/value> "Denmark Strait" .
_:b0cb28e9bc86b0bd3106ba732aed3f83 <http://schema.org/value> "North Atlantic Ocean" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:444acf1074c2ac8d87bc7363044b872dae8474a6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b0cb28e9bc86b0bd3106ba732aed3f83 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:44463ec7576624ac15c1dc79641106f09a74d100> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the environmental monitoring programme outlined within FEPA licences 31792/10/1 and 31814/10/2 for the Lynn and Inner Dowsing (LID) wind farms respectively, both valid from the 10th October 2010 until the 31st October 2013, Brown &amp; May Marine Ltd. was commissioned by Centrica Energy to undertake post-construction fisheries surveys within the LID wind farms.\r\n\r\nThis report details the findings of the 6th to the 12th shrimp survey undertaken in the area of the Lynn &amp; Inner Dowsing Offshore Wind Farms.The survey is the Year 1 post construction survey which span across 2009 and 2010\r\n\r\n\r\nThe survey methodology used replicated that of the previous surveys. This is detailed in the “LID Offshore Wind Farm Post-Construction Shrimp Survey, August 2009, Interim Report (ref: LIDPSS01B)”." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:44463ec7576624ac15c1dc79641106f09a74d100> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e0bdfda4784e0c9ea036ad6d899f8481 .
