<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:439be30f01e88254ddca45883bec02c98a7e53a3> <http://schema.org/description> "This study undertook a literature review and consultation with key stakeholders to establish current knowledge for evidence gaps identified in the ScotMER Fish and Fisheries evidence map. This report includes research recommendations to help fill remaining strategic priority gaps.\r\n The study is also available to download at https://www.gov.scot/publications/review-fish-fisheries-research-inform-scotmer-evidence-gaps-future-strategic-research-uk/" .
