<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:435a38b0575873841484a1f871cc5e9d8ac4b837> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a75a1fab8571c1835e2561c07bca4b4d .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:435a38b0575873841484a1f871cc5e9d8ac4b837> <http://schema.org/description> "The Crown Estate has undertaken a leasing round, known as ‘Round 3’, for the next generation\r\nof offshore wind farms in UK waters. The Round 3 proposals comprise nine development\r\nzones, which are located around the UK. Following the negotiation and signing of a Zone\r\nDevelopment Agreement (ZDA), a single successful bidder will be awarded exclusive\r\ndevelopment rights for offshore wind farms in each zone. The ZDAs will not be signed until the\r\nHRA process is complete." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4355e7733416ee5e9511af354ff7bc3c598e3874> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1450; Approaches to Cardigan Bay, Area in SqKm: 1239, (28/07/2014 to 25/11/2014), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Medium. FY 2014/15. Contractor: MMT UK." .
_:be64008943de878aa7fb23e39cf9de37 <http://schema.org/value> "MMT UK" .
