_:cdebb5c516d770b6243152a4b18aa310 <http://schema.org/value> "Tremadog Bays" .
_:f83ab19226292a67308fea5bee5c1c79 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:cdebb5c516d770b6243152a4b18aa310 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4350e6ae953c1005aaaac322c14a76f4aa50b20c> <http://schema.org/description> "This marine multibeam survey took place in May 2008 in Liverpool &amp; Tremadog Bays on board the RV Prince Madog. The survey was carried out by the British Geological Survey (BGS) and Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory (POL). These data are archived by BGS." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4350e6ae953c1005aaaac322c14a76f4aa50b20c> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f83ab19226292a67308fea5bee5c1c79 .
_:c2f2c9d2c0d305ec4ad26f0c4334f985 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4343749816aff239c036b46d7d5fbfe11ef835df> <http://schema.org/description> "Since 2007 a boat-based monitoring programme has been undertaken for the Lincs offshore wind farm to\r\ncollect information on seabird species during the pre-construction (2007-2010) and construction (2011-2012)\r\nperiods. Pre-construction surveys identified 12 key species which either occurred in (regionally) important\r\nnumbers or were considered potentially sensitive to the construction and operation of the offshore wind farm.\r\nThe main aim of the report within this series was to determine whether the effects of construction related activities have had a\r\nmeasurable influence on the populations of each of the key species. To that end information is presented to\r\nexplore changes in abundance, seasonal and spatial distribution of birds recorded within the Study Area\r\nbetween pre-construction and construction periods." .
_:c2f2c9d2c0d305ec4ad26f0c4334f985 <http://schema.org/value> "seasonal" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4343749816aff239c036b46d7d5fbfe11ef835df> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c2f2c9d2c0d305ec4ad26f0c4334f985 .
_:c2f2c9d2c0d305ec4ad26f0c4334f985 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:ff99d2fc4f42f033cb07a1a6273c8158 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:ff99d2fc4f42f033cb07a1a6273c8158 <http://schema.org/value> "Lincs offshore wind farm" .
_:ff99d2fc4f42f033cb07a1a6273c8158 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4343749816aff239c036b46d7d5fbfe11ef835df> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ff99d2fc4f42f033cb07a1a6273c8158 .
_:c2f2c9d2c0d305ec4ad26f0c4334f985 <http://schema.org/value> "abundance" .
