<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:427c48484cad943e713b9cedf2895d4f07f9685d> <http://schema.org/description> "English Heritage funded project to facilitate the assessment, analysis and publication of the maritime archaeological archive from the area of Alum Bay, on the NW coast of the Isle of Wight. Archaeological work in Alum Bay included in the project stretches from 1993 to 2013. Project outputs will include an Archaeological Management Report and an Academic Monograph" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:427c48484cad943e713b9cedf2895d4f07f9685d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:edca32529144f10d4e2b43aa1a589738 .
