_:e94eefa772919485f2fc0a099c12d987 <http://schema.org/value> "oysters" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:425b4c50da824ebbd9aff7a364a996b265a3aa62> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:de0dd2934f06239692f460618b539236 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:f3de6d182a5db4167b12be2ba0846294 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:425b4c50da824ebbd9aff7a364a996b265a3aa62> <http://schema.org/description> "This project concerns the presence of oysters at the site of Kentish Flats Offshore Wind Farm after its construction. A series of field sampling of the local native oysters was undertaken to be able to assess the levels of specific chemicals in the flesh of the oysters. A comparison is made between the pre and post construction results." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4251395233efbefe7e315350c92700931dfe9220> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d02a28ac36659ba628c0a4a33847a49b .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4251395233efbefe7e315350c92700931dfe9220> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the Department of Trade and Industry's (now Department of Energy and Climate Change) Strategic Environmental Assessment (SEA7) a geophysical survey was undertaken from SeaTrax Xplorer in the vicinity of Portland Bill. Multibeam and sidescan sonar data were collected." .
_:d02a28ac36659ba628c0a4a33847a49b <http://schema.org/value> "Portland Bill" .
