_:e1d839c9800d57f567b981b5f8fb2517 <http://schema.org/value> "Marine Environmental Data and Information Network" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:424fcb1458bff64ffd831f289a2e35dcfcf82481> <http://schema.org/description> "Multibeam survey collecting bathymetry and backscatter to client specifications, namely International Hydrographic Organization (IHO) Order 1a standard, WGS84 latitude and longitude co-ordinates collected by RTK Global Positioning System (RTK-GPS), depths corrected to Chart Datum (CD), Raw and processed data delivered to Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science, UK (Cefas) complete with georeferenced mosaics and GeoTiffs images. These data are archived with the Marine Environmental Data and Information Network (MEDIN) Data Archive Centres (DACs) including the British Geological Survey (BGS) DAC for geology and geophysics, The Archive for Marine Species and Habitats Data (DASSH) and the United Kingdom Hydrographic Office (UKHO) bathymetry DAC. The full site data package including raw is also available on request from BGS." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:424fcb1458bff64ffd831f289a2e35dcfcf82481> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e1d839c9800d57f567b981b5f8fb2517 .
_:e1d839c9800d57f567b981b5f8fb2517 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:e1d839c9800d57f567b981b5f8fb2517 <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:423d97162163b0413de6917ce4fef3dda4b25516> <http://schema.org/description> "Fugro Alluvial Offshore Limited (FAOL) was contracted by DONG Energy to perform a geotechnical\r\ninvestigation for the design and installation of foundation and demonstration wind turbines. The work initial comprised 2 x PCPT using the Fugro Alluvial Offshore Limited Wheeldrive Seacalf Seabed CPT unit." .
_:c1909108bb59bcf6093aa9e01688c0d7 <http://schema.org/value> "DONG Energy" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:423d97162163b0413de6917ce4fef3dda4b25516> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c1909108bb59bcf6093aa9e01688c0d7 .
