<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:41381d8b56188e722f3fbb675983b02ab20d17c7> <http://schema.org/description> "The DAERA estuarine fish survey is an annual assessment of fish communities in seven river estuaries in Northern Ireland. Data is collected primarily for the purposes of reporting to Water Framework Directive (WFD)." .
_:d7ff32d9fe514663c450248e4d01ddc8 <http://schema.org/value> "fish" .
_:ec5733296b7ffec171087e8fa7b0b186 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
