_:ec5733296b7ffec171087e8fa7b0b186 <http://schema.org/value> "Northern Ireland" .
_:de6e18aa8fa273d9632073693a4c8b70 <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea area" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:413553979494f0718b0a48234c60221d04a7d190> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 153 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically the Scottish east coast waters, during November and December of 1989. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:de6e18aa8fa273d9632073693a4c8b70 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
