_:c21f7ee95d8a527472857d1bf0c97ddb <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4008b295e405228558c4d8c31d83cad6fca3eb58> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 48 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, incorporating the Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section and the Rockall to Malin Head section. The data were collected during July of 1991. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:4008b295e405228558c4d8c31d83cad6fca3eb58> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:bb29a13efb120f1f2f0acad1b57061ee <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3ff7679a4323dc56458bd57c8efa1933cc5f270f> <http://schema.org/description> "Acting on behalf of Statoil Petroleum AS and Dudgeon Offshore Wind Limited, Fugro GEOS Ltd has\r\nundertaken a 12-month metocean measurement programme at the Dudgeon Field in the southern\r\nNorth Sea to support wind park development.\r\n\r\nThe Dudgeon mooring consisted of an Oceanor Seawatch Midi buoy configured to measure waves\r\nand also atmospheric pressure; a Nortek Aquadopp deployed in the hull of the buoy configured to\r\nmeasure current speed and direction through the water column; and a Valeport Midas Water Level\r\nRecorder deployed on the seabed to measure water level." .
_:a52f57d5154f2bb899b13eee5a220de5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
