<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3fc7b46d817d1c931b0200e9b8f1418bdddece48> <http://schema.org/description> "Litoral survey of Ladram and Thrulestone Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes the 1992-96 Devon Wildlife Trust Ladram Littoral survey and the 1992-96 Devon Wildlife Trust Thurlestone Littoral survey." .
