<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3ef2b077b201cbefe114739daab3de5560b38a02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3ef2b077b201cbefe114739daab3de5560b38a02> <http://schema.org/description> "In June 2013 EGS (International) Ltd was contracted to undertake the third post\r\nconstruction (6 month) survey of the windfarm. The operations involved monitoring\r\nchanges to seabed morphology around the turbines and substations as well as along the\r\ninter array cable and export cable routes. EGSi carried out the survey using a high frequency\r\nmultibeam (MBES) system and a side-scan sonar (SSS) in conjunction with a USBL system,\r\nacross each of the proposed WTGs, substation locations and export cable routes over the\r\nWalney Offshore Windfarm 1 &amp; 2 sites." .
_:c8583660b12710e5f07b2b05ce4014f1 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
