<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3ed3bff33d8f7f0d09604c99c8682340961b2687> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during July 1997. It incorporates casts along four E-W sections at varying latitudes between the mainland/Inner Hebrides and the Outer Hebrides. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
