_:e6888df606d3b02b7b085fd34204750c <http://schema.org/value> "Faroese waters" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3db09b17ab0aa692a2737dcb7113812de9fb99ee> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 24 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Norwegian Sea, North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically in Faroese waters during February 2001. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Faroes Fisheries Laboratory as part of the Monitoring the Atlantic Inflow toward the Arctic (MAIA) project." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3db09b17ab0aa692a2737dcb7113812de9fb99ee> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e6888df606d3b02b7b085fd34204750c .
