_:a45b3b58bbfda13dd70bbbd66fe78ec8 <http://schema.org/value> "fish" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d5e28b4788730830ab23957da59c53c08fb83ae> <http://schema.org/description> "A watching brief was undertaken during construction of a new wet basin on the foreshore of Falmouth Docks. The deposit sequence comprised modern foreshore silts overlying solid bedrock. No archaeological deposits were exposed and no finds recovered." .
