_:d54c6fd4019ebac237b365e7c878e2d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d49d6f5f1976df715be452170dc982b0cebda63> <http://schema.org/description> "Sabellaria alveolata presence records from colonies at Duckpool, north Cornwall. \r\n \r\n The paper describes the colonies of Sabellaria alveolata that have been recorded at Duckpool 1961-1970. A map indicating where on the shore the various colonies were found is provided but the scale of the map makes it very difficult to estimate the latitude/longitude and/or grid references of the colonies described. A point in the middle of the shore, given in the paper has been used." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d49d6f5f1976df715be452170dc982b0cebda63> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e6b582d1804b20005e9c0baef7836c6b .
_:e6b582d1804b20005e9c0baef7836c6b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e0c08ec9bcaf12586dc5551a5768c889 <http://schema.org/value> "Unknown method survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d43d60687dfdfe953d463e7004b55a94bc08922> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e0c08ec9bcaf12586dc5551a5768c889 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d43d60687dfdfe953d463e7004b55a94bc08922> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d43d60687dfdfe953d463e7004b55a94bc08922> <http://schema.org/description> "This processed bathymetric data set has been derived from an Unknown method survey. The source data was collected, validated and processed for the purpose of Safety Of Life At Sea (SOLAS). The data set must not be used for navigation or to create products that could be used for navigation." .
_:e0c08ec9bcaf12586dc5551a5768c889 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e0c08ec9bcaf12586dc5551a5768c889 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d2e6e2df6aeafbc1baf1786bad04e2c3893c7a8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d2e6e2df6aeafbc1baf1786bad04e2c3893c7a8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c420bf667377fd2b0d23349e64a65a65 .
_:c420bf667377fd2b0d23349e64a65a65 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:c420bf667377fd2b0d23349e64a65a65 <http://schema.org/value> "Race Bank" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d2e6e2df6aeafbc1baf1786bad04e2c3893c7a8> <http://schema.org/description> "meteorological mast was erected on the proposed Race Bank site in October 2005, with instrumentation installed in February 2006. The meteorological instrumentation on each mast includes: six anemometers at heights 90 m (cup and sonic types), 80 m, 70 m, 60 m and 30 m above sea level (ASL); two wind vanes at heights 90 m and 30 m; precipitation sensor; barometer; temperature sensor.\r\nData from these instruments are being collected to give a site specific record of conditions at Race Bank\r\nover several years to ensure a good knowledge of the wind resource prior to construction of the proposed\r\nwind farm, and to enable performance assessment once the wind turbines are in place." .
_:c420bf667377fd2b0d23349e64a65a65 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d2d1763ed9196deb9d6c6c45ade6b6bb86de624> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e2ee804a4d94823dadc147f0e004e68f .
