<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d0fe924c6e7c2f732187d2fbff00a596a28b4c8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f466aecc5dec979d91a63db32c1fcc5 .
_:f466aecc5dec979d91a63db32c1fcc5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f466aecc5dec979d91a63db32c1fcc5 <http://schema.org/name> "taxon" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d0fe924c6e7c2f732187d2fbff00a596a28b4c8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f9028d40ebcb7faca5ee08eb82da13e5 <http://schema.org/value> "MSS" .
_:f9028d40ebcb7faca5ee08eb82da13e5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f466aecc5dec979d91a63db32c1fcc5 <http://schema.org/value> "species" .
_:d9e08614270e63aca728d2d3997778ea <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:f9028d40ebcb7faca5ee08eb82da13e5 <http://schema.org/value> "SNH" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d0fe924c6e7c2f732187d2fbff00a596a28b4c8> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of this benthic survey (cruise 1609A) off Ullapool was to improve knowledge of the occurrence and distribution of species and habitats of recognised conservation importance, particularly priority marine features (PMFs). This site was of interest because the area is a dredge spoil ground, located off Ullapool Harbour in the site of a pMPA (status at time of survey). An underwater video survey were conducted by MSS for MSS on the 2nd October 2009 to collect detailed biological information on the seabed species and habitat features present. Drop-down video drift tows were undertaken at 3 sites. Analyses on the images, commissioned by SNH, were used to describe the nature of the seabed in terms of the physical structure and the species assemblages. MSS used the vessel FRV Alba na Mara for this survey." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d0fe924c6e7c2f732187d2fbff00a596a28b4c8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f9028d40ebcb7faca5ee08eb82da13e5 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d0fe924c6e7c2f732187d2fbff00a596a28b4c8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c43591c3b0e78122bf4b5acb634974a6 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d0fe924c6e7c2f732187d2fbff00a596a28b4c8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d9e08614270e63aca728d2d3997778ea .
_:d023188c34af31be5c5f4e5f8710aa97 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:d023188c34af31be5c5f4e5f8710aa97 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d0fdb127babcf5200cb94398d15932a06e49e46> <http://schema.org/description> "This is Phase 2 of a project with the aim of creating awareness and changing behaviour associated with the operational performance of dredgers and the savings that can be made on fuel and gaseous emissions. The first phase identified areas where carbon reduction can take place from a hydrodynamic point of view in the operation of UK hopper dredgers. In the current project, the identified carbon strategies are evaluated base on measurements onboard ships and more detailed calculations. The scope of work was divided into 6 modules: Optimising ship speed by improved voyage planning, feedback monitor, trim optimisation, maintenance strategies, propeller optimisation and energy saving devices and a Green shipping simulator." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3d0fdb127babcf5200cb94398d15932a06e49e46> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d023188c34af31be5c5f4e5f8710aa97 .
