<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3cf2b7d1ad26521b5fce2950401b09a1f00655f1> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1402; Menabilly to Dodman Point A, Area in SqKm: 9; Menabilly to Dodman Point B, Area in SqKm: 8; Menabilly to Dodman Point C, Area in SqKm: 9), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: SW Coastal Monitoring Programme. FY 2013/14. Contractor: EGS." .
