_:d6dbaef5cf4197cf93a21c2e0634d1d1 <http://schema.org/value> "filamentous cyanobacteria" .
_:c1ea61eebb3f0efc457791cdcd45c17 <http://schema.org/value> "biotope mapping project" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3cc9bfac7b69904a03a4c0806d65c03066adc09a> <http://schema.org/description> "This survey was an intertidal and shallow sublittoral survey in Dorset as part of a larger biotope mapping project. The purpose was to collect baseline information for marine conservation and spatial planning." .
_:c1ea61eebb3f0efc457791cdcd45c17 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c1ea61eebb3f0efc457791cdcd45c17 <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3cc9bfac7b69904a03a4c0806d65c03066adc09a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b473e9d3fafb194bfe0f917d77d8f76b .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3cc9bfac7b69904a03a4c0806d65c03066adc09a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b473e9d3fafb194bfe0f917d77d8f76b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3cc9bfac7b69904a03a4c0806d65c03066adc09a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c1ea61eebb3f0efc457791cdcd45c17 .
