<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3bc23420f0fdb3d2cca235bf3e23eda381b228aa> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a29d0071221b00cc9c1814d7eff729fb .
_:a29d0071221b00cc9c1814d7eff729fb <http://schema.org/value> "flora" .
_:de847aa97b8b5e97e5a5d8da6995f8d5 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3bc23420f0fdb3d2cca235bf3e23eda381b228aa> <http://schema.org/description> "Report following a survey of brackish coastal lagoons present between South Humberside and Boston Haven (Lincolnshire). The survey aimed to produce a list of all the saline lagoons present within the study area, provide preliminary descriptions of each site (including fauna and flora present) and to indicate the scientific interest of each site visited. The survey used qualitative sampling to assess the lagoons." .
_:a29d0071221b00cc9c1814d7eff729fb <http://schema.org/name> "marine biodiversity" .
_:e937f80b4bc85eb4e53cb1528ec0b82e <http://schema.org/value> "Lincolnshire" .
