<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3bb66c38a4c2416a8998ad900026bcdfec97982b> <http://schema.org/description> "This extension project was set up to prepare a Genus Trait Handbook by the extraction of the genus traits data for 150 genera held within the MEPF 04/02 database. The task involved sourcing photomicrographs for all of the genera, interacting with Cefas, JNCC &amp; MarLin and entering the images and data onto page templates already prepared using ADOBE InDesign." .
