<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3a9f8882beaac950eaab0ddd03bd8783c37f159c> <http://schema.org/description> "This marine multibeam Survey took place in July/November 2010 in the Firth of Forth on board the RV White Ribbon. The survey was carried out by the British Geological Survey (BGS) on behalf of Scottish Environment Protection Agency (SEPA). Sea floor bathymetry data were collected using a Kongsberg EM3002D multibeam system. These data are archived by BGS." .
