_:a688b76a023bc919b1ac5a8770dfd110 <http://schema.org/value> "Loughborough University" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3a85cba5605cdfec773f0e441df56ea2e184d8d7> <http://schema.org/description> "This report describes work undertaken by the National Physical Laboratory and Loughborough University to monitor the underwater acoustic noise during the installation of a test pile at the Lynn Offshore Wind Farm. The work took place on the morning of 17th April 2006 at 530 07.168’ N 00 24.567’ E approximately 6 km off-shore from Skegness. Detailed assessment of underwater noise levels were made throughout the piling sequence (a little over 4 hours) at two locations in a direction toward Gibraltar Point corresponding to ranges of 57 m and 1,850 m." .
_:b0960675c8d0d1bafac570311fee8f2f <http://schema.org/value> "Gibraltar Point" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3a85cba5605cdfec773f0e441df56ea2e184d8d7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b0960675c8d0d1bafac570311fee8f2f .
