_:c110a410ad2fdea530eb2351e9caa44f <http://schema.org/value> "Lizard Point" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:392be87b2b19c1bab6b679137b1bab28a55ff73f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c110a410ad2fdea530eb2351e9caa44f .
_:c110a410ad2fdea530eb2351e9caa44f <http://schema.org/value> "Lands End/Cape Bank" .
_:c110a410ad2fdea530eb2351e9caa44f <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:392be87b2b19c1bab6b679137b1bab28a55ff73f> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of this review is to document sources of relevant physical and biological data for the areas of Lands End/Cape Bank and Lizard Point, identify significant gaps in knowledge and to use this information for future survey planning. Lizard Point and Lands End/Cape Bank are known to harbour areas of extensive wave exposed subtidal rocky reefs (Poulton, 2005) and are therefore of particular interest to Natural England from a conservation perspective." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:392be87b2b19c1bab6b679137b1bab28a55ff73f> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fd935ab158cde89a2af15e02721d84bd .
