_:a3eb83c79c61cd33b033a19d8f67b79c <http://schema.org/value> "Met Mast Survey" .
_:a3eb83c79c61cd33b033a19d8f67b79c <http://schema.org/value> "Additional Areas Survey" .
_:a3eb83c79c61cd33b033a19d8f67b79c <http://schema.org/value> "Cable Export Routes Survey" .
_:a3eb83c79c61cd33b033a19d8f67b79c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:38e439d8cb4e7da2b5c167a2cedb814467eec343> <http://schema.org/description> "Gardline Geosurvey undertook a geophysical survey of the Rampion Offshore Wind Farm consisting of a UXO Detection Survey, VHR Survey, Additional Areas Survey, Met Mast Survey and Cable Export Routes Survey (Geophysical Investigation – Technical Specification Document Ref: 5114328-GT-SP-001 Rev 3). The survey was conducted using single beam and multi-beam echo sounders, side scan sonar, pinger, boomer, magnetometer and multichannel VHR seismic. Data from all aspects of the survey have been used for the final interpretation of the data sets. All datasets contained in this series are projected to WGS 1984 UTM 30N. When adding data to GIS packages please use this coordinate projection." .
_:f8776cae02299feb9ad5e73bf9188bd4 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:a3eb83c79c61cd33b033a19d8f67b79c <http://schema.org/value> "UXO Detection Survey" .
