<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:37e2ff0977a8d61c5ac6cc3d32d3043e35b1e5f4> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) regional marine sampling survey took place in June 1969 in Irish Sea on board the MV Heathergate. Seabed samples and borehole cores were collected using wireline drilling system, Shell and Auger. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Internal Report ??." .
