<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:372e5f30a5b9494a2f0fd77c817f403e4b1aa0b8> <http://schema.org/description> "Osiris Projects were commissioned in July 2010, by Vattenfall Wind Power Ltd to carry out a geophysical survey for the proposed extension to the Kentish Flats 2 Offshore Wind Farm. The survey was completed under Osiris Projects Terms and Conditions and was carried out between 22nd July and 22nd September 2010" .
