<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3722ad04f3ec88583c8db9bfd09ced3755101333> <http://schema.org/description> "This report represents the work undertaken by Bournemouth University and Poole Harbour Commissioners on the Protected Wreck site of the Swash Channel Wreck located in the approached to Poole Harbour, Dorset. Part of MSFD NNS baseline data collation project (Jan 2016). Subset of a dataset as we were only pulling out records for a selection of INNS. Contains records for Bonnemaisonia hamifera." .
