<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:371c69eef09d9187ace80a199cdd6a7af95f8ce7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:371c69eef09d9187ace80a199cdd6a7af95f8ce7> <http://schema.org/description> "Titan Environmental Surveys Ltd was commissioned by Centrica to undertake a campaign of measurements of currents and turbidity at four sites within the Lynn and Inner Dowsing Wind Farm Development. Alongside this work, a 13 hour Vessel Mounted Acoustic Doppler Current Profiler (VMADCP) transect was required. This transect ran between the two wind farms and was split in to two sections, an Inner and outer transect (Figure 1.1). The entire study was intended to provide metocean and suspended particulate matter concentration data to validate model predictions described in environmental statements for the site, and establish whether the sediment movement is within acceptable thresholds." .
