<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:364e66b8a53c9352ab057abb23b31123b1ea3ebc> <http://schema.org/description> "This data contains the ranked abundance of the fish species caught during the benthic ecology study. In agreement with the Marine Management Organisation, two seasonal site specific set net surveys were designed and implemented. The first survey was conducted in June 2012 with a second identical survey conducted in the following September." .
_:d23304dd2dd6e7cf71895128bd9f947e <http://schema.org/value> "epi-benthos data" .
_:b1df481e401d86148aab9dbaa88ce83e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3645f64644e3b569e60812bff9cb12bf51cc9842> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d23304dd2dd6e7cf71895128bd9f947e .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3645f64644e3b569e60812bff9cb12bf51cc9842> <http://schema.org/description> "This project relates to the monitoring survey work conducted at the site of the Rhyl Flats Offshore Wind Farm. The monitoring program comprises a variety of topics such as sea bed morphology and scour, current modelling, benthic organisms, electromagnetic fields, marine fish, underwater noise and vibration and ornithology. Some of the outcomes of the monitoring shows localised erosion or deposition of the seabed, benthic communities of the area remain largely unchanged with similar faunal and sediment characteristics as those recorded from the previous years monitoring study, epi-benthos data collected has unchanged over a period of two years - this provides a good baseline to compare future surveys." .
_:b1df481e401d86148aab9dbaa88ce83e <http://schema.org/value> "benthic communities" .
