<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:35c40d773faf22639839189708a022ce7c2103fc> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April 1994. It incorporates CTD profiles from the mouth of the Wash. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
