<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:35527f5033808592e9a80d2ee2dd87160ded495e> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 50 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically to the east of Scotland, during January and February of 2000. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
