<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3536fc335700682292580f69fb486e2dce8c2ab8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e255844a2bd520bc67e2a6fcbeb6ab87 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:3536fc335700682292580f69fb486e2dce8c2ab8> <http://schema.org/description> "Sediment plumes, defined as visible concentrations of sediment at the surface of the water column, can be seen in satellite and aerial images down-current of offshore wind farms across Europe. But until now, little was known about their cause, composition and extent. The main aims of this study was to better understand the formation of these sediment plumes and the interaction of offshore wind farms' monopile base structures with the surrounding water." .
_:d3bfdeefcdfd1dfc5844c31daf9013e6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:d3bfdeefcdfd1dfc5844c31daf9013e6 <http://schema.org/value> "fish" .
_:a1d45bbdbb14de279184135cdf794716 <http://schema.org/value> "West of Duddon Sands" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:35368de606f626e429232135d741ccf7eb589042> <http://schema.org/description> "The following reports detail the findings of the spring and autumn 2012 adult and juvenile fish and epi-benthic pre-construction surveys, undertaken in the area of the West of Duddon Sands offshore wind farm and along the proposed export cable between the 17th - 24th May and the 19th - 25th September." .
_:d3bfdeefcdfd1dfc5844c31daf9013e6 <http://schema.org/name> "migratory marine species" .
_:a1d45bbdbb14de279184135cdf794716 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
