_:dddeb819228f49a2fb7ed4a1834f33c4 <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:34dfa8f00ff4ba5e7ab30b9abd870a7ea4f223d8> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1503; Outer Hebrides DWR, Area in SqKm: 915, (29/05/2016 to 13/06/2016), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Medium. FY 2016/17. Contractor: MMT UK." .
_:dddeb819228f49a2fb7ed4a1834f33c4 <http://schema.org/value> "Civil Hydrography Programme" .
_:dddeb819228f49a2fb7ed4a1834f33c4 <http://schema.org/value> "Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA)" .
