_:c2b4b50a74a64f263b08de60efddc3ae <http://schema.org/value> "Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:33c8dbdde0626f9847b0297dc899982ab92faa4c> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during May - June 1987. It incorporates a CTD survey around the Faroe Islands. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory as part of a physical oceanographic survey of the Faroes Shetland Channel and the surrounding area of the NE Atlantic." .
