<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:33ad67d513b5020db7e8bedf3389aba2ca3c4741> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1262; North Shipwash, Area in SqKm: 14, (10/06/2008 to 28/09/2008), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2008/09. Contractor: MMT." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:33ad67d513b5020db7e8bedf3389aba2ca3c4741> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
