<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:334f9e02eddd269d3fb1685c201b4d981cd02c34> <http://schema.org/description> "Timed searches undertaken by the Marine Biological Association (MBA) to search for non-native species in the Yealm Estuary. Searches primarily focused on the Pacific Oyster (Magallana gigas), although other non-natives were recorded. Abundance was primarily Present/Not present, but in some cases non-standard units of abundance (eg. 'Not common') were used." .
