_:bc251868cb2d64e7f80a1c33e2cdbdef <http://schema.org/value> "sampling operations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:31929821da27fb57feae61949c95fac1eda6d1d3> <http://schema.org/description> "These reports details the findings of the 5th 6th 7th and 8th otter and beam trawl survey undertaken in the area relevant to the operational Lynn and Inner Dowsing offshore wind farms. The survey is the Year 1 post construction survey which span across 2009 and 2010\r\n\r\nThe survey methodology and sampling operations replicated that of the previous survey. These are detailed in the “LID Offshore Wind Farm Post-Construction Otter &amp; Beam Trawl Survey, August 2009, Interim Report (Ref: LIDPOBTS01)” and the “LID Offshore Wind Farm Post-Construction Otter &amp; Beam Trawl Survey, September 2010, Interim Report." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:318225c7024e32ee21aa6a9a0e9f1e1ef778968f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:c59b9d31b68dc358022b7888baad1e53 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:318225c7024e32ee21aa6a9a0e9f1e1ef778968f> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from MCS members' dives weekend around Portland. Records were subsequently validated by an expert post-survey assessor and assigned biotopes according to the MNCR 04.05 key." .
