_:c8e87408554ab7ee7750794afab366b2 <http://schema.org/value> "Kentish Flats" .
_:f7580a4f7d181d2a8e6d13b52874725d <http://schema.org/value> "mammal species" .
_:f29cd8280713cfbc626e236d39596dcf <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:316ae60ff52e0c83ec41b776dc0caaafe184792c> <http://schema.org/description> "This project concerns the possibility of effects of electromagnetic fields on electrically and magnetically sensitive marine organisms at the site of the Kentish Flats Offshore Wind Farm. Such species include electrosensitive fish, notably elasmobranchs (sharks, skates and rays) and other fish and mammal species that may be sensitive to magnetic fields." .
