<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:313a4faf5f8fd8e75e16e673b1585b66b4b3fdf2> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September - October 1989. It incorporates CTD surveys over the Charlie Gibbs Fracture Zone and an area just to the west of the Faroe Islands. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Deacon Laboratory." .
