<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:30a1a9f77c973e62e135d86289be066f8f28b127> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in March 1985. It incorporates a survey of the North Channel between Scotland and Northern Ireland. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
_:fc0aa05c29ce36e7e024c5cd002ffbe6 <http://schema.org/value> "Scotland" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:30a1a9f77c973e62e135d86289be066f8f28b127> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
