_:cc899b22e1503e6e98f31e2e730f01f8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:a9349ebacaba0c99621e43f34be50111 <http://schema.org/value> "Heriot-Watt University" .
