<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2fb0a58b6efe7760b05ef4d4f4bc067d292d5cfc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:a30a50c5a8c4ecb72785d2356106a2ff <http://schema.org/value> "plants" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2fb0a58b6efe7760b05ef4d4f4bc067d292d5cfc> <http://schema.org/description> "The aim of this investigation was to establish monitoring transects at a series of rocky shore sites that represent the range of rock features and biotopes present in the cSAC. and to carry out a baseline survey of them so that the communities of animals and plants can be monitored in future years. The survey methodologies used were based on the ACE (Abundance scales and Checklist at Exact locations) methods, with some modifications. The report details the methodology and gives descriptions of the sites and biotopes present at each sample site. The species data and biotope descriptions are given in an Appendix and have been entered into the Marine Recorder database." .
_:b1be14df46436329beb67200d1afd6ea <http://schema.org/value> "ACE" .
