<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2fae9259170ccf1ca85e1749ee72b7087c89a872> <http://schema.org/description> "HiDef Aerial Surveying Limited (HiDef) has been commissioned by Biodiversity Research Institute to undertake aerial surveys of seabirds at the Gulf of Maine between May 2023 and February 2024. The methodology for this survey is described in HA10003_HiDef method_FINAL for monitoring trends at the Gulf of Maine This shapefile summarises the task elements conducted in support of May 2023 â?? Survey 01(Leg 1 2). including information about the transects flown, including date, time, and positioning data along with observations" .
