<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2fa5ffded24361426babb7fe30adde8caf79aef6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:cf862dbdaf2dc03ad5937df87f052077 <http://schema.org/value> "Maritime Coastguard Agency" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2fa5ffded24361426babb7fe30adde8caf79aef6> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1078; South Ship Head to Black Deep (A), Area in SqKm: 22; South Ship Head to Black Deep (B), Area in SqKm: 15; South Ship Head to Black Deep (C), Area in SqKm: 2; South Ship Head to Black Deep (D), Area in SqKm: 2Caister Shoal &amp; Caister Road, Area in SqKm: 29, (11/06/2004 to 06/07/2004), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2004/05). FY 2004/05. Contractor: RN (NP1016)." .
_:afbcbc4d4c75dc21523df7a0e2f02a79 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
