<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2f7e5d8c8933f660374f915c175d7a68c20d1f3a> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during October - November 1997. It incorporates CTD sections across the Faroe-Shetland Channel. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:cda0aa1916449132f6201118ab1b14d4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
