_:a711e64e43a4081f8d1ba60285f39a2b <http://schema.org/value> "Annex l habitats" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2f725ce283f39327e742db3152e22ad9d89b48dd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2f725ce283f39327e742db3152e22ad9d89b48dd> <http://schema.org/description> "Environmental Statement for the Gunfleet Sands Offshore Wind Farm project, which is located approximately 7km south-east of Clacton-on- Sea, Essex. The project consists of the already consented Gunfleet Sands 1 project (GS1), which has consent to construct up to 30 turbines and a proposed extension, Gunfleet Sands 2 (GS2)." .
_:eac81ac34a89ebe5118812a35026b2d1 <http://schema.org/value> "Clacton-on- Sea" .
_:eac81ac34a89ebe5118812a35026b2d1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:eac81ac34a89ebe5118812a35026b2d1 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2f725ce283f39327e742db3152e22ad9d89b48dd> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:eac81ac34a89ebe5118812a35026b2d1 .
_:eac81ac34a89ebe5118812a35026b2d1 <http://schema.org/value> "Essex" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2f5b76d23e79ecc40d86f2483695b68a8a604fa3> <http://schema.org/description> "Osiris Projects were commissioned in December 2012 by E.ON to carry out an Unexploded Ordnance UXO survey at the proposed Humber Gateway Offshore Wind Farm. The project objectives were to expand the previous UXO detection surveys completed in June 2011 and January 2012, under Osiris Projects Report numbers C11016 and C12001. The survey was carried out between 5th December 2012 and 30th January 2013. The current C12041 UXO survey involved modelling marine magnetic data to enable UXO and archaeological risk assessments to support the placement of inter array cables, with data acquisition comprising of multi-beam bathymetry, side scan sonar, pinger sub-bottom profiling and marine magnetic techniques, using Osiris Projects dedicated survey vessels, MV Bibby Tethra and MV Freja. This series contains Reports, UXO data, Geophysical Data and Charts. The following sections are missing: Volume 3 Appendix 1 and Individual DXF charts for Boulder Clearance" .
_:ba5424c88facfaa0c882e1c2430b86dd <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
