<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2ebc3455044426e8dfee2a68715cd88f8d998a46> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 205 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April - May 1993 from stations in the North East Atlantic, to the SW of the Canary Islands (World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE) area AR10) and centred approximately on 27 N, 32.5 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE)." .
