<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2e7b268a466863bffaf807b736d1689364bf19d2> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the 1958 RV Sarsia cruise no. P10 to the European continental slope. Samples were collected using a rectangular or bowed dredge and identified and recorded by staff of the Marine Biological Association of the UK. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
