_:a97a098f21da16051a45502c88afbbeb <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
_:c171545bfe827503ca9bc1e0bf66738d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c171545bfe827503ca9bc1e0bf66738d <http://schema.org/value> "River Helmsdale" .
