_:d51582f37f8ea12b8051143a28f9a031 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:a97a098f21da16051a45502c88afbbeb <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2d0a18c8607991f971994e887266eb34c4d8097d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c171545bfe827503ca9bc1e0bf66738d .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2d0a18c8607991f971994e887266eb34c4d8097d> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) marine sampling survey took place in August/September 1979 in the North Sea from a Zodiac. The aim of this dive survey was to collect samples for analysis to evaluate possible downstream and offshore movement of gold from the River Helmsdale. Seabed samples were collected by divers. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Marine Geology Internal Report WB/MI/79/10." .
_:c171545bfe827503ca9bc1e0bf66738d <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:d51582f37f8ea12b8051143a28f9a031 <http://schema.org/value> "dive survey" .
_:d51582f37f8ea12b8051143a28f9a031 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:c171545bfe827503ca9bc1e0bf66738d <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2d0a18c8607991f971994e887266eb34c4d8097d> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a97a098f21da16051a45502c88afbbeb .
_:a97a098f21da16051a45502c88afbbeb <http://schema.org/value> "BGS" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2d0646d3b1f94c7445a84ac84ec9e4be65fe3678> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sarsia Cruise in July 1968 around the underwater canyons in the Bay of Biscay, off the north coast of Spain. Samples were collected using either a scallop dredge or an anchor dredge. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
_:ef8e45fd54f37ce9847dc1c12e8181f3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
