<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2cf5bc4bf6bdeb830b9c5af30db339ff59f43585> <http://schema.org/description> "The report in this series presents the work from a project that examined the ability and\r\nperformance of remotely-operated techniques (such as radar) to observe the\r\nbehaviour of birds when they are over the sea but near to the coast." .
