_:efbbf0a49105ed2f30db0baed00d9b0b <http://schema.org/value> "Peter\r\nMadsen Rederi A/S" .
_:f6dc7547512ab1a626d732dc1de770cc <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:dc8066f850f6a034b0f3d5f306a082d1 <http://schema.org/value> "Osiris Projects" .
_:efbbf0a49105ed2f30db0baed00d9b0b <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2c5a09272abc83c55443f9f55e976698d4730c58> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:dc8066f850f6a034b0f3d5f306a082d1 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2c5a09272abc83c55443f9f55e976698d4730c58> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f6dc7547512ab1a626d732dc1de770cc .
_:f6dc7547512ab1a626d732dc1de770cc <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2c5a09272abc83c55443f9f55e976698d4730c58> <http://schema.org/description> "Osiris Projects were commissioned by Ocean Marine Research Ltd on behalf of Peter\r\nMadsen Rederi A/S, to carry out a bathymetric survey at the Burbo Bank offshore wind\r\nfarm, where rock dump operations around existing turbine monopiles have recently\r\nbeen completed.\r\nThe scope of work involved surveying a total of twenty five 75m x 75m boxes, centred\r\non each of the ‘as built’ monopile positions, as provided by SeaScape Energy via\r\nOcean Marine Research Ltd. It was noted during the survey that the positions, as\r\nsupplied by the Client, were inaccurate. This was attributed to rounding errors on the\r\nClient supplied coordinates, as decimal minute positions were rounded to two decimal\r\nplaces.\r\nThe primary objective of the survey was to map seabed levels across the individual\r\nturbine locations in order to assess the position of the rock dump with respect to\r\nproviding effective protection from any future scouring that might occur around the\r\nbase of the turbines." .
_:efbbf0a49105ed2f30db0baed00d9b0b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2c5a09272abc83c55443f9f55e976698d4730c58> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ae2de5aa0bf7349797f39b2c54e3e3c4 .
_:dc8066f850f6a034b0f3d5f306a082d1 <http://schema.org/name> "projects" .
_:ae2de5aa0bf7349797f39b2c54e3e3c4 <http://schema.org/value> "bathymetric survey" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2c5a09272abc83c55443f9f55e976698d4730c58> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f6dc7547512ab1a626d732dc1de770cc <http://schema.org/value> "seabed levels" .
