_:f92a718e8b5ad92da9354507b5624130 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:fb404c2b24cb2ebb186e63331c737b19 <http://schema.org/value> "Barra Fan" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2c42c40a3d1fb2a2a8555c0c77d85ab82a498d34> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2c42c40a3d1fb2a2a8555c0c77d85ab82a498d34> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 34 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from the West Inner Seas off the West Coast of Scotland and the North East Atlantic Ocean area specifically East of Barra Fan, taken during September 1995. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Defence Evaluation and Research Agency Winfrith as part of the Shelf Edge Studies Acoustic Measurement Experiment (SESAME)." .
_:cd91e3739b21a798f8a37690992cf03a <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
