<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2b0dc5d2d925d98e589a32088456c4dd5ad619cb> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1425; DWR via DR1 - Welland Field, Area in SqKm: 478, (01/05/2014 to 01/06/2014), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Medium. FY 2014/15. Contractor: MMT UK." .
_:bdc3c22bd4fd4c93fcc90a4da6adede4 <http://schema.org/value> "Welland Field" .
