_:cb7dd2ecd4e2008092b4881157bc7c55 <http://schema.org/value> "Firth of Clyde" .
_:b4feee95a7c6bc2f8feeddb5bc67653f <http://schema.org/value> "Scottish Environment Protection Agency" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2b0246ae11c1e3461395ea7bcf6bc8071cc4364b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cb7dd2ecd4e2008092b4881157bc7c55 .
