_:f0b697edfdc16cddfd1a4ab9c2a015f5 <http://schema.org/value> "Marine Scotland" .
_:b999f491de9cc2b8ce17a88fdfd52938 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:f0b697edfdc16cddfd1a4ab9c2a015f5 <http://schema.org/value> "seasearch" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a9e3c02703f8ea4e6c6db1297076567dfa9db42> <http://schema.org/description> "In order to better understand the nature, extent and intensity of interactions amongst coastal users, Marine Scotland asked the Local Coastal Partnerships to collect spatial data not already represented in national datasets. This map shows areas important areas for diving around Grampian. It was created by the East Grampian Local Coastal Partnership, and covers the area of sea out to 12 miles. The source was from seasearch and represents the whole of the Grampian Region. There are other reasons for going diving which have not been captured and so the data set is incomplete." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a9e3c02703f8ea4e6c6db1297076567dfa9db42> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f0b697edfdc16cddfd1a4ab9c2a015f5 .
