<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a9b259be749520a8586ab2fab3ad6e35a928765> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f12abeb1c17bc5e772728b31220596a8 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a9b259be749520a8586ab2fab3ad6e35a928765> <http://schema.org/description> "This sampling survey was a trial with the MV Wimpey Sealab to drill in water depths greater than the depth in which the Whitethorn could operate. Five boreholes were drilled before a contract was awarded for further boreholes in North Sea." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a9b259be749520a8586ab2fab3ad6e35a928765> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ce71236f289b529d1eb49752d9cfe250 .
