<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a85423e46751fd5c3b16081e502bc74cbd326d2> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 36 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Irish Sea and St. George's Channel, and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) areas specifically from around the Rosemary Bank and George Bligh Bank areas. The data were collected during August and September 1978. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
_:d634a2f32fd66ae7657c8de8b94b745f <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
