<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a6f59ce7e1694fd965a2c1e243e3b2f53c17ce9> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a85b958a0c96fbdc8f56f888cea9adc4 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a6f59ce7e1694fd965a2c1e243e3b2f53c17ce9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:a85b958a0c96fbdc8f56f888cea9adc4 <http://schema.org/value> "benthic community" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a6f59ce7e1694fd965a2c1e243e3b2f53c17ce9> <http://schema.org/description> "The objectives of this study were to: record the sensitivity and resilience of the benthic community to diving impacts; monitor the site for evidence of diver induced damage either side of a peak diving period and provide an expert eye judgement on whether the fauna is depauperate in relation to the types of community found at other locations across the BNNC reef feature." .
