_:db5bc2dc04b77f9f94c3fe0859c9daf4 <http://schema.org/value> "northern Irish Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a29649b8e78569b927bfa8bdf48d1b3f5b69d60> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:db5bc2dc04b77f9f94c3fe0859c9daf4 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2a29649b8e78569b927bfa8bdf48d1b3f5b69d60> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April 1977. It incorporates casts at an array of moored instrument sites in the northern Irish Sea. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Bidston Laboratory." .
