_:cfafa4e86787748e552388157bbbfcb4 <http://schema.org/value> "Pink-footed Goose" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:29f7ff3fbec8b7a25ce36339e498372747051439> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:de95a66e4c616d4b9b6196763f2b2559 .
