<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:29d126d1da0ccf505ed52eb71126479a5d17d786> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a91f445adf75161f904f964207041e1d .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:29d126d1da0ccf505ed52eb71126479a5d17d786> <http://schema.org/description> "In 2013 3 surveys were performed within the Dudgeon Offshore Wind Farm construction area (turbine site and cable corridor), two geophysical surveys and one geotechnical campaign including CPT and geotechnical boring/sampling. The results from these surveys can be found in the following documents:\r\n 1. ST13503 Seafloor and HR Seismic Hazard Survey, Statoil doc. no.: PM408-GAR-C-IC-001\r\n 2. ST13504 Seabed and Sub-seabed mapping, Statoil doc. no.: PM408-FSE-U-RA-00002\r\n 3. GEO (Danish Geotechnical Institute) (2013) Dudgeon Offshore Wind Farm Geotechnical Investigations. Draft Field Report â?? Geotechnical Boreholes. Draft Report 2, 2013-08-29. GEO Project 36685\r\n Based on the results from these investigations we have no established geohazards, but some potential geohazards have been identified." .
_:a91f445adf75161f904f964207041e1d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
