<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:29b7d08cc955fe11d6c7a30977378106a72ba8f1> <http://schema.org/description> "A combination of data highlighting the habitats, biotopes, seabed, geology, sensitive areas, biodiversity, and grab sampling results for Lyme Bay. A comparative study. Data is available in Word, PDF, photographs, and Excel." .
