<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:291a5927e0fc3cc7a03a4158cebe025dac3d69a8> <http://schema.org/description> "Wessex Archaeology was commissioned by Marine Current Turbines Ltd. to undertake an\r\n archaeological assessment of geophysical survey data along a proposed cable route running to the\r\n Skerries Tidal Stream Array from Cemaes bay in Anglesey. The data consisted of sub-bottom\r\n profiler, sidescan sonar, magnetometer and multibeam bathymetry data acquired by Osiris Projects\r\n in April 2013. The review included an assessment of these data informed by past work conducted\r\n by Wessex Archaeology for the scheme in 2009." .
