<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:28eedfa7154b12aef18f58bcdd61a4b2beef8b2a> <http://schema.org/description> "The Port Meridian deepwater port is located offshore in the Morecambe bay - and is based on a floating regasification vessel. The regasification vessel receives LNG offshore, store the LNG, regasify the LNG onboard and send the gas to shore via a subsea pipeline to the National Grid. The project utilizes technology offered by submerged turret loading (STL) to connect the regas vessel to the subsea pipeline." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:28eedfa7154b12aef18f58bcdd61a4b2beef8b2a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:dd2f23e75274c3821ace80b090843556 .
