<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:28db5a0ff0dd7a74c0cde7b8caf6249f882087fc> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June 1997. It incorporates a CTD survey in the north western North Sea and to the north of Scotland. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory to complement an acoustic and mid-water trawling survey for herring." .
_:a280119cc9a5f1760203b3d4b7f8b2ff <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
