<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:28d418b31c1911275cad482c0af86c4fd1be0bee> <http://schema.org/description> "This geophysical survey has been carried out by Marine Geophysics Unit of British Geological Survey (BGS) for BGS, the survey took place from June to July 1971 in the North Scotland and Minch area, on board the MV Surveyor. The purpose was to collect data as part of a regional mapping programme. Sea floor data were collected using Echosounder and Transit sonar. These data are archived by BGS. No BGS survey report currently available, IGS 1971 annual report contains summary." .
_:e0ae093e8011025270caad8dfc380850 <http://schema.org/value> "North Scotland" .
