<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:28667e68432a57d2daccdcd79417bcfb34320c40> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cc331c6b1886d321359669783a71e8a7 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:28667e68432a57d2daccdcd79417bcfb34320c40> <http://schema.org/description> "Survey of the Wash and North Norfolk Coast Special Area of Conservation (SAC) intertidal areas. The study objectives were to compare the 2008 data with the baseline established from 1998/1999 surveys as well as with the dataset from 1986. It also aimed to compare sediments and invertebrates between areas within the Wash.\r\n The report includes the data (i.e. invertebrate densities), maps (i.e. of sediment classes and species distributions) and a summary of the changes." .
_:e03a62be21856deaa8f6fe02b384a420 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e03a62be21856deaa8f6fe02b384a420 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
