<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:282c68bfdf5af39581420ca13af305a619a988d1> <http://schema.org/description> "A project investigating biomaerl biodiversity, functional structure and related anthropogenic impacts was funded by the European Commission under MASTS-3. The three year project involved collaboration between five laboratories from the UK, France, Spain and Malta. The project aimed to examine western European maerl-bed biodiversity and to establish the functional roles performed by key elements of the biota. The impacts of a variety on anthropogenic disturbances was investigated. The project set out to compile an inventory of NE Atlantic and Mediterranean maerl-bed biota and to develop management guidelines and conservation strategies for European maerl beds. Several publications have resulted from BIOMAERL." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:282c68bfdf5af39581420ca13af305a619a988d1> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e0b816e98f2081d26da815f0d4c444c5 .
