<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:27e892a873f6eb5ccbaa6dff934093dd05c34433> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1225; Approaches to Queens Channel, Area in SqKm: 35, (17/05/2007 to 02/06/2007), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2006/07. Contractor: MMT." .
