<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:27a0cfa35279cd1e1cd0b05cf4c5d9d9b10d769a> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 167 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in April 1999 from the southern North Sea area. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by Rijkswaterstaat as part of the PROcesses of Vertical Exchange in Shelf Seas (PROVESS) project." .
