<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2798b148b2926f490d492b143ee73fbe95d32c89> <http://schema.org/description> "69 locations in and around Avon, Erme and the Dart Estuary. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes the 1987 OPRU HRE Avon and Erme Estuaries littorail survey and the 1987 OPRU HRE Dart Estuary survey." .
