<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:26d9f860559b314a89ca8505774756fe39e28d74> <http://schema.org/description> "The Institute of Geological Sciences now British Geological Survey (BGS) were invited by French institutes BRGM and CNEXO to participate in a magnetic and shallow seismic survey in the English channel between Cherbourg and Falmouth on the first operational cruise of the new French oceanographic ship Noroit in August 1971." .
