<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:25a91e2c2871dc0aee43d432aec2978460aa83f1> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 61 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Indian Ocean area specifically covering a large area from the Mauritius and Reunion to 52S below South Africa. The data were collected from December 1986 to January 1987. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory." .
