<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:259e933fedd85902ebd4a51501201c5e96faec7d> <http://schema.org/description> "This series covers the Hydrodynamic Measurement Campaign carried out by EMU Ltd between October 2010 and October 2012. The measurement campaign was designed to record a complete annual cycle to support the data requirements for zonal characterisation, hydrodynamic modelling and physical processes studies as well as informing the design criteria for turbines and meteorological masts. Data types consisted of: • Water levels • Currents • Waves • Suspended sediment concentration • Temperature • Directional wave statistics. Both the raw and processed datasets are provided." .
