<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:25889ebd4ec5d83035c9cdc4ecfc3dd19c43955e> <http://schema.org/description> "This report was carried out to satisfy the requirements for post-construction monitoring of ornithology at the Gunfleet Sands Wind Farm, and to confirm that predictions made in the Environmental Impact Assessment were correct. The survey was carried out by RPS Hydrosearch on behalf of Dong Energy using boat based surveys twice per month between November 2007 and March 2008." .
