<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:254ae1a0bad565f03bf7d40a1f9d9a837317e5cc> <http://schema.org/description> "This report pertains to samples collected for the UK Department of Trade and Industry (now Department of Energy and Climate Change) as part of Strategic Environmental Assessment SEA1 (White Zone) from west of the Shetland Islands by Geotek Ltd from the RRS Charles Darwin during the summer of 2000. This report is the product of statistical analyses on grain size data of 109 seabed samples." .
