<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:24ad108824e19f109f0843020a9e22f7a5573cae> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b97d5ca6726d2539ae793a342c1b2a40 .
_:b97d5ca6726d2539ae793a342c1b2a40 <http://schema.org/value> "estuary of the Beaulieu River" .
