<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:249e91a13e1899114147138685d32afa3f9a041f> <http://schema.org/description> "Ornithology observational reporting for Kentish Flats Extension between January 2015 and March 2015. This series contains the Summary Reports, Data Forms and GPS tracks for all five surveys." .
