_:a0f16185b713ef06cc86673167f2b52c <http://schema.org/value> "Civil Hydrography Programme" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:23ba8d7916cda67c0c18b19d29326818d585f8bb> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1265; Long Sand Head (TE5A), Area in SqKm: 56; Long Sand Head (TE5), Area in SqKm: 6, (10/06/2008 to 16/09/2008), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2008/09. Contractor: MMT." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:23ba8d7916cda67c0c18b19d29326818d585f8bb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
