_:d0e42deff756f9910e48284cff17d4d <http://schema.org/value> "Centrica Renewable Energy Limited" .
_:bb617131da7f0408f3544faf992a9d95 <http://schema.org/value> "Skegness" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:23aed074bd92bfa85c1f76d35f542f44a62580fa> <http://schema.org/description> "EGS International Ltd (EGSi) were contracted by Centrica Renewable Energy Limited (CREL)\r\nto undertake the 2015 post-construction (year 3) hydrographic and geophysical survey of\r\nthe L&amp;ID (Lynn and Inner Dowsing) windfarms. These works were conducted as part of a\r\nwider post-construction monitoring operation which included survey works on the adjacent\r\nLincs windfarm. Additionally, a benthic survey was required for the Lincs OWF post\r\nconstruction survey.\r\nThe L&amp;ID windfarms are located in the southern North Sea, approximately 5km off the coast\r\nof Lincolnshire near Skegness. This series contains the operations, mobilisation and results reports for the L&amp;ID array cables survey carried out on the EGS Pioneer and the bathymetry and side-scan sonar datasets." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:23aed074bd92bfa85c1f76d35f542f44a62580fa> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d0e42deff756f9910e48284cff17d4d .
_:d0e42deff756f9910e48284cff17d4d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
