<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:235fc2c2556a1aba94f608f5e03adcc345c1155a> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sarsia Cruise in June-July of 1975 along the European continental slope in the Bay of Biscay. Samples collected using 4ft rectangular dredge, anchor dredge and Norway Agassiz trawls. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
