<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:23276869fd7f9574abb9a31bf5d8587717eab980> <http://schema.org/description> "Spectrum Geosurvey Limited was contracted by London Array Limited (hereinafter ‘the Client’)\r\nto survey ten pre-defined areas of archaeological interest across the London Array Offshore\r\nWindfarm site and export cable corridor.\r\nThe surveys were performed on board the survey / crew transfer vessel Spectrum 1. The primary\r\nobjective was to collect high resolution multibeam bathymetry and backscatter data over the\r\ndefined survey areas. Data was required to provide a comparison with previous datasets and to\r\nassess any changes in seabed level and morphology." .
_:d21d3f5e04d9cce401e495a69e3c17ba <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
