_:bd7d8351f2cad4b4aec3c350cd8fcb3f <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey (BGS)" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:23222379c625c6e189313a3cfe1c07d8cce255fc> <http://schema.org/description> "This marine sampling survey took place in August 2015 in the area of Firth of Lorne and east of Colonsay on board the NLV Pharos. The survey was carried out by the British Geological Survey (BGS). The aim of the survey was to test the BGS seabed rockdrill RD2. These data are archived by BGS." .
