<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:2321fe3bb6ad583302b45391a77380486069d362> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during September 1978. It incorporates STD casts performed within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, incorporating parts of the Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section and triangular surveys around each of the Joint Air Sea Interaction Experiment (JASIN) moorings NW of the Anton Dohrn Seamount. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:231e2672d699f4af6e1a379e5db6ae8ecc2ed017> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ec1e83ca57099402d43fd7166b45257e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
