<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:22bff248a7b0e970ccded9df986f96c4aa14bd08> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fcde5a4b0f35649e4f5962ffef357c0a .
_:b00cc1a5a1ab9f21070a08e3f90def34 <http://schema.org/value> "seagrass bed" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:22bff248a7b0e970ccded9df986f96c4aa14bd08> <http://schema.org/description> "Trial Intertidal seagrass survey in Loch Ryan, Scotland for EU Water Framework Directive Monitoring using the WFD (Angiosperm) Intertidal Seagrass tool. The tool looks at the species composition of the seagrass bed, the density (as percent cover) and the extent of the seagrass bed." .
_:b00cc1a5a1ab9f21070a08e3f90def34 <http://schema.org/name> "marine biodiversity" .
_:d6c1c54eec25a37b4b869a0906037c03 <http://schema.org/value> "Angiosperm" .
