<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:229c49f384cb5a388b20cad7b973ad9adc1b2659> <http://schema.org/description> "Ongoing rapid assessments for presence/absence of marine Invasive Non-Native Species (INNS) in Welsh marinas. A sub-section of probable invasive marine species was determined using a mixture of Welsh high-priority species and species previously found by the Marine Aliens 2 group." .
