_:fbc1a0db2bb9dd2a96eac826e4b0deef <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:b2ac96905bd61b65e4f9d22c59d1d9d2 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:b2ac96905bd61b65e4f9d22c59d1d9d2 <http://schema.org/value> "Yorkshire Coast" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:229b84b755452b653b6c44090e2c7e22047a9900> <http://schema.org/description> "This report reviews offshore ornithology environmental statements and associated planning papers, relevant scientific publications and reports, considers mapping of seabird densities, and lists identified key ornithological impacts that could constrain development in two characterisation areas; Area 3 (Yorkshire Coast) and Area 4 (The Wash). The report proposes recommendations that were considered in the refinement of regions that in turn formed the potential locations for new seabed rights for Round 4." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:22958526038b428057c5517f4ed9ec6aa07f22a3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:cc2cd6c2ac6eec65eee697961d33f8c5 <http://schema.org/value> "geophysical surveys" .
_:cc2cd6c2ac6eec65eee697961d33f8c5 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:22958526038b428057c5517f4ed9ec6aa07f22a3> <http://schema.org/description> "The overarching aim of the UXO assessment is to review each shipwreck and determine whether the buffer can be reduced from the “standard” 500m. The supporting objectives are to: • Determine if previous geophysical surveys have identified the wrecks; • Establish positional accuracy of the wrecks; • Evaluate the wreck history, specifically for UXO; • Undertake a qualitative risk assessment for each wreck based on the aforementioned factors; • Produce criteria to determine a reasonable avoidance buffer." .
_:cc2cd6c2ac6eec65eee697961d33f8c5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:22958526038b428057c5517f4ed9ec6aa07f22a3> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cc2cd6c2ac6eec65eee697961d33f8c5 .
