<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:221730060489b39b66c112edbcc7d9bec497afdb> <http://schema.org/description> "A quadrat survey of the Scarlet-and-gold star corals (Balanophyllia regia) and the Devonshire Cup Coral (Caryophyllia smithii) at the Devil's Kitchen, Lundy.\r\n This dataset does not contain a report, just the raw data a review of the techniques used. The raw data contains digital stills of the sites visited, coral counts from 1997 to 2012 but no map to show where the counts were made." .
