<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:21670ffb5304e0abed18ac97587087e50ac157e6> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1120; Tail of the Falls, Area in SqKm: 7, (08/06/2005 to 09/06/2005), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2005/06). FY 2005/06. Contractor: RN (NP1016)." .
