<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:207debf2c6a86d0c538bbc6024b96bdb354edba9> <http://schema.org/description> "This report outlines the results of the review by Wessex Archaeology of data obtained in 2013 during the Unexploded Ordnance (UXO) survey which was undertaken in advance of the construction of the Humber Gateway Offshore Wind Farm. This report also includes a review of the buffer zones proposed in 2012, following the archaeological review of the results of the previous ground-truthing survey carried out in 2011. The 2013 UXO survey comprised diver and Remote Operated Vehicle (ROV) investigations within the development area to assess UXO suspected anomalies identified from geophysical and magnetic survey data assessment. Of the 950 UXO anomalies investigated, 219 targets were found to correlate to suspect archaeology targets identified by Wessex Archaeology in a review of geophysical data." .
_:ceb6eed0127d43fb80d07d03f6a1b3d4 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
