<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1f984d66a5ac0bc51bff406ef2503fefa2fda1fe> <http://schema.org/description> "RPS conducted a bird survey between 2009 and 2011 for the proposed Argyll Array Offshore Windfarm. Although a report has never been created for the data, this series contains site polygons and transects, bird observation data and land based winter survey data. As a part of this bird survey, basking sharks and other species of fish were also recorded and details can be seen in the RPS 2009-2022 Argyll Array Bird Survey Observations dataset." .
