<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1f39db90c9ac55d634c8e51aa5f4ded79dbde17d> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1421; Approaches to the Wash, Area in SqKm: 306, (02/12/2013 to 26/05/2014), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Shallow. FY 2013/14. Contractor: Gardline." .
_:ef36fed66ed075d8359d970186513f4c <http://schema.org/value> "Clyde Sea" .
_:d18c63f035e38179cb17212ed369bd41 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1f33768b31d634fb9c20745cc9f54c9693ed7f80> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 87 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area. It incorporates the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory Rockall via Anton Dohrn (Ellett Line) section and CTD surveys of the Land-Ocean Interaction Study (LOIS) section and the Clyde Sea. The data were collected during September of 1993. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1f33768b31d634fb9c20745cc9f54c9693ed7f80> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
