<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1f0c8f30dd0abe24a9aa0cb3d17dcc3dbf766ef7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fa0a21aba88a6f168a7146ceb0a06e59 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1f0c8f30dd0abe24a9aa0cb3d17dcc3dbf766ef7> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April 1982. It incorporates a CTD survey of the frontal convergence of North and South Atlantic Central waters off NW Africa with yo-yo time series on the front to study interleaving. The data were collected by the University of Liverpool Department of Oceanography as part of a study of the physical processes of the frontal convergence." .
_:fa0a21aba88a6f168a7146ceb0a06e59 <http://schema.org/value> "NW Africa" .
