<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1f089e10f0d533fc64031c335e82ec266708bc9a> <http://schema.org/description> "An assessment of the impacts of the WoDS and Walney projects both individually and cumulatively on marine mammals as well as suggestions for mitigation measures and assessments regarding the residual impacts." .
