<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1efcdef142ec02c41b9696e24a3f1c5edd181134> <http://schema.org/description> "Biological surveys of rocky shore transects in the vicinity of the Sullom Voe oil terminal and reference sites outside the Voe. To provide a baseline for future assessment of gross change." .
_:e605e7c073f3b9ecd74deafc6b17d18d <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1efcdef142ec02c41b9696e24a3f1c5edd181134> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e605e7c073f3b9ecd74deafc6b17d18d .
