<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1e397f3e3e9c9698c372c465f0e003c94f10428d> <http://schema.org/description> "Section 6.3 of the Race Bank Environmental Statement was produced by Centrica’s ornithological consultant, ECON Ecological Consultancy, based on surveys undertaken within the Race Bank site and wider survey area. The Race Bank Environmental Statement was published in January 2009. The purpose of Section 6.3 of the Race Bank Environmental Statement was to provide details of the potential impacts of the proposed project to bird populations in the area, and analyse the significance of these potential impacts." .
