<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1e2d3841c7b9c0195840d84885709adf37c95872> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1076; Lowestoft, Area in SqKm: 6, (25/05/2004 to 09/06/2004), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2004/05). FY 2004/05. Contractor: RN (NP1016)." .
_:f2ed1db73d111aa1caee5950c4d9862d <http://schema.org/value> "Civil Hydrography Programme" .
