<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1cb3eaea5ccc660a35843cafeec97a192b60a982> <http://schema.org/description> "In order to monitor the abundance and composition of fish and epi-benthic species within the area, otter and beam trawl surveys were undertaken during spring 2013 in and adjacent to the Ormonde offshore wind farm. The results of the second year of post-construction surveys have been compared with those obtained prior to construction in April 2009 and October 2009, and post-construction in October 2012." .
