<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1c26eed8793708bbed2238512e3a7481aab24ec0> <http://schema.org/description> "Dataset Description: Data processing and magnetic interpretation study of marine and airborne magnetic data;\r\n Centrica Project: Round 3 Irish Sea - Zone 9 Offshore Wind Farm Development;\r\n Project Phase: Consenting;\r\n\r\n Study Carried Out By: GeoIntrepid;\r\n \r\n Corresponding Centrica Document Title: Determination of the location of magnetic sources in the Irish Sea using marine and airborne magnetic data.\r\n Corresponding Centrica Document No: R3-D-EV-133-0117-000000-001.\r\n Available Datasets and supporting documentation:\r\n 1.\tShapefiles (.shp)\t2.\tGrids\t3.\tVideo (.gxf, .mp4)\t4.\tDatabase\t\t5.\tImages (.jpg)\t6.\tDocuments (.docx, .pdf)" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1c26eed8793708bbed2238512e3a7481aab24ec0> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c734b341c69559161202cc3d031e6a0c .
