<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1c2103850d2954d1daf24a446639457029770c2a> <http://schema.org/description> "Partrac Ltd was contracted by Marine Current Turbines to undertake collection of metocean data\r\n(currents, waves and water level) in Kyle Rhea, at four locations north of the point of the Kyle\r\nRhea ferry crossing.\r\nFour instrumented, ballasted bed-frames each comprising a 600 kHz RDI acoustic doppler\r\ncurrent profilers (ADCP), were deployed at the four sites during the period 15th and 16th January\r\n2012. Recovery operations were completed 60 days later on the 16th and 18th March." .
_:ab6a005aa59d78c12713d632edae9d95 <http://schema.org/value> "water level" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1c2103850d2954d1daf24a446639457029770c2a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ec2900780dd63ef59e9adffcb3fa161 .
