<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1c040d839cf8148ad1f2f6a88ca6ca1c11952eae> <http://schema.org/description> "Marine benthic species abundance data from a five year study in Loch Fyne, carried out between 1995-1999, carried out by the University of Glasgow. Species were recorded as 1 = species found attached to nests of Limaria hians. 2 = species mainly vagile on nests of Limaria hians. 3 = species mainly found in nests of Limaria hians." .
_:f72347bfd18dfa639a3598efd11d45b0 <http://schema.org/value> "abundance data" .
