<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1b6cfa54d6798dbfece5bafba791cab1061d301a> <http://schema.org/description> "Food and Environment Research Agency (Fera) Bird Detection Radarr was commissioned by Scottish Power Ltd to undertake a monitoring exercise during Spring and Autumn 2010 to assess migrational flight activity in the vicinity of the proposed Argyll Array Wind Farm Project." .
_:fc6bea68ee60058906a98935dfeda92 <http://schema.org/value> "Scottish Power Ltd" .
