<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1b29a05bb12dde5b3353b263d9d1bb98f1a27253> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 56 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area including specifically the Dogger Bank (just north), the Thames, Humber, the Wash and off Tyne/Tees. The data were collected during January of 2001. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Centre for Environment, Fisheries and Aquaculture Science Lowestoft Laboratory." .
_:c2c6102942894539463416d1b15f1f35 <http://schema.org/value> "Humber" .
_:c2c6102942894539463416d1b15f1f35 <http://schema.org/value> "Thames" .
