<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1b00feeff35f68ac82f86b630b8bd06b2d5a4b5b> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 25 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in October 1999 from stations on the Western Iberian Continental Margin between Cape Finisterre and Ria de Vigo. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Spanish Institute of Oceanography, La Coruna Oceanographic Centre as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
_:eedfc64cc63d8f3e35d611b156e0d50a <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
