<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1a946731598246417b5b79b70108d7308d10d68c> <http://schema.org/description> "This marine sampling survey took place in July and August 1995 in the Hebridean Shelf edge area aboard the RSS Challenger as part of the LOIS Shelf Edge Study. Seabed sampling data was gathered using a box corer. For technical details of the survey contact Plymouth Marine Laboratory." .
