<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1a643b848619c9061ab92e4489a8ec9815c52d8b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fd92d1b01bc13ceccdc78fa004786864 .
_:fd92d1b01bc13ceccdc78fa004786864 <http://schema.org/value> "Scotland" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1a643b848619c9061ab92e4489a8ec9815c52d8b> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 153 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea, Inner Seas off the west coast of Scotland and the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically the NW Shelf and northern North Sea. The data were collected during March and April of 1992. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:b8432de975d4e9c54bc0e5fe8f564adb <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1a643b848619c9061ab92e4489a8ec9815c52d8b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b8432de975d4e9c54bc0e5fe8f564adb .
_:fd92d1b01bc13ceccdc78fa004786864 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1a630434e0e2e6f0ae1f298e5dc4bef6eb1433c7> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during September 1986. It incorporates CTD sections across the North Channel, an extensive grid of stations in the Firth of Clyde, sections from Islay to Northern Ireland, westwards from Islay, from Jura to Mull, westwards from Mull and from the Sound of Mull to Barra Head. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
