_:b201f656dcbe5f35bd7617bdfd32b78 <http://schema.org/value> "BGS" .
_:cf88a29e20b8016a5007898311844b9e <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1a0787386e17a516d25c07c8954d22771b6e5a90> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:cf88a29e20b8016a5007898311844b9e .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1a0787386e17a516d25c07c8954d22771b6e5a90> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) regional marine sampling survey took place from February to March 1975 in the Firth of Forth on board the MV Whitethorn. Seabed samples and borehole cores were collected using a drilling system including Shell &amp; Auger. Borehole logging was undertaken. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Internal Report 75/8." .
