_:dc2a576d77e82a75568f2b7c285fb436 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:eaa9a5f3f6ebe62980b1032545b9f994 <http://schema.org/name> "policies" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:19fcb4bfc5abc8b4df6dfef797e195a07d9398aa> <http://schema.org/description> "Centre for Marine and Coastal Studies Ltd (CMACS) was appointed by RPS Energy on behalf of Vattenfall UK to undertake post-construction benthic environmental monitoring surveys for the Ormonde Offshore Wind Farm to meet requirements of the Marine Licence for the project.The overall aim of the survey was to acquire data on benthic fauna and seabed sediments using Day Grab and drop down camera to allow comparison with baseline data collected in 2009, before wind farm constructionSediment samples were acquired using a Day grab, and underwater digital images of the seabed were also collected." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:19fcb4bfc5abc8b4df6dfef797e195a07d9398aa> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:eaa9a5f3f6ebe62980b1032545b9f994 .
