<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:197aa5e61a54165e8c16173866a480695cfb86a4> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ae5ee576c77fd8862d40d70702d124c5 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:197aa5e61a54165e8c16173866a480695cfb86a4> <http://schema.org/description> "Report (WB/MG/80/103): Brett, CP. 1980. Cruise Report on Project 80/01 (4 phases, gap between 5-18 June). A Regional Geophysical Survey in the Southern North Sea. (IGS Report No 103). The primary objectives were to complete the geophysical survey of the Indefatigable and Spurn sheets of the IGS 1:250000 map series, and to re-run several line surveyed in 1979 (Project 79/02) on the Flemish Bight sheet. A secondary objective was to run one line along a proposed pipeline route on the California sheet." .
