<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1886e716971b171e664a2e994c61f35cc87221a3> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in December 1990. It incorporates the eastern on-shelf portion of the Mull to Anton Dohrn section (Ellett Line) and a section between Skye and North Uist. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
