<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:186300f4ececbd5f72740d65b7f08f395ca47b03> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:adb9b09b2324540631e5d26f7c76b44f .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:186300f4ececbd5f72740d65b7f08f395ca47b03> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 154 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea and the Inner Seas off the west coast of Scotland areas. Data from multiple stations in various lochs were collected during September 2005. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:186300f4ececbd5f72740d65b7f08f395ca47b03> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f03b25900eb02edb4d53688e4dfae89c .
