_:c09f906f296fcf1cbd0b4e25e0c9a59b <http://schema.org/value> "hydrographic data profiles" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:177baad77110ebc7d0798cda45c4981894dc4adb> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c09f906f296fcf1cbd0b4e25e0c9a59b .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:177baad77110ebc7d0798cda45c4981894dc4adb> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 44 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically south of Orkney Islands, surrounding the Shetland Islands and across to Viking Bank. The data were collected during April of 1993. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:ef8c496f78d4ea9e4381def55186fc90 <http://schema.org/value> "Shetland Islands" .
