_:fc089dadfab628607a9331d8ae272149 <http://schema.org/value> "abundance" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1706316f9ac4371ae444eabdde66244c1b3ff8e6> <http://schema.org/description> "ABP Marine Environmental Research Ltd (ABPmer) was commissioned in 2010 by Celtic Array to develop a range of metocean parameters to support the engineering design for a single met mast location (MM2) within Zone 9 in the Irish Sea. This report provides a comprehensive description of the metocean conditions for a proposed met mast location in the Round 3 Irish Sea zone, namely site MM2. The description was formed using a combination of data from adjacent locations as well as new measurements achieved as part of an ongoing metocean survey programme to support project development. This report compliments the earlier work published for met mast locations MM1 and MM4 (ABPmer,2011 Ref R3-D-EN-054-0000-000000-038) Available data set are metocean time series data in csv formats and reports in pdf formats. Parameters include significant wave height, maximum wave height, wave period, wave direction, wind speed and direction, tidal height, tidal current speed and tidal curremt direction. Associated report : R3-D-EN-054-0000-000000-039" .
_:f6d238786682bbda07056555dc207486 <http://schema.org/value> "maximum wave height" .
