<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:16a9d500aa105af9c52ae676146eec35bb6629af> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1226; Deep Water Route C1, Area in SqKm: 7, (30/06/2007 to 04/06/2007), Standard: IHO S44ed4 Order 1. Contract: RRS (2006 LT). FY 2006/07. Contractor: MMT." .
