<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:15ab0b262b72df62204abb0f7806a431406e5bb1> <http://schema.org/description> "Records from the RV Sarsia Cruise No. P1 in July 1962 to the European continental slope. Samples were collected by a number of methods including long line hooks, rectangular dredge and Agassiz dredge. Records supplied by Dr. Eve Southward and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
