_:ce7750f30332a4b41344ec4b8bea99db <http://schema.org/value> "North East Atlantic Ocean" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:14e627c56778ef4859c4417720d8321c9e0ba92a> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June 1975. It incorporates CTD casts collected along the cruise track in the North East Atlantic Ocean bounded by the polygon 41N,15W; 42N,15W; 42N,14W; 41N,14W; 41N,15W. The data were collected by the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences Wormley Laboratory as part of a topographic experiment cruise." .
_:f00330d39bfa2b3d536d116008331dad <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:14e627c56778ef4859c4417720d8321c9e0ba92a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ce7750f30332a4b41344ec4b8bea99db .
