<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1442cba70f34e3d8c43d9507ddc63c4e1c3d2d11> <http://schema.org/description> "A 300KHz RDI vessel-mounted ADCP was deployed over several sites within the Cantick Head Crown Estate Area for Lease (AfL has since been relocated and renamed to Brims Ness) in April 2011. The following locations were surveyed within the boundary:\r\n-Site 08: 58.76395°N 3.19016°W\r\n-Site 09: 58.77472°N 3.18783°W\r\n-Site 11: 58.76975°N 323514°W\r\n-Site 15: 58.76120°N 3.24475°W\r\n-Site 18: 58.75464°N 3.24195°W\r\n-Site 21: 58.75348°N 3.25707°W" .
