_:c07a8816bb764631739cf191e185866b <http://schema.org/value> "TechWorks Marine Ltd." .
_:c07a8816bb764631739cf191e185866b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
