_:e2c9d1a1840109ee79a209a41375737b <http://schema.org/value> "Islay" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1387635ac78b0c736ee2d01bc0ea7a5e548e25ec> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c07a8816bb764631739cf191e185866b .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1387635ac78b0c736ee2d01bc0ea7a5e548e25ec> <http://schema.org/description> "TechWorks Marine Ltd. were contracted by DP Energy in July 2011 to carry out an ADCP survey off the SW coast of Islay. The data collected for DP Energy on the Islay test site are of two types:\r\n? ADCP transects from a moving vessel, measuring current profiles through the water col-umn.\r\n? Static ADCP measurements, measuring waves and currents." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1387635ac78b0c736ee2d01bc0ea7a5e548e25ec> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:13850ca8d8b9b60b4d03e095fe55effaac62fd66> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f79aa368c44ad3b303dc54b529a7d447 .
