<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:134c9f81bb75ab905415f3763d48f72b8083dd17> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 65 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically the Extended Ellett line (Rockall Trough and Iceland Basin), during October 2006. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the National Oceanography Centre, Southampton." .
