<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1321015c8f5780f2d16408c78a9c3845d9e49e48> <http://schema.org/description> "Osiris Projects were commissioned by Shell U.K. Limited to carry out a detail survey at the near shore wind farm development site known as the London Array project, together with associated cable route surveys. Volume 1 of the report contains the results of the development area detail survey. Volume 2 contains the results of the cable route surveys, whilst volume 3 is an Operations Report detailing the locations, times and type of survey work undertaken.\r\n\r\nThe surveys were carried out during the period 28th April to 6th August 2004, with substantial delays due to adverse weather conditions. Data acquisition was undertaken from Osiris Projects survey vessels MV ‘Seker’ and MV ‘Freja’." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1321015c8f5780f2d16408c78a9c3845d9e49e48> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
