<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:12eb051d4588b94402eb2df6a72fd8ea0c9f7a69> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 16 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the Indian Ocean area specifically in the Madagascar and Mascarene Basins, during July and August of 2001. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Cambridge Department of Earth Sciences." .
