_:d6e6638471406ba389c22ce45dfedd80 <http://schema.org/value> "NRA South West Region" .
_:d3ab3e5b682cba7114404c1cf0f24c1c <http://schema.org/value> "species" .
_:c936d917d826865b9ba9f539eaa06ec6 <http://schema.org/value> "organic carbon/nitrogen analysis" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:12d3a7328a43b9e84525646bb6ce1d12d012d1d7> <http://schema.org/description> "Four 0.01m2 cores were taken at each intertidal site. The survey was carried out in September 1990 by the NRA South West Region. Samples were also taken for particle size analysis and organic carbon/nitrogen analysis. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes 1990 NRA Kingsbridge Estuary survey, 1990 NRA Plym Estuary Littoral survey, Wigham Plym Estuary Littoral Sediment survey." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:12d3a7328a43b9e84525646bb6ce1d12d012d1d7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c936d917d826865b9ba9f539eaa06ec6 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:12d3a7328a43b9e84525646bb6ce1d12d012d1d7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:12d3a7328a43b9e84525646bb6ce1d12d012d1d7> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d3ab3e5b682cba7114404c1cf0f24c1c .
_:c936d917d826865b9ba9f539eaa06ec6 <http://schema.org/value> "particle size analysis" .
_:c936d917d826865b9ba9f539eaa06ec6 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
