<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:12c845301ece1ec0a9e9aab30fb515977f2fd65e> <http://schema.org/description> "The survey targeted sites where seafans were known to have been present in order to assess whether populations had been damaged by scallop dredging. In addition to Seasearch records contained here specific measurements and condition assessment of the seafans was carried out using Seasearch pink sea fan recording forms. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo." .
_:b5df0b99074f7920ddbb7629c8de93ab <http://schema.org/value> "Seasearch pink sea fan recording forms" .
