_:baadb58e9a3c04703b5cff102bff4cf6 <http://schema.org/value> "Fugro" .
_:ec4d9ccad893bd7b3df09aa749b992b8 <http://schema.org/value> "Norfolk coast" .
_:ec4d9ccad893bd7b3df09aa749b992b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:126f0e4eebda2e5f467f7f11a9472f03f4668531> <http://schema.org/description> "Triton Knoll Offshore Wind Farm Ltd. contracted Fugro to perform geophysical, UXO and environmental\r\nsurveys in the Triton Knoll Offshore Wind Farm site, approximately 18 NM from the Lincolnshire coast\r\nand 25 NM from the Norfolk coast. The survey operations were performed onboard the Fugro Mercator\r\n during the survey period 8 July 2018 to 6 January 2019 and onboard Fugro Galaxy during survey period\r\n17 December 2018 and 20 December 2018 . Survey operations were also performed onboard \r\nthe M.V. Fugro Frontier during the survey period 23 July to 22 October 2018 and the nearshore survey operations onboard the Fugro Seeker during the survey period 25 June to 17 August 2018." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:126f0e4eebda2e5f467f7f11a9472f03f4668531> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
