_:c1e716ffba6055b244ce28473d27092a <http://schema.org/value> "National Monuments\r\nRecord" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:125a6488b3a261fb405892bbd0de784f3eee327e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
