<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:11c1704a06240328fd61c8f5765b7e05b10849b4> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during July 1990. It incorporates CTD sections and anchor stations in the Humber Estuary and the Wash. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory as part of the Joint Nutrient Study I (JoNuS)." .
