<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:10f22f436db9b2bd0ee92f2479d63d548188e27d> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1458; East Anglia Routine Resurvey 2014, East Anglia - EA4 Caister Road A, Area in SqKm: 3; East Anglia - EA3 Cockle Shoal, Area in SqKm: 4; East Anglia - EA4 Caister Road B, Area in SqKm: 2; East Anglia - EA7 Cross Sand A, Area in SqKm: 2; East Anglia - EA7 Cross Sand B, Area in SqKm: 2; East Anglia - EA7 Cross Sand C, Area in SqKm: 0; East Anglia - EA12 Pakefield Road, Area in SqKm: 20; East Anglia - EA10 Stanford Channel B, Area in SqKm: 1; East Anglia - EA10 Stanford Channel A, Area in SqKm: 2; East Anglia - EA9 Holm Channel, Area in SqKm: 41; East Anglia - EA7 Cross Sand Checkline, Area in SqKm: 66, (28/06/2014 to 14/09/2014), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: RRS. FY 2014/15. Contractor: EGS." .
