<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:104b1357bd5f48301f3dcf064cfe4b18ca5db5bb> <http://schema.org/description> "This is a brief site review of Lundy, it contains an incomplete report that is scheduled to be finished soon. The aims of this project include:\r\n - re/establish suite relocatable transects for monitoring\r\n - survey transects, assessing biotopes\r\n - compare results with the 2000 report where possible\r\n - use the above to make an assessment into the condition of the attribute\r\n - write a report to record the above." .
