<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:100d3b3b06d7e3510193c976c37f28a338e1a847> <http://schema.org/description> "ABP Marine Environmental Research Ltd (ABPmer) was commissioned by Celtic Array in 2009 to provide an initial review of the metocean survey requirements and options for the Zone 9 in the Irish Sea in order to plan the metoceans aspect for the Zone. Topics addressed were R3 metocean requirements, instrument options, supplier details and cost for relevant instrumentation\r\n\r\nAssociated report :R3-D-EN-128-0000-501006-002" .
_:cd9d75bbec542bbf185a740992738992 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
