_:f8d7367c8b45727676a8266f2c235b71 <http://schema.org/value> "northern North Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:1002f9624cf2d1f33b611dcc223d86820b0de2b3> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 31 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, along the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory Rockall via Anton Dohrn Seamount (Ellett Line) section in the North East Atlantic Ocean. Within this dataset are also three isolated CTD profiles obtained from the northern North Sea and Faroes-Shetland Channel. The data were collected during June of 1990. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
_:f8d7367c8b45727676a8266f2c235b71 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
