<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0f9419dfe59952b4b0c4fbb9fbd33ec3f08b9643> <http://schema.org/description> "A total of six mounds were selected for survey, two are located within the L&amp;ID wind\r\nfarms, created in 2007 adjacent to turbines LN02 and LN29 and named Mound A and\r\nMound B respectively. The four other mounds, labelled Mound C to F are located\r\nwithin the Lincs wind farm at turbines LS61, LS62, LS43 and LS44 respectively and\r\nwere created in during 2011.\r\n\r\nThe aim of the survey was to assess the size of the mounds, the sediment\r\ncharacteristics and the epifaunal communities within the vicinity of the mounds.\r\nDuring October 2011, high resolution multibeam bathymetry for was acquired\r\naround each mound. Grab samples and drop down video/still photography were\r\nsampled on the centre of each mound and additionally at locations 50 metres north,\r\nsouth, east and west of the central location." .
_:f456082d68af8892000286a7822ffff2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
