<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0e94d8d78ff835d76da36dfd2eabadbd11029097> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 119 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea, Inner Seas off the west coast of Scotland, North East Atlantic Ocean (limit 40W) area specifically in sea lochs in the North Minch and Shetland, during April and May of 2007. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Fisheries Research Services Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
_:ef380bba8ee53fa03c05fff1cb63f7ff <http://schema.org/value> "North Minch" .
_:ef380bba8ee53fa03c05fff1cb63f7ff <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea" .
_:f73e12424a54e6278ba0fc8070ec56d6 <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0e83476884d3a8428709035225f8133d3803155a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f73e12424a54e6278ba0fc8070ec56d6 <http://schema.org/value> "Natural Power" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0e83476884d3a8428709035225f8133d3803155a> <http://schema.org/description> "Natural Power has been commissioned by National Renewable Energy Centre (NaREC) to carry out continuous monitoring of the wind resource at the development location. Offshore data was not avaliable from the \r\n NaREC project area for use in analysis. As a result data from an onshore LIDAR unit (ZephIR 300) together\r\n with long term reference data (from a meteorological reference station and a meso-scale model) has been \r\n used to provide an estimation of the long term ambient wind climate at various locations around the NaREC \r\n project area." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0e83476884d3a8428709035225f8133d3803155a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f73e12424a54e6278ba0fc8070ec56d6 .
