<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0e775cb7ab0f90ec972e16de77a05e75afe0d43e> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b6e888a2ee04ddac1968258aee93955b .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0e775cb7ab0f90ec972e16de77a05e75afe0d43e> <http://schema.org/description> "Report: Sunderland, J, and Tully, M. 1970. Cruise Report for MV Surveyor. MGU Project 70/03. (IGS Report No 9) Positioning: Main Chain Decca using Decca Type 1844 Type receiver. Coastline corrections were applied to reduce fixed errors when within 0.5 Nm of the coast. Echo Sounding: Kelvin Hughes MS 32 Sonar Systems: EG&amp;G side-scan sonar. Kelvin Hughes Transit sonar also used. Seismic Systems: Sparker System: EG&amp;G sparker system with 263b hydrophone streamer. Most lines run at 1kJ Gravitymeter: LaCoste and Romberg Air Sea gravity meter. Magnetometer: RVU Barringer magnetometer" .
