<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0e45adfc00275e075db8873d5bd6136c0bcd4933> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during January - February 1997. It incorporates CTD sections east of the Orkneys, between 57 and 58.5N and 3W and 0E, including the JONSIS section. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture Environment and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
