<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0ddd448e4c17f27a5a604d51c26ec86022d369d1> <http://schema.org/description> "This briefing note examines information regarding the movement of the Wisbech Channel\r\nover the past 160 years. It is based on information derived from historical charts and a\r\nreport from the mid 1970s which specifically considered changes in the Nene outflow and\r\nthe Great Ouse" .
