_:cb2804de90028d5e41faeaae04a4b56c <http://schema.org/value> "United Kingdom Hydrographic Office" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0dac4c95b77d5033e678a98b5c3246f3f742bd3c> <http://schema.org/description> "Multibeam (bathymetry and backscatter), underwater video and camera stills and SA and Fauna grabs acquired via Hamon Grab gathered onboard Cefas Endeavour in January 2014. These data are archived with the Marine Environmental Data and Information Network (MEDIN) Data Archive Centres (DACs) including the British Geological Survey (BGS) DAC for geology and geophysics, The Archive for Marine Species and Habitats Data (DASSH) and the United Kingdom Hydrographic Office (UKHO) bathymetry DAC. The full site data package including raw is also available on request from BGS." .
_:cb2804de90028d5e41faeaae04a4b56c <http://schema.org/value> "Archive for Marine Species and Habitats Data" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0da6fe4b7ea21fc4b1a85746724f6523337530d5> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a10c1988eabc404fedf11cb32b389eb3 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0da6fe4b7ea21fc4b1a85746724f6523337530d5> <http://schema.org/description> "A collection of Non-Native Species sightings from Merseyside Biobank. Part of MSFD NNS baseline data collation project (Jan 2016). The species listed are Spartina anglica, Sargassum muticum and Ensis directus." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0da6fe4b7ea21fc4b1a85746724f6523337530d5> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c93d6fbd53129a2f7e95625af144aff7 .
