_:a25a9032098e05a14ea881efdee9d3c3 <http://schema.org/value> "Orsted" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0da291be1b54a616420406d1162a643c23e8d4a8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a25a9032098e05a14ea881efdee9d3c3 .
_:a25a9032098e05a14ea881efdee9d3c3 <http://schema.org/value> "Bibby HydroMap" .
_:a25a9032098e05a14ea881efdee9d3c3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0da291be1b54a616420406d1162a643c23e8d4a8> <http://schema.org/description> "Bibby HydroMap were commissioned in May 2018 by Orsted to carry out Geophysical and Benthic surveys at Horsea 03 Lots 5 and 8. \r\n The survey across the Lot 8 export route was completed under Bibby HydroMap's terms and conditions using MV Bibby Tethra, between 16th August and 3rd September 2018 with a 40m line spacing. \r\n The main objectives of the surveys were as follows: \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Cable route engineering \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Geo-hazard assessment \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Consenting requirements \r\n o Identifying archaeological restrictions \r\n o Identifying protected ecological habitats \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ Planning of Geotechnical investigations \r\n Ã¢?Â¢ UXO clearance for Geotechnical investigations \r\n This dataset comprises of the subbottom data across the survey area." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0da291be1b54a616420406d1162a643c23e8d4a8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b322db0641de4dee5ba1a39b3e1128cf .
