<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0d7dc4f66f1a47a842533a976078142b878dca71> <http://schema.org/description> "Deep water coral records from the 1901 RV Prince de Monaco cruise along the Moroccan shelf, to the Canary Islands and to Madeira. Records supplied by Jason-Hall Spencer and collated by DASSH as part of the 'Dredging the Depths' project." .
