<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0d3265b5d17261ea30b8dd6c06fef84217cc1dd5> <http://schema.org/description> "The Oceanography Department of Gardline Environmental Ltd. was contracted to collect detailed Metocean data within the Greater Wash Strategic Environmental Assessment (SEA) area off the north Norfolk coast. Nortek acoustic wave and current (AWAC) recorders collected wave bursts, current profiles and tidal sea level data at two locations within the SEA, as defined by Dudgeon Offshore Wind Limited (DOW)." .
