<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0c92873b05d2819c18589a4e700e3108159ed918> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 28 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in December 2008 throughout Liverpool Bay. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory as part of the National Oceanography Centre (formerly the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory), Liverpool Bay/Irish Sea Coastal Observatory initiative." .
