<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0c44f9963ef1c97cf03d541724850867481483af> <http://schema.org/description> "Initial proposals and interim reports for Offshore Wind Leasing Round 4 presented to statutory organisations and bodies, and the market, in July 2018. We continued to engage with statutory organisations and planning authorities to assess potential locations for new seabed rights off the coast of England, Wales and Northern Ireland. \r\n\r\nWe also continued to build upon the evidence base to identify, characterise and refine the most favourable areas of the seabed. By refining the number of regions and\r\nsharing our detailed data and analysis of constraints affecting the characterisation areas inside\r\neach of these regions, we aim to support and inform the markets’ selection of sites, helping\r\nto reduce consenting risk, and ensure the most viable projects come forward.\r\n\r\nFor the final version of these documents resleased at the launch of Offshore Wind Leasing Round 4, please refer to this series: 2019, The Crown Estate, Round 4 Launch Documents." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0c44f9963ef1c97cf03d541724850867481483af> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:ef653f9ed3ec7396279a34c08d7dbcb2 <http://schema.org/value> "Northern Ireland" .
