_:db7c6996ced256f535be920fa3eb4e6b <http://schema.org/value> "Inter-Agency Committee on Marine Science and Technology" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0ba7fe66c911851ef0a1c29efbdc3d6e17363723> <http://schema.org/description> "Author: Inter-Agency Committee on Marine Science and Technology. Report number: R457. IACMST information Document: 10. This report details the work carried out by IACMST on a review of the marine related activities and the UK economy. The report includes those activities which involve working on or in the sea. Also those activities that are involved in the production of goods or the provision of services that will themselves directly contribute to activities on or in the sea." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0ba7fe66c911851ef0a1c29efbdc3d6e17363723> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c92bd9e99dfbbffb4f4f6f2105dc7470 .
