_:ee79cc94543e37ca69ea5b121ba8b065 <http://schema.org/value> "BGS Deep-tow boomer" .
_:ee79cc94543e37ca69ea5b121ba8b065 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
_:be0c654af58c4ffd4021fe2aac198b29 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:e42d410a38889f4b58f3d4186af367aa <http://schema.org/value> "Shetlands margin area" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0af55bdf922a3f0808684e44375d26d4d4c570c8> <http://schema.org/description> "This marine geophysical survey took place in August 2000 on board the RV Hakon Mosby on the AFEN slide, Shetlands margin area. This was a joint contribution of the University of Bergen and the British Geological Survey to the EU COSTA (Continental Slope Stability) project. The main objective of the COSTA project is the assessment of continental slope stability along the European Continental Margin with respect to natural processes and human activity. Subsurface seismic data was collected using BGS Deep-tow boomer and Halliburton sleeve gun system. Technical details of the survey are contained in University of Bergen report 100-02/00 (BGS2000/074)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0af55bdf922a3f0808684e44375d26d4d4c570c8> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:e42d410a38889f4b58f3d4186af367aa .
_:be0c654af58c4ffd4021fe2aac198b29 <http://schema.org/value> "British Geological Survey" .
_:ee79cc94543e37ca69ea5b121ba8b065 <http://schema.org/value> "Halliburton sleeve gun system" .
_:ee79cc94543e37ca69ea5b121ba8b065 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
