<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0a6e3e31113a5b2696ecccddb2bcf87e43c25080> <http://schema.org/description> "This project summarises the findings of aerial surveys of the proposed London Array Ltd. Offshore wind farm site, and associated control zones, for birds and marine mammals. Surveys were undertaken between November 2009 and May 2010 by APEM." .
