<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0a52ca3ac1bef512fa3819c3c75c5551b88e3d33> <http://schema.org/description> "Records are taken from \r\n \r\n BUTLER, P. 2009 Establishing the Arctica islandica archive: Development of the definitive shell-based proxy for the North Atlantic shelf seas. PhD thesis, Bangor University.\r\n \r\n Records Digitised by ISCZ project 2011.\r\n \r\n Ocean Quahogs are listed as a Species Feature of Conservation Importance under the Ecological Network Guidence. and on the OSPAR List of Threatened and/or Declining Species and Habitats (Region II â?? Greater North Sea)\r\n \r\n In Wales, ocean quahogs are a species of principal importance for the purpose of conservation biodiversity under the Natural Environment and Rural Communities Act 2006" .
