<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:096bc5bea37d547a7cad9c51eb372f1419c75c79> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 59 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, within the North East Atlantic Ocean area, incorporating stations of the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory Rockall via Anton Dohrn Seamount (Ellett Line), plus three further sections from Loch Moidart to Loch Boisdale, Loch Maddy to Dunvegan and Loch Bracadale to Oigh Sgeir. The data were collected during August and September of 1990. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Dunstaffnage Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:096bc5bea37d547a7cad9c51eb372f1419c75c79> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:a0cab1cb210b0017f11048737c5e7155 .
