<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:094906eff7ba5b7df92b52b3a231a37943df2eeb> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 13 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June - July 1997 from stations off the coast of the Iberian Peninsula, in an area bounded by 42 - 45 N, 8 - 12 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Royal Netherlands Institute for Sea Research as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) II project." .
