_:f5ee8f176d4a2481646ac10cd5473cc5 <http://schema.org/value> "date/time" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:09378fbbdccfbc0d0549dd07e05c82e0326141a9> <http://schema.org/description> "The data set comprises time series measurements from offshore pressure gauges mounted on the sea floor. The data holdings are approximately 250 observation months from 100 sites. The data have mainly been collected in the continental shelf seas around the British Isles. Data records contain date/time, total pressure and, occasionally, temperature. The sampling interval is typically 15 minutes or hourly, over deployment periods ranging from 1 to 6 months. Data were collected mainly by the Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory (POL), now the National Oceanography Centre (NOC) at Liverpool, and are managed by the British Oceanographic Data Centre (BODC)." .
_:d00065ef8ddd4d00f7d748d83db9761 <http://schema.org/name> "measurements and facts" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:09378fbbdccfbc0d0549dd07e05c82e0326141a9> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d00065ef8ddd4d00f7d748d83db9761 .
_:b8462fb2222d6e0da332da6552c0a731 <http://schema.org/value> "Marine Licence" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:08e483bb77dc3d9edc973f48cba6de177019a349> <http://schema.org/description> "The Pre-Construction Baseline Monitoring Report read in conjunction with the attached survey reports, constitutes the Pre-Construction\r\nBaseline Monitoring Report for Array 2, as required under Condition 5.2.14 of the Marine Licence. It presents\r\nthe findings of the pre-construction Annex I habitats; benthic ecology; fish &amp;amp; shellfish; ornithology; marine\r\nmammals and geophysical surveys.\r\nSection 3 summarises the Marine Licence conditions that have been discharged either wholly or partially\r\nthrough the production of monitoring plans, the pre-construction surveys, and the production of survey\r\nreports.\r\nPre-construction survey reports for Benthic Ecology (BOD-101-04-NPC-MWL-00008-A-01 and 00010-A-01), Fish\r\nand Shellfish Ecology (BOD-101-04-NPC-MWL-00007-A-01) and Birds and Marine Mammals (BOD-101-04-BODMWL-\r\n00022-A-01) are appended to this report (Annex A-C)." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:08e483bb77dc3d9edc973f48cba6de177019a349> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b8462fb2222d6e0da332da6552c0a731 .
