<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:08dadc443c6fc0f6fe26e05b80dd7bbe210406fd> <http://schema.org/description> "Anatec have been commissioned by Cathie Associates to analyse the shipping and fishing activity in the area surrounding the Walney Extension Offshore Wind Farm and its export cable system, located off the North West coast of England." .
