<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:08cbc7dfc28f8e0c06d9e7835b1472e86a15d2e5> <http://schema.org/description> "The dataset comprises 25 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, from across the North Sea area specifically along the east coast of Scotland and the Moray Firth to the Firth of Forth, during May of 1993. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Scottish Office Agriculture and Fisheries Department Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
