<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0887691f4d503a60c8b163b2292838db8493e4e9> <http://schema.org/description> "Volunteer marine species records from MNCR Sector UK10 Cardigan Bay and North Wales collected during the Species Recording Scheme established in 1977 as part of the Underwater Conservation Year." .
