<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0867ebae74b14ab8396b551036038cdb28d2ec9e> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during November 1995. It incorporates a CTD grid survey of the Irish Sea between the Isle of Man and the UK mainland. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
