_:a94e4aa9b1217b29e4f109c14499fce2 <http://schema.org/name> "procedures" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0855406e12aad5345a69990fc0c8ea03ffd823a5> <http://schema.org/description> "Magnetometer survey of area in which an Armada vessel was said to have sunk. A cannon had been found in the vicinity in 1956, prior to which, 18th century salvage attempts had yielded an iron cannon. The Archaeological Diving Unit (ADU) magnetometer and subsequent diver survey revealed a cannon dated to the late 17th or early 18th century; and a probable grave slab of similar date. No craft remains were identified. The location or area of search area is not specified in the ADU dive report." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0845e83526e041d864fec818dd20588c913e6bcd> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f83a75667c8c8aa32bfb2a41533b69c5 .
_:f83a75667c8c8aa32bfb2a41533b69c5 <http://schema.org/value> "North Sea" .
_:f83a75667c8c8aa32bfb2a41533b69c5 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
_:f83a75667c8c8aa32bfb2a41533b69c5 <http://schema.org/value> "Humber Plume" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0845e83526e041d864fec818dd20588c913e6bcd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:f83a75667c8c8aa32bfb2a41533b69c5 <http://schema.org/value> "Humber Estuary" .
_:f83a75667c8c8aa32bfb2a41533b69c5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0845e83526e041d864fec818dd20588c913e6bcd> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during April 1991. It incorporates CTD sections and anchor stations in the Humber Estuary, Humber Plume and the Wash plus a CTD section E-W across the North Sea along 53N. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory as part of the Joint Nutrient Study I (JoNuS)." .
_:fb630e0dff361bd399b748328f8ba23e <http://schema.org/value> "Narec" .
_:fb630e0dff361bd399b748328f8ba23e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:fb630e0dff361bd399b748328f8ba23e <http://schema.org/name> "organizations" .
_:fb630e0dff361bd399b748328f8ba23e <http://schema.org/value> "National monitoring facilities" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:082fdc96dce3e312aed97ed52a0dd6d6ed1c23d6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:082fdc96dce3e312aed97ed52a0dd6d6ed1c23d6> <http://schema.org/description> "The report in this series provides a summary of historical metocean data which Narec has acquired in proximity to\r\nthe site, and is intended to provide an overview of conditions which occur on site.\r\nData is taken from multiple instruments which were deployed by Narec both on the seabed using\r\nupward looking acoustic measurements, and a Waverider Buoy. Information from processed data\r\nreports and National monitoring facilities is also presented." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:082fdc96dce3e312aed97ed52a0dd6d6ed1c23d6> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fb630e0dff361bd399b748328f8ba23e .
