<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:07ae684b49123c7404a40b234f16904960b92bf4> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f8e0bc80645414eecf5cc184ed18740 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:07ae684b49123c7404a40b234f16904960b92bf4> <http://schema.org/description> "ABP Marine Environmental Research Ltd (ABPmer) was commissioned by Celtic Array to develop a range of metocean parameters to support the engineering design for 2 met mast locations (MM1 and MM4) within Zone 9 in the Irish Sea. This report provides a comprehensive description of the metocean conditions for two proposed met mast locations in the Round 3 Irish Sea zone, namely site MM1 and MM4. The description was formed using a combination of data from adjacent locations as well as new measurements achieved as part of an ongoing metocean survey programme to support project development. This analysis demonstrates some important contrasts between the two locations which is to help guide future metocean studies of to support the project development plans\r\n\r\nAvailable data set are time series data in csv formats and reports in pdf formats\r\n\r\nAssociated report : R3-D-EN-054-0000-000000-038" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:07ae684b49123c7404a40b234f16904960b92bf4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
