_:dd8082ba8b58d21375dd9fc1395a4891 <http://schema.org/value> "Murchison" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0794448d8ae9c85b4f6de1a1eb02083a88cc04f2> <http://schema.org/description> "Surveys were undertaken in 2005 and 2006 with the objective of obtaining data on long term trends in contaminant persistence and biological recovery around a number of established producing fields selected on the basis of good long term monitoring data sets. Surveys were undertaken at Alba (in 2005), Beryl, Brae, Murchison and Nelson (all in 2006). The sampling and sample processing methods used were compatible with those used in previous operator surveys." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:077409f40cf6cafda611b3fa537f2a830e0c59dc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:077409f40cf6cafda611b3fa537f2a830e0c59dc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c91a1dd216e61092bc46903ddef235f0 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:077409f40cf6cafda611b3fa537f2a830e0c59dc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fe2dbe6f287eaa3ccf9b26eaec1178e4 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:077409f40cf6cafda611b3fa537f2a830e0c59dc> <http://schema.org/description> "Eggs produced by four Acartia species from the Solent-Southampton Water estuarine system were examined. Acartia tonsa produced two morphologically distinct types of eggs, which were identified as subitaneous and diapause. Diapause eggs from this species were spiny while the subitaneous form had a relatively smooth chorion surface; a second subitaneous egg was produced by A. tonsa, which had significant spine extensions on the surface. Acartia margalefi, A. discaudata, and A. clausiproduced only smooth eggs, which were identified as subitaneous. Observations under scanning electron microscopy (SEM) revealed consistent interspecific variations in the texture of the chorion surface of both subitaneous and diapause eggs in all species." .
_:c4b9faa9fae386263c730b78d588dda7 <http://schema.org/value> "A. discaudata" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:077409f40cf6cafda611b3fa537f2a830e0c59dc> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c4b9faa9fae386263c730b78d588dda7 .
