<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:071ae6090146f5d0e9ae26ad7439b309b0cf9d6d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:071ae6090146f5d0e9ae26ad7439b309b0cf9d6d> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 17 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in September 1995 from stations in the north east Atlantic between 45 - 50 N, 5 - 15 W. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the University of Gent Department of Biology as part of the Ocean Margin Exchange (OMEX) I project." .
