<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:06ab917bfbe886f2566540a45e76558e236b452e> <http://schema.org/description> "Littoral surveys in and around Sabbacombe and Start Bay. Data on species and biotope recorded and entered onto Marine Recorder. Species data and biotope data mapped as points using MapInfo. Includes the 1994 Devon Wildlife Trust Sabbacombe littoral survey and the 1994 Devon Wildlife Trust Start Bay littoral survey." .
