<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0669501a3e9589b58ec953e4974cadb1e980586b> <http://schema.org/description> "This British Geological Survey (BGS) regional marine sampling survey took place in November 1980 in Irish Sea and North Channel on board the MV Whitethorn. Seabed samples and cores were collected using Shipek grab, Gravity corer and Vibrocorer. These data are archived by BGS. Technical details of the survey are contained in BGS Internal Report 80/22." .
