_:b4645619384018a7155f34d0af2f91af <http://schema.org/value> "Scottish Marine Biological Association" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:062f3fbff912fb4cce7e073d03fe28238d4d9a86> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a salinity-temperature-depth (STD) sensor package, during March 1977. It incorporates the Rockall via Anton Dohrn Seamount (Ellett Line) section, across the South Rockall Channel and between Porcupine Bank and Rockall Bank. The data were collected by the Scottish Marine Biological Association." .
_:c26caa1442b003ace57a5cac954fdcfb <http://schema.org/value> "Porcupine Bank" .
_:c26caa1442b003ace57a5cac954fdcfb <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
