_:c98de5e0afa04aee74527fed786b3211 <http://schema.org/value> "biological community diversity" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:05a71fcb988fb9d43a826a3d2c175a5d85934f9b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c072258a2ae3778858e39c5ead41c908 .
_:ed236c46999eed463d2a2cca62d091dd <http://schema.org/value> "Southern North Sea" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:05a71fcb988fb9d43a826a3d2c175a5d85934f9b> <http://schema.org/description> "The relationship between backscatter imagery, sediment gain size and measures of biological community diversity are investigated using a quantitative approach at two aggregate extraction sites: one in the Southern North Sea, the other in the English channel." .
_:c072258a2ae3778858e39c5ead41c908 <http://schema.org/value> "sediment gain size" .
