<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0594547fa6daf269750164f40c83437a459f0101> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during June - July 1997. It incorporates CTD grid surveys of the Firth of Forth and the Moray Firth. The data were collected by the Marine Scotland Aberdeen Marine Laboratory." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0594547fa6daf269750164f40c83437a459f0101> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f8b9fb65d81f295ce421e1bafdfa1ce4 .
