<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0580bed2bcab15883e12bdf1477b170550e2790a> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:c8589fa7d35f498d8d79c2d1f17ad5cf .
_:c8589fa7d35f498d8d79c2d1f17ad5cf <http://schema.org/value> "Maritime Coastguard Agency" .
_:c8589fa7d35f498d8d79c2d1f17ad5cf <http://schema.org/value> "Civil Hydrography Programme" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0580bed2bcab15883e12bdf1477b170550e2790a> <http://schema.org/description> "Samples and associated geological data are held at the British Geological Survey for Maritime Coastguard Agency (MCA), Civil Hydrography Programme (CHP), Bathymetric Survey HI1414; DWR via DR1 - Off Botney Ground TSS, Area in SqKm: 331, (05/03/2013 to 15/04/2013), Standard: IHO S44ed5 Order 1a. Contract: Medium (2011). FY 2012/13. Contractor: MMT UK." .
_:c8589fa7d35f498d8d79c2d1f17ad5cf <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
