<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:05552d03f8b8bc15a7a23f1aa6ec612039566568> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:fe1c28bd5fe3e4a37facbc87a12063ea .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:05552d03f8b8bc15a7a23f1aa6ec612039566568> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, in June 1985. It incorporates three sections in the North Channel, from the south, centre and north of the Mull of Galloway across to Northern Ireland. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Lowestoft Fisheries Laboratory." .
