_:fda7475f45018ae10fede0ed6a010e71 <http://schema.org/value> "DONG Energy" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:052b2c9c84f8539247565ebefa6065c38b839179> <http://schema.org/description> "Cathie Associates have been commissioned by DONG Energy to perform a Burial Risk Assessment (BRA) for the inter-array cables and the export cable.\r\nThe purpose of the BRA is to determine the minimum burial depths required to achieve the protection requirements of the project with regard to natural and anthropogenic hazards. In addition, the study will evaluate burial techniques and the potential for reduced burial and requirements for additional route preparation or cable protection measures." .
