<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:04fbfa2bce50059e9045d112ac91d7b7c7bc2963> <http://schema.org/description> "As part of the environmental monitoring programme outlined within FEPA licences 31792/10/1 and 31814/10/2 for the Lynn and Inner Dowsing (LID) wind farms respectively, both valid from the 10th October 2010 until the 31st October 2013, Brown &amp; May Marine Ltd. was commissioned by Centrica to undertake post-construction fisheries surveys within the LID wind farms.\r\nThis report details the findings of the 19th to 24th survey in a series of shrimp surveys to be undertaken in the area relevant to the operational LID wind farms. The survey is the Year 3 post construction survey which span across 2011 and 2012\r\nThe survey methodology replicated that of the previous surveys" .
