<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0407578d30479f930725c5d786bde8aaa7033c04> <http://schema.org/description> "This dataset comprises 167 hydrographic data profiles, collected by a conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) sensor package, during August - October 1994 from stations from the Straits of Hormuz to the Murray Ridge in the Gulf of Oman and the Arabian Sea. A complete list of all data parameters are described by the SeaDataNet Parameter Discovery Vocabulary (PDV) keywords assigned in this metadata record. The data were collected by the Plymouth Marine Laboratory as part of the ARABESQUE project." .
