<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:03d2bbbae00f436f1fb4a5f3710bbedb2edf290d> <http://schema.org/description> "A report on surveys in 2003/04 of crab tiling activity on Devonâ??s estuaries and comparison with 2000/01 crab tile survey data. Electronic final report, MapInfo layers, locations, photographs and excel database available from Devon Biodiversity Records Centre." .
