<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:00f7bf414e6b31fdffa631d991001cb6f7a79ac6> <http://schema.org/description> "A desktop study of the socio-economic environment of the area in and adjacent to the proposed developments; locally the Morecambe Bay area and from a wider perspective, the counties of Cumbria and north Lancashire. The primary aim of the study is to collate and present basic information on the socio-economic background of the region." .
