<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:00a09dc78c70e91e58250beea464b5624cb6a589> <http://schema.org/description> "Kentish Flats particulars of deposit on the seabed, the licencing, timing and monitoring requirements from Aug 2003 till 31 July 2006. Terms and conditions under the Food and Environment Protection Act 1985 : Part II (as amended) - Deposits in the sea in connection with marine construction works: Licences 31780/03/0 and the ammended licence 31780/05/1." .
