<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:00924fb7605ba7ba513387e0fc997344ff3c7f38> <http://schema.org/description> "A survey highlighting detailed biotopes and maps for the intertidal areas of the Teign Estuary. The Mouth of the Estuary to the railway cuttings at Newton Abbot. Electronic data available in a PDF, Word, GIS, photographic, and excel format. Photographs available from DBRC." .
