_:b7d30ae989c6ed87f09e8adaabbe02a7 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:003efafed9a9580c7f823f7a6a7d9b3253dfc475> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:b7d30ae989c6ed87f09e8adaabbe02a7 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:003efafed9a9580c7f823f7a6a7d9b3253dfc475> <http://schema.org/description> "This project examines the ecological assessment of a cable route undertaken at Pegwell Bay from within the site of the Thanet Offshore Wind Farm. This ecological assessment is required as part of the Ecological Impact Assessment (EIA) of the wind farm.\r\n\r\nThe survey area for Phase 1 habitat/land use survey and for most protected species comprised the currently proposed line of the cable route between its landfall point and the power station, together with land to 30m on either side of it. A more Extensive area, comprising land to 500m on both sides of the route, was searched for the presence of waterbodies." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:003efafed9a9580c7f823f7a6a7d9b3253dfc475> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/Dataset> .
_:b7d30ae989c6ed87f09e8adaabbe02a7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
_:b7d30ae989c6ed87f09e8adaabbe02a7 <http://schema.org/value> "Pegwell Bay" .
_:ffad69dd751225da6d0e73cebfa664f2 <http://schema.org/value> "Osiris Projects" .
_:ed9a07bdcbd9bb10f6270705f2546ca6 <http://schema.org/value> "outer Thames estuary" .
_:ed9a07bdcbd9bb10f6270705f2546ca6 <http://schema.org/value> "Gunfleet Sands" .
_:ed9a07bdcbd9bb10f6270705f2546ca6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/PropertyValue> .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0034eb306a60a6d4c5c5cf7f3f3cb967233e8a2b> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ed9a07bdcbd9bb10f6270705f2546ca6 .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:0034eb306a60a6d4c5c5cf7f3f3cb967233e8a2b> <http://schema.org/description> "On the instructions of RPS Energy, acting on behalf of GE Gunfleet Limited, Osiris Projects were commissioned to carry out marine geophysical surveys over two adjacent proposed offshore wind farm sites and their associated cable routes, at Gunfleet Sands in the outer Thames estuary. Data acquisition took place during the period 27th September 2005 to 21st December 2005, with survey works undertaken using Osiris Projects survey catamaran MV ‘LIA’." .
_:ffad69dd751225da6d0e73cebfa664f2 <http://schema.org/value> "RPS Energy" .
_:ffad69dd751225da6d0e73cebfa664f2 <http://schema.org/value> "GE Gunfleet Limited" .
_:ed9a07bdcbd9bb10f6270705f2546ca6 <http://schema.org/name> "geospatial region" .
