<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:002ae8f0d68534371f0a427761c9e8597b5d121d> <http://schema.org/description> "Marine benthic species abundance data from 1992 impact assessment of discharges at Garnock Valley Sewer (GVS), ICI chemicals long sea outfall, and short sewerage discharges in Irvine and Ayr Bay. This dataset was collated as part of a Scottish Natural Heritage (SNH) Grant to access marine life datasets in Scotland." .
