<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:000b65f0be4b7bee07e3befcadde651222ae94d0> <http://schema.org/description> "Mollusc abundance records from selected sites Selected mollusc abundance records from selected sites within the Menai marine conservation area. A map of sampling locations is given but no latitude longitude, therefore co-ordinates have been used to estimate location. Species abundance is not included." .
